(5450, 1436, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used for flower pots , marble planters , and flowerbeds as decoration, and turning a dirt tile into a grass tile. Flowers are picked using a sickle. The tile must be \'overflowing\' with flowers to be picked. You may plant flowers on a dirt or grass tile. It uses gardening skill.', '<ul><li>Used for <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_flowerpot\" title=\"Pottery flowerpot\">flower pots</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_planter\" title=\"Marble planter\">marble planters</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Flowerbed\" title=\"Flowerbed\">flowerbeds</a> as decoration, and turning a dirt tile into a grass tile.</li>\n<li>Flowers are picked using a sickle. The tile must be \'overflowing\' with flowers to be picked.</li>\n<li>You may plant flowers on a dirt or grass tile. It uses gardening skill.</li></ul>', 2),
(5451, 1437, 'Description', 'Description', 'Some crooked but beautiful blue flowers.', '<p><i>Some crooked but beautiful blue flowers.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5452, 1437, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Activate a sickle, right click a flower tile, Nature>Pick flowers', '<p>Activate a sickle, right click a flower tile, <i>Nature&gt;Pick flowers</i>\n</p>', 1),
(5453, 1437, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used for flower pots , marble planters , and flowerbeds as decoration, and turning a dirt tile into a grass tile. Flowers are picked using a sickle. The tile must be \'overflowing\' with flowers to be picked. You may plant flowers on a dirt or grass tile. It uses gardening skill.', '<ul><li>Used for <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_flowerpot\" title=\"Pottery flowerpot\">flower pots</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_planter\" title=\"Marble planter\">marble planters</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Flowerbed\" title=\"Flowerbed\">flowerbeds</a> as decoration, and turning a dirt tile into a grass tile.</li>\n<li>Flowers are picked using a sickle. The tile must be \'overflowing\' with flowers to be picked.</li>\n<li>You may plant flowers on a dirt or grass tile. It uses gardening skill.</li></ul>', 2),
(5454, 1438, 'Description', 'Description', 'Some greenish-yellow furry flowers.', '<p><i>Some greenish-yellow furry flowers.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5455, 1438, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Activate a sickle, right click a flower tile, Nature>Pick flowers', '<p>Activate a sickle, right click a flower tile, <i>Nature&gt;Pick flowers</i>\n</p>', 1),
(5456, 1438, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used for flower pots , marble planters , and flowerbeds as decoration, and turning a dirt tile into a grass tile. Flowers are picked using a sickle. The tile must be \'overflowing\' with flowers to be picked. You may plant flowers on a dirt or grass tile. It uses gardening skill.', '<ul><li>Used for <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_flowerpot\" title=\"Pottery flowerpot\">flower pots</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_planter\" title=\"Marble planter\">marble planters</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Flowerbed\" title=\"Flowerbed\">flowerbeds</a> as decoration, and turning a dirt tile into a grass tile.</li>\n<li>Flowers are picked using a sickle. The tile must be \'overflowing\' with flowers to be picked.</li>\n<li>You may plant flowers on a dirt or grass tile. It uses gardening skill.</li></ul>', 2),
(5460, 1440, 'Description', 'Description', 'These spirit gates marks the transition between the normal world and the sacred. They are usually placed near the entrance to shrines.', '<p><i>These spirit gates marks the transition between the normal world and the sacred. They are usually placed near the entrance to shrines.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5461, 1440, 'Note', 'Note', 'When the Spirit Gates asks to be constructed higher up than 100 steps, this translates to atleast 1000 dirt above sea-level. Spirit gates are mission structures requiring Masonry skill.', '<p>When the Spirit Gates asks to be constructed higher up than 100 steps, this translates to atleast 1000 dirt above sea-level.\n</p>\n<p><b>Spirit gates</b> are <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Mission_structures\" title=\"Category:Mission structures\">mission structures</a> requiring <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">Masonry</a> skill.\n</p>', 1),
(5462, 1440, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Mission structures , for more information on mission structures in general.', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Mission_structures\" title=\"Category:Mission structures\">Mission structures</a>, for more information on mission structures in general.</li></ul>', 2),
(5466, 1441, 'Description', 'Description', 'A long, sharp horn from an animal. A butchered item obtained from butchering a bull .', '<p><i>A long, sharp horn from an animal.</i>\n</p>\n<p>A <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Butchering_items\" title=\"Category:Butchering items\">butchered item</a> obtained from <a href=\"/index.php/Butchering\" title=\"Butchering\">butchering</a> a <a href=\"/index.php/Bull\" title=\"Bull\">bull</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(5467, 1441, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used in some cooking recipes. Used to create a healing cover with a potency of 3.', '<ul><li>Used in some <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> recipes.</li>\n<li>Used to create a <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing cover</a> with a potency of 3.</li></ul>', 1),
(5468, 1441, 'Notes', 'Notes', '0.30 kg is used in the creation of a healing cover. Butchered products decay extremely fast outside of bulk storage.', '<ul><li>0.30 kg is used in the creation of a healing cover.</li>\n<li>Butchered products decay extremely fast outside of bulk storage.</li></ul>', 2),
(5475, 1446, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small flask containing an [sic] brown smoky fluid.', '<p><i>A small flask containing an [sic] brown smoky fluid.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5476, 1446, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'The potion of carpentry can be created by mixing black dragon blood with a source salt . To see the type of potion that would be made, choose \"Alchemy > Lore\" (requires at least 10 natural substances skill). Mixing this potion has a difficulty of 20. Skill level in natural substances determines the chance of successfully creating the potion.', '<ul><li>The potion of carpentry can be created by mixing black dragon <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with a <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a>.</li>\n<li>To see the type of potion that would be made, choose \"Alchemy &gt; Lore\" (requires at least 10 natural substances skill).</li>\n<li>Mixing this potion has a difficulty of 20. Skill level in <a href=\"/index.php/Natural_substances\" title=\"Natural substances\">natural substances</a> determines the chance of successfully creating the potion.</li></ul>', 1),
(5477, 1446, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'In order to imbue an item with potion you must activate the potion, right click the item, and choose \"Alchemy > Imbue\". An example of event window text while imbuing: You start to smear the potion of carpentry on the carving knife. You imbue a carving knife with a potion of carpentry. The carving knife will now be more effective when used for the specific purpose. As an example, this text was listed upon examination of the carving knife: It has been imbued with special abilities, and it improves carpentry max ql [9] The entire potion is consumed upon imbuement of an item. Potion quality has the largest effect the strength of the potion\'s imbuement, while skill in natural substances has a lesser effect.', '<p>In order to imbue an item with potion you must activate the potion, right click the item, and choose \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\". \n</p>\n<p>An example of event window text while imbuing:\n<span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> You start to smear the potion of carpentry on the carving knife. </span>\n<span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> You imbue a carving knife with a potion of carpentry. </span>\n<span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> The carving knife will now be more effective when used for the specific purpose. </span>\n</p>\n<p>As an example, this text was listed upon examination of the carving knife:\n</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> It has been imbued with special abilities, and it improves carpentry max ql [9] </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>The entire potion is consumed upon imbuement of an item.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Potion quality has the largest effect the strength of the potion\'s imbuement, while skill in <a href=\"/index.php/Natural_substances\" title=\"Natural substances\">natural substances</a> has a lesser effect.</li></ul>', 2),
(5478, 1446, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Improving Carpentry items using an imbued tool will make the action easier. The power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly with use.', '<ul><li>Improving <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> items using an imbued tool will make the action easier.</li>\n<li>The power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly with use.</li></ul>', 3),
(5489, 1450, 'Description', 'Description', 'A wooden beam used in construction.', '<p><i>A wooden beam used in construction.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5490, 1450, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Wooden beam is a material used to make: Timber framed house walls Wooden bridges Amphora racks Planter racks Small barrel racks Large barrel racks Wine barrel racks Archery towers Crate racks Large planters Pile of wooden beams', '<p><b>Wooden beam</b> is a material used to make:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Walls\" title=\"Category:Walls\">Timber framed house walls</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Wood_bridge\" title=\"Wood bridge\">Wooden bridges</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Amphora_rack\" title=\"Amphora rack\">Amphora racks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Planter_rack\" title=\"Planter rack\">Planter racks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Small_barrel_rack\" title=\"Small barrel rack\">Small barrel racks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Large_barrel_rack\" title=\"Large barrel rack\">Large barrel racks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Wine_barrel_rack\" title=\"Wine barrel rack\">Wine barrel racks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Archery_tower\" title=\"Archery tower\">Archery towers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Crate_rack\" title=\"Crate rack\">Crate racks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Large_planter\" title=\"Large planter\">Large planters</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-file-height=\"752\" data-file-width=\"1325\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"142\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/39/Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg/250px-Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/39/Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg/375px-Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/39/Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg/500px-Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg 2x\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/index.php/File:Pile_of_wooden_beam.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>Pile of wooden beams</div></div></div>', 1),
(5499, 1453, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a window.', '<p><i>You see a window. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(5500, 1453, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 wooden beam in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Timber framed window .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_beam\" title=\"Wooden beam\">wooden beam</a>  in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Timber framed window</b>.</li></ul>', 1),
(5501, 1453, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
(5502, 1453, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a plank before improving it. Activate a plank , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the plank is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 3),
(5503, 1453, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Timber framed wall Timber framed door Timber framed double door Timber framed window Timber framed balcony Timber framed jetty Timber framed arched wall Timber framed arch left Timber framed arch right Timber framed T arch', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_wall\" title=\"Timber framed wall\">Timber framed wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_door\" title=\"Timber framed door\">Timber framed door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_double_door\" title=\"Timber framed double door\">Timber framed double door</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Timber framed window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_balcony\" title=\"Timber framed balcony\">Timber framed balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_jetty\" title=\"Timber framed jetty\">Timber framed jetty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arched_wall\" title=\"Timber framed arched wall\">Timber framed arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_left\" title=\"Timber framed arch left\">Timber framed arch left</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_right\" title=\"Timber framed arch right\">Timber framed arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_T_arch\" title=\"Timber framed T arch\">Timber framed T arch</a></li></ul>', 4),
(5504, 1454, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a door.', '<p><i>You see a door. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(5505, 1454, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob, for example trolls , or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob, for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>, or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(5506, 1454, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 wooden beam in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Timber framed double door .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_beam\" title=\"Wooden beam\">wooden beam</a>  in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Timber framed double door</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
(5507, 1454, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(5508, 1454, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a plank before improving it. Activate a plank , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the plank is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(5509, 1454, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Timber framed wall Timber framed door Timber framed double door Timber framed window Timber framed balcony Timber framed jetty Timber framed arched wall Timber framed arch left Timber framed arch right Timber framed T arch', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_wall\" title=\"Timber framed wall\">Timber framed wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_door\" title=\"Timber framed door\">Timber framed door</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Timber framed double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_window\" title=\"Timber framed window\">Timber framed window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_balcony\" title=\"Timber framed balcony\">Timber framed balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_jetty\" title=\"Timber framed jetty\">Timber framed jetty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arched_wall\" title=\"Timber framed arched wall\">Timber framed arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_left\" title=\"Timber framed arch left\">Timber framed arch left</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_right\" title=\"Timber framed arch right\">Timber framed arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_T_arch\" title=\"Timber framed T arch\">Timber framed T arch</a></li></ul>', 5),
(5510, 1455, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a wall.', '<p><i>You see a wall. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(5511, 1455, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 wooden beam in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Timber framed wall .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_beam\" title=\"Wooden beam\">wooden beam</a>  in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Timber framed wall</b>.</li></ul>', 1),
(5512, 1455, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
(5513, 1455, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a plank before improving it. Activate a plank , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the plank is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 3),
(5514, 1455, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Timber framed wall Timber framed door Timber framed double door Timber framed window Timber framed balcony Timber framed jetty Timber framed arched wall Timber framed arch left Timber framed arch right Timber framed T arch', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Timber framed wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_door\" title=\"Timber framed door\">Timber framed door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_double_door\" title=\"Timber framed double door\">Timber framed double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_window\" title=\"Timber framed window\">Timber framed window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_balcony\" title=\"Timber framed balcony\">Timber framed balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_jetty\" title=\"Timber framed jetty\">Timber framed jetty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arched_wall\" title=\"Timber framed arched wall\">Timber framed arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_left\" title=\"Timber framed arch left\">Timber framed arch left</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_right\" title=\"Timber framed arch right\">Timber framed arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_T_arch\" title=\"Timber framed T arch\">Timber framed T arch</a></li></ul>', 4),
(5515, 1456, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a door.', '<p><i>You see a door. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(5516, 1456, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob, for example trolls , or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob, for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>, or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(5517, 1456, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 wooden beam in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Timber framed door .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_beam\" title=\"Wooden beam\">wooden beam</a>  in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Timber framed door</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
(5518, 1456, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(5519, 1456, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a plank before improving it. Activate a plank , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the plank is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(5520, 1456, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Timber framed wall Timber framed door Timber framed double door Timber framed window Timber framed balcony Timber framed jetty Timber framed arched wall Timber framed arch left Timber framed arch right Timber framed T arch', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_wall\" title=\"Timber framed wall\">Timber framed wall</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Timber framed door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_double_door\" title=\"Timber framed double door\">Timber framed double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_window\" title=\"Timber framed window\">Timber framed window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_balcony\" title=\"Timber framed balcony\">Timber framed balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_jetty\" title=\"Timber framed jetty\">Timber framed jetty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arched_wall\" title=\"Timber framed arched wall\">Timber framed arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_left\" title=\"Timber framed arch left\">Timber framed arch left</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_right\" title=\"Timber framed arch right\">Timber framed arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_T_arch\" title=\"Timber framed T arch\">Timber framed T arch</a></li></ul>', 5),
(5538, 1458, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a arched wall opening.', '<p><i>You see a arched wall opening. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(5539, 1458, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 wooden beam in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Timber framed arched wall .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_beam\" title=\"Wooden beam\">wooden beam</a>  in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Timber framed arched wall</b>.</li></ul>', 1),
(5540, 1458, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
(5541, 1458, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a plank before improving it. Activate a plank , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the plank is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 3),
(5542, 1458, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Timber framed wall Timber framed door Timber framed double door Timber framed window Timber framed balcony Timber framed jetty Timber framed arched wall Timber framed arch left Timber framed arch right Timber framed T arch', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_wall\" title=\"Timber framed wall\">Timber framed wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_door\" title=\"Timber framed door\">Timber framed door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_double_door\" title=\"Timber framed double door\">Timber framed double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_window\" title=\"Timber framed window\">Timber framed window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_balcony\" title=\"Timber framed balcony\">Timber framed balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_jetty\" title=\"Timber framed jetty\">Timber framed jetty</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Timber framed arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_left\" title=\"Timber framed arch left\">Timber framed arch left</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_arch_right\" title=\"Timber framed arch right\">Timber framed arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Timber_framed_T_arch\" title=\"Timber framed T arch\">Timber framed T arch</a></li></ul>', 4),
(5546, 1460, 'Description', 'Description', 'A one step long wooden stake that is used to stake out a settlement, which would provide increased security and reserve the land for your use. Use it on the ground where you wish to settle.', '<p><i>A one step long wooden stake that is used to stake out a settlement, which would provide increased security and reserve the land for your use. Use it on the ground where you wish to settle.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5547, 1460, 'Use', 'Use', 'Right-clicking the deed stake in your inventory and selecting Use will bring up a Settle Application Form . With sufficient funds in your bank (4.21s, and other requirements met) you can use this to found minimum 11x11 tile deed .  Larger deeds require more funds in your bank at the rate of 1 copper per tile. More information on managing, resizing, maintaining, etc the settlement can be found at: Settlement', '<p>Right-clicking the deed stake in your inventory and selecting <i>Use</i> will bring up a <b>Settle Application Form</b>. With sufficient funds in your <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Bank\" title=\"Bank\">bank</a> (4.21s, and other requirements met) you can use this to found minimum 11x11 <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Deed\" title=\"Deed\">deed</a>.  Larger deeds require more funds in your <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Bank\" title=\"Bank\">bank</a> at the rate of 1 copper per tile.\n</p>\n<p>More information on managing, resizing, maintaining, etc the settlement can be found at: <a href=\"/index.php/Settlement\" title=\"Settlement\">Settlement</a>\n</p>', 1),
(5548, 1460, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'A rare version will make the settlement deed rare. The position of the deed stake is where the deed token will be placed when the settlement is founded.', '<ul><li>A rare version will make the settlement deed rare.</li>\n<li>The position of the deed stake is where the deed token will be placed when the settlement is founded.</li></ul>', 2),
(5549, 1460, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Settlement Token', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Token\" title=\"Token\">Settlement Token</a></li></ul>', 3),
(5553, 1462, 'Intro', 'Intro', 'Hello, I am Warlander, citizen of Arr on Deliverance and mayor of Warland on Xanadu! :) Board Moderator since March 2015. Client Developer since June 2015. Server Developer since September 2015. I am creating tools for Wurm Online, probably the most known one is a DeedPlanner . Player Warlander Kingdom Freedom Server Xanadu Alts Mackordian', '<p>Hello, I am Warlander, citizen of Arr on Deliverance and mayor of Warland on Xanadu! :)\n</p>\n<p>Board Moderator since March 2015.\n</p>\n<p>Client Developer since June 2015.\n</p>\n<p>Server Developer since September 2015.\n</p>\n<p>I am creating tools for Wurm Online, probably the most known one is a <a href=\"/index.php/Toolkits\" title=\"Toolkits\">DeedPlanner</a>.\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r120112\">.mw-parser-output .player-highlight-row{background-color:#FFE4C4}</style>\n</p>\n<table border=\"5\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"float:right; margin:1em; width:150px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"player-highlight-row\">Player\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Warlander</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"player-highlight-row\">Kingdom\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/index.php/Freedom\" title=\"Freedom\">Freedom</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"player-highlight-row\">Server\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/index.php/Freedom\" title=\"Freedom\">Xanadu</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"player-highlight-row\">Alts\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Mackordian\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(5554, 1462, 'Villages', 'Villages', 'I was mayor and citizen of many villages - I don\'t remember all of them, here is short list of what I remember: Mayor of Death Valley - Independence, 2010 (as Mackordian) Mayor of Seaside Rocks - Independence, 2011 Mayor of Seaside Rocks (2nd village with the same name) - Independence, 2012 Citizen of Zbuczyn - Deliverance, 2012 Mayor of Seaside Desert - Exodus, March 2014 - August 2014 Citizen of Nowe Wszczniesz - Xanadu, September 2014 - November 2016 Citizen of Arrr! - Deliverance, November 2016 - now Mayor of Warland - Xanadu, March 2017 - now [22:17:21] It is 14:25:18 on Wrath day in week 4 of the starfall of the Digging in the year of 1065.\n[22:17:21] The settlement of Warland has just been founded by Warlander.', '<p>I was mayor and citizen of many villages - I don\'t remember all of them, here is short list of what I remember:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Mayor of Death Valley - Independence, 2010 (as Mackordian)</li>\n<li>Mayor of Seaside Rocks - Independence, 2011</li>\n<li>Mayor of Seaside Rocks (2nd village with the same name) - Independence, 2012</li>\n<li>Citizen of Zbuczyn - Deliverance, 2012</li>\n<li>Mayor of Seaside Desert - Exodus, March 2014 - August 2014</li>\n<li>Citizen of Nowe Wszczniesz - Xanadu, September 2014 - November 2016</li>\n<li>Citizen of Arrr! - Deliverance, November 2016 - now</li>\n<li>Mayor of Warland - Xanadu, March 2017 - now</li></ul>\n<p>[22:17:21] It is 14:25:18 on Wrath day in week 4 of the starfall of the Digging in the year of 1065.\n[22:17:21] The settlement of Warland has just been founded by Warlander.\n</p>', 1),
(5555, 1462, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Saint of the path of love Able Shieldsmith Ambassador of Lomaner Angler Animal Trainer Arboriculturist Archaeologist Athlete Axeman Baron of Lomaner Blacksmith Carpenter Caterer Chieftain of Lomaner Cook Crofter Digger Dragonslayer Drunkard Duke of Lomaner Ecologist Educated Entertainer Excavator Farmer Fearless Fine Carpenter Fisherman Fletcher Forester Geologist Goldsmith Guru Handyman High Mason Investigator Iron Chef Jarl of Lomaner Lumberjack Marquis of Lomaner Mason Master Carpenter Master Farmer Mercenary Mighty Fine Carpenter Miner Potter Prime Minester Prospector Provost of Lomaner Puppeteer Renowned Blacksmith Renowned Carpenter Renowned Fine Carpenter Repairman Restorer Rider of Lomaner Roadbuilder Sculptor Shieldsmith Smith Soldier Swami Tailor Tanner Tim the Toolman Timberman Treehugger Trollslayer Total: 68', '<p>Saint of the path of love\n</p>\n<ul><li>Able Shieldsmith</li>\n<li>Ambassador of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Angler</li>\n<li>Animal Trainer</li>\n<li>Arboriculturist</li>\n<li>Archaeologist</li>\n<li>Athlete</li>\n<li>Axeman</li>\n<li>Baron of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Blacksmith</li>\n<li>Carpenter</li>\n<li>Caterer</li>\n<li>Chieftain of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Cook</li>\n<li>Crofter</li>\n<li>Digger</li>\n<li>Dragonslayer</li>\n<li>Drunkard</li>\n<li>Duke of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Ecologist</li>\n<li>Educated</li>\n<li>Entertainer</li>\n<li>Excavator</li>\n<li>Farmer</li>\n<li>Fearless</li>\n<li>Fine Carpenter</li>\n<li>Fisherman</li>\n<li>Fletcher</li>\n<li>Forester</li>\n<li>Geologist</li>\n<li>Goldsmith</li>\n<li>Guru</li>\n<li>Handyman</li>\n<li>High Mason</li>\n<li>Investigator</li>\n<li>Iron Chef</li>\n<li>Jarl of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Lumberjack</li>\n<li>Marquis of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Mason</li>\n<li>Master Carpenter</li>\n<li>Master Farmer</li>\n<li>Mercenary</li>\n<li>Mighty Fine Carpenter</li>\n<li>Miner</li>\n<li>Potter</li>\n<li>Prime Minester</li>\n<li>Prospector</li>\n<li>Provost of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Puppeteer</li>\n<li>Renowned Blacksmith</li>\n<li>Renowned Carpenter</li>\n<li>Renowned Fine Carpenter</li>\n<li>Repairman</li>\n<li>Restorer</li>\n<li>Rider of Lomaner</li>\n<li>Roadbuilder</li>\n<li>Sculptor</li>\n<li>Shieldsmith</li>\n<li>Smith</li>\n<li>Soldier</li>\n<li>Swami</li>\n<li>Tailor</li>\n<li>Tanner</li>\n<li>Tim the Toolman</li>\n<li>Timberman</li>\n<li>Treehugger</li>\n<li>Trollslayer</li></ul>\n<p>Total: 68\n</p>', 2),
(5556, 1462, 'Killed uniques', 'Killed_uniques', 'Green dragon hatching - 6 June 2014, Exodus Troll king - 26 June 2014, Exodus Black dragon hatching - 28 June 2014, Exodus Green dragon hatching - 31 January 2015, Xanadu', '<ul><li>Green dragon hatching - 6 June 2014, Exodus</li>\n<li>Troll king - 26 June 2014, Exodus</li>\n<li>Black dragon hatching - 28 June 2014, Exodus</li>\n<li>Green dragon hatching - 31 January 2015, Xanadu</li></ul>', 3),
(5557, 955, 'Creatures', 'Creatures', 'Various creatures have the ability to make area of effect attacks. Some may stomp the ground and make powerful sweeps to damage all nearby players. The Red Dragon and Hell horses can breathe fire . Others can stun nearby players. Uniques Kyklops Goblin leader Forest Giant Dragons Valrei Spawns Avatars Drakespirit Eaglespirit Son of Nogump Common Creatures Hell horses', '<p>Various creatures have the ability to make area of effect attacks. Some may stomp the ground and make powerful sweeps to damage all nearby players. The <a href=\"/index.php/Dragon\" title=\"Dragon\">Red Dragon</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Hell_horse\" title=\"Hell horse\">Hell horses</a> can breathe <a href=\"/index.php/Fire\" title=\"Fire\">fire</a>. Others can stun nearby players.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uniques\">Uniques</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Kyklops\" title=\"Kyklops\">Kyklops</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Goblin_leader\" title=\"Goblin leader\">Goblin leader</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Forest_Giant\" title=\"Forest Giant\">Forest Giant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Dragon\" title=\"Dragon\">Dragons</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Valrei_Spawns\">Valrei Spawns</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Avatars\" title=\"Avatars\">Avatars</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Drakespirit\" title=\"Drakespirit\">Drakespirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Eaglespirit\" title=\"Eaglespirit\">Eaglespirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Son_of_Nogump\" title=\"Son of Nogump\">Son of Nogump</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Common_Creatures\">Common Creatures</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Hell_horse\" title=\"Hell horse\">Hell horses</a></li></ul>', 0),
(5558, 955, 'Spells', 'Spells', 'Fo Fo has no area of effect spells which deal damage to creatures or players, however Fo\'s ability to heal all allies in an area using Light of Fo can be useful in PvP and while slaying unique creatures. Humid drizzle Light of Fo Dirt (spell) Wild growth Ward Holy crop Vynora Vynora has area of effect spells which cause damage to creatures, the environment, and players. Tentacles Ice pillar Tornado Rite of spring Magranon Magranon\'s area of effect spells can cause damage to creatures, structures and players. The ability to cast Mass Stamina to replenish stamina of nearby allies is useful in PvP and while slaying unique creatures or climbing . Fire pillar Mass stamina Wrath of Magranon Ritual of the sun Libila Libila\'s area of effect spells can cause damage to creatures and players, and they can spawn large numbers of zombie creatures. Corrupt Fungus trap Pain rain Scorn of Libila Rite of death Zombie infestation Land of the dead', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fo\">Fo</span></h3>\n<p>Fo has no area of effect spells which deal damage to creatures or players, however Fo\'s ability to heal all allies in an area using Light of Fo can be useful in <a href=\"/index.php/PvP\" title=\"PvP\">PvP</a> and while slaying <a href=\"/index.php/Unique\" title=\"Unique\">unique</a> creatures.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Humid_drizzle\" title=\"Humid drizzle\">Humid drizzle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Light_of_Fo\" title=\"Light of Fo\">Light of Fo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Dirt_(spell)\" title=\"Dirt (spell)\">Dirt (spell)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Wild_growth\" title=\"Wild growth\">Wild growth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Ward\" title=\"Ward\">Ward</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Holy_crop\" title=\"Holy crop\">Holy crop</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vynora\">Vynora</span></h3>\n<p>Vynora has area of effect spells which cause damage to creatures, the environment, and players.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Tentacles\" title=\"Tentacles\">Tentacles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Ice_pillar\" title=\"Ice pillar\">Ice pillar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Tornado\" title=\"Tornado\">Tornado</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rite_of_spring\" title=\"Rite of spring\">Rite of spring</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Magranon\">Magranon</span></h3>\n<p>Magranon\'s area of effect spells can cause damage to creatures, structures and players. The ability to cast Mass Stamina to replenish stamina of nearby allies is useful in <a href=\"/index.php/PvP\" title=\"PvP\">PvP</a> and while slaying <a href=\"/index.php/Unique\" title=\"Unique\">unique</a> creatures or <a href=\"/index.php/Climbing\" title=\"Climbing\">climbing</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Fire_pillar\" title=\"Fire pillar\">Fire pillar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mass_stamina\" title=\"Mass stamina\">Mass stamina</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Wrath_of_Magranon\" title=\"Wrath of Magranon\">Wrath of Magranon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Ritual_of_the_sun\" title=\"Ritual of the sun\">Ritual of the sun</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Libila\">Libila</span></h3>\n<p>Libila\'s area of effect spells can cause damage to creatures and players, and they can spawn large numbers of <a href=\"/index.php/Zombie\" title=\"Zombie\">zombie</a> creatures. \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Corrupt\" title=\"Corrupt\">Corrupt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fungus_trap\" title=\"Fungus trap\">Fungus trap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Pain_rain\" title=\"Pain rain\">Pain rain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Scorn_of_Libila\" title=\"Scorn of Libila\">Scorn of Libila</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rite_of_death\" title=\"Rite of death\">Rite of death</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Zombie_infestation\" title=\"Zombie infestation\">Zombie infestation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Land_of_the_dead\" title=\"Land of the dead\">Land of the dead</a></li></ul>', 1),
(5559, 955, 'Items', 'Items', 'Artifacts Some Artifacts have powerful area of effect properties. Orb of doom Crown of might Finger of Fo', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Artifacts\">Artifacts</span></h3>\n<p>Some <a href=\"/index.php/Artifact\" title=\"Artifact\">Artifacts</a> have powerful area of effect properties.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Orb_of_doom\" title=\"Orb of doom\">Orb of doom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Crown_of_might\" title=\"Crown of might\">Crown of might</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Finger_of_Fo\" title=\"Finger of Fo\">Finger of Fo</a></li></ul>', 2),
(5572, 1466, 'Description', 'Description', 'Crabs are known to hide well and walk sideways.', '<p><i>Crabs are known to hide well and walk sideways.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5573, 1466, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'It is a hostile creature with a red hover outline, but will not attack players embarked on a cart or ship . They will, however, attack swimming or walking players and, once engaged, will not stop attacking even when embarking, akin to sharks . They have a decently fast attack speed and cause a lot of cutting wounds . Newer players should be wary trying to fight it. Its spawning conditions may require areas of sand and rock . Instead of normal seafood meat , crabs can be butchered for special crab meat , which has high nutritional value on its own, and may be needed for certain cooking recipes.', '<ul><li>It is a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">hostile creature</a> with a red hover outline, but will not attack <a href=\"/index.php/Player\" title=\"Player\">players</a> embarked on a <a href=\"/index.php/Cart\" title=\"Cart\">cart</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Ship\" title=\"Ship\">ship</a>. They will, however, attack <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Swimming\" title=\"Swimming\">swimming</a> or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">walking</a> players and, once engaged, will not stop attacking even when embarking, akin to <a href=\"/index.php/Shark\" title=\"Shark\">sharks</a>.</li>\n<li>They have a decently fast <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Attack\" title=\"Attack\">attack</a> speed and cause a lot of cutting <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Wounds\" title=\"Wounds\">wounds</a>. Newer players should be wary trying to fight it.</li>\n<li>Its <a href=\"/index.php/Spawning\" title=\"Spawning\">spawning</a> conditions may require areas of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sand\" title=\"Sand\">sand</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Rock\" title=\"Rock\">rock</a>.</li>\n<li>Instead of normal seafood <a href=\"/index.php/Meat\" title=\"Meat\">meat</a>, crabs can be butchered for special <a href=\"/index.php/Crab_meat\" title=\"Crab meat\">crab meat</a>, which has high <a href=\"/index.php/Nutrition\" title=\"Nutrition\">nutritional value</a> on its own, and may be needed for certain <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> recipes.</li></ul>', 1),
(5574, 1467, 'Description', 'Description', 'These creatures love to bathe in the sun and go for a swim hunting fish.', '<p><i>These creatures love to bathe in the sun and go for a swim hunting fish.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5575, 1467, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Seals are carnivorous and will attack other animals to eat, but not players (unless attacked). Uses a headbutt attack.', '<ul><li>Seals are carnivorous and will attack other animals to eat, but not players (unless attacked).</li>\n<li>Uses a headbutt attack.</li></ul>', 1),
(5582, 1439, 'Description', 'Description', 'The Deathcrawler minions usually spawn in large numbers. They have deadly poisonous bites.', '<p>The Deathcrawler minions usually spawn in large numbers. They have deadly poisonous bites.\n</p>', 0),
(5583, 1439, 'Abilities', 'Abilities', 'Deals light poisonous clawing and bite attacks.', '<ul><li>Deals light <a href=\"/index.php/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">poisonous</a> clawing and bite attacks.</li></ul>', 1),
(5584, 1439, 'Note', 'Note', 'The poison wounds dealt by this creature can\'t be healed with cotton, therefore it\'s advisable to have healing covers and farmer\'s salve ready for such poison wounds. Spawned by the Gods on Valrei . Can spawn from 60ql and higher treasure hunting maps.', '<ul><li>The poison wounds dealt by this creature can\'t be healed with cotton, therefore it\'s advisable to have <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing covers</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Farmer%27s_salve\" title=\"Farmer\'s salve\">farmer\'s salve</a> ready for such poison wounds.</li>\n<li>Spawned by the Gods on <a href=\"/index.php/Valrei_(moon)\" title=\"Valrei (moon)\">Valrei</a>.</li>\n<li>Can spawn from 60ql and higher treasure hunting maps.</li></ul>', 2),
(5601, 1476, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small flask containing a grey oily substance that glows in the dark.', '<p><i>A small flask containing a grey oily substance that glows in the dark.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5602, 1476, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Potion created by mixing red dragon hatchling blood with source salt .', '<p>Potion created by mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Red_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Red dragon hatchling\">red dragon hatchling</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(5603, 1476, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'Activate the potion and right-click tool you want to imbue. Select \"Alchemy > Imbue\" from the menu.\nExamine the imbued tool to see what effect (ranging to 100) does the imbue have. Improving weapon smithing products using imbued tool will be easier.', '<p>Activate the potion and right-click tool you want to imbue. Select \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\" from the menu.\nExamine the imbued tool to see what effect (ranging to 100) does the imbue have.\n</p>\n<p>Improving <a href=\"/index.php/Weapon_smithing\" title=\"Weapon smithing\">weapon smithing</a> products using imbued tool will be easier.\n</p>', 2),
(5604, 1476, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly.', '<ul><li>Power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly.</li></ul>', 3),
(5605, 1477, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small flask containing a black thick liquid.', '<p><i>A small flask containing a black thick liquid.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5606, 1477, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Potion created by mixing black dragon hatchling\'s blood with source salt .', '<p>Potion created by mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Black dragon hatchling\">black dragon hatchling\'s</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(5607, 1477, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'In order to imbue an item with potion you must activate the potion, right click the item, and choose \"Alchemy > Imbue\". The entire potion is consumed upon imbuement of an item. Potion quality has the largest effect the strength of the potion\'s imbuement, while skill in natural substances has a lesser effect.', '<p>In order to imbue an item with potion you must activate the potion, right click the item, and choose \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\".\n</p>\n<ul><li>The entire potion is consumed upon imbuement of an item.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Potion quality has the largest effect the strength of the potion\'s imbuement, while skill in <a href=\"/index.php/Natural_substances\" title=\"Natural substances\">natural substances</a> has a lesser effect.</li></ul>', 2),
(5608, 1477, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Imbued tool will make improving with it easier. Effect\'s power will wear down, similarly to enchants.', '<ul><li>Imbued tool will make improving with it easier.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Effect\'s power will wear down, similarly to enchants.</li></ul>', 3),
(5609, 1478, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small flask containing an poisonous green smoky fluid. This potion can be applied to a weapon, applying an enchantment that causes the weapon to deal acid damage instead of its normal damage type, such as crushing or piercing. It does not affect extra wounds of other damage types caused by enchantments such as Frostbrand .', '<p><i>A small flask containing an poisonous green smoky fluid.</i>\n</p>\n<p>This potion can be applied to a weapon, applying an enchantment that causes the weapon to deal acid damage instead of its normal damage type, such as crushing or piercing.\n</p>\n<p>It does not affect extra wounds of other damage types caused by enchantments such as <a href=\"/index.php/Frostbrand\" title=\"Frostbrand\">Frostbrand</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(5610, 1478, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Does not stack with salve of frost or demise enchantments.', '<ul><li>Does not stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Salve_of_frost\" title=\"Salve of frost\">salve of frost</a> or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Demise\" title=\"Demise\">demise</a> enchantments.</li></ul>', 1),
(5611, 1479, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small jar containing an crystalline white mixture.', '<p><i>A small jar containing an crystalline white mixture.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5612, 1479, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Potion created by mixing white dragon hatchling blood with source salt .', '<p>Potion created by mixing <a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"White dragon hatchling\">white dragon hatchling</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(5613, 1479, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'Activate the potion and right-click weapon you want to imbue. Select \"Alchemy > Imbue\" from the menu. This potion can be applied to a weapon, applying an enchantment that causes the weapon to deal cold damage instead of its normal damage type, such as crushing or piercing. It does not affect extra wounds of other damage types caused by enchantments such as Frostbrand .', '<ul><li>Activate the potion and right-click weapon you want to imbue. Select \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\" from the menu.</li>\n<li>This potion can be applied to a weapon, applying an enchantment that causes the weapon to deal cold damage instead of its normal damage type, such as crushing or piercing.</li>\n<li>It does not affect extra wounds of other damage types caused by enchantments such as <a href=\"/index.php/Frostbrand\" title=\"Frostbrand\">Frostbrand</a>.</li></ul>', 2),
(5614, 1479, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Does not stack with potion of acid or demise enchantments.', '<ul><li>Does not stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Potion_of_acid\" title=\"Potion of acid\">potion of acid</a> or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Demise\" title=\"Demise\">demise</a> enchantments.</li></ul>', 3),
(5615, 1480, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small flask containing a dark substance that glows in the dark.', '<p><i>A small flask containing a dark substance that glows in the dark.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5616, 1480, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'Activate the potion and right-click a pickaxe - select \"Alchemy > Imbue\" from the context menu. \nExamine imbued tool to get event message about power of the effect. Imbued pickaxe will make the ore/shards you mine higher quality.', '<p>Activate the potion and right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Pickaxe\" title=\"Pickaxe\">pickaxe</a> - select \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\" from the context menu. \nExamine imbued tool to get event message about power of the effect.\n</p>\n<p>Imbued pickaxe will make the ore/shards you mine higher quality.\n</p>', 1),
(5617, 1480, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The potion is consumed in the process of imbuing. The effect wears down slowly.', '<ul><li>The potion is consumed in the process of imbuing.</li>\n<li>The effect wears down slowly.</li></ul>', 2),
(5618, 1480, 'Imbue formula', 'Imbue_formula', 'These general rules apply to all imbues Imbues now add a bonus of up to 25% of the difference between the result quality and 100 at 100 imbue power. This can exceed your gathering skill. The formula for determining the resulting QL is: base QL + ((100-base QL) * ((Imbue power / 100) / 4) Any rune bonus is applied before the imbue bonus.', '<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"These_general_rules_apply_to_all_imbues\">These general rules apply to all imbues</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Imbues now add a bonus of up to 25% of the difference between the result quality and 100 at 100 imbue power. This can exceed your gathering skill.\n<ul><li>The formula for determining the resulting QL is: base QL + ((100-base QL) * ((Imbue power / 100) / 4)</li>\n<li>Any rune bonus is applied before the imbue bonus.</li></ul></li></ul>', 3),
(5619, 1481, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small flask containing a bright yellow smoky fluid.', '<p><i>A small flask containing a bright yellow smoky fluid.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5620, 1481, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Potion created by mixing kyklops blood with source salt .', '<p>Potion created by mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Kyklops\" title=\"Kyklops\">kyklops</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(5621, 1481, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'Activate the potion and right-click tool you want to imbue. Select \"Alchemy > Imbue\" from the menu.\nExamine the imbued tool to see what effect (ranging to 100) does the imbue have. Improving leatherworking products using imbued tool will be easier.', '<p>Activate the potion and right-click tool you want to imbue. Select \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\" from the menu.\nExamine the imbued tool to see what effect (ranging to 100) does the imbue have.\n</p>\n<p>Improving <a href=\"/index.php/Leatherworking\" title=\"Leatherworking\">leatherworking</a> products using imbued tool will be easier.\n</p>', 2),
(5622, 1481, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly.', '<ul><li>Power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly.</li></ul>', 3),
(5623, 1482, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small flask containing an bright green shining fluid. Potion created by mixing forest giant blood with source salt .', '<p><i>A small flask containing an bright green shining fluid.</i>\n</p>\n<p>Potion created by mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Forest_giant\" title=\"Forest giant\">forest giant</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(5624, 1482, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'Activate the potion and right-click a hatchet . Choose \"Alchemy > Imbue\" from the menu. To then check the imbuement\'s power, simply examine the hatchet.', '<p>Activate the potion and right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Hatchet\" title=\"Hatchet\">hatchet</a>. Choose \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\" from the menu.\n</p>\n<p>To then check the imbuement\'s power, simply examine the hatchet.\n</p>', 1),
(5625, 1482, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Felled trees cut with an imbued hatchet have increased quality which can actually exceed that typically produced by the player\'s base woodcutting skill alone. Imbue effects slowly fade away with time.', '<ul><li>Felled trees cut with an imbued hatchet have increased quality which can actually exceed that typically produced by the player\'s base woodcutting skill alone.</li>\n<li>Imbue effects slowly fade away with time.</li></ul>', 2),
(5626, 1482, 'Imbue formula', 'Imbue_formula', 'These general rules apply to all imbues Imbues now add a bonus of up to 25% of the difference between the result quality and 100 at 100 imbue power. This can exceed your gathering skill. The formula for determining the resulting QL is: base QL + ((100-base QL) * ((Imbue power / 100) / 4) Any rune bonus is applied before the imbue bonus.', '<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"These_general_rules_apply_to_all_imbues\">These general rules apply to all imbues</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Imbues now add a bonus of up to 25% of the difference between the result quality and 100 at 100 imbue power. This can exceed your gathering skill.\n<ul><li>The formula for determining the resulting QL is: base QL + ((100-base QL) * ((Imbue power / 100) / 4)</li>\n<li>Any rune bonus is applied before the imbue bonus.</li></ul></li></ul>', 3),
(5627, 1483, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small jar containing an dull grey ointment.', '<p><i>A small jar containing an dull grey ointment.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5628, 1483, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Potion created by mixing troll king blood with source salt .', '<p>Potion created by mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Troll_king\" title=\"Troll king\">troll king</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(5629, 1483, 'Imbuing', 'Imbuing', 'Activate the potion and right-click your chisel. Select \"Alchemy > Imbue\" from the menu. Examine the imbued tool to see what effect (ranging to 100) the imbue has. Improving stonecutting products using imbued tool will be easier.', '<ul><li>Activate the potion and right-click your chisel. Select \"Alchemy &gt; Imbue\" from the menu. Examine the imbued tool to see what effect (ranging to 100) the imbue has.</li>\n<li>Improving stonecutting products using imbued tool will be easier.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
(5630, 1483, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly. Will not increase the quality of created items, eg brick quality set by quality of shard.', '<ul><li>Power of the imbue effect will wear down slowly.</li>\n<li>Will not increase the quality of created items, eg brick quality set by quality of shard.</li></ul>', 3),
(5634, 1485, 'Description', 'Description', 'The skull of a special animal can be a great trophy.', '<p><i>The skull of a special animal can be a great trophy.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5635, 1485, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The skulls of unique creatures have no functional use other than for decoration. Left on-deed, skulls do not decay. Skulls are obtained by butchering a unique creature. Currently, all unique skulls have the same visual model. Table of Unique Skulls: Animal Weight (kg) Red Dragon 15.00 Black Dragon 15.00 White Dragon 15.00 Green Dragon 15.00 Kyklops 15.00 Troll King 12.00 Forest Giant 12.00 Goblin Leader 9.00', '<ul><li>The skulls of unique creatures have no functional use other than for decoration.</li>\n<li>Left on-deed, skulls do not decay.</li>\n<li>Skulls are obtained by butchering a unique creature.</li>\n<li>Currently, all unique skulls have the same visual model.</li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<p><b>Table of Unique Skulls:</b>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"100\">Animal</th>\n<th><a href=\"/index.php/Weight\" title=\"Weight\">Weight</a> (kg)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Red_Dragon\" title=\"Red Dragon\">Red Dragon</a></td>\n<td>15.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Black_Dragon\" title=\"Black Dragon\">Black Dragon</a></td>\n<td>15.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/White_Dragon\" title=\"White Dragon\">White Dragon</a></td>\n<td>15.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Green_Dragon\" title=\"Green Dragon\">Green Dragon</a></td>\n<td>15.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Kyklops\" title=\"Kyklops\">Kyklops</a></td>\n<td>15.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Troll_King\" title=\"Troll King\">Troll King</a></td>\n<td>12.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Forest_Giant\" title=\"Forest Giant\">Forest Giant</a></td>\n<td>12.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Goblin_Leader\" title=\"Goblin Leader\">Goblin Leader</a></td>\n<td>9.00\n</td></tr></tbody></table>', 1),
(5636, 1485, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Goblin skull Skull cup Skull mask Human skull shoulder pad', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Goblin_skull\" title=\"Goblin skull\">Goblin skull</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Skull_cup\" title=\"Skull cup\">Skull cup</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Skull_mask\" title=\"Skull mask\">Skull mask</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Human_skull_shoulder_pad\" title=\"Human skull shoulder pad\">Human skull shoulder pad</a></li></ul>', 2),
(5641, 1487, 'Description', 'Description', 'The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly. The black dragon hatchling is one of the 5 hatchlings in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from huge eggs (which are no longer produced).', '<p><i>The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly.</i>\n</p>\n<p>The black dragon hatchling is one of the 5 hatchlings in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_egg\" title=\"Huge egg\">huge eggs</a> (which are no longer produced).\n</p>', 0),
(5642, 1487, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Despite its wings, the black dragon hatchling is unable to fly. The black dragon hatchling can swim. Cannot be tamed. The black dragon hatchling may pick up and throw players. The black dragon hatchling, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path. Slaying the black dragon hatchling will give the title \"Dragonslayer\". It cannot spawn on deeds. When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of black dragon hide and blood .Mixing black dragon hatchling blood with source salt will create an oil of the armour smith .', '<ul><li>Despite its wings, the black dragon hatchling is unable to fly.</li>\n<li>The black dragon hatchling can swim.</li>\n<li>Cannot be tamed.</li>\n<li>The black dragon hatchling may pick up and throw players.</li>\n<li>The black dragon hatchling, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path.</li>\n<li>Slaying the black dragon hatchling will give the title \"Dragonslayer\".</li>\n<li>It cannot spawn on deeds.</li>\n<li>When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of black dragon <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">hide</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a>.Mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">black dragon hatchling blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a> will create an <a href=\"/index.php/Oil_of_the_armour_smith\" title=\"Oil of the armour smith\">oil of the armour smith</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(5643, 1487, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Black dragon Blue dragon hatchling Green dragon hatchling Red dragon hatchling White dragon hatchling', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon\" title=\"Black dragon\">Black dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Blue dragon hatchling\">Blue dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Green_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Green dragon hatchling\">Green dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Red_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Red dragon hatchling\">Red dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"White dragon hatchling\">White dragon hatchling</a></li></ul>', 2),
(5644, 1488, 'Description', 'Description', 'The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly. The green dragon hatchling is one of the 5 hatchlings in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from huge eggs (which are no longer produced).', '<p><i>The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly.</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\nThe green dragon hatchling is one of the 5 hatchlings in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_egg\" title=\"Huge egg\">huge eggs</a> (which are no longer produced).\n</p>', 0),
(5645, 1488, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Despite its wings, the green dragon hatchling is unable to fly. The green dragon hatchling can swim. Cannot be tamed. The green dragon hatchling has a stomping attack which hurts anyone in its range. The green dragon hatchling, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path. Slaying the green dragon hatchling will give the title \"Dragonslayer\". Cannot spawn on deeds. When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of green dragon hide and green dragon hatchling blood . Mixing green dragon hatchling blood with source salt will create an potion of acid .', '<ul><li>Despite its wings, the green dragon hatchling is unable to fly.</li>\n<li>The green dragon hatchling can swim.</li>\n<li>Cannot be tamed.</li>\n<li>The green dragon hatchling has a stomping attack which hurts anyone in its range.</li>\n<li>The green dragon hatchling, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path.</li>\n<li>Slaying the green dragon hatchling will give the title \"Dragonslayer\".</li>\n<li>Cannot spawn on deeds.</li>\n<li>When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of green dragon hide and <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">green dragon hatchling blood</a>. Mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">green dragon hatchling blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a> will create an <a href=\"/index.php/Potion_of_acid\" title=\"Potion of acid\">potion of acid</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(5646, 1488, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Green dragon Black dragon hatchling Blue dragon hatchling Red dragon hatchling White dragon hatchling', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Green_dragon\" title=\"Green dragon\">Green dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Black dragon hatchling\">Black dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Blue dragon hatchling\">Blue dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Red_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Red dragon hatchling\">Red dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"White dragon hatchling\">White dragon hatchling</a></li></ul>', 2),
(5647, 1489, 'Description', 'Description', 'The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly. The White dragon hatchling is one of the 5 hatchlings in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from huge eggs (which are no longer produced).', '<p><i>The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly.</i>\n</p>\n<p>The White dragon hatchling is one of the 5 hatchlings in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_egg\" title=\"Huge egg\">huge eggs</a> (which are no longer produced). \n</p>', 0),
(5648, 1489, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Despite its wings, the white dragon hatchling is unable to fly. The white dragon hatchling can swim. It cannot be tamed. The white dragon hatchling, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path. Slaying the white dragon hatchling will give the title \"Dragonslayer\". When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of white dragon hatchling hide and blood . Mixing White dragon hatchling blood with source salt will create a salve of frost . It cannot spawn on deeds.', '<ul><li>Despite its wings, the white dragon hatchling is unable to fly.</li>\n<li>The white dragon hatchling can swim.</li>\n<li>It cannot be tamed.</li>\n<li>The white dragon hatchling, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path.</li>\n<li>Slaying the white dragon hatchling will give the title \"Dragonslayer\". When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of white dragon hatchling <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">hide</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a>. Mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">White dragon hatchling blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a> will create a <a href=\"/index.php/Salve_of_frost\" title=\"Salve of frost\">salve of frost</a>.</li>\n<li>It cannot spawn on deeds.</li></ul>', 1),
(5649, 1489, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'White dragon Black dragon hatchling Blue dragon hatchling Green dragon hatchling Red dragon hatchling', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon\" title=\"White dragon\">White dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Black dragon hatchling\">Black dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Blue dragon hatchling\">Blue dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Green_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Green dragon hatchling\">Green dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Red_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Red dragon hatchling\">Red dragon hatchling</a></li></ul>', 2),
(5656, 1484, 'Description', 'Description', 'The menacing huge dragon, with scales in every possible red color. The red dragon is one of the 5 dragons in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from huge eggs (which are no longer produced). The red dragon is an adult dragon.', '<p><i>The menacing huge dragon, with scales in every possible red color.</i>\n</p>\n<p>The red dragon is one of the 5 dragons in Wurm. They are spawned at random, unless they are hatched from <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_egg\" title=\"Huge egg\">huge eggs</a> (which are no longer produced). The red dragon is an adult dragon. \n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(5657, 1484, 'Abilities', 'Abilities', 'Despite its wings, the red dragon is unable to fly. The red dragon can swim. It cannot be tamed. The red dragon can breathe fire. The red dragon, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path. Slaying the red dragon will give the title \" Dragonslayer \". It cannot spawn on deeds. When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of dragon scale and blood . Mixing red dragon blood with source salt will create a Potion of the ropemaker .', '<ul><li>Despite its wings, the red dragon is unable to fly.</li>\n<li>The red dragon can swim.</li>\n<li>It cannot be tamed.</li>\n<li>The red dragon can breathe fire.</li>\n<li>The red dragon, like any other unique, will break any wall or fence in its path.</li>\n<li>Slaying the red dragon will give the title \"<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Dragonslayer\" title=\"Dragonslayer\">Dragonslayer</a>\".</li>\n<li>It cannot spawn on deeds.</li>\n<li>When slain, every premium player in local will receive a small piece of dragon scale and <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a>. Mixing red dragon <a href=\"/index.php/Blood\" title=\"Blood\">blood</a> with <a href=\"/index.php/Source_salt\" title=\"Source salt\">source salt</a> will create a <a href=\"/index.php/Potion_of_the_ropemaker\" title=\"Potion of the ropemaker\">Potion of the ropemaker</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(5658, 1484, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Black dragon hatchling Blue dragon hatchling Green dragon hatchling Red dragon hatchling White dragon hatchling Black dragon Blue dragon Green dragon White dragon', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Black dragon hatchling\">Black dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Blue dragon hatchling\">Blue dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Green_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Green dragon hatchling\">Green dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Red_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Red dragon hatchling\">Red dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"White dragon hatchling\">White dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon\" title=\"Black dragon\">Black dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_dragon\" title=\"Blue dragon\">Blue dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Green_dragon\" title=\"Green dragon\">Green dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon\" title=\"White dragon\">White dragon</a></li></ul>', 2),
(5659, 1468, 'Examine text', 'Examine_text', 'The tortoise is pretty harmless but can pinch you quite bad with its bite.', '<p><i>The tortoise is pretty harmless but can pinch you quite bad with its bite.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5660, 1468, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'It spawns in or near water and sand. It has a very small aggression range and attacks by biting.', '<ul><li>It spawns in or near water and sand.</li>\n<li>It has a very small aggression range and attacks by biting.</li></ul>', 1),
(5674, 1064, 'Description', 'Description', 'A heavy lump of faintly sparkling white metal.', '<p><i>A heavy lump of faintly sparkling white metal.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5675, 1064, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Glimmersteel lumps are obtained as rewards from the Hota Battlecamp . Also, at the end of Epic scenarios, the winning God will sometimes inflict terraforming events upon the territories of opposing kingdoms, such as large trenches, towers of dirt and volcanos. Around these changes, boulders appear which can be mined for Glimmersteel and Adamantine. Can also be obtained at the end of a rift . Can also be obtained from Terraforming events (Epic only)', '<p>Glimmersteel lumps are obtained as rewards from the <a href=\"/index.php/Hota_Battlecamp\" title=\"Hota Battlecamp\">Hota Battlecamp</a>. \n</p>\n<p>Also, at the end of Epic scenarios, the winning God will sometimes inflict terraforming events upon the territories of opposing kingdoms, such as large trenches, towers of dirt and volcanos. Around these changes, boulders appear which can be mined for Glimmersteel and Adamantine.\n</p>\n<p>Can also be obtained at the end of a <a href=\"/index.php/Rift\" title=\"Rift\">rift</a>.\n</p>\n<p>Can also be obtained from Terraforming events (Epic only)\n</p>', 1),
(5676, 1064, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Like other moon metals, this metal has some very special properties .', '<ul><li>Like other moon metals, this metal has some very <a href=\"/index.php/Metal_lumps#Table_of_properties\" title=\"Metal lumps\">special properties</a>.</li></ul>', 2),
(5677, 1064, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'See List of glimmersteel products . See metal products list for more items that can be made from glimmersteel.', '<ul><li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Glimmersteel_products\" title=\"Category:Glimmersteel products\">List of glimmersteel products</a>.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Any-metal_products\" title=\"Category:Any-metal products\">metal products list</a> for more items that can be made from glimmersteel.</li></ul>', 3),
(5710, 1508, 'Description', 'Description', 'An inviting canopy bed, fit for a king. Canopy bed is a piece of furniture that when inside a house lets you sleep in it, to gain sleep bonus for double skill gain.', '<p><i>An inviting canopy bed, fit for a king.</i>\n</p>\n<p><b>Canopy bed</b> is a piece of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Furniture\" title=\"Furniture\">furniture</a> that when inside a <a href=\"/index.php/House\" title=\"House\">house</a> lets you sleep in it, to gain <a href=\"/index.php/Sleep_bonus\" title=\"Sleep bonus\">sleep bonus</a> for double <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Skill\" title=\"Skill\">skill</a> gain.\n</p>', 0),
(5711, 1508, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'As furniture, a canopy bed may be used as a decoration in addition to the uses described below. Sleeping You can logout in canopy bed, accumulating useful sleep bonus the longer you are offline. Right-click the bed and select \'Bed\' > \'Sleep\'. A canopy bed can only be slept on if it is inside a completed house. Otherwise the following message will display in your event window: The house is too windy to provide protection. To find out if a bed is available or who is sleeping in it, examine it. If the bed is occupied, it will say: Some kind of mysterious haze lingers over the canopy bed, and you notice that the canopy bed is occupied by the spirit of <playername> . After the sleeper has accumulated the maximum sleep bonus (5 hours), the bed will be automatically freed up for other players to sleep in. If the canopy bed is not on your own deed, there will be a 60 second timer for sleeping in it. Sleeping damages a canopy bed, regardless of the house being on a deed or not. Renting If you have manage item permissions of the house, you can rent beds to other players for coins , making it possible to earn money by running an inn . Right-click the bed and Select \'Bed\' > \'Rent 10 iron\' coins, \'Rent 25 iron\', \'Rent 50 iron\', \'Rent 1 copper\', \'Rent 10 copper\', \'Rent 1 silver\', \'Rent 10 silver\', or \'No rent\'. If you rent yourself a bed, the money will be withdrawn from your inventory and you will then logout to sleep.', '<p>As furniture, a canopy bed may be used as a decoration in addition to the uses described below.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sleeping\">Sleeping</span></h3>\n<p>You can logout in canopy bed, accumulating useful sleep bonus the longer you are offline. Right-click the bed and select \'Bed\' &gt; \'Sleep\'.\n</p>\n<ul><li>A canopy bed can only be slept on if it is inside a completed house. Otherwise the following message will display in your event window: <span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 10px 10px 10px 10px; display: block; width: 70%;\">The house is too windy to provide protection.</span></li>\n<li>To find out if a bed is available or who is sleeping in it, <a href=\"/index.php/Examine\" title=\"Examine\">examine</a> it. If the bed is occupied, it will say: <span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 10px 10px 10px 10px; display: block; width: 70%;\">Some kind of mysterious haze lingers over the canopy bed, and you notice that the canopy bed is occupied by the spirit of <i>&lt;playername&gt;</i>.</span></li>\n<li>After the sleeper has accumulated the maximum sleep bonus (5 hours), the bed will be automatically freed up for other players to sleep in.</li>\n<li>If the canopy bed is not on your own deed, there will be a 60 second timer for sleeping in it.</li>\n<li>Sleeping damages a canopy bed, regardless of the house being on a deed or not.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Renting\">Renting</span></h3>\n<p>If you have manage item permissions of the house, you can rent beds to other players for <a href=\"/index.php/Bank_of_Wurm\" title=\"Bank of Wurm\">coins</a>, making it possible to earn money by running an <a href=\"/index.php/Inn\" title=\"Inn\">inn</a>.\n</p>\n<p>Right-click the bed and Select \'Bed\' &gt; \'Rent 10 iron\' coins, \'Rent 25 iron\', \'Rent 50 iron\', \'Rent 1 copper\', \'Rent 10 copper\', \'Rent 1 silver\', \'Rent 10 silver\', or \'No rent\'.\n</p>\n<p>If you rent yourself a bed, the money will be withdrawn from your inventory and you will then logout to sleep.\n</p>', 1),
(5712, 1508, 'Creating', 'Creating', 'The quality of the head board affects the success chance when creating. The bed frame is damaged if you fail. Wood type is determined by the last wooden piece added. Beds can only be started inside a house. It does not have to be a finished house though. You could also build a new house around an existing bed. A bed cannot occupy the same tile as another bed or storage bin .  It can share a tile with a forge or oven. You can use furs larger than what the bed needs. When you add a fur, it will use one kilogram and give you back the rest. Total materials required 25x planks 4x shafts 4x small nails 3x large nails 8x cotton sheets (1.50 kg each) 8x furs (1.00 kg each)', '<ul><li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Head_board\" title=\"Head board\">head board</a> affects the success chance when creating.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/index.php/Bed_frame\" title=\"Bed frame\">bed frame</a> is <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damaged</a> if you fail.</li>\n<li>Wood type is determined by the last wooden piece added.</li>\n<li>Beds can only be started inside a house. It does not have to be a finished house though. You could also build a new house around an existing bed.</li>\n<li>A bed cannot occupy the same tile as another bed or <a href=\"/index.php/Storage_bin\" title=\"Storage bin\">storage bin</a>.  It can share a tile with a forge or oven.</li>\n<li>You can use furs larger than what the bed needs. When you add a fur, it will use one kilogram and give you back the rest.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Total_materials_required\">Total materials required</span></h3>\n<ul><li>25x <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">planks</a></li>\n<li>4x <a href=\"/index.php/Shaft\" title=\"Shaft\">shafts</a></li>\n<li>4x <a href=\"/index.php/Small_nails\" title=\"Small nails\">small nails</a></li>\n<li>3x <a href=\"/index.php/Large_nails\" title=\"Large nails\">large nails</a></li>\n<li>8x <a href=\"/index.php/Cotton_sheet\" title=\"Cotton sheet\">cotton sheets</a> (1.50 kg each)</li>\n<li>8x <a href=\"/index.php/Fur\" title=\"Fur\">furs</a> (1.00 kg each)</li></ul>', 2),
(5713, 1508, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 65. Can not be picked up by hand. Can be loaded into a Rowing boat , Large cart , or anything bigger. Able to have items placed on it.', '<ul><li>Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 65.</li>\n<li>Can not be picked up by hand.</li>\n<li>Can be loaded into a <a href=\"/index.php/Rowing_boat\" title=\"Rowing boat\">Rowing boat</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">Large cart</a>, or anything bigger.</li>\n<li>Able to have items placed on it.</li></ul>', 3),
(5714, 1508, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Bed Straw bed Bedroll Festive bedroll', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Bed\" title=\"Bed\">Bed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Straw_bed\" title=\"Straw bed\">Straw bed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bedroll\" title=\"Bedroll\">Bedroll</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Festive_bedroll\" title=\"Festive bedroll\">Festive bedroll</a></li></ul>', 4),
(5715, 1509, 'Description', 'Description', 'A comfortable wooden bench with wrought-iron decorations.', '<p><i>A comfortable wooden bench with wrought-iron decorations.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5716, 1509, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used as decoration.', '<ul><li>Used as decoration.</li></ul>', 1),
(5717, 1509, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 35. Cannot be picked up by hand Can be loaded with Large cart or above', '<ul><li>Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 35.</li>\n<li>Cannot be picked up by hand</li>\n<li>Can be loaded with <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">Large cart</a> or above</li></ul>', 2),
(5718, 1510, 'Description', 'Description', 'A large wardrobe with wooden inlays.', '<p><i>A large wardrobe with wooden inlays.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5719, 1510, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used as decoration. Only armour can be placed inside the Wardrobe.', '<ul><li>Used as decoration.</li>\n<li>Only armour can be placed inside the Wardrobe.</li></ul>', 1),
(5720, 1510, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 55. Can not be picked up by hand. Can be loaded with a Large cart or above. Can be locked with a small or large padlock', '<ul><li>Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 55.</li>\n<li>Can not be picked up by hand.</li>\n<li>Can be loaded with a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">Large cart</a> or above.</li>\n<li>Can be locked with a small or large <a href=\"/index.php/Padlock\" title=\"Padlock\">padlock</a></li></ul>', 2),
(5721, 1511, 'Description', 'Description', 'A wooden coffer. Simple yet beautifully decorated.', '<p><i>A wooden coffer. Simple yet beautifully decorated.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5722, 1511, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can store items. It holds the same amount and type of items as a large chest . Some items may be placed on top of the coffer, as decoration. Since the item is a container already, any items placed on it will be dropped on the ground when it is loaded; a message in event log will notify the player of this. Requires fine carpentry skill of 24 or above. Can be loaded into a large cart or above. Can not be picked up by hand. Can be locked with a small or large padlock . Does not stop decay.', '<ul><li>Can store items. It holds the same amount and type of items as a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_chest\" title=\"Large chest\">large chest</a>.</li>\n<li>Some items may be placed on top of the coffer, as decoration. Since the item is a container already, any items placed on it will be dropped on the ground when it is loaded; a message in event log will notify the player of this.</li>\n<li>Requires fine carpentry skill of 24 or above.</li>\n<li>Can be loaded into a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">large cart</a> or above.</li>\n<li>Can not be picked up by hand.</li>\n<li>Can be locked with a small or large <a href=\"/index.php/Padlock\" title=\"Padlock\">padlock</a>.</li>\n<li>Does not stop decay.</li></ul>', 1),
(5723, 1512, 'Description', 'Description', 'A Royal Throne.', '<p><i>A Royal Throne.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(5724, 1512, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used as decoration.', '<ul><li>Used as decoration.</li></ul>', 1),
(5725, 1512, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be loaded into large cart or above. Can be picked up by hand. Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 70 (for creation and continuing). Will fit into a mailbox. Wood types show their various colors. Wood type is determined by the last wood piece attached.', '<ul><li>Can be loaded into <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">large cart</a> or above.</li>\n<li>Can be picked up by hand.</li>\n<li>Skill Requirement: Fine Carpentry 70 (for creation and continuing).</li>\n<li>Will fit into a mailbox.</li>\n<li>Wood types show their various colors. Wood type is determined by the last wood piece attached.</li></ul>', 2),
