(5731, 1514, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be loaded into a large cart or bigger. Can be picked up by hand. Able to have items placed on it, though not all items will fit. Will fit into a mailbox.', '<ul><li>Can be loaded into a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">large cart</a> or bigger.</li>\n<li>Can be picked up by hand.</li>\n<li>Able to have items placed on it, though not all items will fit.</li>\n<li>Will fit into a mailbox.</li></ul>', 2),
