(5775, 1524, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Skill Requirement: 40 Cloth tailoring. Can be picked up by hand. Cannot be mailed Carpets made before 07-Mar-2023 patch keep their original look - See image below for size and color comparison;  small red carpet (aka small colourful carpet ), medium blue carpet (aka Medium colourful carpet ), and large gold carpet (aka Large colourful carpet). The trim can be dyed with 300g of dye. The base of the carpet can be dyed with 1000g of dye. Existing color can be removed using lye to remove the dye.', '<ul><li>Skill Requirement: 40 Cloth tailoring.</li>\n<li>Can be picked up by hand.</li>\n<li>Cannot be <a href=\"/index.php/Mail\" title=\"Mail\">mailed</a></li>\n<li>Carpets made before 07-Mar-2023 patch keep their original look - See image below for size and color comparison;  small red carpet (aka <a href=\"/index.php/Small_colourful_carpet\" title=\"Small colourful carpet\">small colourful carpet</a> ), medium blue carpet (aka <a href=\"/index.php/Medium_colourful_carpet\" title=\"Medium colourful carpet\">Medium colourful carpet</a> ), and large gold carpet (aka Large colourful carpet).</li>\n<li>The trim can be dyed with 300g of dye.</li>\n<li>The base of the carpet can be dyed with 1000g of dye.</li>\n<li>Existing color can be removed using <a href=\"/index.php/Lye\" title=\"Lye\">lye</a> to remove the dye.</li></ul>\n<p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Carpet_size_comparison.PNG\"><img alt=\"Carpet size comparison.PNG\" data-file-height=\"239\" data-file-width=\"893\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"134\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/4b/Carpet_size_comparison.PNG/500px-Carpet_size_comparison.PNG\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/4b/Carpet_size_comparison.PNG/750px-Carpet_size_comparison.PNG 1.5x, /images/4/4b/Carpet_size_comparison.PNG 2x\" width=\"500\"/></a>\n</p>', 2),
