(6140, 1635, 'Description', 'Description', 'A sturdy rectangular table made from marble.', '<p><i>A sturdy rectangular table made from marble.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(6141, 1635, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used as decoration.', '<ul><li>Used as decoration.</li></ul>', 1),
(6142, 1635, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be picked up after completion. You need atleast 50 Stone cutting skill. Able to have items placed on it.', '<ul><li>Can be picked up after completion.</li>\n<li>You need atleast 50 Stone cutting skill.</li>\n<li>Able to have items placed on it.</li></ul>', 2),
(6155, 1640, 'Description', 'Description', 'A wooden cupboard, used to store all kinds of small items.', '<p><i>A wooden cupboard, used to store all kinds of small items.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(6156, 1640, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Requires 40 fine carpentry to begin and/or continue creation. The volume of a cupboard is 572 L, slightly larger than a coffin . It cannot hold logs or fishing poles. Nail quality influences creation chance. Plank quality does not. It is about waist high, 2 meters long and 0.5 meter deep. You could put 12-16 on a tile and they wouldn\'t overlap. Although, they can overlap if needed. Rename text is displayed on mouseover and you can use up to 20 characters for the name. It can be picked up by hand or loaded in a wagon or a large cart . It can only be placed inside another container with load . Trying to drag it from your inventory into, say a wagon, won\'t work. If you load it into that same wagon it will work. It can be locked with a small padlock', '<ul><li>Requires 40 fine carpentry to begin and/or continue creation.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/index.php/Volume\" title=\"Volume\">volume</a> of a cupboard is 572 L, slightly larger than a <a href=\"/index.php/Coffin\" title=\"Coffin\">coffin</a>.</li>\n<li>It cannot hold logs or fishing poles.</li>\n<li>Nail <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> influences creation chance. Plank quality does not.</li>\n<li>It is about waist high, 2 meters long and 0.5 meter deep. You could put 12-16 on a tile and they wouldn\'t overlap. Although, they can overlap if needed.</li>\n<li>Rename text is displayed on mouseover and you can use up to 20 characters for the name.</li>\n<li>It can be picked up by hand or loaded in a <a href=\"/index.php/Wagon\" title=\"Wagon\">wagon</a> or a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">large cart</a>.</li>\n<li>It can only be placed inside another container with <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Load\" title=\"Load\">load</a>. Trying to drag it from your inventory into, say a wagon, won\'t work. If you load it into that same wagon it will work.</li>\n<li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Small_padlock\" title=\"Small padlock\">small padlock</a></li></ul>', 1),
(6157, 1640, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Container', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Container\" title=\"Container\">Container</a></li></ul>', 2),
(6158, 1641, 'Description', 'Description', 'A nice woven Tapestry made of wool with a motif of festivities.', '<p><i>A nice woven Tapestry made of wool with a motif of festivities.</i>\n</p>', 0),
