(6177, 1650, 'Table of Weapons', 'Table_of_Weapons', 'Legend Note: Most or all of these values are modified by other factors during combat, and should generally only be used for comparing weapons to each other. Name : Name of item Skills : Parent skill category to which the weapon belongs. Damage Type : The type of damage the weapon deals by default. Wielding : Whether the weapon is held in one or both hands. Weight : How much the weapon weighs by default. Strength : How much damage the weapon deals per hit. Attack Speed : How much time, in seconds, it takes to swing the weapon. Strength/Second : Damage per second ( Strength divided by Attack Speed ). Critical Chance : Modifies chance to perform a critical hit with the weapon. Reach : How far away the wielder can be from the opponent and still be within optimal range. Parry Percent : Modifies chance to parry with the weapon. Skill Penalty : Penalty to Combat Rating , normally applied to weapons primarily used as tools, such as pickaxes and sickles. Name Skills Damage Type Wielding Weight Strength Attack Speed Strength/ Second Critical Chance Reach Parry Percent Skill Penalty Short sword Swords > Shortsword Slashing/Piercing One-handed 2.0kg 4.0 3.0s 1.333 10% 2 100% 0 Long sword Swords > Longsword Slashing/Piercing One-handed 3.0kg 5.5 4.0s 1.375 1% 3 100% 0 Two handed sword Swords > Two handed sword Slashing/Piercing Two-handed 4.0kg 9.0 5.0s 1.800 5% 4 100% 0 Sword of Magranon Swords Slashing/Piercing Two-handed 5.0kg 15.0 5.0s 3.000 8% 4 100% 0 Small maul Mauls Crushing One-handed 3.0kg 4.5 3.0s 1.500 1% 2 100% 0 Medium maul Mauls Crushing One-handed 4.0kg 8.0 5.0s 1.600 3% 3 100% 0 Large maul Mauls Crushing Two-handed 5.0kg 11.0 6.0s 1.833 3% 4 100% 0 Hammer of Magranon Hammers Crushing One-handed 7.0kg 18.0 6.0s 3.000 8% 4 100% 0 Sceptre of ascension Mauls Crushing One-handed 5.0kg 17.0 6.0s 2.833 8% 3 100% 0 Huge shod club Clubs Crushing Two-handed 15.0kg 7.0 6.0s 1.167 1% 4 100% 2 Small axe Axes Slashing One-