(6822, 1774, 'Kill Count', 'Kill_Count', 'The following Whitelighters have fallen to members of The Horde since its founding: Baldeagleog: 5x Maincorpse: 4x Thothtoo: 4x Papichulopanchito: 4x Fogshark: 3x Awesomefusion 3x Christa: 2x Xandroth: 2x WSrich: 2x Jalted: 2x Ginog: 2x Ericartman: 2x Kraegar: 2x Shyana: 2x Undeadman 2x Maxthx 2x Zaz: 1x xxcaliburslave:1x Legionaire: 1x Fudd: 1x Adamz: 1x Sunny: 1x Siimerophwa: 1x Salkanor: 1x Kremlin: 1x Jyin: 1x Goldielox: 1x Rekhyt: 1x wtfcn: 1x Uberbear: 1x Horton: 1x Fernando: 1x Vean: 1x Smackeddown: 1x Rayjon 1x Christian 1x cneate 1x Perezi 1x Fomar 1x Robbinman 1x Rat 1x Pinejon 1x Kingbob (WL Alt) .... we\'ve lost count', '<p>The following Whitelighters have fallen to members of The Horde since its founding:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Baldeagleog: 5x</li>\n<li>Maincorpse: 4x</li>\n<li>Thothtoo: 4x</li>\n<li>Papichulopanchito: 4x</li>\n<li>Fogshark: 3x</li>\n<li>Awesomefusion 3x</li>\n<li>Christa: 2x</li>\n<li>Xandroth: 2x</li>\n<li>WSrich: 2x</li>\n<li>Jalted: 2x</li>\n<li>Ginog: 2x</li>\n<li>Ericartman: 2x</li>\n<li>Kraegar: 2x</li>\n<li>Shyana: 2x</li>\n<li>Undeadman 2x</li>\n<li>Maxthx 2x</li>\n<li>Zaz: 1x</li>\n<li>xxcaliburslave:1x</li>\n<li>Legionaire: 1x</li>\n<li>Fudd: 1x</li>\n<li>Adamz: 1x</li>\n<li>Sunny: 1x</li>\n<li>Siimerophwa: 1x</li>\n<li>Salkanor: 1x</li>\n<li>Kremlin: 1x</li>\n<li>Jyin: 1x</li>\n<li>Goldielox: 1x</li>\n<li>Rekhyt: 1x</li>\n<li>wtfcn: 1x</li>\n<li>Uberbear: 1x</li>\n<li>Horton: 1x</li>\n<li>Fernando: 1x</li>\n<li>Vean: 1x</li>\n<li>Smackeddown: 1x</li>\n<li>Rayjon 1x</li>\n<li>Christian 1x</li>\n<li>cneate 1x</li>\n<li>Perezi 1x</li>\n<li>Fomar 1x</li>\n<li>Robbinman 1x</li>\n<li>Rat 1x</li>\n<li>Pinejon 1x</li>\n<li>Kingbob (WL Alt) .... we\'ve lost count</li></ul>', 1),
(6823, 1776, 'Infos', 'Infos', 'The settlement of Altopiano SGA was founded at 04:02:36 on day of Tears in week 1 of the Raven\'s starfall in the year of 1013. We are currently recruiting italian speaking players (only because we communicate mainly with Mumble), we accept non-premium players but only if they are going to become premium soon. Citizens There is plenty of land available inside our 29 tiles perimeter in which all citizens can build their own houses and pen, premium citizens can even move on one of the available houses inside the village. If you wish to become a citizen, we only ask you to be prepared to join in with the village projects and to help the other citizens. We are looking especially for players who are prepared to give a long term commitment to the village. Resources The village has a 89 tiles farm growing vegetables , cereals , wemp plants and cotton , we have our own mine and we keep bulls , cows , deers and horses . There are 2 public big fish spots not far from our village where you can fish marlins and white sharks Harbour We have a little harbour south of our village where we keep our boats. Click on the image for a full-size version. More infos For more info please contact Spaccaossi in-game or through our site(in italian)', '<p>The settlement of Altopiano SGA was founded at 04:02:36 on day of Tears in week 1 of the Raven\'s starfall in the year of 1013.\n</p>\n<p>We are currently recruiting italian speaking players (only because we communicate mainly with Mumble), we accept non-premium players but only if they are going to become premium soon.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Citizens\">Citizens</span></h3>\n<p>There is plenty of land available inside our 29 tiles perimeter in which all citizens can build their own houses and pen, premium citizens can even move on one of the available houses inside the village.\n</p>\n<p>If you wish to become a citizen, we only ask you to be prepared to join in with the village projects and to help the other citizens. We are looking especially for players who are prepared to give a long term commitment to the village.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span></h3>\n<p>The village has a 89 tiles farm growing <a href=\"/index.php/Vegetables\" title=\"Vegetables\">vegetables</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Cereals\" title=\"Cereals\">cereals</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wemp_plants\" title=\"Wemp plants\">wemp plants</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Cotton\" title=\"Cotton\">cotton</a>, we have our own mine and we keep <a href=\"/index.php/Bull\" title=\"Bull\">bulls</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cows\" title=\"Cows\">cows</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Deers\" title=\"Deers\">deers</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Horse\" title=\"Horse\">horses</a>.\n</p>\n<p>There are 2 public big fish spots not far from our village where you can fish <a href=\"/index.php/Marlin\" title=\"Marlin\">marlins</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/White_shark\" title=\"White shark\">white sharks</a>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Harbour\">Harbour</span></h3>\n<p>We have a little harbour south of our village where we keep our boats.\n</p>\n<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://img801.imageshack.us/img801/1050/wurm201108150456.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"wurm201108150456.th.jpg\" src=\"http://img801.imageshack.us/img801/1050/wurm201108150456.th.jpg\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p>Click on the image for a full-size version.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"More_infos\">More infos</span></h3>\n<p>For more info please contact Spaccaossi in-game or through <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.clansga.it\" rel=\"nofollow\">our site(in italian)</a>\n</p>', 0),
(6824, 1776, 'Planning', 'Planning', 'Here\'s a picture of how the village is planned to become: Click on the image for a full-size version. The village in not entirely completed yet, we only have to build some premium player\'s houses, but most of the hark work has already been done.', '<p>Here\'s a picture of how the village is planned to become:\n</p>\n<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://imageshack.us/photo/my-images/35/villaggio.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"villaggio.th.jpg\" src=\"http://img35.imageshack.us/img35/5996/villaggio.th.jpg\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p>Click on the image for a full-size version.\n</p>\n<p>The village in not entirely completed yet, we only have to build some premium player\'s houses, but most of the hark work has already been done.\n</p>', 1),
(6825, 1776, 'Citizens', 'Citizens_2', 'Here\'s a no fixed order list of our citizens: Spaccaossi (Mayor) Darkraffa (mascot)', '<p>Here\'s a no fixed order list of our citizens:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Spaccaossi (Mayor)</b></li>\n<li>Darkraffa (mascot)</li></ul>', 2),
(6826, 1776, 'Ex Citizens', 'Ex_Citizens', 'Davy (co-founder) GiuseppeP (handyman) Padremaronno - (Priest of Vynora ) Harrypotter - (Priest of Magranon ) Orione - (Priest of Fo ) HedVoix updated -- GiuseppeP 08:02, 5 April 2012 (UTC)', '<ul><li><b>Davy (co-founder)</b></li>\n<li>GiuseppeP (handyman)</li>\n<li>Padremaronno - (Priest of <a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a>)</li>\n<li>Harrypotter - (Priest of <a href=\"/index.php/Magranon\" title=\"Magranon\">Magranon</a>)</li>\n<li>Orione - (Priest of <a href=\"/index.php/Fo\" title=\"Fo\">Fo</a>)</li>\n<li>HedVoix</li></ul>\n<p>updated --<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/User:GiuseppeP\" title=\"User:GiuseppeP\">GiuseppeP</a> 08:02, 5 April 2012 (UTC)\n</p>', 3),
(6827, 1777, 'Description', 'Description', 'Homestead founded by Kevhar (Wesnc\'s Alt)', '<p>Homestead founded by Kevhar (Wesnc\'s Alt)\n</p>', 0),
(6828, 1777, 'Info', 'Info', 'Size 5 homestead pretty much,  nothing more.', '<p>Size 5 homestead pretty much,  nothing more.\n</p>', 1),
(6829, 1778, 'Members', 'Members', 'DISBANDED', '<p><b>DISBANDED</b>\n</p>', 0),
