lptor</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Lumberjack\" title=\"Lumberjack\">Lumberjack</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Lordfox\" title=\"Player:Lordfox\">Lordfox</a> <b> Priest </b></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Offices\" title=\"Offices\">Harbinger</a></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Residents\">Residents</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Bula</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Keeper_of_Faith\" title=\"Keeper of Faith\">Keeper of Faith</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Digger\" title=\"Digger\">Digger</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Excavator\" title=\"Excavator\">Excavator</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Corbindallis</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Digger\" title=\"Digger\">Digger</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Miner\" title=\"Miner\">Miner</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mason\" title=\"Mason\">Mason</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Dipse\" title=\"Player:Dipse\">Dipse</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Digger\" title=\"Digger\">Digger</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Gwiazdka</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Grartlush</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Tanner\" title=\"Tanner\">Tanner</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Rydian</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Digger\" title=\"Digger\">Digger</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Near</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Lumberjack\" title=\"Lumberjack\">Lumberjack</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Vircung</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Carpenter\" title=\"Carpenter\">Carpenter</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Digger\" title=\"Digger\">Digger</a>,</dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Zivenpl</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Lumberjack\" title=\"Lumberjack\">Lumberjack</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Digger\" title=\"Digger\">Digger</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Bowmaker\" title=\"Bowmaker\">Bowmaker</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Carpenter\" title=\"Carpenter\">Carpenter</a></dd></dl>', 1),
(6904, 1810, 'Village history', 'Village_history', 'January 11, 2008 8:02:14 PM Iaqb founded February 8, 2008 2:32:26 PM Wwiiol drained 93 copper and 75 iron from the coffers June 1, 2008 23:43:19 Iaqb expanded to the size of 10. Aug 27, 2008 12:26:16 PM iaqb starts disbanding Aug 28, 2008 13:35:29 The village of Kaer Morhen has been disbanded by Iaqb [13:35:29] It is 01:46:40 on day of Tears in week 1 of the starfall of the Leaf in the year of 991. \n[13:35:29] The village of Kaer Morhen has just been disbanded by Iaqb.', '<ul><li>January 11, 2008 8:02:14 PM <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Iaqb\" title=\"Player:Iaqb\">Iaqb</a> founded <br/></li>\n<li>February 8, 2008 2:32:26 PM Wwiiol drained 93 copper and 75 iron from the coffers</li>\n<li>June 1, 2008 23:43:19 <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Iaqb\" title=\"Player:Iaqb\">Iaqb</a> expanded to the size of 10.</li>\n<li>Aug 27, 2008 12:26:16 PM iaqb starts disbanding</li>\n<li>Aug 28, 2008 13:35:29 The village of Kaer Morhen has been disbanded by Iaqb</li></ul>\n<pre>[13:35:29] It is 01:46:40 on day of Tears in week 1 of the starfall of the Leaf in the year of 991. \n[13:35:29] The village of Kaer Morhen has just been disbanded by Iaqb.\n</pre>', 2),
(6905, 1810, 'Raid\'s logs', 'Raid.27s_logs', '[22:18:49] Addamm proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of Fyrkat. [00:45:56] Keihn proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron she found in the coffers of Ptoutpost. (with Dark Citadel ) [01:01:20] Rozare proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron she found in the coffers of Bexley South Outpost. (with S M) [02:04:22] Rozare proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron she found in the coffers of Valenwood Outpost. (with S M) [03:19:46] Rozare proudly displays the 2 silver and 25 copper she found in the coffers of Springfield. (with S M) [03:52:19] Jot proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of Austria. (with S M) [04:07:58] Jot proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of Vision Bay. (with S M) [05:06:23] Rozare proudly displays the  56 copper and 25 iron she found in the coffers of Fyrkat. (with S M) [21:08:43] Jot proudly displays the 56 copper and 25 iron he found in the coffers of Fyrkat. (with S M) [00:36:12] Iaqb proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of  Homeside. (with S M) [21:02:13] Iaqb proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of  Fyrkat. (with S M)', '<p>[22:18:49] Addamm proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of Fyrkat. <br/>\n[00:45:56] Keihn proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron she found in the coffers of Ptoutpost. (with <a class=\"new\" href=\"/index.php?title=Dark_Citadel&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Dark Citadel (page does not exist)\">Dark Citadel</a>) <br/>\n[01:01:20] Rozare proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron she found in the coffers of Bexley South Outpost. (with S M) <br/>\n[02:04:22] Rozare proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron she found in the coffers of Valenwood Outpost. (with S M) <br/>\n[03:19:46] Rozare proudly displays the 2 silver and 25 copper she found in the coffers of Springfield. (with S M) <br/>\n[03:52:19] Jot proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of Austria. (with S M) <br/>\n[04:07:58] Jot proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of Vision Bay. (with S M) <br/>\n[05:06:23] Rozare proudly displays the  56 copper and 25 iron she found in the coffers of Fyrkat. (with S M) <br/>\n[21:08:43] Jot proudly displays the 56 copper and 25 iron he found in the coffers of Fyrkat. (with S M)<br/>\n[00:36:12] Iaqb proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of  Homeside. (with S M)<br/>\n[21:02:13] Iaqb proudly displays the 37 copper and 50 iron he found in the coffers of  Fyrkat. (with S M)<br/>\n</p>', 3),
(6906, 1811, 'General Information', 'General_Information', 'A subsection of CAPSALOT, In celebration of The Great Cubeman and his good deeds to Wurm Online. It stands for Colossus Of CAPSALOT', '<p>A subsection of CAPSALOT, In celebration of The Great Cubeman and his good deeds to Wurm Online. It stands for Colossus Of CAPSALOT\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
