(6964, 1828, 'Drains / Raids', 'Drains_.2F_Raids', 'Lions head Memorial park - 37c 50i - 29/04/2008 Participants: Raffeh, Chjees, JayZ, SheepMan Oceans Veiw - 37c 50i -  1/05/2008 Participants: Raffeh, Chjees, JayZ, SheepMan, darius, balmore, taya. Springfeild - No Drain (BUG) - 1/05/2008 Participants: Raffeh, Chjees, JayZ, SheepMan, balmore, taya, darius. Tower Bashing - 15 Towers Bashed - 2/05/2008 Participants: Most of MR =] Rivendell - 06/05/08 Participants: SheepMan, Jayz, Chjees, Tommty, Taya, Topdog, Balmore, Kingen, zarnibuddha, longshanks. Tradepost (TP) - 37c 50i - 25/05/2008 Participants: Raffeh, JayZ, SheepMan Hammerfell - 2 artifacts stolen - 25/05/2008 Participants: Obliion, LO, Camelot and Woodscove', '<p><b>Lions head Memorial park - 37c 50i - 29/04/2008  </b> <br/> Participants: Raffeh, Chjees, JayZ, SheepMan\n</p>\n<p><b>Oceans Veiw - 37c 50i -  1/05/2008 </b> <br/> Participants: Raffeh, Chjees, JayZ, SheepMan, darius, balmore, taya.\n</p>\n<p><b>Springfeild - No Drain (BUG) - 1/05/2008  </b> <br/> Participants: Raffeh, Chjees, JayZ, SheepMan, balmore, taya, darius.\n</p>\n<p><b>Tower Bashing - 15 Towers Bashed - 2/05/2008  </b> <br/> Participants: Most of MR =]\n</p>\n<p><b>Rivendell - 06/05/08 </b> <br/> Participants: SheepMan, Jayz, Chjees, Tommty, Taya, Topdog, Balmore, Kingen, zarnibuddha, longshanks.\n</p>\n<p><b>Tradepost (TP) - 37c 50i - 25/05/2008  </b> <br/> Participants: Raffeh, JayZ, SheepMan\n</p>\n<p><b>Hammerfell - 2 artifacts stolen - 25/05/2008  </b> <br/> Participants: Obliion, LO, Camelot and Woodscove\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(6965, 1828, 'Founded on', 'Founded_on', 'Founded on 08/04/2008', '<p>Founded on 08/04/2008\n</p>', 6),
(6966, 1829, 'Description', 'Description', 'Located West-Northwest on the mainland (around 9x, 13y), with a large deposit of public clay . Founded on September 6th, 2010. Current size is 15x13. Aggressive Animals are rather scarce here, but have been seen here and there. The settlement has a personal guard tower nearby just incase, with two guards.', '<p>Located West-Northwest on the mainland (around 9x, 13y), with a large deposit of public <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a>. Founded on September 6th, 2010.\n<br/>Current size is 15x13.\n</p>\n<p>Aggressive Animals are rather scarce here, but have been seen here and there. The settlement has a personal <a href=\"/index.php/Guard_tower\" title=\"Guard tower\">guard tower</a> nearby just incase, with two guards.\n<br/>\n</p>', 0),
(6967, 1829, 'Land History', 'Land_History', 'Not much is known about who lived at the spot before Dragonhead saw it. What is, it was named Saltwater Bay, founded over a year ago. It was a port settlement for Kinsaitos, which is just east-southeast up the road. The area was in disrepair when Dragonhead saw it. Trees growing on the top tier and lots of missing fences. But it was like the area was calling to him.', '<p>Not much is known about who lived at the spot before Dragonhead saw it. What is, it was named Saltwater Bay, founded over a year ago. It was a port settlement for Kinsaitos, which is just east-southeast up the road.\n</p>\n<p>The area was in disrepair when Dragonhead saw it. Trees growing on the top tier and lots of missing fences. But it was like the area was calling to him.\n</p>', 1),
(6968, 1829, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Dragonhead Beanietwo', '<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.wurmonline.com/wiki/index.php?title=Player:Dragonhead\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragonhead</a>\n<br/>Beanietwo\n</p>', 2),
(6969, 1832, 'The Town', 'The_Town', 'It is a town that includes a size 10 village deed , 3 size 5 homesteads and a size 5 village in an estimated 90x90 area. Acropolis is an upgrade-expansion of Sleepy Hollow .', '<p>It is a town that includes a size 10 village <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Deed\" title=\"Deed\">deed</a>, 3 size 5 homesteads and a size 5 village in an estimated 90x90 area. Acropolis is an upgrade-expansion of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sleepy_Hollow\" title=\"Sleepy Hollow\">Sleepy Hollow</a>.\n</p>', 0),
