(6990, 1837, 'Introduction', 'Introduction', 'Brown Bear Cove was a small village located on the Home Server , about twenty minutes north of Newtown.  It was named after the large amount of Brown Bears that inhabit the area and the small cove which the village centers around.  Brown Bear Cove was deeded as a homestead while the three citizens gathered enough currency to purchase a village deed.  They never did.', '<p><b>Brown Bear Cove</b> was a small <a href=\"/index.php/Settlement\" title=\"Settlement\">village</a> located on the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Server_Types#Home_Server\" title=\"Server Types\">Home Server</a>, about twenty minutes north of Newtown.  It was named after the large amount of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Brown_Bear\" title=\"Brown Bear\">Brown Bears</a> that inhabit the area and the small cove which the village centers around.  Brown Bear Cove was <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Deed\" title=\"Deed\">deeded</a> as a <a href=\"/index.php/Settlement\" title=\"Settlement\">homestead</a> while the three <a href=\"#Citizens\">citizens</a> gathered enough currency to purchase a village deed.  They never did.\n</p>', 0),
(6991, 1837, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Maincorpse Tigiot', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Maincorpse\" title=\"Player:Maincorpse\">Maincorpse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Tigiot\" title=\"Player:Tigiot\">Tigiot</a></li></ul>', 1),
(6992, 1837, 'Buildings', 'Buildings', 'BEWAREZ OF SHARKZ (Maincorpse\'s house) Surplusxmas\'s Forest Home Brown Bear Cove Shed Tigiot\'s House Brown Bear Inn The citizens of Brown Bear Cove also managed Brown Bear Inn , an eight tile building, which also served as a food merchant , safe haven, and resting place about 22 to 25 minutes north of Newtown on the highway .  Brown Bear Inn was under construction at the time of the Wurmageddon .', '<ul><li>BEWAREZ OF SHARKZ (Maincorpse\'s house)</li>\n<li>Surplusxmas\'s Forest Home</li>\n<li>Brown Bear Cove Shed</li>\n<li>Tigiot\'s House</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brown_Bear_Inn\">Brown Bear Inn</span></h3>\n<p>The citizens of Brown Bear Cove also managed <a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_settlement\" title=\"Undefined settlement\">Brown Bear Inn</a>, an eight tile building, which also served as a <a href=\"/index.php/Hot_food_cooking\" title=\"Hot food cooking\">food</a> <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Personal_Merchant\" title=\"Personal Merchant\">merchant</a>, safe haven, and resting place about 22 to 25 minutes north of Newtown on the <a href=\"/index.php/Highway\" title=\"Highway\">highway</a>.  Brown Bear Inn was under construction at the time of the <a href=\"/index.php/Wurmageddon\" title=\"Wurmageddon\">Wurmageddon</a>.\n</p>', 2),
(6993, 1837, 'Neighboring Towns', 'Neighboring_Towns', 'Cliffside Zealots\' Refuge Oakplace Newtown Lion\'s Head Kyara Donny\'s Place', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cliffside\" title=\"Cliffside\">Cliffside</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Zealots_Refuge\" title=\"Zealots Refuge\">Zealots\' Refuge</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Oakplace\" title=\"Oakplace\">Oakplace</a></li>\n<li>Newtown</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Lion%27s_Head\" title=\"Lion\'s Head\">Lion\'s Head</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Kyara\" title=\"Kyara\">Kyara</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Donny%27s_Place\" title=\"Donny\'s Place\">Donny\'s Place</a></li></ul>', 3),
(6994, 1839, 'Alliances', 'Alliances', 'Zealots Refuge', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Zealots_Refuge\" title=\"Zealots Refuge\">Zealots Refuge</a></li></ul>', 0),
(6995, 1840, 'History', 'History', 'Gavin (founder) first joined Wurm - like most - completely ignorant to the ways of Wurm. He quickly met Siementaa, who showed him how to play properly before he decided to embark upon a journey to build his own village atop a hill. After realizing the location he had chosen was not adequate for a decently-sized settlement, he moved back to an area around Newtown and started Southlands. Having many problems with the locals in the area, he once again set off to deed an area with his newly acquired size 10 village deed. It wasn\'t an easy task to find a proper area, however after much searching he decided to place his deed atop a large hill overlooking a beautiful lake, with many veins of different ore types, water, many different trees, clay, tar, and almost all other resources that are required. Since founding, building, and recruiting a few members, Gavin (with the help of citizens) has expanded Cliffside into several different size 5 deeds and plans to expand it further with four more size 5\'s. Cliffside is a rather secure location being on side a cliff so hard to enter from the back, And having main deed and 4 size 5 homesteads, We also have 5 guard towers scattered around mostly 50+ ql We plan to make cliffside a safe haven in case anything mischievous ever finds its way into homeserver or incase the spiders group up and go on a rampage :O NOTE: Gavin has now moved to the wild server in hopes to find something more thrilling than killing spiders, Also to make his other account a champion of vynora, And to benefit from the uncapped ore,', '<p>Gavin (founder) first joined Wurm - like most - completely ignorant to the ways of Wurm. He quickly met Siementaa, who showed him how to play properly before he decided to embark upon a journey to build his own village atop a hill. <br/>\nAfter realizing the location he had chosen was not adequate for a decently-sized settlement, he moved back to an area around Newtown and started Southlands. <br/>\nHaving many problems with the locals in the area, he once again set off to deed an area with his newly acquired size 10 village deed. It wasn\'t an easy task to find a proper area, however after much searching he decided to place his deed atop a large hill overlooking a beautiful lake, with many veins of different ore types, water, many different trees, clay, tar, and almost all other resources that are required. <br/>\nSince founding, building, and recruiting a few members, Gavin (with the help of citizens) has expanded Cliffside into several different size 5 deeds and plans to expand it further with four more size 5\'s.\n</p>\n<p>Cliffside is a rather secure location being on side a cliff so hard to enter from the back, And having main deed and 4 size 5 homesteads, We also have 5 guard towers scattered around mostly 50+ ql\n</p>\n<p>We plan to make cliffside a safe haven in case anything mischievous ever finds its way into homeserver or incase the spiders group up and go on a rampage :O\n<br/><br/><br/>\n<i><b>NOTE: Gavin has now moved to the wild server in hopes to find something more thrilling than killing spiders, Also to make his other account a champion of vynora, And to benefit from the uncapped ore,</b></i>\n<i></i>\n</p>', 0),
(6996, 1840, 'Elders/Co-Mayors', 'Elders.2FCo-Mayors', 'Plaier (Plaier is one of the most active members in cliffside and is the Mayor)', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Plaier\" title=\"User:Plaier\">Plaier</a> <font color=\"#000000\"> <i>(Plaier is one of the most active members in cliffside and is the Mayor)</i> </font></li></ul>', 1),
(6997, 1840, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Plaier (Armorsmith/Smith/Mason/Terraformer/Miner/Woodcutter/Weaponsmith) Jakeo (Platesmith) Zandarth (Blacksmith/Carpenter)', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Plaier\" title=\"User:Plaier\">Plaier</a> <font color=\"#000000\"> <i>(Armorsmith/Smith/Mason/Terraformer/Miner/Woodcutter/Weaponsmith)</i> </font></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Jakeo\" title=\"User:Jakeo\">Jakeo</a> <font color=\"#000000\"><i>(Platesmith)</i> </font></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Zandarth\" title=\"User:Zandarth\">Zandarth</a> <font color=\"#000000\"><i>(Blacksmith/Carpenter)</i> </font></li></ul>', 2),
(6998, 1840, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Greenwolf None Plaier Digger + Lumberjack + Miner + Chainsmith + Handyman Siementaa None Sayers Close Dilzi None Zandarth Carpenter+Blacksmith', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Greenwolf\" title=\"User:Greenwolf\">Greenwolf</a> <font color=\"#000000\"> <i>None</i> </font></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Plaier\" title=\"User:Plaier\">Plaier</a> <font color=\"#000000\"> <i>Digger + Lumberjack + Miner + Chainsmith + Handyman</i> </font></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Siementaa\" title=\"User:Siementaa\">Siementaa</a> <font color=\"#000000\"><i>None</i> </font></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Sayers\" title=\"User:Sayers\">Sayers</a> <font color=\"#000000\"><i>Close</i> </font></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Dilzi\" title=\"User:Dilzi\">Dilzi</a> <font color=\"#000000\"><i>None</i> </font></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Zandarth\" title=\"User:Zandarth\">Zandarth</a> <font color=\"#000000\"><i>Carpenter+Blacksmith</i></font></li></ul>', 3),
(6999, 1840, 'Shops & Buildings', 'Shops_.26_Buildings', 'Note: All cliffside merchants have moved to the market valley just outside Newtown,\nWe have enchantments meals armor and weapons for sale there =]', '<p>Note: All cliffside merchants have moved to the market valley just outside Newtown,\nWe have enchantments meals armor and weapons for sale there =]\n</p>', 4),
(7000, 1840, 'Directions', 'Directions', 'From newtown cross the landbridge and follow till you get to a crossroads When you see the sign saying cliffside and pointing follow that road until you come to a Y bend Turn right and follow along keep following the Wide 2 tile road ignoring the \"Cliffside Side Lane\" sign once you are 15 minutes into the highway Just around the corner you should see the entrance to cliffside with some gates and guard towers', '<p>From newtown cross the landbridge and follow till you get to a crossroads<br/>\nWhen you see the sign saying cliffside and pointing follow that road until you come to a Y bend<br/>\nTurn right and follow along keep following the Wide 2 tile road ignoring the \"Cliffside Side Lane\" sign once you are 15 minutes into the highway<br/>\nJust around the corner you should see the entrance to cliffside with some gates and guard towers<br/>\n</p>', 5),
(7001, 1840, 'Closest Towns', 'Closest_Towns', 'Vires Lion\'s Head Newtown Rockcliff Brown Bear Cove Ravens Keep', '<ul><li>Vires</li>\n<li>Lion\'s Head</li>\n<li>Newtown</li>\n<li>Rockcliff</li>\n<li>Brown Bear Cove</li>\n<li>Ravens Keep</li></ul>', 6),
(7002, 1840, 'Closest Homesteads', 'Closest_Homesteads', 'Planck and Raheny\'s Farm Rosethorn Stabbish\'s Province Ilzid Lenoel', '<ul><li>Planck and Raheny\'s Farm</li>\n<li>Rosethorn</li>\n<li>Stabbish\'s Province</li>\n<li>Ilzid Lenoel</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 7),
(7003, 1840, 'Screenshots', 'Screenshots', 'None Atm', '<ul><li>None Atm</li></ul>', 8),
(7004, 1841, 'Local Information', 'Local_Information', 'Located on the east side of the highway between Lion\'s Head and Rockcliff Darashurth is within reach of clay, iron, tar and gold. Local trees are mostly pine and there is a high density of wolves and bears. Just north of the main deed is the Darashurth Estates homestead which provides housing for visitors from wild.', '<p>Located on the east side of the highway between <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Lion%27s_Head\" title=\"Lion\'s Head\">Lion\'s Head</a> and <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rockcliff\" title=\"Rockcliff\">Rockcliff</a> Darashurth is within reach of clay, iron, tar and gold. Local trees are mostly pine and there is a high density of wolves and bears. Just north of the main deed is the Darashurth Estates homestead which provides housing for visitors from wild.\n</p>', 0),
(7005, 1841, 'Citizenry', 'Citizenry', 'Darashurth does not accept citizens at this time. The only exception to this is players that are temporarily on home from wild, or home alts of wild players, conditions do apply. Levedara ~ Founder ~ Currently on Wild Allessendressa ~ Mayor Members from wild Sempar WL main JcRiotz BL alt Crimsonbrood BL alt Spuda WL main, currently on wild Asurmen WL main Versveth BL alt, currently on wild Schweet WL main, currently on wild Krawuzi BL alt Deego WL alt Fuel WL main, currently on wild Genghiskahn WL main Other citizens On deed Raidsoft Daolveteran Seyss Stuckey Katic Off deed Alvin Meatham Mausmane Jinxocculte ~ Moved to Wild', '<p>Darashurth does not accept citizens at this time. The only exception to this is players that are temporarily on home from wild, or home alts of wild players, conditions do apply. \n</p>\n<p><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Levedara\" title=\"Player:Levedara\">Levedara</a> ~ Founder ~ Currently on Wild<br/>\nAllessendressa ~ Mayor\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Members_from_wild\">Members from wild</span></h3>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Sempar\" title=\"Player:Sempar\">Sempar</a></td>\n<td>WL main\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JcRiotz</td>\n<td>BL alt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crimsonbrood</td>\n<td>BL alt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spuda</td>\n<td>WL main, currently on wild\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Asurmen</td>\n<td>WL main\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Versveth</td>\n<td>BL alt, currently on wild\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schweet</td>\n<td>WL main, currently on wild\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Krawuzi</td>\n<td>BL alt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deego</td>\n<td>WL alt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Fuel\" title=\"Player:Fuel\">Fuel</a></td>\n<td>WL main, currently on wild\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Genghiskahn\" title=\"Player:Genghiskahn\">Genghiskahn</a></td>\n<td>WL main\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_citizens\">Other citizens</span></h3>\n<p>On deed\n</p>\n<ul><li>Raidsoft</li>\n<li>Daolveteran</li>\n<li>Seyss</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Stuckey\" title=\"Player:Stuckey\">Stuckey</a></li>\n<li>Katic</li></ul>\n<p>Off deed\n</p>\n<ul><li>Alvin</li>\n<li>Meatham</li>\n<li>Mausmane</li>\n<li>Jinxocculte ~ Moved to Wild</li></ul>', 1),
(7006, 1841, 'Allies', 'Allies', 'Darashurth is proud to be allied with the following villages and will come to their aid in times of trouble. Kyara Hammerfell Lion\'s Head The nearby homestead of Port Mexico farm and Darashurth estates are also allied and receive the full protection and support of the village.', '<p>Darashurth is proud to be allied with the following villages and will come to their aid in times of trouble. \n</p>\n<ul><li>Kyara</li>\n<li>Hammerfell</li>\n<li>Lion\'s Head</li></ul>\n<p>The nearby homestead of Port Mexico farm and Darashurth estates are also allied and receive the full protection and support of the village.\n</p>', 2),
(7007, 1841, 'Lore', 'Lore', 'Darastryx Hurthi, or Daras`hurth is a s10 village, the name meaning Dragon\'s Fortress. It is said the founder has strong ties to the Goddess Libila , and a HOTS tower stands along side the village. While the soldiers are enemies to the citizens of Jenn-Kellon they will not attack. This is also the site of the Niflheim v2(please note niflheim v2 is not tied to the site, link for tribute purposes only).', '<p>Darastryx Hurthi, or Daras`hurth is a s10 village, the name meaning Dragon\'s Fortress. It is said the founder has strong ties to the Goddess <a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a>, and a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/HOTS\" title=\"HOTS\">HOTS</a> tower stands along side the village. While the soldiers are enemies to the citizens of <a href=\"/index.php/Jenn-Kellon\" title=\"Jenn-Kellon\">Jenn-Kellon</a> they will not attack.\n</p>\n<p>This is also the site of the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.draconicspires.com/wurm/tower.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Niflheim</a> v2(please note niflheim v2 is not tied to the site, link for tribute purposes only).\n</p>', 3),
(7010, 1844, 'About Dragons Peak', 'About_Dragons_Peak', 'Dragons Peak was an old size 10 village in the last Beta map of wurm (ending just before the 6th of june). It was a 5 minute walk from Newtown and a 10-15 minute walk from Beta Kyara', '<p>Dragons Peak was an old size 10 village in the last Beta map of wurm (ending just before the 6th of june).\n</p>\n<p>It was a 5 minute walk from Newtown and a 10-15 minute walk from Beta <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Kyara\" title=\"Kyara\">Kyara</a>\n</p>', 0),
(7011, 1845, 'The Location', 'The_Location', 'Dragon\'s Reach is West of Rockcliff . The coast can be followed the entire way from Rockcliff to Dragon\'s Reach. The Reach is a mere 15 minute walk from the Goblin Lake, where the Goblin Leader was slain. A mere 5 minute walk across the South valley is Niflheim . A short swim North North West takes one to Rhapzodys Island .', '<p>Dragon\'s Reach is West of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rockcliff\" title=\"Rockcliff\">Rockcliff</a>. The coast can be followed the entire way from <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rockcliff\" title=\"Rockcliff\">Rockcliff</a> to Dragon\'s Reach. The Reach is a mere 15 minute walk from the Goblin Lake, where the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Goblin_Leader\" title=\"Goblin Leader\">Goblin Leader</a> was slain. \n</p>\n<p>A mere 5 minute walk across the South valley is <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Niflheim\" title=\"Niflheim\">Niflheim</a>. A short swim North North West takes one to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rhapzodys_Island\" title=\"Rhapzodys Island\">Rhapzodys Island</a>.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(7012, 1845, 'The People', 'The_People', 'Levedara ~ Founder ~ Mayor Svartalf ~ Co-Founder ~ Citizen Drunkenrabbit ~ Citizen Sassi ~ Citizen Dufusthebig ~ Citizen Hober ~ Trader ~ Private', '<p><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Levedara\" title=\"Player:Levedara\">Levedara</a> ~ Founder ~ Mayor \n</p>\n<p>Svartalf ~ Co-Founder ~ Citizen\n</p>\n<p>Drunkenrabbit ~ Citizen\n</p>\n<p>Sassi ~ Citizen\n</p>\n<p>Dufusthebig ~ Citizen\n</p>\n<p>Hober ~ Trader ~ Private\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(7013, 1845, 'What Dragon\'s Reach has to Offer', 'What_Dragon.27s_Reach_has_to_Offer', 'The area is rich with Goblins for hunting, many can be found along the shore, and guided tours to Goblin Lake can be provided. The reach has a Merchant selling weapons, armor and various tools, as well as high quality heavy meals. Silver Jewelery is available as well, perfect for gifts for those that matter! Various basic goods can be purchased as well, from seeds The Drunken Dragon Inn has enough beds to house 8 guests, and every guest recieves a free meal. Dragon\'s Reach features Altars Dedicated to all 3 White Light Gods. And of course, from the Reach one has access to Niflheim .', '<p>The area is rich with <a href=\"/index.php/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">Goblins</a> for hunting, many can be found along the shore, and guided tours to Goblin Lake can be provided.\n</p>\n<p>The reach has a Merchant selling weapons, armor and various tools, as well as high quality heavy meals. Silver Jewelery is available as well, perfect for gifts for those that matter! Various basic goods can be purchased as well, from seeds\n</p>\n<p>The Drunken Dragon Inn has enough <a href=\"/index.php/Bed\" title=\"Bed\">beds</a> to house 8 guests, and every guest recieves a free meal. \n</p>\n<p>Dragon\'s Reach features <a href=\"/index.php/Altar\" title=\"Altar\">Altars</a> Dedicated to all 3 White Light Gods.\n</p>\n<p>And of course, from the Reach one has access to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Niflheim\" title=\"Niflheim\">Niflheim</a>.\n</p>', 2),
(7014, 1845, 'Screenshots', 'Screenshots', 'Coming Soon.', '<p>Coming Soon.\n</p>', 3),
(7015, 1846, 'Town Structure', 'Town_Structure', 'The system is based on one leader, a high council, a council then trusted town members, normal town members and newer memebers. For information on joining this town message either zerobyte in black light chat or icedevil on the forums who will get in contact with zerobyte.', '<p>The system is based on one leader, a high council, a council then trusted town members, normal town members and newer memebers.\n</p>\n<p>For information on joining this town message either zerobyte in black light chat or icedevil on the forums who will get in contact with zerobyte.\n</p>', 0),
(7016, 1846, 'Location', 'Location', 'The town is SouthWest from newtown.  An estimated 3-4km away.', '<p>The town is SouthWest from newtown.  An estimated 3-4km away.\n</p>', 1),
(7017, 1846, 'Pictures', 'Pictures', '[ [1] ] Picture one [ [2] ] Picture two [ [3] ] Picture three', '<p>[<a class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://i2.photobucket.com/albums/y49/icedevilwoot/dyinground1.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">[1]</a>] Picture one\n</p>\n<p>[<a class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://i2.photobucket.com/albums/y49/icedevilwoot/dyinground2.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">[2]</a>] Picture two\n</p>\n<p>[<a class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://i2.photobucket.com/albums/y49/icedevilwoot/dyinground3.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">[3]</a>] Picture three\n</p>', 2),
(7023, 1705, 'Description', 'Description', 'A skill which uses wood to create wooden items, typically with a carving knife or saw .  Carpentry also determines the maximum slope you can build on, and is used when building a house . For very low levels of carpentry making planks gives good skill gain but building a house and fences out of wood or repairing them soon raises the skill much faster.', '<p>A skill which uses wood to create wooden items, typically with a <a href=\"/index.php/Carving_knife\" title=\"Carving knife\">carving knife</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Saw\" title=\"Saw\">saw</a>.  Carpentry also determines the <a href=\"/index.php/Maximum_slope\" title=\"Maximum slope\">maximum slope</a> you can build on, and is used when <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Building_a_house\" title=\"Building a house\">building a house</a>. For very low levels of carpentry making planks gives good skill gain but building a house and fences out of wood or repairing them soon raises the skill much faster.\n</p>', 0),
(7024, 1705, 'Tools Used', 'Tools_Used', 'Carving knife File Mallet Pelt Saw Logs', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Carving_knife\" title=\"Carving knife\">Carving knife</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/File\" title=\"File\">File</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">Mallet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Pelt\" title=\"Pelt\">Pelt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Saw\" title=\"Saw\">Saw</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">Logs</a></li></ul>', 1),
(7025, 1705, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'Carpentry Mind > Mind logic Body > Body control Subskills Fine carpentry - Fine carpentry contains more difficult carpentry functions such as creating barrels and carts . Toy making - The creation of toys. Bowyery - The creation of bows Fletching - The creation of arrows Ship building - The creation of boats', '<ul><li>Carpentry</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body\" title=\"Body\">Body</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Subskills\">Subskills</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Fine_carpentry\" title=\"Fine carpentry\">Fine carpentry</a> - Fine carpentry contains more difficult carpentry functions such as creating <a href=\"/index.php/Barrel\" title=\"Barrel\">barrels</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Cart\" title=\"Cart\">carts</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Toy_making\" title=\"Toy making\">Toy making</a> - The creation of toys.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bowyery\" title=\"Bowyery\">Bowyery</a> - The creation of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Bows\" title=\"Bows\">bows</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fletching\" title=\"Fletching\">Fletching</a> - The creation of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">arrows</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Ship_building\" title=\"Ship building\">Ship building</a> - The creation of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Boats\" title=\"Boats\">boats</a></li></ul>', 2),
(7026, 1705, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Carpenter at 50 skill Renowned Carpenter at 70 skill Master Carpenter at 90 skill Legendary Architect at 100 skill', '<ul><li>Carpenter at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Renowned Carpenter at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Master Carpenter at 90 skill</li>\n<li>Legendary Architect at 100 skill</li></ul>', 3),
(7027, 1705, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Guides:Carpentry and subskills guide for the resource conscious Category:Carpentry items . Carpentry Bowyery Fine carpentry Fletching Ship building Toy making', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Guides:Carpentry_and_subskills_guide_for_the_resource_conscious\" title=\"Guides:Carpentry and subskills guide for the resource conscious\">Guides:Carpentry and subskills guide for the resource conscious</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Carpentry_items\" title=\"Category:Carpentry items\">Category:Carpentry items</a>.</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Carpentry</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Bowyery\" title=\"Bowyery\">Bowyery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fine_carpentry\" title=\"Fine carpentry\">Fine carpentry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fletching\" title=\"Fletching\">Fletching</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Ship_building\" title=\"Ship building\">Ship building</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Toy_making\" title=\"Toy making\">Toy making</a></li></ul></li></ul>', 4),
(7029, 1852, 'Gingerland', 'Gingerland', 'Located on South Lake about 35min from NT. Set on a nice beach with an olive forest and a fishing pier.Locals have named the penninsula \"Spider Island\" (even though its not an island but w/e). The HS is jutting out of a hill and the digging of this is like a masterpiece in its self. It sits on a very nicely crafted man-made beach with conveniently located Iorn and Tin veins. The HS is completley walled in and has a bouncy trench all around with some parts reaching as much as 100 dirts steep. Inside there is my main house which is an odd shaped 3x4 and a 2x3 guest house for any tired hunters.', '<p>Located on South Lake about 35min from NT. Set on a nice beach with an olive forest and a fishing pier.Locals have named the penninsula \"Spider Island\" (even though its not an island but w/e). The HS is jutting out of a hill and the digging of this is like a masterpiece in its self.\n</p>\n<p>It sits on a very nicely crafted man-made beach with conveniently located Iorn and Tin veins. The HS is completley walled in and has a bouncy trench all around with some parts reaching as much as 100 dirts steep. Inside there is my main house which is an odd shaped 3x4 and a 2x3 guest house for any tired hunters.\n</p>', 0),
(7030, 1852, 'Founders', 'Founders', 'Ginger', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Ginger\" title=\"User:Ginger\">Ginger</a></li></ul>', 1),
(7031, 1852, 'Current Projects', 'Current_Projects', 'Building a new huge wooden house..in progress Making it look good (statues and such) Nothing else really', '<ul><li>Building a new huge wooden house..in progress</li>\n<li>Making it look good (statues and such)</li>\n<li>Nothing else really</li></ul>', 2),
(7032, 1852, 'Alliances', 'Alliances', 'Seaside Southport Orange County King', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Seaside\" title=\"Seaside\">Seaside</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"new\" href=\"/index.php?title=Southport&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Southport (page does not exist)\">Southport</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Orange_County\" title=\"Orange County\">Orange County</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_settlement\" title=\"Undefined settlement\">King</a></li></ul>', 3),
