(7085, 1865, 'Lion\'s Head- \"Do unto others, before they do unto you\"', 'Lion.27s_Head-_.22Do_unto_others.2C_before_they_do_unto_you.22', 'Lion\'s Head is a size ten village located along the coast south from Rockcliff , along the northern highway, at the very base of Gold Mountain.  The area is rich in resources, being near Iron, Gold, copper, flint, clay, tar, and lots of Wood of all kinds. Bears , wolves , mountain lions , wild boars , dogs , crocodiles and spiders are found frequently in the area. The city itself strives to be picturesque, and offers a majestic view of Gold Mountain. It is home to some of the more skilled and well known craftspeople on home server.', '<p>Lion\'s Head is a size ten village located along the coast south from <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rockcliff\" title=\"Rockcliff\">Rockcliff</a>, along the northern highway, at the very base of Gold Mountain.  The area is rich in resources, being near Iron, Gold, copper, flint, clay, tar, and lots of Wood of all kinds. <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Brown_Bear\" title=\"Brown Bear\">Bears</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Black_wolf\" title=\"Black wolf\">wolves</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mountain_Lion\" title=\"Mountain Lion\">mountain lions</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Wild_Boar\" title=\"Wild Boar\">wild boars</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Dog\" title=\"Dog\">dogs</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Crocodile\" title=\"Crocodile\">crocodiles</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_spider\" title=\"Huge spider\">spiders</a> are found frequently in the area.\n</p>\n<p>The city itself strives to be picturesque, and offers a majestic view of Gold Mountain.\n</p>\n<p>It is home to some of the more skilled and well known craftspeople on home server.\n</p>', 0),
(7086, 1865, 'History', 'History', 'Lion\'s Head began as a thread on the Lionhead Studios forums .  The first settlement was located a short ways north of Newtown, near the homesteads of Ruidean and Lake View .  The plan was to found a deeded village, which was impossible in that location.  Therefore, after much discussion, a new location was decided on in the resource rich coast at the base of Gold Mountain (sometimes called Twin Peaks Mountain). The brave pioneers loaded all their belongings upon several rafts, and began the long journey to the North, watching for bears with great vigilance.  The journey lasted several days, everyone moving slowly with their rafts and other burdens.  Some things were lost, including the entire set of blacksmith\'s equipment.  Several players were injured upon coming ashore, and one was killed due to the heavy concentration of wildlife in the area. Finally, the new location was picked, and the settlement quickly founded in the ruins of an older settlement.  They were soon to discover that this settlement was not quite abandoned, however.  The sole survivor of the previous town, Stingard, was still holding the fort. Rara was his name, and he was not exactly pleased to see a bunch of newbies building a town in his front yard.  However, what began as an unfortunate misunderstanding soon became a great boon of fortune, as Rara became one of the town\'s most valued members, bringing with him great experience and skill to guide the village in its infancy. Since then, Lion\'s Head has grown into a significant trade center.  Its merchants have on offer all manner of goods, some of them extraordinarily rare and valuable.', '<p>Lion\'s Head began as a thread on the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://allboards.lionhead.com/index.php?\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lionhead Studios forums</a>.  The first settlement was located a short ways north of Newtown, near the homesteads of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Ruidean\" title=\"Ruidean\">Ruidean</a> and <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Lake_View\" title=\"Lake View\">Lake View</a>.  The plan was to found a deeded village, which was impossible in that location.  Therefore, after much discussion, a new location was decided on in the resource rich coast at the base of Gold Mountain (sometimes called Twin Peaks Mountain).  \n</p>\n<p>The brave pioneers loaded all their belongings upon several rafts, and began the long journey to the North, watching for bears with great vigilance.  The journey lasted several days, everyone moving slowly with their rafts and other burdens.  Some things were lost, including the entire set of blacksmith\'s equipment.  Several players were injured upon coming ashore, and one was killed due to the heavy concentration of wildlife in the area. \n</p>\n<p>Finally, the new location was picked, and the settlement quickly founded in the ruins of an older settlement.  They were soon to discover that this settlement was not quite abandoned, however.  The sole survivor of the previous town, Stingard, was still holding the fort. Rara was his name, and he was not exactly pleased to see a bunch of newbies building a town in his front yard.  However, what began as an unfortunate misunderstanding soon became a great boon of fortune, as Rara became one of the town\'s most valued members, bringing with him great experience and skill to guide the village in its infancy.  \n</p>\n<p>Since then, Lion\'s Head has grown into a significant trade center.  Its merchants have on offer all manner of goods, some of them extraordinarily rare and valuable.  \n</p>', 1),
(7087, 1865, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Currently Active Members Ironlion - Founder/ Mayor Rara - Elder, Majordomo Nubcaek - Elder, Founder Miggy - Elder, Founder Harmonixer - Elder, Founder Svartalf- Elder Alessendressa Manieczek Neoxis Solar Dragonfell Franek Banana Leopater Nebumoth Lordfox Hurjolf \"Legacy\" Members Raggs- Elder, Founder Ravek- Elder, Founder Slugfly Dreadhead Evillion Monde Solar Derobrash Apocryphite Honorary Citizens Levedara', '<p><i>Currently Active Members</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ironlion\" title=\"Player:Ironlion\">Ironlion</a>- Founder/<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mayor\" title=\"Mayor\">Mayor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Rara\" title=\"Player:Rara\">Rara</a>- Elder, Majordomo</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Nubcaek\" title=\"Player:Nubcaek\">Nubcaek</a>- Elder, Founder</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Miggy\" title=\"Player:Miggy\">Miggy</a>- Elder, Founder</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Harmonixer</a>- Elder, Founder</li>\n<li>Svartalf- Elder</li>\n<li>Alessendressa</li>\n<li>Manieczek</li>\n<li>Neoxis</li>\n<li>Solar</li>\n<li>Dragonfell</li>\n<li>Franek</li>\n<li>Banana</li>\n<li>Leopater</li>\n<li>Nebumoth</li>\n<li>Lordfox</li>\n<li>Hurjolf</li></ul>\n<p><i>\"Legacy\" Members</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Raggs- Elder, Founder</li>\n<li>Ravek- Elder, Founder</li>\n<li>Slugfly</li>\n<li>Dreadhead</li>\n<li>Evillion</li>\n<li>Monde</li>\n<li>Solar</li>\n<li>Derobrash</li>\n<li>Apocryphite</li></ul>\n<p><i>Honorary Citizens</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Levedara\" title=\"Player:Levedara\">Levedara</a></li></ul>', 2),
(7088, 1865, 'Points of Interest', 'Points_of_Interest', 'The Tradehouses- located on the waterfront, most of the merchants are here Rara\'s Luxury Armour Shop- This place has high quality armour of all kinds, and is the only store on home that offers armour of this calibre.  Drake Hide, Steel plate, Iron Chain, \'specialty\' chain, and Studded Leather. Gold Mountain Inn-  Here\'s the place to grab a cool drink, a hot meal, and a good night\'s sleep Off Topic Goods-  The home of the trader. (currently closed to the public due to excessive leeching/abuse) More info about this town here: http://www.wurmonline.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=7096&start=0', '<ul><li>The Tradehouses- located on the waterfront, most of the merchants are here</li>\n<li>Rara\'s Luxury Armour Shop- This place has high quality armour of all kinds, and is the only store on home that offers armour of this calibre.  Drake Hide, Steel plate, Iron Chain, \'specialty\' chain, and Studded Leather.</li>\n<li>Gold Mountain Inn-  Here\'s the place to grab a cool drink, a hot meal, and a good night\'s sleep</li>\n<li>Off Topic Goods-  The home of the trader. (currently closed to the public due to excessive leeching/abuse)</li></ul>\n<p>More info about this town here: <a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.wurmonline.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=7096&amp;start=0\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.wurmonline.com/forum/viewtopic.php?t=7096&amp;start=0</a>\n</p>', 3),
(7089, 1865, 'Neighboring Towns', 'Neighboring_Towns', 'Northern Light Zealots Refuge Newtown Cliffside Brown Bear Cove Kyara Donny\'s Place Rockcliff Darashurth', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Northern_Light\" title=\"Northern Light\">Northern Light</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Zealots_Refuge\" title=\"Zealots Refuge\">Zealots Refuge</a></li>\n<li>Newtown</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cliffside\" title=\"Cliffside\">Cliffside</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Brown_Bear_Cove\" title=\"Brown Bear Cove\">Brown Bear Cove</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Kyara\" title=\"Kyara\">Kyara</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Donny%27s_Place\" title=\"Donny\'s Place\">Donny\'s Place</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rockcliff\" title=\"Rockcliff\">Rockcliff</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Darashurth\" title=\"Darashurth\">Darashurth</a></li></ul>', 4),
(7090, 1865, 'Alliances', 'Alliances', 'Rockcliff Kyara Hammerfell Vires Darashurth', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rockcliff\" title=\"Rockcliff\">Rockcliff</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Kyara\" title=\"Kyara\">Kyara</a></li>\n<li>Hammerfell</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Vires\" title=\"Vires\">Vires</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Darashurth\" title=\"Darashurth\">Darashurth</a></li></ul>', 5),
(7091, 1866, 'Description', 'Description', 'Lómándir Kingdom is located at the South-West from Newtown. The kingdom is composed of 1 principal Castle, some villages and Lord Castles. Hierarchy There are 3 type of members : The Nobles, the Third Estate, and the Clergy. The Nobles are the players who are citizen of the kingdom for a long time.\nThe Clergy is composed of god follower and priest.\nThe Third Estate are composed of poor people, paysan ect... The Noble live in the Lómándir Castle, or in their own castle.\nThe Clergy live in temple ect...\nAnd the 3rd Estate live in the towns and villages.', '<p>Lómándir Kingdom is located at the South-West from Newtown.\n</p>\n<p>The kingdom is composed of 1 principal Castle, some villages and Lord Castles.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hierarchy\">Hierarchy</span></h3>\n<p>There are 3 type of members : The Nobles, the Third Estate, and the Clergy.\n</p>\n<p>The Nobles are the players who are citizen of the kingdom for a long time.\nThe Clergy is composed of god follower and priest.\nThe Third Estate are composed of poor people, paysan ect...\n</p>\n<p><br/>\nThe Noble live in the Lómándir Castle, or in their own castle.\nThe Clergy live in temple ect...\nAnd the 3rd Estate live in the towns and villages.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(7092, 1866, 'Towns, castles and temple', 'Towns.2C_castles_and_temple', 'Lómándir Castle - Not started Tinewyn - Principal town, almost finished (5x5 farm + 10 tiles mines with iron vein + forge + oven + walls) Fo Temple - Not started', '<ul><li>Lómándir Castle - Not started</li>\n<li>Tinewyn - Principal town, almost finished (5x5 farm + 10 tiles mines with iron vein + forge + oven + walls)</li>\n<li>Fo Temple - Not started</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(7093, 1866, 'Member', 'Member', 'Nobility Kiro - Lómándir King Clergy Third Estate', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nobility\">Nobility</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Kiro</a>  - Lómándir King</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clergy\">Clergy</span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Third_Estate\">Third Estate</span></h3>', 2),
(7094, 1866, 'Thanks To', 'Thanks_To', 'Thank to : Kingen , he built 50% of the farm', '<p>Thank to :\n<a href=\"/index.php/Player:Kingen\" title=\"Player:Kingen\">Kingen</a>, he built 50% of the farm\n</p>', 3),
(7097, 1869, 'Alliances', 'Alliances', 'Proud to be allied with: Dragon Fell & Mirage: City of Mists .', '<p><strong>Proud to be allied with:</strong><br/>\nDragon Fell &amp; <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mirage\" title=\"Mirage\">Mirage: City of Mists</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(7098, 1870, 'Joining', 'Joining', 'For information on joining us, please private message one of the members from the Council.', '<p>For information on joining us, please private message one of the members from the Council.<br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(7099, 1870, 'Our Website', 'Our_Website', 'You can read our storyline and find some of us at this linky: http://mirage.7.forumer.com/ For members of the alliance, please apply to subscribe for your town usergroup. This is necessary to be able to access your town forum. Thanks. Gibbo is now known as the Crystal Warden .', '<p>You can read our storyline and find some of us at this linky: <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mirage\" title=\"Mirage\">http://mirage.7.forumer.com/</a><br/>\n</p>\n<p>For members of the alliance, please apply to subscribe for your town usergroup. This is necessary to be able to access your town forum. Thanks.<br/>\n</p>\n<p><b>Gibbo</b> is now known as the <b>Crystal Warden</b>.<br/>\n</p>', 1),
(7100, 1871, 'Mist Island', 'Mist_Island', 'Mist Island is the last island on the South-West of the Map.\nIt is a small island, with an ever-growing lava pit by the town. Mist Island is populated by Mist (Village), Virtue (homestead) and Misty Island Estates (Homestead).', '<p>Mist Island is the last island on the South-West of the Map.\nIt is a small island, with an ever-growing lava pit by the town.\n</p>\n<p>Mist Island is populated by Mist (Village), Virtue (homestead) and Misty Island Estates (Homestead).\n</p>', 0),
(7101, 1871, 'Mist (Village)', 'Mist_.28Village.29', 'A reclusive town with extremely high standards for members. Mostly consisting of veteran players. -Mayor- Shazaam -Elders- Malvado Lex -Citizens- Kai Bismark Dedri Artashes', '<p>A reclusive town with extremely high standards for members. <br/>\nMostly consisting of veteran players.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"-Mayor-\">-Mayor-</span></h5>\n<p>Shazaam<br/>\n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"-Elders-\">-Elders-</span></h5>\n<p>Malvado<br/>\nLex <br/>\n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"-Citizens-\">-Citizens-</span></h5>\n<p>Kai<br/>\nBismark<br/>\nDedri<br/>\nArtashes<br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(7102, 1871, 'Stores & Trade', 'Stores_.26_Trade', 'Mist has a Merchant readily available on it\'s dock.\nItems vary, but can consist of anything.\nPlease contact a member for details about an order.', '<p>Mist has a Merchant readily available on it\'s dock.\nItems vary, but can consist of anything.\nPlease contact a member for details about an order.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
(7103, 1871, 'Other Information', 'Other_Information', 'Potential candidates for Citizenship should contact either : Shazaam or Malvado.', '<p>Potential candidates for Citizenship should contact either : Shazaam or Malvado.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 3),
(7104, 1871, 'Maps', 'Maps', '', '', 4),
(7106, 1873, 'Mayor', 'Mayor', 'Bleth', '<p>Bleth\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(7107, 1873, 'City Council', 'City_Council', 'Azzu Raszlo Masterdat', '<p>Azzu<br/>\nRaszlo<br/>\nMasterdat<br/>\n</p>', 1),
(7108, 1873, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Gulogulo Frost Joshu Skymaniker Coenred Newlaurethwl See present Moi\'Coh', '<p>Gulogulo<br/>\nFrost<br/>\nJoshu<br/>\nSkymaniker<br/>\nCoenred<br/>\nNewlaurethwl<br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Moi%27Coh\" title=\"Moi\'Coh\">See present Moi\'Coh</a>\n</p>', 2),
(7109, 1874, 'Description', 'Description', 'Mons Lupi (Latin for Wolf Mountain) is a small White Lighter town. It is NW of Kyara , SE of Newtown', '<p><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mons_Lupi\" title=\"Mons Lupi\">Mons Lupi</a> (Latin for Wolf Mountain) is a small <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/White_Lighter\" title=\"White Lighter\">White Lighter</a> town.\n<br/> <br/>\nIt is NW of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Kyara\" title=\"Kyara\">Kyara</a>, SE of Newtown\n</p>', 0),
(7110, 1874, 'Mayor and Elders', 'Mayor_and_Elders', 'Mayor Fabra Elder Croglogom Elder RogerWilco Elder Globalwar', '<p>Mayor Fabra<br/>\nElder Croglogom<br/>\nElder RogerWilco<br/>\nElder Globalwar\n</p>', 1),
(7111, 1877, 'Info', 'Info', 'Northern Light was founded by Swedishphoenix in 2007 on the 4th of January at 5:34:57 PM. Deed size: 10 Towers: 2, 40 QL Democracy: No Trader : Yes Personal Merchant : 1) Stationed inside the village. She is currently selling some 50 QL tools. Personal Merchant : 2) Stationed inside the village. She is currently selling misc. armors at this time. Deity: Vynora - IRC-channel: #Northern-Light @ irc.heavenlyplace.net Forums: http://www.orjans.se/alex/wurm/', '<p>Northern Light was founded by <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Swedishphoenix\" title=\"Player:Swedishphoenix\">Swedishphoenix</a> in 2007 on the 4th of January at 5:34:57 PM.\n</p>\n<p>Deed size: 10<br/>\nTowers: 2, 40 QL<br/>\nDemocracy: No<br/>\n<a href=\"/index.php/Trader\" title=\"Trader\">Trader</a>: Yes<br/>\n<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Personal_Merchant\" title=\"Personal Merchant\">Personal Merchant</a>: 1) Stationed inside the village. She is currently selling some 50 QL tools.<br/>\n<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Personal_Merchant\" title=\"Personal Merchant\">Personal Merchant</a>: 2) Stationed inside the village. She is currently selling misc. armors at this time.<br/>\nDeity: <a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a><br/>\n-<br/>\nIRC-channel: #Northern-Light @ irc.heavenlyplace.net<br/>\nForums: <a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.orjans.se/alex/wurm/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.orjans.se/alex/wurm/</a><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(7112, 1877, 'Villagers', 'Villagers', 'Playername - Rank [ Titled Profession , Profession] - Robfox - Mayor [ Digger , Carpenter , Goldsmith , Miner , Handyman , Lumberjack , Tailor] Swedishphoenix - Co-mayor [ Trollslayer , Digger , Miner , Blacksmith , Handyman , Tracker , Weaponsmith, Goldsmith ] Steffe - Co-mayor [ Digger , Carpenter , Lumberjack, Mason] - Shaka - Elder [ Smith , Blacksmith , Goldsmith , Weaponsmith, Carpenter , Digger ,] Moru - Elder [ Digger , Cook, Farmer , Chain armour smith, Mason] Ulfpain - Elder [ Prospector , Metallurger, Coalmaker, Lumberjack , Plate armour smith, Miner ] Tosti - Elder [ Miner , Chain armour smith, Handyman ] Tfugl - Elder [ Ageless , Digger , Farmer , Carpenter , Excavator , Ropemaker] - Xerbee - Citizens [ Ageless , Carpenter ] Trollet - Citizens [Priest of Vynora, Locksmith, Animal tamer] Soot - Citizens [ Bowmaker ] Iolite - Citizens [ Potterer ] Ziggyzag - Citizens [Weaponsmith] Swecwurm - Citizens [Retired High Advisor] BlackHawk - Citizens [Non-preem] Yuito - Citizens [Baker - Non-preem] Droy - Villager Worstnightmare - Villager Bold text indicates achieved title.', '<p><i>Playername - Rank [<b>Titled Profession</b>, Profession]</i><br/>\n-<br/>\n<a href=\"/index.php/Player:Robfox\" title=\"Player:Robfox\">Robfox</a> - Mayor [<b>Digger</b>, <b>Carpenter</b>, <b>Goldsmith</b>, <b>Miner</b>, <b>Handyman</b>, <b>Lumberjack</b>, Tailor]<br/>\n<a href=\"/index.php/Player:Swedishphoenix\" title=\"Player:Swedishphoenix\">Swedishphoenix</a> - Co-mayor [<b>Trollslayer</b>, <b>Digger</b>, <b>Miner</b>, <b>Blacksmith</b>, <b>Handyman</b>, <b>Tracker</b>, Weaponsmith, <b>Goldsmith</b>]<br/>\n<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Steffe\" title=\"Player:Steffe\">Steffe</a> - Co-mayor [<b>Digger</b>, <b>Carpenter</b>, Lumberjack, Mason]<br/> \n-<br/>\nShaka - Elder [<b>Smith</b>, <b>Blacksmith</b>, <b>Goldsmith</b>, Weaponsmith, <b>Carpenter</b>, <b>Digger</b>,]<br/> \nMoru - Elder [<b>Digger</b>, Cook, <b>Farmer</b>, Chain armour smith, Mason]<br/> \nUlfpain - Elder [<b>Prospector</b>, Metallurger, Coalmaker, <b>Lumberjack</b>, Plate armour smith, <b>Miner</b>]<br/> \nTosti - Elder [<b>Miner</b>, Chain armour smith, <b>Handyman</b>]<br/>\nTfugl - Elder [<b>Ageless</b>, <b>Digger</b>, <b>Farmer</b>, <b>Carpenter</b>, <b>Excavator</b>, Ropemaker]<br/>\n-<br/>\nXerbee - Citizens [<b>Ageless</b>, <b>Carpenter</b>]<br/>\nTrollet - Citizens [Priest of Vynora, Locksmith, Animal tamer]<br/>\nSoot - Citizens [<b>Bowmaker</b>]<br/>\nIolite - Citizens [<b>Potterer</b>]<br/>\nZiggyzag - Citizens [Weaponsmith]<br/>\nSwecwurm - Citizens [Retired High Advisor]<br/>\nBlackHawk - Citizens [Non-preem]<br/>\nYuito - Citizens [Baker - Non-preem]<br/>\nDroy - Villager <br/>\nWorstnightmare - Villager <br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n<i>Bold text indicates achieved title.</i>\n</p>', 1),
(7113, 1877, 'Titles', 'Titles', '2x Ageless (Tfugl, Xerbee) 2x Blacksmiths (Swedishphoenix, Shaka) 1x Bowmaker (Soot) 5x Carpenters (Robfox, Steffe, Shaka, Tfugl, Xerbee) 6x Diggers (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Steffe, Shaka, Tfugl, Moru) 1x Excavator (Tfugl) 2x Farmers (Tfugl, Moru) 3x Goldsmiths (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Shaka) 4x Handymen (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Tfugl, Tosti) 2x Lumberjacks (Robfox, Ulfpain) 4x Miners (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Ulfpain, Tosti) 1x Potterer (Iolite) 1x Prospector (Ulfpain) 1x Smith (Shaka) 1x Tracker (Swedishphoenix) 1x Trollslayer (Swedishphoenix) 37 titles in total.', '<p>2x Ageless (Tfugl, Xerbee) <br/>\n2x Blacksmiths (Swedishphoenix, Shaka) <br/>\n1x Bowmaker (Soot) <br/>\n5x Carpenters (Robfox, Steffe, Shaka, Tfugl, Xerbee) <br/>\n6x Diggers (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Steffe, Shaka, Tfugl, Moru) <br/>\n1x Excavator (Tfugl) <br/>\n2x Farmers (Tfugl, Moru) <br/>\n3x Goldsmiths (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Shaka) <br/>\n4x Handymen (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Tfugl, Tosti) <br/>\n2x Lumberjacks (Robfox, Ulfpain) <br/>\n4x Miners (Robfox, Swedishphoenix, Ulfpain, Tosti) <br/>\n1x Potterer (Iolite) <br/>\n1x Prospector (Ulfpain) <br/>\n1x Smith (Shaka) <br/>\n1x Tracker (Swedishphoenix) <br/>\n1x Trollslayer (Swedishphoenix) <br/>\n</p>\n<p>37 titles in total. <br/>\n</p>', 2),
(7114, 1877, 'Allies', 'Allies', 'Rackham Danevang Price is Right', '<p><i>Rackham<br/></i>\n<i>Danevang<br/></i>\n<i>Price is Right<br/></i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 3),
(7115, 1877, 'Enemies', 'Enemies', 'Enemy towns: None KoS-list: Auras - Do I really have to explain why? Pvtryan - Ryan\'s an asshat, a thief and a murderer. Period. Dead - Stole from us. Stealing is not tolerated. Extrusion - Stole and ruined parts of Cliffside . Also has a past of calling us (Swec and NL) names. Ryuu - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy. Caelohh - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy. Sinen - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy. Margrave - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy. COnemind - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy. Aruka - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy. Dramen - DIDN\'T Steal from Bobbarker and Notbob.', '<p><b>Enemy towns:</b><br/>\n<i>None<br/></i>\n</p>\n<p><b>KoS-list:<br/></b>\n<i>Auras</i> - Do I really have to explain why?<br/>\n<i>Pvtryan</i> - Ryan\'s an asshat, a thief and a murderer. Period.<br/>\n<i>Dead</i> - Stole from us. Stealing is not tolerated.<br/>\n<i>Extrusion</i> - Stole and ruined parts of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cliffside\" title=\"Cliffside\">Cliffside</a>. Also has a past of calling us (Swec and NL) names.<br/>\n<i>Ryuu</i> - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy.<br/>\n<i>Caelohh</i> - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy.<br/>\n<i>Sinen</i> - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy.<br/>\n<i>Margrave</i> - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy.<br/>\n<i>COnemind</i> - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy.<br/>\n<i>Aruka</i> - Stole merchandize worth 1 gold from Pink Daisy.<br/>\n<i>Dramen</i> - <b>DIDN\'T</b> Steal from Bobbarker and Notbob.<br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(7116, 1877, 'Resources', 'Resources', '', '', 5),
(7117, 1877, 'Town map', 'Town_map', 'This is a very basic map of the village, and it still needs walls and gates, names on houses and proper tiles.', '<p><img alt=\"phoenixbylayoutez5.png\" src=\"http://img80.imageshack.us/img80/2027/phoenixbylayoutez5.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p><i>This is a very basic map of the village, and it still needs walls and gates, names on houses and proper tiles.</i>\n</p>', 6),
(7118, 1877, 'Screenshots', 'Screenshots', '', '', 7),
(7119, 1877, 'History and Events', 'History_and_Events', 'Jan 4, 2007 00:35:39 - Swedishphoenix founded Northern Light. Jan 8, 2007 21:28:47 - Under the rule of Swedishphoenix , Northern Light has formed an alliance with Rackham. Citizens rejoice! Jan 9, 2007 15:28:49 - Under the rule of Swedishphoenix , Northern Light has formed an alliance with Sturmgeist . Citizens rejoice!', '<p>Jan 4, 2007 00:35:39 - <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Swedishphoenix\" title=\"Player:Swedishphoenix\">Swedishphoenix</a> founded Northern Light.<br/>\nJan 8, 2007 21:28:47 - Under the rule of <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Swedishphoenix\" title=\"Player:Swedishphoenix\">Swedishphoenix</a>, Northern Light has formed an alliance with Rackham. Citizens rejoice!<br/>\nJan 9, 2007 15:28:49 - Under the rule of <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Swedishphoenix\" title=\"Player:Swedishphoenix\">Swedishphoenix</a>, Northern Light has formed an alliance with <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sturmgeist\" title=\"Sturmgeist\">Sturmgeist</a>. Citizens rejoice!<br/>\n</p>', 8),
(7120, 1879, 'The Town', 'The_Town', 'Old Kvigham is a size 5 village deed, created 13th of March 2007. It is located quite a few houndred tiles north east of Moi\' Coh. Everyone in the village speak swedish.', '<p>Old Kvigham is a size 5 village deed, created 13th of March 2007. It is located quite a few houndred tiles north east of Moi\' Coh.\n</p>\n<p>Everyone in the village speak swedish.\n</p>', 0),
(7121, 1879, 'Mayor', 'Mayor', 'Ekiz Old Kvigham\'s tailorer and farmer', '<p><b><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Ekiz</a></b>\nOld Kvigham\'s tailorer and farmer\n</p>', 1),
(7122, 1879, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'HanDenFulaDuVet Old Kvigham\'s smither Kippe Old Kvigham\'s masoner Kvigs Old Kvigham\'s carpenter HerrJan Maange Old Kvigham\'s fletcher Iriz Metalguy', '<p><b><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">HanDenFulaDuVet</a></b>\nOld Kvigham\'s smither\n</p>\n<p><b><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Kippe\" title=\"Player:Kippe\">Kippe</a></b>\nOld Kvigham\'s masoner\n</p>\n<p><b><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Kvigs\" title=\"Player:Kvigs\">Kvigs</a></b>\nOld Kvigham\'s carpenter\n</p>\n<p><b><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:HerrJan\" title=\"Player:HerrJan\">HerrJan</a></b>\n</p>\n<p><b><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Maange</a></b>\nOld Kvigham\'s fletcher\n</p>\n<p><b><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Iriz\" title=\"Player:Iriz\">Iriz</a></b>\n</p>\n<p><b><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Metalguy</a></b>\n</p>', 2);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(7123, 1879, 'Old Kvigham\'s doings', 'Old_Kvigham.27s_doings', 'Our current main project is to actually build all roads and houses. The terraforming is complete since long. After we have built all we need, we will possibly connect our road network with the main road network, so we may walk to New Town, following a road (which makes it easier to find us!)', '<p>Our current main project is to actually build all roads and houses. The terraforming is complete since long. \n</p>\n<p>After we have built all we need, we will possibly connect our road network with the main road network, so we may walk to New Town, following a road (which makes it easier to find us!)\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 3),
(7124, 1879, 'Other', 'Other', 'We have a merchant in the New East Road Merchant Center selling our wares.', '<p>We have a merchant in the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/New_East_Road_Merchant_Center\" title=\"New East Road Merchant Center\">New East Road Merchant Center</a> selling our wares.\n</p>', 4),
(7125, 1880, 'About Us', 'About_Us', 'Mare Arcanum is a place of tranquility, inspiration and success! A family community where everybody knows everyone with players from all around the world, there will ALWAYS be someone there. Originally started out as a small band of Mol-Rehanons from the wild lands looking for sanctuary in the homeland. They knew not of this land, the lands were wild and forests still virgin, they risked all for a new home. Before they knew it they found themselves with a thriving town to call home. Mare Arcanum. Mare Arcanum has the biggest population by far on Mol-Rehan home and possibly the whole of Mol-Rehan! We have many high-skilled, dedicated friendly citizens. A glamorous ship yard with a wave of boats for exploration of the homeland. After  a long period of training and preparation the people of Mare Arcanum sailed over the great western sea and entered the wild lands where they began a new independent town called rivendell. We will accept people; be it old returning veteran to the just created newbie. Thankyou for reading the Mare Arcanum wikipedia page!', '<p>Mare Arcanum is a place of tranquility, inspiration and success! A family community where everybody knows everyone with players from all around the world, there will <b>ALWAYS</b> be someone there. \n</p>\n<p>Originally started out as a small band of Mol-Rehanons from the wild lands looking for sanctuary in the homeland. They knew not of this land, the lands were wild and forests still virgin, they risked all for a new home. Before they knew it they found themselves with a thriving town to call home. Mare Arcanum.\n</p>\n<p>Mare Arcanum has the biggest population by far on Mol-Rehan home and possibly the whole of Mol-Rehan! We have many high-skilled, dedicated friendly citizens. A glamorous ship yard with a wave of boats for exploration of the homeland. \n</p>\n<p>After  a long period of training and preparation the people of Mare Arcanum sailed over the great western sea and entered the wild lands where they began a new independent town called rivendell.\n</p>\n<p>We will accept people; be it old returning veteran to the just created newbie. Thankyou for reading the Mare Arcanum wikipedia page!\n</p>', 0),
(7126, 1880, 'RIVENDELL\'S ANTHEM', 'RIVENDELL.27S_ANTHEM', 'http://au.youtube.com/watch?v=sFhrnhT6Xlc RIVENDELL\'S RAP We are internet tough guys. We come and take ya life Rebelling against a legion which cannot fight so pack it up get out of the way go out the door we dont want your noob asses anymore 2 Hits and ya out cuz thats what Rivendell is all about We yell our name loud^We wear our tag proud I\'d like to see a Legion reply to this right now Peasant to Leader, We all bow down to one Rivendell-We are yours united as one.', '<p><a class=\"external free\" href=\"https://au.youtube.com/watch?v=sFhrnhT6Xlc\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://au.youtube.com/watch?v=sFhrnhT6Xlc</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"RIVENDELL\'S_RAP\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"RIVENDELL.27S_RAP\"><b>RIVENDELL\'S RAP</b></span></h3>\n<p>We are internet tough guys.\n</p>\n<p>We come and take ya life\n</p>\n<p>Rebelling against a legion which cannot fight\n</p>\n<p>so pack it up\n</p>\n<p>get out of the way\n</p>\n<p>go out the door\n</p>\n<p>we dont want your noob asses anymore\n</p>\n<p>2 Hits and ya out\n</p>\n<p>cuz thats what Rivendell is all about\n</p>\n<p>We yell our name loud^We wear our tag proud\n</p>\n<p>I\'d like to see a Legion reply to this right now\n</p>\n<p>Peasant to Leader, We all bow down to one\n</p>\n<p>Rivendell-We are yours united as one.\n</p>', 1),
(7127, 1880, 'Mayors', 'Mayors', 'The people who created Rivendell and developed it into a beautiful place to be and making sure everybody has a good game. The brains of the town, to ensure all rules are kept. Thanks to Rudie and Dellas who were the founders of its spot today. Wintersolstice - Lord Mayor [Ageless], [Blacksmith], [Renowned Blackmsith], [Handyman], [Keeper of Faith], [Mason], [Weaponsmith] Dellas - Co-Mayor [Carpenter], [Fletcher] Garrettwademan - Co-Mayor [Miner], [Tanner], [Bowmaker], [Timberman], [Fletcher], [Ageless], [Prime Minester], [Beastspeaker], [Animal Trainer], [Digger], [Mason], [Troll Slayer], [Keeper of Faith], [Carpenter], [Handyman], [Repairman], [Lumberjack], [Excavator], [High Tanner]', '<p><b>The people who created Rivendell and developed it into a beautiful place to be and making sure everybody has a good game. The brains of the town, to ensure all rules are kept. Thanks to Rudie and Dellas who were the founders of its spot today.</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Wintersolstice\" title=\"Player:Wintersolstice\">Wintersolstice</a> - Lord Mayor [Ageless], [Blacksmith], [Renowned Blackmsith], [Handyman], [Keeper of Faith], [Mason], [Weaponsmith]</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Dellas\" title=\"Player:Dellas\">Dellas</a> - Co-Mayor [Carpenter], [Fletcher]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Garrettwademan\" title=\"Player:Garrettwademan\">Garrettwademan</a> - Co-Mayor [Miner], [Tanner], [Bowmaker], [Timberman], [Fletcher], [Ageless], [Prime Minester], [Beastspeaker], [Animal Trainer], [Digger], [Mason], [Troll Slayer], [Keeper of Faith], [Carpenter], [Handyman], [Repairman], [Lumberjack], [Excavator], [High Tanner]</li></ul>', 2),
(7128, 1880, 'Officers', 'Officers', 'The officers, they keep people in line and help the mayors with managing. Avalanche/Komokrap Demondan Maz - [High Ma z on], [Farmer], [Ma z on], [Master Ma z on]', '<p><b>The officers, they keep people in line and help the mayors with managing.</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Avalanche/Komokrap</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Demondan\" title=\"Player:Demondan\">Demondan</a></li>\n<li>Maz - [High Ma<b>z</b>on], [Farmer], [Ma<b>z</b>on], [Master Ma<b>z</b>on]</li></ul>', 3),
(7129, 1880, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'The people who make Rivendell/Mare arcanum a great place to live. Bakes - [Trollslayer], [Excavator], [Digger] Blake Blippy Buff - [Miner,Tailor, Carpenter, Trollslayer] Cooljpx - Vynora Champion [Ropemaker] Equinox - [Ageless], [Keeper or Faith], [Platesmith] Flay - [Carpenter], [Farmer], [HarborMaster], [Renowned Carpenter] Freddy - [Iron Chef], [Carpenter], [Fine Carpenter], [Renowned Carpenter] Ion - Trainee Fo Priest [Trollslayer] Jakeo - [Ageless, Destroyer of Faith, Carpenter, Fletcher, Arrowmaker] Ostinator - [Trollslayer] Pow - Champion of Vynora [Conduit] Rivendell - Fo Priestess Vitruvis - Vynora Priestess Volcano - Vynora Priest [Reverent] Walkerboh - [High Tanner], [Prime Minester], [Fisherlady], [Repairwomn], [Miner], [Tanner] Walkerbooh - Blacklight Priestess [Miner] Zattila Zuluwarrior Berserkers Killgod - [Blacksmith], [Chainsmith] Nevrax - [Trollslayer, [Digger] Vogar - [Master Tanner], [Dragonslayer]', '<p><b>The people who make Rivendell/Mare arcanum a great place to live.</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Bakes - [Trollslayer], [Excavator], [Digger]</li>\n<li>Blake</li>\n<li>Blippy</li>\n<li>Buff - [Miner,Tailor, Carpenter, Trollslayer]</li>\n<li>Cooljpx - Vynora Champion [Ropemaker]</li>\n<li>Equinox - [Ageless], [Keeper or Faith], [Platesmith]</li>\n<li>Flay - [Carpenter], [Farmer], [HarborMaster], [Renowned Carpenter]</li>\n<li>Freddy - [Iron Chef], [Carpenter], [Fine Carpenter], [Renowned Carpenter]</li>\n<li>Ion - Trainee Fo Priest [Trollslayer]</li>\n<li>Jakeo - [Ageless, Destroyer of Faith, Carpenter, Fletcher, Arrowmaker]</li>\n<li>Ostinator - [Trollslayer]</li>\n<li>Pow - Champion of Vynora [Conduit]</li>\n<li>Rivendell - Fo Priestess</li>\n<li>Vitruvis - Vynora Priestess</li>\n<li>Volcano - Vynora Priest [Reverent]</li>\n<li>Walkerboh - [High Tanner], [Prime Minester], [Fisherlady], [Repairwomn], [Miner], [Tanner]</li>\n<li>Walkerbooh - Blacklight Priestess [Miner]</li>\n<li>Zattila</li>\n<li>Zuluwarrior</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Berserkers\">Berserkers</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Killgod - [Blacksmith], [Chainsmith]</li>\n<li>Nevrax - [Trollslayer, [Digger]</li>\n<li>Vogar - [Master Tanner], [Dragonslayer]</li></ul>', 4),
(7130, 1880, 'Recruitment', 'Recruitment', 'We are accepting recruits! Contact one of the mayors to be accepted. However be prepared to work hard as lazy people never last long, the rewards shall later be great indeed. Drains/raids Woodscove (Feb 08) : Participants: 50 people from Rivendell and other major Jenn-Kellon towns. Lo Bridge Outpost: [14:06:54] You find 37 copper and 50 iron in the coffers of Lo Bridge Outpost. Participants: Kingen, Peo, Baldeagleog, Madt, Wwiiol, Tehheretic, Mee Lo Bridge Outpost: [18:31:07] You find 37 copper and 50 iron in the coffers of Lo Bridge Outpost Participants: Kingen, Peo, Mee, Khalad, Deanys, Demondan, Baconfiftyfive ( Fort Mole ) , Garah, Ianspwnsjoo, Nevrax ( Vanguard ) Water Works - Drained (June 08) : Patricipants: Rudie, Walkerboh and others from OB and LO Black Horse (Dec 08) - No drain : Patricipants: Demondan, Killgod, Rudie, Dragonspawn (New Libilian Outlaws) , AAetius (Libilian Outlaws) and Carmichael ( Libilian Outlaws ) Tower Bashing - 4 Towers of JK removed (Jan 2nd 09) : Participants: Candee, Polan, Rudie and others from LO, TO, WV Tower Bashing - 4 Towers of JK removed (Jan 24th 09) : Participants: Candee, Equinox and others from LO, TO and WV. Black Horse Manor - Drained & Disbanded (Jan 31st) : Participants: Bakes, Pancakebunny (Tuscany) and Carmichael (Libilian Outlaws) Broodje Bakpaal - Drained (Feb 1st) : Participants: Mee, Aaetius (Libilian outlaws) , Kingen (Libilian outlaws) , Dragonspawn (Tuscany Outlaws) , Steffe (Libilian outlaws) and Zarnibuddha (Libilian outlaws) Broodje Bakpaal - Drained & Tower bashed (Feb 21st) : Participants: Walkerboh, Wintersolstice, Bakes and LO OW-WL Passage - Drained (March 09) : Participants: Rivendell, Whosville and Libilian Outlaws', '<p>We are accepting recruits! Contact one of the mayors to be accepted. However be prepared to work hard as lazy people never last long, the rewards shall later be great indeed.\n</p>\n<h1><span id=\"Drains/raids\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drains.2Fraids\">Drains/raids</span></h1>\n<ul><li><b>Woodscove <small>(Feb 08)</small>: </b><br/>Participants: 50 people from Rivendell and other major <a href=\"/index.php/Jenn-Kellon\" title=\"Jenn-Kellon\">Jenn-Kellon</a> towns.</li>\n<li><b>Lo Bridge Outpost: [14:06:54] You find 37 copper and 50 iron in the coffers of Lo Bridge Outpost.</b><br/>Participants: Kingen, Peo, Baldeagleog, Madt, Wwiiol, Tehheretic, Mee</li>\n<li><b>Lo Bridge Outpost: [18:31:07] You find 37 copper and 50 iron in the coffers of Lo Bridge Outpost</b><br/>Participants: Kingen, Peo, Mee, Khalad, Deanys, Demondan, Baconfiftyfive <small>(<a class=\"new\" href=\"/index.php?title=Fort_Mole&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Fort Mole (page does not exist)\">Fort Mole</a>)</small>, Garah, Ianspwnsjoo, Nevrax <small>(<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Vanguard\" title=\"Vanguard\">Vanguard</a>)</small></li>\n<li><b>Water Works - Drained <small>(June 08)</small></b>:<br/>Patricipants: Rudie, Walkerboh and others from OB and LO</li>\n<li><b>Black Horse <small>(Dec 08)</small> - No drain</b>:<br/>Patricipants: Demondan, Killgod, Rudie, Dragonspawn <small>(New Libilian Outlaws)</small>, AAetius <small> (Libilian Outlaws) </small> and Carmichael (<small>Libilian Outlaws</small>)</li>\n<li><b>Tower Bashing - 4 Towers of JK removed <small>(Jan 2nd 09)</small></b>:<br/>Participants: Candee, Polan, Rudie and others from LO, TO, WV</li>\n<li><b>Tower Bashing - 4 Towers of JK removed <small>(Jan 24th 09)</small></b>:<br/>Participants: Candee, Equinox and others from LO, TO and WV.</li>\n<li><b>Black Horse Manor - Drained &amp; Disbanded <small>(Jan 31st)</small></b>:<br/>Participants: Bakes, Pancakebunny <small>(Tuscany)</small> and Carmichael <small>(Libilian Outlaws)</small></li>\n<li><b>Broodje Bakpaal - Drained <small>(Feb 1st)</small></b>:<br/>Participants: Mee, Aaetius <small>(Libilian outlaws)</small>, Kingen <small>(Libilian outlaws)</small>, Dragonspawn <small>(Tuscany Outlaws)</small>, Steffe <small>(Libilian outlaws)</small> and Zarnibuddha<small>(Libilian outlaws)</small></li>\n<li><b>Broodje Bakpaal - Drained &amp; Tower bashed <small>(Feb 21st)</small></b>:<br/>Participants: Walkerboh, Wintersolstice, Bakes and LO</li>\n<li><b>OW-WL Passage - Drained <small>(March 09)</small></b>:<br/>Participants: Rivendell, Whosville and Libilian Outlaws</li></ul>', 5),
(7131, 1880, 'In Rememberence', 'In_Rememberence', 'Keyos Annette Rudie - One of the Original Founders of Mare Arcanum and Rivendell, As well as Founder of the Second Rivendell. Mee Melros Nevrax This wurm-wikipedia article was created by Candee', '<ul><li>Keyos</li>\n<li>Annette</li>\n<li>Rudie - One of the Original Founders of Mare Arcanum and Rivendell, As well as Founder of the Second Rivendell.</li>\n<li>Mee</li>\n<li>Melros</li>\n<li>Nevrax</li></ul>\n<p><b>This wurm-wikipedia article was created by Candee</b>\n</p>', 6),
