(7154, 1884, 'Selling our Wares', 'Selling_our_Wares', 'Items and Enchanted Items near our Newtown shop and taking custom orders.\nCustom orders work as follows... Item Price 10 QL = 5 copper 20 QL = 15 copper 30 QL = 25 copper 40 QL = 35 copper 50 QL = 45 copper Spell Price 1 copper per spell QL 5 copper for Bless to be cast 25 copper upfront for Aura of Shared Pain spells, if successful, 25c will be deducted from the total spell price. Also Selling meals and can custom cast Opulence for 1c per level.', '<p>Items and Enchanted Items near our Newtown shop and taking custom orders.\nCustom orders work as follows...\n</p>\n<p><b>Item Price</b>\n</p>\n<p>10 QL = 5 copper<br/>\n20 QL = 15 copper<br/>\n30 QL = 25 copper<br/>\n40 QL = 35 copper<br/>\n50 QL = 45 copper<br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><b>Spell Price</b>\n</p>\n<p>1 copper per spell QL<br/>\n5 copper for <a href=\"/index.php/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a> to be cast<br/>\n25 copper upfront for <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_Shared_Pain\" title=\"Aura of Shared Pain\">Aura of Shared Pain</a> spells, if successful, 25c will be deducted from the total spell price.<br/>\n</p>\n<p>Also Selling meals and can custom cast <a href=\"/index.php/Opulence\" title=\"Opulence\">Opulence</a> for 1c per level.\n</p>', 4),
