(7161, 1886, 'Description', 'Description', 'The village of Raven\'s Wood was founded by Jonathanlaramee 14:56:55 on day of the Wurm in week 2 of the starfall of the Digging in the year of 998 (2009-06-17 03:49:12 CET). We are a somewhat active village situated at the end of the hook-shaped bay on the south-east coast. We have a lower city with stone houses and a harbor, and a upper deed with (upcoming) public services. Services Mailbox Harbor For residents Large mine with many iron veins Animal pen Large farm area Workshop Storage building Merchants Atm none Available resources High ql iron veins Clay spots (several minutes away by boat or foot) Sand', '<p>The village of Raven\'s Wood was founded by Jonathanlaramee 14:56:55 on day of the Wurm in week 2 of the starfall of the Digging in the year of 998 (2009-06-17 03:49:12 CET).\n</p>\n<p>We are a somewhat active village situated at the end of the hook-shaped bay on the south-east coast. We have a lower city with stone houses and a harbor, and a upper deed with (upcoming) public services.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Mailbox</li>\n<li>Harbor</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"For_residents\">For residents</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Large mine with many iron veins</li>\n<li>Animal pen</li>\n<li>Large farm area</li>\n<li>Workshop</li>\n<li>Storage building</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Merchants\">Merchants</span></h4>\n<p>Atm none\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Available_resources\">Available resources</span></h4>\n<ul><li>High ql iron veins</li>\n<li>Clay spots (several minutes away by boat or foot)</li>\n<li>Sand</li></ul>', 0),
(7162, 1886, 'Upcoming services', 'Upcoming_services', 'Inn Guard tower Mayor Jonathanlaramee Elders Arvid Citizens Battleflame (Vynora priest alt of Jonathan)', '<ul><li>Inn</li>\n<li>Guard tower</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mayor\">Mayor</span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Jonathanlaramee\" title=\"Player:Jonathanlaramee\">Jonathanlaramee</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elders\">Elders</span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Arvid\" title=\"Player:Arvid\">Arvid</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Citizens\">Citizens</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Battleflame (Vynora priest alt of Jonathan)</li></ul>', 1),
(7163, 1886, 'External links', 'External_links', '3D rendition of the village', '<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i249.photobucket.com/albums/gg232/jonathanlaramee/village-1.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D rendition of the village</a>\n</p>', 2),
(7164, 1887, 'Information', 'Information', 'A secretive town currently using a size 10 deed, Redfield is founded upon turbulent land. The entrance is a steep, almost vertical cliff festooned with beasts, and the majority of the island is plagued by fruit trees. A very large area has been flattened to accompany room for building within the deed space and a small (21x21 tiles) area next to it for residency. The main parts of the town have been shifted into this new, flattened area, as the old town was located right next to a narrow cliff-edge which is currently the residential area. Redfield is greatly concerned with aesthetics and beauty, so it was decided to work the whole town into an L-shaped plaza. This decision wasted space somewhat, but the town managed to fit all the important buildings into the deed area as well as a few residential ones. The town features an ~200 tile mine with many fully-raised ceilings and a very long shaft called the \"Fish mine\" and a very deep \"Bear Pit\". To the west of the settlement,there is a size 5 homestead that has been fortified by tall stone walls and palisades entitled \"West Redfield\". In the near future, the town plans to colonize north, south and further westward using size 5 homestead deeds. Redfield is not actively seeking new members, but will always have use for high-skilled members. Redfield won\'t accept total beginners unless under special circumstances. We organise everything using Ventrilo, so a microphone is a must. Guard Towers Two Democracy None Trader Yes, Private Deity Vynora Mayor Elder-owned account', '<p>A secretive town currently using a size 10 deed, Redfield is founded upon turbulent land. The entrance is a steep, almost vertical cliff festooned with beasts, and the majority of the island is plagued by fruit trees.<br/><br/> \nA very large area has been flattened to accompany room for building within the deed space and a small (21x21 tiles) area next to it for residency.<br/><br/>\nThe main parts of the town have been shifted into this new, flattened area, as the old town was located right next to a narrow cliff-edge which is currently the residential area. Redfield is greatly concerned with aesthetics and beauty, so it was decided to work the whole town into an L-shaped plaza. This decision wasted space somewhat, but the town managed to fit all the important buildings into the deed area as well as a few residential ones.<br/><br/>\nThe town features an ~200 tile mine with many fully-raised ceilings and a very long shaft called the \"Fish mine\" and a very deep \"Bear Pit\". To the west of the settlement,there is a size 5 homestead that has been fortified by tall stone walls and palisades entitled \"West Redfield\". In the near future, the town plans to colonize north, south and further westward using size 5 homestead deeds. <br/><br/>\nRedfield is not actively seeking new members, but will always have use for high-skilled members. Redfield won\'t accept total beginners unless under special circumstances. We organise everything using Ventrilo, so a microphone is a must.\n<br/>\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Guard Towers</dt>\n<dd>Two</dd>\n<dt>Democracy</dt>\n<dd>None</dd>\n<dt>Trader</dt>\n<dd>Yes, Private</dd>\n<dt>Deity</dt>\n<dd>Vynora</dd>\n<dt>Mayor</dt>\n<dd>Elder-owned account</dd></dl>', 0),
(7165, 1887, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Ethanv Elijahj [Trollslayer] Explorerdora ( Bear-bait/explorer alt ) Hamsterkiller [Digger] Puddin ( Spare alt ) Rutipants ( Priest in-training ) Schmendict Sticheyx [Carpenter, Blacksmith, Trollslayer] Talgoose Ter [Digger] Wolfislandkeeper ( West Redfield Deedkeeper Alt ) Wolfislanddeedkeeper ( Mayor )( Redfield Writkeeper Alt ) Woot [Miner, Trollslayer]', '<ul><li>Ethanv</li>\n<li>Elijahj [Trollslayer]</li>\n<li>Explorerdora (<i>Bear-bait/explorer alt</i>)</li>\n<li>Hamsterkiller [Digger]</li>\n<li>Puddin (<i>Spare alt</i>)</li>\n<li>Rutipants (<i>Priest in-training</i>)</li>\n<li>Schmendict</li>\n<li>Sticheyx [Carpenter, Blacksmith, Trollslayer]</li>\n<li>Talgoose</li>\n<li>Ter [Digger]</li>\n<li>Wolfislandkeeper (<i>West Redfield Deedkeeper Alt</i>)</li>\n<li>Wolfislanddeedkeeper (<b>Mayor</b>)(<i>Redfield Writkeeper Alt</i>)</li>\n<li>Woot [Miner, Trollslayer]</li></ul>', 1),
(7166, 1887, 'Town Map', 'Town_Map', '', '<p><img alt=\"redfieldtownmap.PNG\" src=\"http://xs312.xs.to/xs312/07082/redfieldtownmap.PNG\"/>\n</p>', 2),
(7167, 1887, 'Pictures', 'Pictures', 'Town complete. Contender for the best looking town in Wurm. [ [1] ] [ [2] ] [ [3] ]', '<p><b>Town complete. Contender for the best looking town in Wurm.</b>\n</p>\n<p><img alt=\"1eddv8.th.jpg\" src=\"http://img408.imageshack.us/img408/7659/1eddv8.th.jpg\"/>\n[<a class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://img408.imageshack.us/img408/7659/1eddv8.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">[1]</a>]\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n<img alt=\"2edni0.th.jpg\" src=\"http://img411.imageshack.us/img411/8409/2edni0.th.jpg\"/>\n[<a class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://img411.imageshack.us/img411/8409/2edni0.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">[2]</a>]\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n<img alt=\"schmenmw1.th.jpg\" src=\"http://img403.imageshack.us/img403/1240/schmenmw1.th.jpg\"/>\n[<a class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://img403.imageshack.us/img403/1240/schmenmw1.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">[3]</a>]\n</p>', 3),
(7168, 1888, 'Information', 'Information', 'A pleasant S10 village on Home, boasting several Merchants. They are dedicated to helping newbies. There you can buy Meals, newbies items, weapons, tools, and archery supplies. Founded by Rhapzody, it was almost impossible to place a s10 village so close to NT but she manage to pull it off. The village has a mine that is over 200 tiles big and has more than 10 iron veins.', '<p>A pleasant S10 village on Home, boasting several Merchants. They are dedicated to helping newbies. There you can buy Meals, newbies items, weapons, tools, and archery supplies.\n</p>\n<p>Founded by Rhapzody, it was almost impossible to place a s10 village so close to NT but she manage to pull it off. The village has a mine that is over 200 tiles big and has more than 10 iron veins.\n</p>', 0),
(7169, 1888, 'Members', 'Members', 'Decoy Fardringle(Inactive) Rhapzody ( Mayor ) Stenner Tehheretic Zodina ( Priest )', '<ul><li>Decoy</li>\n<li>Fardringle(Inactive)</li>\n<li>Rhapzody (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mayor\" title=\"Mayor\">Mayor</a>)</li>\n<li>Stenner</li>\n<li>Tehheretic</li>\n<li>Zodina (<a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">Priest</a>)</li></ul>', 1),
(7170, 1888, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Rhapzody - Renowned Blacksmith, Blacksmith, Carpenter, Handyman, Mason, Farmer, Miner, digger, Excavator, LumberJack, Stay at home mother. Fardringle - Bowmaker, Fletcher, Carpenter, Miner. Kyuno - Miner, Digger. Ackiup - Digger.', '<ul><li>Rhapzody - Renowned Blacksmith, Blacksmith, Carpenter, Handyman, Mason, Farmer, Miner, digger, Excavator, LumberJack, Stay at home mother.</li>\n<li>Fardringle - Bowmaker, Fletcher, Carpenter, Miner.</li>\n<li>Kyuno - Miner, Digger.</li>\n<li>Ackiup - Digger.</li></ul>', 2),
(7171, 1888, 'Merchants', 'Merchants', 'Archers outpost - 40-50ql bows and 20-30ql arrows can be bought here. All bows and arrows made by Fardringle Mrs.Maples meals - Sells 50-70ql meals 35i for a 1.4kg. Q50 Enchanted tools - Sells QL50 tools with various enchants. Usual pricing of 1c per power, 1c per QL. Newbie store - Sells generally low ql items. Sickles, scythes, axes, and various other items. Tool Store - All tools available in this store are q30-50 with no enchants. Leather Armor shop - 30-40ql leather armor (usually studded) is found here.', '<ul><li>Archers outpost - 40-50ql bows and 20-30ql arrows can be bought here. All bows and arrows made by Fardringle</li>\n<li>Mrs.Maples meals - Sells 50-70ql meals 35i for a 1.4kg.</li>\n<li>Q50 Enchanted tools - Sells QL50 tools with various enchants. Usual pricing of 1c per power, 1c per QL.</li>\n<li>Newbie store - Sells generally low ql items. Sickles, scythes, axes, and various other items.</li>\n<li>Tool Store - All tools available in this store are q30-50 with no enchants.</li>\n<li>Leather Armor shop - 30-40ql leather armor (usually studded) is found here.</li></ul>', 3),
(7172, 1888, 'Directions', 'Directions', 'Riverside is a short distance (5 min) north of Newtown. Cross the land bridge heading North, follow the road up hill, over the summit, and down to a signed crossroads. Riverside is to the right (East), signed as \'Store\'.', '<p>Riverside is a short distance (5 min) north of Newtown. Cross the land bridge heading North, follow the road up hill, over the summit, and down to a signed crossroads. Riverside is to the right (East), signed as \'Store\'.<br/>\n</p>', 4),
(7173, 1888, 'Pictures', 'Pictures', '', '<p><img alt=\"wurm000.jpg\" src=\"http://i119.photobucket.com/albums/o144/th3heretic/wurm000.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p><img alt=\"wurm003.jpg\" src=\"http://i119.photobucket.com/albums/o144/th3heretic/wurm003.jpg\"/>\n</p>', 5),
(7174, 1888, 'The mine', 'The_mine', 'Riverside mine', '<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://24.10.194.228/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Riverside mine</a>\n</p>', 6),
(7175, 1890, 'Of the Fallen Past', 'Of_the_Fallen_Past', 'Rome is a new village in a very nice area. We are located in the Tundra east of Karuiazwa. We have iron and clay in our area along with tons of animals. This village is being disbanded to become a great new one called Valrei (settlement)|Valrei.', '<p>Rome is a new village in a very nice area. We are located in the Tundra east of Karuiazwa. We have iron and clay in our area along with tons of animals.\n</p>\n<p>This village is being disbanded to become a great new one called Valrei (settlement)|Valrei.\n</p>', 0),
(7176, 1891, 'Ruidean - The Fortress of Light', 'Ruidean_-_The_Fortress_of_Light', 'Originating from the fifth map, the great rhuidean rises again with a name change. The Founders consist of Pinejon, Kokin and Listylister. Carrying on from the previous town follows the construction of tall stone walls. With our advanced knowledge and power a fortress was built on the edge of the lake, with great views over the lands of wurm.', '<p>Originating from the fifth map, the great rhuidean rises again with a name change. The Founders consist of Pinejon, Kokin and Listylister.\n</p>\n<p>Carrying on from the previous town follows the construction of tall stone walls. With our advanced knowledge and power a fortress was built on the edge of the lake, with great views over the lands of wurm.\n</p>', 0),
(7177, 1891, 'Images', 'Images', '', '<p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:One.gif\" title=\"Ruidean\"><img alt=\"Ruidean\" data-file-height=\"496\" data-file-width=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"388\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/56/One.gif/800px-One.gif\" srcset=\"/images/5/56/One.gif 1.5x\" width=\"800\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Two.gif\" title=\"Ruidean\"><img alt=\"Ruidean\" data-file-height=\"539\" data-file-width=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"421\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/78/Two.gif/800px-Two.gif\" srcset=\"/images/7/78/Two.gif 1.5x\" width=\"800\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Three.gif\" title=\"Ruidean\"><img alt=\"Ruidean\" data-file-height=\"461\" data-file-width=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/2a/Three.gif/800px-Three.gif\" srcset=\"/images/2/2a/Three.gif 1.5x\" width=\"800\"/></a>\n</p>', 1),
(7178, 1892, 'Infomation', 'Infomation', 'Size 10 Village Deed. Founded by Sharp, Looking for Weapon smith and other professions Contact Sharp . Mayor Sharp Armoursmith Town Structure The system is based on one leader, a high council and Town memebers. For information on joining this town message either Sharp in black light chat or  on the forums who will need to get contact with Blackangel or Chrono. Members BlackAngel - Masonry Chrono - Carp Flint - Miner Mich - Weaponsmith - Blacksmith Kull - Blacksmith There are probably more members, they will be added soon. Screenshots Coming soon Allies (contact Sharp to Add your village) Devils Peak Angmar Band of Brothers Valhallama', '<ul><li>Size 10 Village Deed.</li></ul>\n<p>Founded by Sharp, Looking for Weapon smith and other professions Contact <u>Sharp</u>.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mayor\">Mayor</span></h1>\n<ul><li>Sharp <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Armoursmith\" title=\"Armoursmith\">Armoursmith</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/><br/>\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Town_Structure\">Town Structure</span></h1>\n<p>The system is based on one leader, a high council and Town memebers.\n</p>\n<p>For information on joining this town message either Sharp in black light chat or  on the forums who will need to get contact with Blackangel or Chrono. \n<br/><br/>\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Members\">Members</span></h1>\n<ul><li>BlackAngel - <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">Masonry</a><br/></li>\n<li>Chrono - <a href=\"/index.php/Carp\" title=\"Carp\">Carp</a><br/></li>\n<li>Flint - <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Miner\" title=\"Miner\">Miner</a><br/></li>\n<li>Mich - <a href=\"/index.php/Weapon_smithing\" title=\"Weapon smithing\">Weaponsmith</a> - <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Blacksmith\" title=\"Blacksmith\">Blacksmith</a> <br/></li>\n<li>Kull - <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Blacksmith\" title=\"Blacksmith\">Blacksmith</a><br/></li></ul>\n<p>There are probably more members, they will be added soon.\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Screenshots\">Screenshots</span></h1>\n<p>Coming soon\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span></h1>\n<p>(contact Sharp to Add your village)\n</p>\n<ul><li>Devils Peak</li>\n<li>Angmar</li>\n<li>Band of Brothers</li>\n<li>Valhallama</li></ul>', 0),
(7179, 1893, 'The Village', 'The_Village', 'It is located on the southern sea nestled in a maple forest. There are rolling hills covered with Rose, Lavender, and Oleander bushes as well as the occasional Oak tree. It is plentiful with many deer, cows, bulls, and pigs around, as well as some unwanted creatures such as spiders. The land is also rich in resources such as many deposits of clay, vast forests, iron ore, and plenty of rock to mine.', '<p>It is located on the southern sea nestled in a maple forest. There are rolling hills covered with Rose, Lavender, and Oleander bushes as well as the occasional Oak tree. It is plentiful with many deer, cows, bulls, and pigs around, as well as some unwanted creatures such as spiders. The land is also rich in resources such as many deposits of clay, vast forests, iron ore, and plenty of rock to mine.\n</p>', 0),
(7180, 1893, 'Citizenship Application', 'Citizenship_Application', 'To become a citizen of Seaside you must first ask one of the elders. We will then find out information about you, ask you some questions and take a vote. All we ask is that you obey common sense rules such as no stealing, treat other villagers with respect, and to help out with village projects. Stealing, killing of village members, or destroying property will not be tolerated. If you decide you want to do any of these things, you will be thrown out of the village and your belongings donated to the village.', '<p>To become a citizen of Seaside you must first ask one of the elders. We will then find out information about you, ask you some questions and take a vote. All we ask is that you obey common sense rules such as no stealing, treat other villagers with respect, and to help out with village projects.\n</p>\n<p>Stealing, killing of village members, or destroying property will not be tolerated. If you decide you want to do any of these things, you will be thrown out of the village and your belongings donated to the village.\n</p>', 1),
(7181, 1893, 'Founders', 'Founders', 'Annalise Titles - Carpenter | Mason | Digger | Handyman | Miner Acurapassion Titles - Carpenter', '<dl><dt><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Annalise\" title=\"Player:Annalise\">Annalise</a></dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Carpenter | Mason | Digger | Handyman | Miner</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/index.php/User:Acurapassion\" title=\"User:Acurapassion\">Acurapassion</a></dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Carpenter</dd></dl>', 2),
(7182, 1893, 'Mayor', 'Mayor', 'Veronica Titles - Carpenter | Miner | Mason | Handyman | Tanner | LumberJack | Digger', '<dl><dt><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Veronica\" title=\"Player:Veronica\">Veronica</a></dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Carpenter | Miner | Mason | Handyman | Tanner | LumberJack | Digger</dd></dl>', 3),
(7183, 1893, 'Elders', 'Elders', 'Kraegar Titles - Miner | Blacksmith | Carpenter | Handyman | Smith | Mason | Lumberjack | Farmer | Renowned Blacksmith | Repairman Major donor of money. Smackeddown Titles - None yet', '<dl><dt><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Kraegar\" title=\"Player:Kraegar\">Kraegar</a></dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Miner | Blacksmith | Carpenter | Handyman | Smith | Mason | Lumberjack | Farmer | Renowned Blacksmith | Repairman</dd>\n<dd>Major donor of money.</dd>\n<dt>Smackeddown</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd></dl>', 4),
