>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Marche</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Mekakilla-IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Natey-Alt, IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Natiwy-IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Nukeboy-IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Reaperswe\" title=\"Player:Reaperswe\">Reaperswe</a></dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Shadowstalker</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Carpenter</dd>\n<dt>Sleepless</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Smeagal-IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Snoops-IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Vakia-BL, IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> None yet</dd>\n<dt>Weathermatt</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Trollslayer</dd>\n<dt><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Wilderon\" title=\"Player:Wilderon\">Wilderon</a>- IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Digger</dd>\n<dt>Wooter-IA</dt>\n<dd><b>Titles -</b> Mason | Miner</dd></dl>\n<p><br/>\n<i><b>IA - Inactive Player</b></i>\n</p>\n<p><i><b>Alt - Alternate Account</b></i>\n</p>', 5),
(7185, 1893, 'Current Projects', 'Current_Projects', 'None at the moment.', '<p>None at the moment.\n</p>', 6),
(7186, 1893, 'Helpful Stores', 'Helpful_Stores', 'Seaside has it\'s very own trader now, Aarya! Merchant Smitty sells smithed items from the Seaside smithy! (moved to SS outlet near noob store) Merchant Bill sells wood products. Merchant Taylor sells tailored items. (moved to SS outlet near noob store) Merchant Master Gunny sells weapons.', '<ul><li>Seaside has it\'s very own trader now, Aarya!</li>\n<li>Merchant Smitty sells smithed items from the Seaside smithy! (moved to SS outlet near noob store)</li>\n<li>Merchant Bill sells wood products.</li>\n<li>Merchant Taylor sells tailored items. (moved to SS outlet near noob store)</li>\n<li>Merchant Master Gunny sells weapons.</li></ul>', 7),
(7187, 1893, 'Alliances', 'Alliances', 'Acropolis Emerald Bastion Gingerland Hammerfell King\'s Place New Beginnin Noob Store Town Old Guard Old Valley Overlook Orange County Rome Shadowstalker\'s Oasis Sleepy Hollow Smackeddown\'s View Southport Torun Road Rest Stop Torun Rd Gaurd Tranquility', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Acropolis\" title=\"Acropolis\">Acropolis</a></li>\n<li>Emerald Bastion</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Gingerland\" title=\"Gingerland\">Gingerland</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"new\" href=\"/index.php?title=Hammerfell&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Hammerfell (page does not exist)\">Hammerfell</a></li>\n<li>King\'s Place</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/New_Beginnin\" title=\"New Beginnin\">New Beginnin</a></li>\n<li>Noob Store Town</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Old_Guard\" title=\"Old Guard\">Old Guard</a></li>\n<li>Old Valley Overlook</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Orange_County\" title=\"Orange County\">Orange County</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rome\" title=\"Rome\">Rome</a></li>\n<li>Shadowstalker\'s Oasis</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sleepy_Hollow\" title=\"Sleepy Hollow\">Sleepy Hollow</a></li>\n<li>Smackeddown\'s View</li>\n<li><a class=\"new\" href=\"/index.php?title=Southport&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Southport (page does not exist)\">Southport</a></li>\n<li>Torun Road Rest Stop</li>\n<li>Torun Rd Gaurd</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Tranquility\" title=\"Tranquility\">Tranquility</a></li></ul>', 8),
