(7315, 1941, 'People', 'People', 'Mayor Flinter - [Bowmaker] , [Carpenter] , [Digger] , [Excavator] , [Farmer] , [Fletcher] , Goldsmith, [Handyman] , [Lumberjack] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Renowned Carpenter] , [Trollslayer] Co-Mayors Ecrir - [Blacksmith] , [Carpenter] , [Digger] , [Excavator] , [Handyman] , [High Mason] , [Land Shaper] , [Lumberjack] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Platesmith] , [Prime Minester] , [Tailor] , [Trollslayer] Mirabelle - [Blacksmith] , [Carpenter] , [Digger] , [Farmer] , [Handywoman] , [High Tanner] , [Lumberjack] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Repairwoman] , [Tailor] , [Tanner] , [Trollslayer] Sopheri - [Blacksmith] Tunes - [Blacksmith] , [Carpenter] , [Farmer] , [Handyman] , [Lumberjack] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Prospector] , [Renowned Blacksmith] , [Repairman] , [Smith] , [Trollslayer] Citizens Charles EliteWarrior - [Miner] , [Trollslayer] , [Chainsmith] Endangeredthehuman - Cook, [Trollslayer] Fatalshock Florian Garrett - [Blacksmith] , [Carpenter] , [Chainsmith] , [Digger] , [Excavator] , [Handyman] , [Lumberjack] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Prime Minester] , [Renowned Blacksmith] , [Smith] , [Trollslayer] Glamdering Helsinger - Weaponsmith, Shieldsmith Iron Joee Khalad Kyros Letumblade Loras - [Blacksmith] , [Miner] Lostpox Mik Mouserecoil - [Digger] , [Excavator] Necrotic Nightfaii - [Trollslayer] Nightfall - [Carpenter] , [Digger] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Trollslayer] Nightshade Othobrithol - [Blacksmith] , [Carpenter] , [Chainsmith] , [Digger] , [Excavator] , [Farmer] , [Handyman] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Trollslayer] Roughshot Ruka Saidin (Magranon priest) - [Keeper of Faith] , [Trollslayer] Samantha - [Trollslayer] Sirnahme Syrik Thedragonslaya - [Trollslayer] Thorgot - [Able Bowmaker] , [Farmer] , [Harbormaster] , [Master Carpenter] , [Mighty Fine Carpenter] , [Potter] , [Repairman] , [Timberman] Vulkan Waswat Winston Wolfgarr - [Miner] , [Trollslayer] Worstnightmare - [Keeper of Faith] , [Trollslayer] Wort - [Carpenter] , [Digger] , [Goldsmith] , [Handyman] , [High Tanner] , [Lumberjack] , [Mason] , [Miner] , [Tailor] , [Tanner] , [Trollslayer] Xenoo - [Miner] , [Trollslayer] Zahrkon - [Artist] , [Blacksmith] , [Chainsmith] , [Handyman] , [High Mason] , [High Tanner] , [Mason] , [Master Blacksmith] , [Miner] , [Prime Minester] , [Repairman] , [Renowned Blacksmith] , [Renowned Chainsmith] , [Sculptor] , [Tanner] , [Trollslayer] Alts Antikeks (Vynora priest in training) Bloodcry (Vynora priest) Box Cookiemonster (Vynora priest) Dalmarak Garetjax (Vynora priest) Hawkrift (Vynora priest) Ilromov (Vynora priest) - [Channeler] , [Crofter] , [Devout] , [Farmer] , [Padre] , [Ropemaker] Kaasje Marmot Mibay Othobjr (Vynora priest in training) Tatianna (Vynora priest in training) Vpreist (Vynora priest) - [Fisherwoman] Walkingstick (Vynora priest) - [Channeler] , [Devout] , [Padre] , [Trollslayer] Wanted (Vynora priest in training) Xallas', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mayor\">Mayor</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Flinter\" title=\"Player:Flinter\">Flinter</a> - <b>[Bowmaker]</b>, <b>[Carpenter]</b>, <b>[Digger]</b>, <b>[Excavator]</b>, <b>[Farmer]</b>, <b>[Fletcher]</b>, Goldsmith, <b>[Handyman]</b>, <b>[Lumberjack]</b>, <b>[Mason]</b>, <b>[Miner]</b>, <b>[Renowned Carpenter]</b>, <b>[Trollslayer]</b></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Co-Mayors\">Co-Mayors</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Ecrir\" title=\"Player:Ecrir\">Ecrir</a> - <b>[Blacksmith]</b>, <b>[Carpenter]</b>, <b>[Digger]</b>, <b>[Excavator]</b>, <b>[Handyman]</b>, <b>[High Mason]</b>, <b>[Land Shaper]</b>, <b>[Lumberjack]</b>, <b>[Mason]</b>, <b>[Miner]</b>, <b>[Platesmith]</b>, <b>[Prime Minester]</b>, <b>[Tailor]</b>, <b>[Trollslayer]</b></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Mirabelle\" title=\"Player:Mirabelle\">Mirabelle</a> - <b>[Blacksmith]</b>, <b>[Carpenter]</b>, <b>[Digger]</b>, <b>[Farmer]</b>, <b>[Handywoman]</b>,  <b>[High Tanner]</b>, <b>[Lumberjack]</b>, <b>[Mason]</b>,