er]</b></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alts\">Alts</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Antikeks</a> (Vynora priest in training)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Bloodcry\" title=\"Player:Bloodcry\">Bloodcry</a> (Vynora priest)</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Box\" title=\"Player:Box\">Box</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Cookiemonster\" title=\"Player:Cookiemonster\">Cookiemonster</a> (Vynora priest)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Dalmarak</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Garetjax</a> (Vynora priest)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Hawkrift</a> (Vynora priest)</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Ilromov\" title=\"Player:Ilromov\">Ilromov</a> (Vynora priest) - <b>[Channeler]</b>, <b>[Crofter]</b>, <b>[Devout]</b>, <b>[Farmer]</b>, <b>[Padre]</b> , <b>[Ropemaker]</b></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Kaasje\" title=\"Player:Kaasje\">Kaasje</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Marmot\" title=\"Player:Marmot\">Marmot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Mibay</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Othobjr</a> (Vynora priest in training)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Tatianna</a> (Vynora priest in training)</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Vpreist\" title=\"Player:Vpreist\">Vpreist</a> (Vynora priest) - <b>[Fisherwoman]</b></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Walkingstick\" title=\"Player:Walkingstick\">Walkingstick</a> (Vynora priest) - <b>[Channeler]</b>, <b>[Devout]</b>, <b>[Padre]</b>, <b>[Trollslayer]</b></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Wanted\" title=\"Player:Wanted\">Wanted</a> (Vynora priest in training)</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Xallas\" title=\"Player:Xallas\">Xallas</a></li></ul>', 4),
(7316, 1941, 'Directions', 'Directions', 'Head west from Newtown to Aegis . Follow the Public Highway till Rockcliff .\nTurn south and keep following the road, pass the desert, through a small tunnel all the way till you reach the village. Click Gold 2 Village Roadmap for map.', '<p>Head west from Newtown to <a class=\"new\" href=\"/index.php?title=Aegis&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Aegis (page does not exist)\">Aegis</a>. Follow the Public <a href=\"/index.php/Highway\" title=\"Highway\">Highway</a> till <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rockcliff\" title=\"Rockcliff\">Rockcliff</a>.\nTurn south and keep following the road, pass the desert, through a small tunnel all the way till you reach the village. \n</p>\n<p>Click Gold 2 Village Roadmap for map.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(7317, 1941, 'Pictures', 'Pictures', 'View of the village from the dock View of the Ahkenaten Colossus View of the dock from the village View of some of the stone houses', '<p>View of the village from the dock\n<img alt=\"wurm010xt1.png\" src=\"http://i257.photobucket.com/albums/hh219/Mirabelle_album/wurm010xt1.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\nView of the Ahkenaten Colossus\n<img alt=\"wurm125.jpg\" src=\"http://i257.photobucket.com/albums/hh219/Mirabelle_album/wurm125.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\nView of the dock from the village\n<img alt=\"wurm005.png\" src=\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v282/neodragon11/wurm005.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\nView of some of the stone houses\n<img alt=\"wurm094.png\" src=\"http://i257.photobucket.com/albums/hh219/Mirabelle_album/wurm094.png\"/>\n</p>', 6),
(7318, 1942, 'Residents', 'Residents', 'Mayor Paperback (active) Founders Hiddenmyst (active) Citizens Subby (active) Rati (inactive) Aradin (inactive) Faridis (inactive) Flagg (inactive) ReformedMidnight (inactive) Hannesone (inactive)', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mayor\">Mayor</span></h3>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Paperback\" title=\"Player:Paperback\">Paperback</a></i> (active)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Founders\">Founders</span></h3>\n<ul><li><i>Hiddenmyst</i> (active)</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Citizens\">Citizens</span></h3>\n<ul><li><i>Subby</i> (active)</li>\n<li><i>Rati</i> (inactive)</li>\n<li><i>Aradin</i> (inactive)</li>\n<li><i>Faridis</i> (inactive)</li>\n<li><i>Flagg</i> (inactive)</li>\n<li><i>ReformedMidnight</i> (inactive)</li>\n<li><i>Hannesone</i> (inactive)</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(7319, 1942, 'Roles', 'Roles', 'Paperback - Farmer, Miner, Cook, Hunter Hiddenmyst - Cook, Hunter, Fisher, Miner', '<ul><li><i><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Paperback\" title=\"Player:Paperback\">Paperback</a></i> - Farmer, Miner, Cook, Hunter</li>\n<li><i>Hiddenmyst</i> - Cook, Hunter, Fisher, Miner</li></ul>', 1),
(7320, 1942, 'General Rules', 'General_Rules', 'No Stealing This is common sense, don\'t steal anything on the ground, unless you know for sure you have been told you can. Don\'t cut certain trees You CAN cut: Cedar , Apple , Cherry , Pine , Lemon Don\'t affect areas with building/scraps It\'s not something that we can really help, but don\'t go off and pack 1000\'s of tiles, or pave places, just for the hell of it. Stuff like making statues, and placing them all over the place, and make sure you get rid of your scraps somewhere away from the paths, out of the way - a whole bunch of random scraps and statues looks rubbish', '<ul><li>No Stealing\n<ul><li><i>This is common sense, don\'t steal anything on the ground, unless you know for sure you have been told you can.</i></li></ul></li>\n<li>Don\'t cut certain trees\n<ul><li><i>You CAN cut: <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cedar\" title=\"Cedar\">Cedar</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Apple\" title=\"Apple\">Apple</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Cherry\" title=\"Cherry\">Cherry</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Pine\" title=\"Pine\">Pine</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Lemon\" title=\"Lemon\">Lemon</a></i></li></ul></li>\n<li>Don\'t affect areas with building/scraps\n<ul><li><i>It\'s not something that we can really help, but don\'t go off and pack 1000\'s of tiles, or pave places, just for the hell of it. Stuff like making statues, and placing them all over the place, and make sure you get rid of your scraps somewhere away from the paths, out of the way - a whole bunch of random scraps and statues looks rubbish</i></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
(7321, 1942, 'Future Development', 'Future_Development', 'Albion upgraded to a Size 10 Village Deed, on January 28th, 2008. There are 10 houses available for anyone who wants to join Albion and each house has an amount of space for farming. Lot 1 Lot 2 Lot 3 Lot 4 Lot 5 Lot 6 Lot 7 Lot 8 Lot 9 Lot 10 See the current development stage plan updated last: 1/27th/08', '<p>Albion upgraded to a Size 10 Village Deed, on January 28th, 2008.\n</p>\n<p>There are 10 houses available for anyone who wants to join Albion and each house has an amount of space for farming.<br/>\n</p>\n<p>Lot 1<br/>\nLot 2<br/>\nLot 3<br/>\nLot 4<br/>\nLot 5<br/>\nLot 6<br/>\nLot 7<br/>\nLot 8<br/>\nLot 9<br/>\nLot 10<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>See the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.albion.pap3rback.com/uploads/Albion.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">current development stage plan</a> <i>updated last: 1/27th/08</i></li></ul>', 3),
(7322, 1942, 'Joining', 'Joining', 'If you wish to join Albion, or are interested in joining a village then consider joining Albion. Albion is looking for people with any experience, but having any form of skills is always a plus. We offer free resources to citizens like; cotton, iron, tools, wood, planks and meals to help you achieve you skills. To join either: Send an Application on our website email [email protected] Message Paperback on the forums PM Paperback in-game PM Hiddenmyst in-game', '<p>If you wish to join Albion, or are interested in joining a village then consider joining Albion.<br/>\nAlbion is looking for people with any experience, but having any form of skills is always a plus.<br/>\nWe offer free resources to citizens like; cotton, iron, tools, wood, planks and meals to help you achieve you skills.<br/>\n<br/>\n<b>To join either:<br/></b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Send an Application on our website</li>\n<li>email <a class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"c4a7abaab0a5a7b084b4a5b4f7b6a6a5a7afeaa7aba9\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\">[email protected]</a></li>\n<li>Message Paperback on the forums<br/></li>\n<li>PM Paperback in-game<br/></li>\n<li>PM Hiddenmyst in-game<br/><b></b></li></ul>', 4),
(7323, 1942, 'Location', 'Location', 'Albion is quite remote, and out of the way. Not to say it doesn\'t have it\'s good and bad points! Directions to get to Albion: Start at the Newtown settlement token Check which way is East Cross the water, and follow the highway out of Newtown, East Keep going until you reach Donnar\'s Pass Outpost(DP Outpost) Look at the Maps for easier directions(Gold 2 Village Roadmap is the best) Once you hit the pier, go into the water and swim directly SE you will see an island, ignore it and swim around it You should hit land in around 20-45 minutes Walk south if you walk past or into a desert, you\'ve gone too far View a map to Albion - made using the Gold 2 Village Roadmap', '<p>Albion is quite remote, and out of the way. Not to say it doesn\'t have it\'s good and bad points!\n</p>\n<p><b>Directions to get to Albion:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Start at the Newtown <a href=\"/index.php/Settlement_token\" title=\"Settlement token\">settlement token</a>\n<ul><li>Check which way is <i>East</i></li></ul></li>\n<li>Cross the water, and follow the highway out of Newtown, East\n<ul><li>Keep going until you reach Donnar\'s Pass Outpost(DP Outpost)</li>\n<li>Look at the <a href=\"/index.php/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a> for easier directions(Gold 2 Village Roadmap is the best)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Once you hit the pier, go into the water and swim directly SE\n<ul><li>you will see an island, ignore it and swim around it</li></ul></li>\n<li>You should hit land in around 20-45 minutes</li>\n<li>Walk south\n<ul><li>if you walk past or into a desert, you\'ve gone too far</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n<b><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.albion.pap3rback.com/uploads/map_to_albion.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">View a map to Albion</a></b> - <i>made using the Gold 2 Village Roadmap</i>\n</p>', 5),
(7324, 1942, 'Kill on Sight list', 'Kill_on_Sight_list', 'Albion\'s members do not want to randomly put normal people on the guards KoS(kill on sight) list, and we absolutely make sure we have to do it, in order to help protect Albion. Naulus(04/08/08) Stole from Albion Jessylove(Unknown) Suspicious, active on game but not answering to face, found wondering around albion, ran when members logged in, lived with Naulus', '<p>Albion\'s members do not want to randomly put normal people on the guards KoS(kill on sight) list, and we absolutely make sure we have to do it, in order to help protect Albion.<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Naulus(04/08/08)\n<ul><li>Stole from Albion</li></ul></li>\n<li>Jessylove(Unknown)\n<ul><li>Suspicious, active on game but not answering to face, found wondering around albion, ran when members logged in, lived with Naulus</li></ul></li></ul>', 6),
(7325, 1942, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Albion\'s Website', '<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.albion.pap3rback.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Albion\'s Website</a></li></ul>', 7),
(7326, 1943, 'Description', 'Description', 'I am starting new villages and am looking from more people to join\nI have an area all ready started with a couple of smaller off areas near by.\nit is about south of new town and is near the sea,\nif you go on http://wurmonline.com/wiki/index.php?title=Gold_2_Village_Roadmap it is where raven plains out post was \nand the  got animals but more can join,\nfriendly people near by\nhas a mine with iron and zinc, a lead and sliver mines near by So pm me if you want to join/more info\nor go to the forum', '<p>I am starting new villages and am looking from more people to join\nI have an area all ready started with a couple of smaller off areas near by.\nit is about south of new town and is near the sea,\nif you go on <a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://wurmonline.com/wiki/index.php?title=Gold_2_Village_Roadmap\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://wurmonline.com/wiki/index.php?title=Gold_2_Village_Roadmap</a> it is where raven plains out post was \nand the  got animals but more can join,\nfriendly people near by\nhas a mine with iron and zinc, a lead and sliver mines near by\n</p>\n<p><br/>\nSo pm me if you want to join/more info\nor go to the forum\n</p>', 0),
(7327, 1943, 'Traders', 'Traders', '', '', 1),
(7328, 1943, 'Village Citzens', 'Village_Citzens', 'Jerjer Zabuzar Afrosamurai', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Jerjer\" title=\"Player:Jerjer\">Jerjer</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Zabuzar\" title=\"Player:Zabuzar\">Zabuzar</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Afrosamurai\" title=\"Player:Afrosamurai\">Afrosamurai</a></li></ul>', 2),
