(7485, 1996, 'Members', 'Members', 'List of members and their jobs and positions more jobs and positions will be added later, along with titles! Elwood-Mayor\nThoi- Smith, second in command\nUsafpararescue-Villager\nRileykeat-Villager\nOls-Villager\nOsdeath-Town Farmer, Trollslayer\nLemon-Villager\nSirjake-Villager', '<p>List of members and their jobs and positions more jobs and positions will be added later, along with titles!\n</p>\n<p>Elwood-Mayor\nThoi- Smith, second in command\nUsafpararescue-Villager\nRileykeat-Villager\nOls-Villager\nOsdeath-Town Farmer, Trollslayer\nLemon-Villager\nSirjake-Villager\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
