(7889, 2166, 'Infos', 'Infos', 'The settlement of Hogwarts was founded at 17:31:36 on day of Tears in week 3 of the starfall of the Saw in the year of 1020. Hogwarts is the official village of the Italian Community and it was founded by Davy.\nThat is located near the way to Gurubear\'s Crater . on febraury the settlement has been sold to Cynny Citizens All citizen transfered on Chaos PvP server, and now lives in Guardians of the light [gotL] If you wish to become a citizen on the new deeed, you need join the Italian Community .', '<p>The settlement of Hogwarts was founded at 17:31:36 on day of Tears in week 3 of the starfall of the Saw in the year of 1020.\n</p>\n<p>Hogwarts is the official village of the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://wurmonlineitalia.it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Italian Community</a> and it was founded by Davy.\nThat is located near the way to <a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_settlement\" title=\"Undefined settlement\">Gurubear\'s Crater</a>.\n</p>\n<p>on febraury <b>the settlement has been sold to Cynny</b>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Citizens\">Citizens</span></h3>\n<p>All citizen transfered on Chaos PvP server, and now lives in <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Guardians_of_the_light\" title=\"Guardians of the light\">Guardians of the light</a> [gotL]\n</p>\n<p>If you wish to become a citizen on the new deeed, you need join the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://wurmonlineitalia.it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Italian Community</a>.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 0),
(7890, 2166, 'Ex Citizens', 'Ex_Citizens', '(contact them in game to join new village) Davy (Mayor) GiuseppeP (co-mayor) Harrypotter Crowel CashMania Faster Luposelvaggio Luposolitario CreeperTheMOB', '<p><i>(contact them in game to join new village)</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Davy (Mayor)</b></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:GiuseppeP\" title=\"Player:GiuseppeP\">GiuseppeP</a> (co-mayor)</li>\n<li>Harrypotter</li>\n<li>Crowel</li>\n<li>CashMania</li>\n<li>Faster</li>\n<li>Luposelvaggio</li>\n<li>Luposolitario</li>\n<li>CreeperTheMOB</li></ul>', 1),
(7891, 2167, 'Home', 'Home', 'Home is a settlement roughly 30 seconds from Esert, We are to the southeast of Esert. Laws The laws for Home are as follows: No trespassing This includes: Being thrown by a monster Being lured into someone\'s property No greifing This includes: Fencing off Resources (This excludes trees that you planted) Locking gates that you did not place Stealing No use of artifacts or items such as shaker orbs use of rods of transmutation is allowed use of the rod of transmutation is only legal when used under the following stipulations: Do not transmute to lead or gold Do not transmute in a cave is in question as to who dug it Do not transmute under houses If you find someone breaking any of these laws please contact: Ignaticus, Weegin, or Bloxdude. If none of the afformentioned authorities are available, please Drop a note in the community hall, known as weegin\'s mansion, this is simply any useless item that has been renamed with the needed text, if there is not enough space, please place the items inside a container so that we can keep the things seperate as evidence. The official note item is a wooden scrap, preferably one that is very small, such as a scrap from a handle. Mayors Ignaticus (incumbent) Citizens Bloxdude Dovahkiindragonborn Eternalsword Farluil Kingnecromancer Malica Owainn Siphonife Skiethan Smokenose Spooty Weegin', '<p>Home is a settlement roughly 30 seconds from Esert, We are to the southeast of Esert.\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Laws\">Laws</span></h4>\n<p>The laws for Home are as follows:\n</p>\n<ul><li>No trespassing\n<ul><li>This includes:\n<ul><li>Being thrown by a monster</li>\n<li>Being lured into someone\'s property</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>No greifing\n<ul><li>This includes:\n<ul><li>Fencing off Resources (This excludes trees that you planted)</li>\n<li>Locking gates that you did not place</li>\n<li>Stealing</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>No use of artifacts or items such as shaker orbs\n<ul><li>use of rods of transmutation is allowed\n<ul><li>use of the rod of transmutation is only legal when used under the following stipulations:\n<ul><li>Do not transmute to lead or gold</li>\n<li>Do not transmute in a cave is in question as to who dug it</li>\n<li>Do not transmute under houses</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>If you find someone breaking any of these laws please contact: Ignaticus, Weegin, or Bloxdude.\n<ul><li>If none of the afformentioned authorities are available, please Drop a note in the community hall, known as weegin\'s mansion, this is simply any useless item that has been renamed with the needed text, if there is not enough space, please place the items inside a container so that we can keep the things seperate as evidence.\n<ul><li>The official note item is a wooden scrap, preferably one that is very small, such as a scrap from a handle.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mayors\">Mayors</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Ignaticus (incumbent)</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Citizens\">Citizens</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Bloxdude</li>\n<li>Dovahkiindragonborn</li>\n<li>Eternalsword</li>\n<li>Farluil</li>\n<li>Kingnecromancer</li>\n<li>Malica</li>\n<li>Owainn</li>\n<li>Siphonife</li>\n<li>Skiethan</li>\n<li>Smokenose</li>\n<li>Spooty</li>\n<li>Weegin</li></ul>', 0),
(7892, 2169, 'Description', 'Description', 'Iceland is a fairly new village nestling in the forest close to the steppe and tundra expanse in the north east corner of Freedom Isles. Plagued by everything from dogs to trolls, it is an ideal hunting ground for new and seasoned players alike.', '<p>Iceland is a fairly new village nestling in the forest close to the steppe and tundra expanse in the north east corner of Freedom Isles. Plagued by everything from dogs to trolls, it is an ideal hunting ground for new and seasoned players alike. \n</p>', 0),
(7893, 2169, 'Location', 'Location', 'We are situated on the north east shore of Freedom Isles. Coordinates 46x 11y on the Freedom Map . To get to us by boat sail around the coast to Tower Point and take the road up from there. Access by land can be achieved via Roadside or the unmapped lake, but there are no roads at present.', '<p>We are situated on the north east shore of Freedom Isles. Coordinates 46x 11y on the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://pic.phyrefile.com/n/ne/nesral/2009/08/07/Freedom.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Freedom Map</a>.\n</p>\n<p>To get to us by boat sail around the coast to Tower Point and take the road up from there. Access by land can be achieved via Roadside or the unmapped lake, but there are no roads at present.\n</p>', 1),
(7894, 2169, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Mayor Silentnight Elders Miceless Synystar Villagers Champ Meisless Gnarrzter Fleischman', '<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mayor\">Mayor</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Silentnight</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elders\">Elders</span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Miceless\" title=\"Player:Miceless\">Miceless</a></li>\n<li>Synystar</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Villagers\">Villagers</span></h4>\n<ul><li>Champ</li>\n<li>Meisless</li>\n<li>Gnarrzter</li>\n<li>Fleischman</li></ul>', 2),
(7895, 2170, 'Village Description', 'Village_Description', 'The village of Insanity Hills is located about 20 minutes south-west of Samling. It was founded on the high point of a valley leading from Insanity Port on the Reborn-Fjord south-west of Samling to Insanity Hills South Port on a bay of the inner sea.', '<p>The village of Insanity Hills is located about 20 minutes south-west of Samling. It was founded on the high point of a valley leading from <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Insanity_Port\" title=\"Insanity Port\">Insanity Port</a> on the Reborn-Fjord south-west of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Samling\" title=\"Samling\">Samling</a> to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Insanity_Hills_South_Port\" title=\"Insanity Hills South Port\">Insanity Hills South Port</a> on a bay of the inner sea.\n</p>', 0),
(7896, 2170, 'Transportation', 'Transportation', 'A two-wide road connects Insanity Port, Insanity Hills and Insanity Hills South Port. The road extends from the South Port to Bay Hill Estates and east to Darkenstone . Another road runs from Insanity Hills south to Oreo . The Reborn area is only reachable by boat or along the shore from Insanity Port.', '<p>A two-wide road connects Insanity Port, Insanity Hills and Insanity Hills South Port. The road extends from the South Port to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Bay_Hill_Estates\" title=\"Bay Hill Estates\">Bay Hill Estates</a> and east to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Darkenstone\" title=\"Darkenstone\">Darkenstone</a>. Another road runs from Insanity Hills south to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Oreo\" title=\"Oreo\">Oreo</a>.\n</p>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Reborn\" title=\"Reborn\">Reborn</a> area is only reachable by boat or along the shore from Insanity Port. \n</p>', 1),
(7897, 2170, 'Village History', 'Village_History', 'The village of Insanity Hills was originally located just a few minutes south of Newtown int the Jenn-Kellon homelands. During the exodus to Freedom they set foot on the shore of a fjord south-west of Samling . On a little ridge between the shore and a valley leading deeper inland they founded the village of Insanity Port as a base of operations. A few weeks later the village of Insanity Hills was founded on a plateau further into the valley. Since then the valley and the surrounding area have been developed and roads have been built to connect to the major cities in the east and south.', '<p>The village of Insanity Hills was originally located just a few minutes south of Newtown int the <a href=\"/index.php/Jenn-Kellon\" title=\"Jenn-Kellon\">Jenn-Kellon</a> homelands.\n</p>\n<p>During the exodus to <a href=\"/index.php/Freedom\" title=\"Freedom\">Freedom</a> they set foot on the shore of a fjord south-west of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Samling\" title=\"Samling\">Samling</a>. On a little ridge between the shore and a valley leading deeper inland they founded the village of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Insanity_Port\" title=\"Insanity Port\">Insanity Port</a> as a base of operations. A few weeks later the village of Insanity Hills was founded on a plateau further into the valley.\n</p>\n<p>Since then the valley and the surrounding area have been developed and roads have been built to connect to the major cities in the east and south.\n</p>', 2),
(7898, 2170, 'Villagers', 'Villagers', 'Elders The elders are the members of the original village in the Jenn-Kellon homelands Spellcast Nulliusrex Selavi Ago Colch Nikodeimus Notable villagers Wurzel Spiritual services Thyrim Priest of Magranon Runthgar Priest of Magranon Xerus Priest of Vynora (90 Faith, 70 Channeling) Jalina Priest of Fo (70 Faith, 40 Channeling)', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elders\">Elders</span></h3>\n<p>The elders are the members of the original village in the Jenn-Kellon homelands\n</p>\n<ul><li>Spellcast</li>\n<li>Nulliusrex</li>\n<li>Selavi</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Ago\" title=\"Player:Ago\">Ago</a></li>\n<li>Colch</li>\n<li>Nikodeimus</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_villagers\">Notable villagers</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Wurzel</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Spiritual_services\">Spiritual services</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Thyrim Priest of Magranon</li>\n<li>Runthgar Priest of Magranon</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Xerus\" title=\"Player:Xerus\">Xerus</a> Priest of Vynora (90 Faith, 70 Channeling)</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Jalina\" title=\"Player:Jalina\">Jalina</a> Priest of Fo (70 Faith, 40 Channeling)</li></ul>', 3),
(7899, 2171, 'Description', 'Description', 'Insula Magna is a player Settlement in the Pristine lands of the Freedom Isles . It is located approximately at coordinates (7x,26y) on the Community Map . Insula Magna has a public Inn with many Beds to rent, accessible Token for banking, and several Merchants and a Trader . A large church is available for use. An altar of Magranon and an altar Vynora are currently available in the settlement. It is reachable by boat and a land bridge from shore. The settlement is still under construction.', '<p><b>Insula Magna</b> is a player <a href=\"/index.php/Settlement\" title=\"Settlement\">Settlement</a> in the <a href=\"/index.php/Pristine\" title=\"Pristine\">Pristine</a> lands of the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Freedom_Isles\" title=\"Freedom Isles\">Freedom Isles</a>.\n</p>\n<p>It is located approximately at coordinates (7x,26y) on the <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/13689934/Wurm/Pristine%20community%20map%20HR.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Community Map</a>.\n</p>\n<p><b>Insula Magna</b> has a public Inn with many <a href=\"/index.php/Bed\" title=\"Bed\">Beds</a> to rent, accessible <a href=\"/index.php/Token\" title=\"Token\">Token</a> for banking, and several <a href=\"/index.php/Merchants\" title=\"Merchants\">Merchants</a> and a <a href=\"/index.php/Trader\" title=\"Trader\">Trader</a>.\n</p>\n<p>A large church is available for use. An altar of Magranon and an altar Vynora are currently available in the settlement.\n</p>\n<p>It is reachable by boat and a land bridge from shore.\n</p>\n<p>The settlement is still under construction.\n</p>', 0),
(7900, 2171, 'Resources', 'Resources', 'Several significant agricultural fields including: Pumpkin Wemp Garlic Cotton Reed Several herds of animals including: Horses Cows Bison Crafting stations including: Kitchens         ( Food ) Looms            ( Cloth ) Forges           ( Blacksmithing / Weapon smithing ) Carpentry Shops  ( Carpentry items ) Weaving stations ( Rope )', '<p>Several significant agricultural fields including:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Wemp\" title=\"Wemp\">Wemp</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Garlic\" title=\"Garlic\">Garlic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Cotton\" title=\"Cotton\">Cotton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Reed\" title=\"Reed\">Reed</a></li></ul>\n<p>Several herds of animals including:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Horses\" title=\"Horses\">Horses</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cows\" title=\"Cows\">Cows</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bison\" title=\"Bison\">Bison</a></li></ul>\n<p>Crafting stations including:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Kitchens         (<a href=\"/index.php/Food\" title=\"Food\">Food</a>)</li>\n<li>Looms            (<a href=\"/index.php/Cloth\" title=\"Cloth\">Cloth</a>)</li>\n<li>Forges           (<a href=\"/index.php/Blacksmithing\" title=\"Blacksmithing\">Blacksmithing</a>/<a href=\"/index.php/Weapon_smithing\" title=\"Weapon smithing\">Weapon smithing</a>)</li>\n<li>Carpentry Shops  (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Carpentry_items\" title=\"Carpentry items\">Carpentry items</a>)</li>\n<li>Weaving stations (<a href=\"/index.php/Rope\" title=\"Rope\">Rope</a>)</li></ul>', 1),
(7901, 2171, 'Members', 'Members', 'JTFoomega Juju Albert icbash Kire', '<ul><li>JTFoomega</li>\n<li>Juju</li>\n<li>Albert</li>\n<li>icbash</li>\n<li>Kire</li></ul>', 2),
(7902, 2171, 'Alliance', 'Alliance', 'StoneridandGarden O', '<ul><li>StoneridandGarden O</li></ul>', 3),
(7903, 2171, 'Recruitment', 'Recruitment', 'Insula Magna is currently open to new members provided that they are friendly and good citizens willing to contribute to the community.', '<p><b>Insula Magna</b> is currently open to new members provided that they are friendly and good citizens willing to contribute to the community.\n</p>', 4),
(7904, 2171, 'Forum', 'Forum', 'The Insula Magna online forum is located here: Online Forum', '<p>The <b>Insula Magna</b> online forum is located here:<a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://insulamagna.createaforum.com/index.php\" rel=\"nofollow\">Online Forum</a>\n</p>', 5),
