f Faith</b> - <b>Blacksmith</b> - <b>Miner</b> - Animal husbandry]</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Moru\" title=\"Player:Moru\">Moru</a> - <i>Citizen</i> [<b>Keeper of Faith</b> - <b>Trollslayer</b> - <b>Farmer</b> - Chef - Carpenter]</li></ul>', 1),
