(8036, 2215, 'Description', 'Description', '-Wiki is in construction- Solace is a fun, close-knit, size 25 deed. Having a beautiful sea side view and large mountains behind it, Solace reaches the peak of tranquility and offers the perfect mixture of scenery to relax you entire soul. Utilizing multiple public buildings for much of our crafting while having private houses for each citizen for personal storage and space. Along with providing every citizen a place for your own and a organized area to craft, Solace has a wide variety of resources at its disposal such as large farming spaces, fruit orchards, access to iron, copper, zinc and silver. As well with having clay, tar and moss all very close by. Also with having any livestock you could need such as cattle, horses and even bears! Surrounded by endless lush forests of every type of lumber and great for hunting, containing many dens to deer, bear, unicorns, wolves and more.', '<pre>                                            -Wiki is in construction-\n</pre>\n<p>Solace is a fun, close-knit, size 25 deed. Having a beautiful sea side view and large mountains behind it, Solace reaches the peak of tranquility and offers the perfect mixture of scenery to relax you entire soul. \n</p>\n<p>Utilizing multiple public buildings for much of our crafting while having private houses for each citizen for personal storage and space. Along with providing every citizen a place for your own and a organized area to craft, Solace has a wide variety of resources at its disposal such as large farming spaces, fruit orchards, access to iron, copper, zinc and silver. As well with having clay, tar and moss all very close by. Also with having any livestock you could need such as cattle, horses and even bears! Surrounded by endless lush forests of every type of lumber and great for hunting, containing many dens to deer, bear, unicorns, wolves and more.\n</p>', 0),
