(8728, 2421, 'Effects', 'Effects', 'The curved shoulder pad gives a reduction to biting damage when wearing medium or heavy armour.', '<p>The curved shoulder pad gives a reduction to biting damage when wearing medium or heavy armour.\n</p>', 1),
