(9291, 2569, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Slate iron fence with Slate brick. Each Slate brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.', '<ul><li>Repair Slate iron fence with Slate brick. Each Slate brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
