(9338, 2580, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Pottery brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Pottery double door . Continuation requires at least 1 Pottery brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_brick\" title=\"Pottery brick\">Pottery brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Pottery double door</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_brick\" title=\"Pottery brick\">Pottery brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 3),
