(9448, 2599, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Sandstone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Sandstone window . Continuation requires at least 1 Sandstone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Sandstone window</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(9449, 2599, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(9450, 2599, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Sandstone brick before improving it. Activate a Sandstone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Sandstone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
