(9456, 2600, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 4),
(9457, 2600, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Sandstone brick before improving it. Activate a Sandstone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Sandstone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(9458, 2600, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Sandstone wall Sandstone window Sandstone door Sandstone double door Sandstone oriel Sandstone narrow window Sandstone portcullis Sandstone barred wall Sandstone arched wall Sandstone T arch Sandstone arch right Sandstone arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_wall\" title=\"Sandstone wall\">Sandstone wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_window\" title=\"Sandstone window\">Sandstone window</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sandstone door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_double_door\" title=\"Sandstone double door\">Sandstone double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_oriel\" title=\"Sandstone oriel\">Sandstone oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_narrow_window\" title=\"Sandstone narrow window\">Sandstone narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Sandstone portcullis (wall)\">Sandstone portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_barred_wall\" title=\"Sandstone barred wall\">Sandstone barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_arched_wall\" title=\"Sandstone arched wall\">Sandstone arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_T_arch\" title=\"Sandstone T arch\">Sandstone T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_arch_right\" title=\"Sandstone arch right\">Sandstone arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_arch_left\" title=\"Sandstone arch left\">Sandstone arch left</a></li></ul>', 6),
(9459, 2601, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a door', '<p><i>You see a door </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9460, 2601, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob (for example trolls ) or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob (for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>) or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(9461, 2601, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 2),
(9462, 2601, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Sandstone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Sandstone double door . Continuation requires at least 1 Sandstone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Sandstone double door</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 3),
(9463, 2601, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 4),
(9464, 2601, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Sandstone brick before improving it. Activate a Sandstone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Sandstone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
