(9544, 2615, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a door', '<p><i>You see a door </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9545, 2615, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob (for example trolls ) or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob (for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>) or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(9546, 2615, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 2),
(9547, 2615, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Marble brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Marble portcullis (wall) . Continuation requires at least 1 Marble brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Marble portcullis (wall)</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 3),
(9548, 2615, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 4),
(9549, 2615, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Marble brick before improving it. Activate a Marble brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Marble brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(9550, 2615, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Marble wall Marble window Marble door Marble double door Marble oriel Marble narrow window Marble portcullis Marble barred wall Marble arched wall Marble T arch Marble arch right Marble arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_wall\" title=\"Marble wall\">Marble wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_window\" title=\"Marble window\">Marble window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_door\" title=\"Marble door\">Marble door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_double_door\" title=\"Marble double door\">Marble double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_oriel\" title=\"Marble oriel\">Marble oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_narrow_window\" title=\"Marble narrow window\">Marble narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Marble portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_barred_wall\" title=\"Marble barred wall\">Marble barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_arched_wall\" title=\"Marble arched wall\">Marble arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_T_arch\" title=\"Marble T arch\">Marble T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_arch_right\" title=\"Marble arch right\">Marble arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_arch_left\" title=\"Marble arch left\">Marble arch left</a></li></ul>', 6),
(9551, 2616, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small spool of wood with a string rolled up in the centre. Yo-yo is an entertaining toy.', '<p><i>A small spool of wood with a string rolled up in the centre.</i>\n</p>\n<p>Yo-yo is an entertaining toy.\n</p>', 0),
(9552, 2616, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Right-click the yoyo and choose Spin . Using yoyo improves yoyo skill. Failing a trick damages the yoyo. Using a yoyo takes the same amount of time regardless of Stamina level.', '<p>Right-click the yoyo and choose <b>Spin</b>. Using yoyo improves yoyo skill. Failing a trick damages the yoyo. Using a yoyo takes the same amount of time regardless of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stamina\" title=\"Stamina\">Stamina</a> level.\n</p>', 1),
(9553, 2616, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Maximum quality (QL) is capped by the quality of the shaft used.  On failure, the shaft\'s quality is reduced. An entire shaft is now required in the process.  If larger than 0.2kg of string is used, only 0.2kg of the string of cloth is used. It is possible to move around while spinning a yoyo. Taking damage (such as from falling) will cancel the action. It is necessary to move to a different location occasionally, as skill-gain will stop if standing on the same tile too long. Sacrificing yoyos gives double favor to followers of Vynora. While using a yoyo, your character visually holds whatever item is currently active. You will be unable to drop the active item during this time.', '<ul><li>Maximum <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> (QL) is capped by the quality of the <a href=\"/index.php/Shaft\" title=\"Shaft\">shaft</a> used.  On failure, the shaft\'s quality is reduced.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>An entire shaft is now required in the process.  If larger than 0.2kg of string is used, only 0.2kg of the string of cloth is used.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>It is possible to move around while spinning a yoyo. Taking damage (such as from falling) will cancel the action.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>It is necessary to move to a different location occasionally, as skill-gain will stop if standing on the same tile too long.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Sacrificing yoyos gives double favor to followers of Vynora.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>While using a yoyo, your character visually holds whatever item is currently active. You will be unable to drop the active item during this time.</li></ul>', 2),
(9554, 2616, 'Moves', 'Moves', 'Move Required Skill Sun 1 Grind 1 Cradle 1 Suicide Basilisk 1 Whip 10(?) Orbit 20(?) Orbit Over Back 40 Dragon Knot ? A successful sequence [21:35:18] You start to spin your yoyo. [21:35:22] The yoyo has good speed now. [21:35:27] You try the \'sun\' and succeed! [21:35:37] You try the \'grind\' and succeed! [21:35:47] You try the \'cradle\' and succeed! [21:35:57] You try the \'suicide basilisk\' and succeed! [21:36:07] You try the \'whip\' and succeed! [21:36:17] You try the \'orbit\' and succeed! [21:36:27] You try the \'orbit over back\' and succeed! [21:36:37] You try the \'dragon knot\' and succeed! [21:36:37] You reel the yoyo in.', '<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Move</th>\n<th>Required Skill\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sun</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grind</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cradle</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suicide Basilisk</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Whip</td>\n<td>10(?)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orbit</td>\n<td>20(?)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orbit Over Back</td>\n<td>40\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dragon Knot</td>\n<td>?\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"A_successful_sequence\">A successful sequence</span></h3>\n<p>[21:35:18] You start to spin your yoyo.<br/>\n[21:35:22] The yoyo has good speed now.<br/>\n[21:35:27] You try the \'sun\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:35:37] You try the \'grind\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:35:47] You try the \'cradle\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:35:57] You try the \'suicide basilisk\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:36:07] You try the \'whip\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:36:17] You try the \'orbit\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:36:27] You try the \'orbit over back\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:36:37] You try the \'dragon knot\' and succeed!<br/>\n[21:36:37] You reel the yoyo in.<br/>\n</p>', 3),
(9555, 2616, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'When using a Yoyo Toys > Yoyo When creating a yoyo Carpentry > Toy making', '<p>When using a Yoyo\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Toys\" title=\"Toys\">Toys</a> &gt; Yoyo</li></ul>\n<p>When creating a yoyo\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Toy_making\" title=\"Toy making\">Toy making</a></li></ul>', 4),
(9556, 2616, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Trickster at 50 skill Freestyler at 70 skill Wild One at 90 skill Legendary Woodspinner at 100 skill', '<ul><li>Trickster at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Freestyler at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Wild One at 90 skill</li>\n<li>Legendary Woodspinner at 100 skill</li></ul>', 5),
(9557, 2617, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a barred wall', '<p><i>You see a barred wall </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9558, 2617, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 1),
(9559, 2617, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Marble brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Marble barred wall . Continuation requires at least 1 Marble brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Marble barred wall</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(9560, 2617, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(9561, 2617, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Marble brick before improving it. Activate a Marble brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Marble brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(9562, 2617, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Marble wall Marble window Marble door Marble double door Marble oriel Marble narrow window Marble portcullis Marble barred wall Marble arched wall Marble T arch Marble arch right Marble arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_wall\" title=\"Marble wall\">Marble wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_window\" title=\"Marble window\">Marble window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_door\" title=\"Marble door\">Marble door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_double_door\" title=\"Marble double door\">Marble double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_oriel\" title=\"Marble oriel\">Marble oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_narrow_window\" title=\"Marble narrow window\">Marble narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Marble portcullis (wall)\">Marble portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Marble barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_arched_wall\" title=\"Marble arched wall\">Marble arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_T_arch\" title=\"Marble T arch\">Marble T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_arch_right\" title=\"Marble arch right\">Marble arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_arch_left\" title=\"Marble arch left\">Marble arch left</a></li></ul>', 5),
(9575, 2620, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a window.', '<p><i>You see a window. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9576, 2620, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 1),
(9577, 2620, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Rounded stone window . Continuation requires at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Rounded stone window</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(9578, 2620, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(9579, 2620, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Rounded stone before improving it. Activate a Rounded stone , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Rounded stone is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(9580, 2620, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Rounded stone wall Rounded stone window Rounded stone door Rounded stone double door Rounded stone oriel Rounded stone narrow window Rounded stone portcullis Rounded stone barred wall Rounded stone arched wall Rounded stone T arch Rounded stone arch right Rounded stone arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone wall\">Rounded stone wall</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rounded stone window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_door\" title=\"Rounded stone door\">Rounded stone door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_double_door\" title=\"Rounded stone double door\">Rounded stone double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_oriel\" title=\"Rounded stone oriel\">Rounded stone oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_narrow_window\" title=\"Rounded stone narrow window\">Rounded stone narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Rounded stone portcullis (wall)\"> Rounded stone portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_barred_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone barred wall\">Rounded stone barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arched_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone arched wall\">Rounded stone arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_T_arch\" title=\"Rounded stone T arch\">Rounded stone T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_right\" title=\"Rounded stone arch right\">Rounded stone arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_left\" title=\"Rounded stone arch left\">Rounded stone arch left</a></li></ul>', 5),
(9581, 2621, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a door', '<p><i>You see a door </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9582, 2621, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob (for example trolls ) or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob (for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>) or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(9583, 2621, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 2),
(9584, 2621, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Rounded stone door . Continuation requires at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Rounded stone door</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 3),
(9585, 2621, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 4),
(9586, 2621, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Rounded stone before improving it. Activate a Rounded stone , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Rounded stone is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(9587, 2621, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Rounded stone wall Rounded stone window Rounded stone door Rounded stone double door Rounded stone oriel Rounded stone narrow window Rounded stone portcullis Rounded stone barred wall Rounded stone arched wall Rounded stone T arch Rounded stone arch right Rounded stone arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone wall\">Rounded stone wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_window\" title=\"Rounded stone window\">Rounded stone window</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rounded stone door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_double_door\" title=\"Rounded stone double door\">Rounded stone double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_oriel\" title=\"Rounded stone oriel\">Rounded stone oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_narrow_window\" title=\"Rounded stone narrow window\">Rounded stone narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Rounded stone portcullis (wall)\"> Rounded stone portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_barred_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone barred wall\">Rounded stone barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arched_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone arched wall\">Rounded stone arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_T_arch\" title=\"Rounded stone T arch\">Rounded stone T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_right\" title=\"Rounded stone arch right\">Rounded stone arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_left\" title=\"Rounded stone arch left\">Rounded stone arch left</a></li></ul>', 6),
(9588, 2622, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a door', '<p><i>You see a door </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9589, 2622, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob (for example trolls ) or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob (for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>) or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(9590, 2622, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 2),
(9591, 2622, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Rounded stone double door . Continuation requires at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Rounded stone double door</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 3);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(9592, 2622, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 4),
(9593, 2622, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Rounded stone before improving it. Activate a Rounded stone , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Rounded stone is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(9594, 2622, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Rounded stone wall Rounded stone window Rounded stone door Rounded stone double door Rounded stone oriel Rounded stone narrow window Rounded stone portcullis Rounded stone barred wall Rounded stone arched wall Rounded stone T arch Rounded stone arch right Rounded stone arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone wall\">Rounded stone wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_window\" title=\"Rounded stone window\">Rounded stone window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_door\" title=\"Rounded stone door\">Rounded stone door</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rounded stone double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_oriel\" title=\"Rounded stone oriel\">Rounded stone oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_narrow_window\" title=\"Rounded stone narrow window\">Rounded stone narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Rounded stone portcullis (wall)\"> Rounded stone portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_barred_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone barred wall\">Rounded stone barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arched_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone arched wall\">Rounded stone arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_T_arch\" title=\"Rounded stone T arch\">Rounded stone T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_right\" title=\"Rounded stone arch right\">Rounded stone arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_left\" title=\"Rounded stone arch left\">Rounded stone arch left</a></li></ul>', 6),
(9595, 2623, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see an oriel', '<p><i>You see an oriel </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9596, 2623, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 1),
(9597, 2623, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Rounded stone oriel . Continuation requires at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Rounded stone oriel</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(9598, 2623, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(9599, 2623, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Rounded stone before improving it. Activate a Rounded stone , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Rounded stone is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(9600, 2623, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Rounded stone wall Rounded stone window Rounded stone door Rounded stone double door Rounded stone oriel Rounded stone narrow window Rounded stone portcullis Rounded stone barred wall Rounded stone arched wall Rounded stone T arch Rounded stone arch right Rounded stone arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone wall\">Rounded stone wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_window\" title=\"Rounded stone window\">Rounded stone window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_door\" title=\"Rounded stone door\">Rounded stone door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_double_door\" title=\"Rounded stone double door\">Rounded stone double door</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rounded stone oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_narrow_window\" title=\"Rounded stone narrow window\">Rounded stone narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Rounded stone portcullis (wall)\"> Rounded stone portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_barred_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone barred wall\">Rounded stone barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arched_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone arched wall\">Rounded stone arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_T_arch\" title=\"Rounded stone T arch\">Rounded stone T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_right\" title=\"Rounded stone arch right\">Rounded stone arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_arch_left\" title=\"Rounded stone arch left\">Rounded stone arch left</a></li></ul>', 5),
