(9608, 2625, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob (for example trolls ) or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob (for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>) or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
