(9610, 2625, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Rounded stone portcullis (wall) . Continuation requires at least 1 Rounded stone and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Rounded stone portcullis (wall)</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 3),
