(9666, 2633, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall . Can be turned back to a plain narrow stone window with a crowbar .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li>\n<li>Can be turned back to a <a href=\"/index.php/Plain_narrow_stone_window\" title=\"Plain narrow stone window\">plain narrow stone window</a> with a <a href=\"/index.php/Crowbar\" title=\"Crowbar\">crowbar</a>.</li></ul>', 3),
(9667, 2633, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Stone brick before improving it. Activate a Stone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Stone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>', 4),
(9668, 2633, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Rendering a painted wall will keep the original paint.', '<ul><li>Rendering a painted wall will keep the original paint.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(9669, 2633, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Rendered wall Rendered window Rendered door Rendered double door Rendered oriel Rendered narrow window Rendered portcullis Rendered barred wall Rendered arched wall Rendered T arch Rendered arch right Rendered arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_wall\" title=\"Rendered wall\">Rendered wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_window\" title=\"Rendered window\">Rendered window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_door\" title=\"Rendered door\">Rendered door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_double_door\" title=\"Rendered double door\">Rendered double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_oriel\" title=\"Rendered oriel\">Rendered oriel</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rendered narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Rendered portcullis (wall)\">Rendered portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_barred_wall\" title=\"Rendered barred wall\">Rendered barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_arched_wall\" title=\"Rendered arched wall\">Rendered arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_T_arch\" title=\"Rendered T arch\">Rendered T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_arch_right\" title=\"Rendered arch right\">Rendered arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_arch_left\" title=\"Rendered arch left\">Rendered arch left</a></li></ul>', 6),
(9670, 2634, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a door', '<p><i>You see a door </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9671, 2634, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob (for example trolls ) or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob (for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>) or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(9672, 2634, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 2),
(9673, 2634, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Build a plain stone portcullis . combine 20kg of clay, activate it, right-click the wall and select Render wall.', '<ul><li>Build a <a href=\"/index.php/Plain_stone_portcullis\" title=\"Plain stone portcullis\">plain stone portcullis</a>.</li>\n<li>combine 20kg of clay, activate it, right-click the wall and select Render wall.</li></ul>', 3),
(9674, 2634, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall . Can be turned back to a plain stone portcullis with a crowbar .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li>\n<li>Can be turned back to a <a href=\"/index.php/Plain_stone_portcullis\" title=\"Plain stone portcullis\">plain stone portcullis</a> with a <a href=\"/index.php/Crowbar\" title=\"Crowbar\">crowbar</a>.</li></ul>', 4),
(9675, 2634, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Stone brick before improving it. Activate a Stone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Stone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>', 5),
(9676, 2634, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Rendering a painted wall will keep the original paint.', '<ul><li>Rendering a painted wall will keep the original paint.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 6),
