(9816, 2572, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Rounded stone iron fence with Rounded stone. Each Rounded stone will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.', '<ul><li>Repair Rounded stone iron fence with Rounded stone. Each Rounded stone will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
