(9990, 2705, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Slate brick wall Slate window Slate door Slate double door Slate oriel Slate narrow window Slate portcullis Slate barred wall Slate arched wall Slate T arch Slate arch right Slate arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick_wall\" title=\"Slate brick wall\">Slate brick wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_window\" title=\"Slate window\">Slate window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_door\" title=\"Slate door\">Slate door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_double_door\" title=\"Slate double door\">Slate double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_oriel\" title=\"Slate oriel\">Slate oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_narrow_window\" title=\"Slate narrow window\">Slate narrow window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Slate portcullis (wall)\">Slate portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_barred_wall\" title=\"Slate barred wall\">Slate barred wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_arched_wall\" title=\"Slate arched wall\">Slate arched wall</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Slate T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_arch_right\" title=\"Slate arch right\">Slate arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_arch_left\" title=\"Slate arch left\">Slate arch left</a></li></ul>', 5),
(9991, 2706, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a wall.', '<p><i>You see a wall. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(9992, 2706, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 1),
(9993, 2706, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Slate brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Slate arch right . Continuation requires at least 1 Slate brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick\" title=\"Slate brick\">Slate brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Slate arch right</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick\" title=\"Slate brick\">Slate brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(9994, 2706, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(9995, 2706, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Slate brick before improving it. Activate a Slate brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Slate brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick\" title=\"Slate brick\">Slate brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick\" title=\"Slate brick\">Slate brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick\" title=\"Slate brick\">Slate brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
