(10056, 2716, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Rounded stone before improving it. Activate a Rounded stone , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Rounded stone is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4);
