(10078, 2720, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Stone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Plain stone arch left . Continuation requires at least 1 Stone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Plain stone arch left</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(10079, 2720, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'A hammer or mallet can be used for modifying the wall into its trimmed version, the Stone arch left . Activate the tool and right-click the wall, then select Add decorations . You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>A <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> can be used for modifying the wall into its trimmed version, the <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_arch_left\" title=\"Stone arch left\">Stone arch left</a>. <b>Activate</b> the tool and <b>right-click</b> the wall, then select <b>Add decorations</b>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(10080, 2720, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Stone brick before improving it. Activate a Stone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Stone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
