(10086, 2722, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see an arched wall', '<p><i>You see an arched wall </i>\n</p>', 0),
(10087, 2722, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 1),
(10088, 2722, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Stone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Stone T arch . Continuation requires at least 1 Stone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Stone T arch</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(10089, 2722, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'Pliers are used for modifying the wall into its trimless version, the Plain stone T arch . Activate the tool and right-click the wall, then select Remove Decorations . You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Pliers\" title=\"Pliers\">Pliers</a> are used for modifying the wall into its trimless version, the <a href=\"/index.php/Plain_stone_T_arch\" title=\"Plain stone T arch\">Plain stone T arch</a>.  <b>Activate</b> the tool and <b>right-click</b> the wall, then select <b>Remove Decorations</b>.</li>\n<li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(10090, 2722, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Stone brick before improving it. Activate a Stone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Stone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(10091, 2722, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Stone wall Stone door Stone portcullis Stone window Stone oriel Stone double door Stone T arch Stone arch right Stone arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_wall\" title=\"Stone wall\">Stone wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_door\" title=\"Stone door\">Stone door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Stone portcullis (wall)\"> Stone portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_window\" title=\"Stone window\">Stone window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_oriel\" title=\"Stone oriel\">Stone oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_double_door\" title=\"Stone double door\">Stone double door</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Stone T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_arch_right\" title=\"Stone arch right\">Stone arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_arch_left\" title=\"Stone arch left\">Stone arch left</a></li></ul>', 5),
(10092, 2723, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see an arched wall', '<p><i>You see an arched wall </i>\n</p>', 0),
(10093, 2723, 'Skill Requirements', 'Skill_Requirements', 'At least 30 masonry skill is required to build stone walls. See multi-story housing for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.', '<ul><li>At least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill is required to build stone walls.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/index.php/Multi-story_housing#Skill_needed\" title=\"Multi-story housing\">multi-story housing</a> for more information regarding skill requirements on additional floors.</li></ul>', 1),
(10094, 2723, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Stone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory. Activate a trowel and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Stone arch right . Continuation requires at least 1 Stone brick and 1 mortar in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Stone arch right</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> and 1 mortar in your inventory.</li></ul>', 2),
(10095, 2723, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'Pliers are used for modifying the wall into its trimless version, the Plain stone arch right . Activate the tool and right-click the wall, then select Remove Decorations . You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Pliers\" title=\"Pliers\">Pliers</a> are used for modifying the wall into its trimless version, the <a href=\"/index.php/Plain_stone_arch_right\" title=\"Plain stone arch right\">Plain stone arch right</a>.  <b>Activate</b> the tool and <b>right-click</b> the wall, then select <b>Remove Decorations</b>.</li>\n<li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 3),
(10096, 2723, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a Stone brick before improving it. Activate a Stone brick , right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the Stone brick is affected by its damage and your masonry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a>, right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(10097, 2723, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Stone wall Stone door Stone portcullis Stone window Stone oriel Stone double door Stone T arch Stone arch right Stone arch left', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_wall\" title=\"Stone wall\">Stone wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_door\" title=\"Stone door\">Stone door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_portcullis_(wall)\" title=\"Stone portcullis (wall)\"> Stone portcullis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_window\" title=\"Stone window\">Stone window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_oriel\" title=\"Stone oriel\">Stone oriel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_double_door\" title=\"Stone double door\">Stone double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_T_arch\" title=\"Stone T arch\">Stone T arch</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Stone arch right</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_arch_left\" title=\"Stone arch left\">Stone arch left</a></li></ul>', 5),
