(10105, 2725, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 Plank and 1 Large nails in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Wooden wall . Continuation requires at least 1 plank in your inventory.', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">Plank</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Large_nails\" title=\"Large nails\">Large nails</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Wooden wall</b>.</li>\n<li>Continuation requires at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> in your inventory.</li></ul>', 1),
