(10196, 2747, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Marble high iron fence with Marble brick. Each Marble brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color. High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, iron fence gates can.', '<ul><li>Repair Marble high iron fence with Marble brick. Each Marble brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_fence_gate\" title=\"Iron fence gate\">iron fence gates</a> can.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
