(10208, 2750, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Rendered high iron fence with Clay. Each Clay will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color. High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, iron fence gates can.', '<ul><li>Repair Rendered high iron fence with Clay. Each Clay will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_fence_gate\" title=\"Iron fence gate\">iron fence gates</a> can.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
