(10212, 2751, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Slate high iron fence gate with slate brick. Each slate brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color. Intelligent monsters such as trolls are able to open unlocked gates. High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, iron fence gates can. Gates can be locked with a gate lock , then controlled by deed permissions if applicable, as well as the key .', '<ul><li>Repair Slate high iron fence gate with slate brick. Each slate brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Intelligent monsters such as <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a> are able to open unlocked gates.</li>\n<li>High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_fence_gate\" title=\"Iron fence gate\">iron fence gates</a> can.</li>\n<li>Gates can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Gate_lock\" title=\"Gate lock\">gate lock</a>, then controlled by deed <a href=\"/index.php/Permissions\" title=\"Permissions\">permissions</a> if applicable, as well as the <a href=\"/index.php/Key\" title=\"Key\">key</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
(10213, 2751, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Fences Fence gates Empirical Evaluation of Fences', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Fences\" title=\"Category:Fences\">Fences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Gates\" title=\"Category:Gates\">Fence gates</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Empirical_Evaluation_of_Fences\" title=\"Empirical Evaluation of Fences\">Empirical Evaluation of Fences</a></li></ul>', 3),
(10214, 2752, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see an iron fence gate.', '<p><i>You see an iron fence gate. </i>\n</p>', 0);
