(10215, 2752, 'Skill required', 'Skill_required', 'To calculate the maximum slope you can build on, based on your carpentry or masonry skill, use the following formula submitted by Ketza : Max slope = (3 * √ skill) + 10 Skill Max Slope 6 17 8 18 9 19 12 20 14 21 16 22 19 23 22 24 25 25 29 26 33 27 36 28 41 29 45 30 49 31 54 32 59 33 64 34 70 35 75 36 81 37 88 38 94 39 Note: Maximum slope is rounded down', '<p>To calculate the <a href=\"/index.php/Maximum_slope\" title=\"Maximum slope\">maximum slope</a> you can build on, based on your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, use the following formula submitted by <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ketza\" title=\"Player:Ketza\">Ketza</a>:\n</p>\n<p><i>Max slope = (3 *</i> √<i>skill) + 10</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"100\">Skill\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Max Slope\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>23\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>27\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>28\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>29\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>31\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>59</td>\n<td>33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>34\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75</td>\n<td>36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>81</td>\n<td>37\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>38\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>39\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Note:</b> Maximum slope is rounded <i>down</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(10216, 2752, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Sandstone high iron fence gate with Sandstone brick. Each Sandstone brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color. Intelligent monsters such as trolls are able to open unlocked gates. High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, iron fence gates can. Gates can be locked with a gate lock , then controlled by deed permissions if applicable, as well as the key .', '<ul><li>Repair Sandstone high iron fence gate with Sandstone brick. Each Sandstone brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Intelligent monsters such as <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a> are able to open unlocked gates.</li>\n<li>High iron fence gates cannot be built in arched walls, <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_fence_gate\" title=\"Iron fence gate\">iron fence gates</a> can.</li>\n<li>Gates can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Gate_lock\" title=\"Gate lock\">gate lock</a>, then controlled by deed <a href=\"/index.php/Permissions\" title=\"Permissions\">permissions</a> if applicable, as well as the <a href=\"/index.php/Key\" title=\"Key\">key</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
(10217, 2752, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Fences Fence gates Empirical Evaluation of Fences', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Fences\" title=\"Category:Fences\">Fences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Gates\" title=\"Category:Gates\">Fence gates</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Empirical_Evaluation_of_Fences\" title=\"Empirical Evaluation of Fences\">Empirical Evaluation of Fences</a></li></ul>', 3),
