(11595, 3131, 'Description', 'Description', 'A pearl is the shiny, precious product of the clam.', '<p>A pearl is the shiny, precious product of the clam.\n</p>', 0),
(11596, 3131, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Pearls are only known to be produced by clams , and handily enough, the snowman statue on rare occasions. Pearls can be foraged from Seaweed Resource nodes . Pearls can be made into pearl necklaces .', '<ul><li>Pearls are only known to be produced by <a href=\"/index.php/Clam\" title=\"Clam\">clams</a>, and handily enough, the <a href=\"/index.php/Snowman_statue\" title=\"Snowman statue\">snowman statue</a> on rare occasions.</li>\n<li>Pearls can be foraged from <a href=\"/index.php/Seaweed\" title=\"Seaweed\">Seaweed</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Resource_nodes\" title=\"Resource nodes\">Resource nodes</a>.</li>\n<li>Pearls can be made into <a href=\"/index.php/Pearl_necklace\" title=\"Pearl necklace\">pearl necklaces</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(11600, 3133, 'Description', 'Description', 'The common name for several species of ray-finned fish in the family Salmonidae.', '<p><i>The common name for several species of ray-finned fish in the family Salmonidae.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(11601, 3133, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Used in some cooking recipes. Can be eaten raw or cooked to relieve a small amount of hunger. Can be used as food for taming. Fish decay extremely rapidly after a few hours in your inventory and out of water. To prevent decay, fish can be stored in food storage bins and in crates. Bait ranking is from 1-10. The higher the number, the more likely that fish is to bite. Fishing time ranking is from 1-4. The higher the number, the more likely you are to see that fish.', '<ul><li>Used in some cooking recipes.</li>\n<li>Can be eaten raw or cooked to relieve a small amount of hunger.</li>\n<li>Can be used as food for taming.</li>\n<li>Fish decay extremely rapidly after a few hours in your inventory and out of water. To prevent decay, fish can be stored in food storage bins and in crates.</li>\n<li>Bait ranking is from 1-10. The higher the number, the more likely that fish is to bite.</li>\n<li>Fishing time ranking is from 1-4. The higher the number, the more likely you are to see that fish.</li></ul>', 1),
(11602, 3133, 'Fishing Guidelines', 'Fishing_Guidelines', 'Salmon Water types Lake, Sea Only surface Fishing height Depends on time Not special fish Swim depths 0-75 Equipment Spear, Light rod, Medium rod Fishing times Morning 4 Afternoon 1 Evening 4 Night 2 Baits Best: Fly (none) 1 Cheese piece 1 Corn kernel 1 Dough Ball 1 Fish bait 1 Fly 10 Grub 5 Minnow 5 Perch 5 Roach 5 Sardines 5 Wheat Grain 1 Wurm 5 Weight at 10ql 2.50kg Multiplier by ql 0.25 Rod damage ?', '<table class=\"mw-collapsible wikitable\" style=\"width: 90%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Salmon</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water types</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Lake, Sea</td>\n<td>Only surface\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fishing height</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Depends on time</td>\n<td>Not special fish\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swim depths</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">0-75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Equipment</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">Spear, Light rod, Medium rod\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fishing times</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#90EE90\">Morning 4</td>\n<td>Afternoon 1</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#90EE90\">Evening 4</td>\n<td>Night 2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\">Baits</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#90EE90\" colspan=\"3\">Best: Fly</td>\n<td>(none) 1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cheese piece 1</td>\n<td>Corn kernel 1</td>\n<td>Dough Ball 1</td>\n<td>Fish bait 1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fly 10</td>\n<td>Grub 5</td>\n<td>Minnow 5</td>\n<td>Perch 5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roach 5</td>\n<td>Sardines 5</td>\n<td>Wheat Grain 1</td>\n<td>Wurm 5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weight at 10ql</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">2.50kg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiplier by ql</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">0.25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rod damage</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">?\n</td></tr></tbody></table>', 2),
(11603, 3132, 'Description', 'Description', 'Minnows are small freshwater fish of the family Cyprinidae, ideal for bait. This has a good nutrition value.', '<p><i>Minnows are small freshwater fish of the family Cyprinidae, ideal for bait. This has a good nutrition value.</i>\n</p>', 0),
