(11612, 3139, 'Description', 'Description', 'The loach is a small eel-like freshwater fish belonging to the loach family (Cobitidae).', '<p><i>The loach is a small eel-like freshwater fish belonging to the loach family (Cobitidae).</i>\n</p>', 0),
