(11649, 3148, 'Description', 'Description', 'A spell given to priests of Vynora at 28 faith . This spell is used to enchant jewelry. Wearing jewelry with this enchantment will reduce the damage of all fire wounds suffered by the player.', '<p>A <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Spells\" title=\"Category:Spells\">spell</a> given to <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priests</a> of <a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a> at 28 <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>.\n</p>\n<p>This spell is used to enchant jewelry. Wearing jewelry with this enchantment will reduce the damage of all fire wounds suffered by the player.\n</p>', 0),
