(11989, 3229, 'Skill required', 'Skill_required', 'To calculate the maximum slope you can build on, based on your carpentry or masonry skill, use the following formula submitted by Ketza : Max slope = (3 * √ skill) + 10 Skill Max Slope 6 17 8 18 9 19 12 20 14 21 16 22 19 23 22 24 25 25 29 26 33 27 36 28 41 29 45 30 49 31 54 32 59 33 64 34 70 35 75 36 81 37 88 38 94 39 Note: Maximum slope is rounded down', '<p>To calculate the <a href=\"/index.php/Maximum_slope\" title=\"Maximum slope\">maximum slope</a> you can build on, based on your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, use the following formula submitted by <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ketza\" title=\"Player:Ketza\">Ketza</a>:\n</p>\n<p><i>Max slope = (3 *</i> √<i>skill) + 10</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"100\">Skill\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Max Slope\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>23\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>27\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>28\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>29\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>31\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>59</td>\n<td>33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>34\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75</td>\n<td>36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>81</td>\n<td>37\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>38\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>39\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Note:</b> Maximum slope is rounded <i>down</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(11990, 3229, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Pottery portcullis (fence) with Pottery brick. Each Pottery brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, cracks will form on the wall. Intelligent monsters such as trolls are able to open unlocked gates. Gates can be locked with a gate lock , then controlled by deed permissions if applicable, as well as the key .', '<ul><li>Repair Pottery portcullis (fence) with Pottery brick. Each Pottery brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, cracks will form on the wall.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Intelligent monsters such as <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a> are able to open unlocked gates.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Gates can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Gate_lock\" title=\"Gate lock\">gate lock</a>, then controlled by deed <a href=\"/index.php/Permissions\" title=\"Permissions\">permissions</a> if applicable, as well as the <a href=\"/index.php/Key\" title=\"Key\">key</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
