rlin, Octopus, Sailfish, Tuna, White shark, Dorado\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Any water of any depth</td>\n<td>Sardine, Clam\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fish_by_equipment_type\">Fish by equipment type</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 90%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Equipment type</th>\n<th>Fish\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Net</td>\n<td>Clam, Sardine, Minnow, Perch, Roach\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spear</td>\n<td>Brook trout, Carp, Catfish, Loach, Perch, Roach, Salmon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pole</td>\n<td>Carp, Minnow, Loach, Perch, Roach, Smallmouth Bass\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Light rod</td>\n<td>Brook trout, Carp, Catfish, Herring, Loach, Minnow, Perch, Pike, Roach, Salmon, Smallmouth Bass, Snook, Wurmfish\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Medium rod</td>\n<td>Brook trout, Carp, Catfish, Herring, Loach, Pike, Salmon, Snook\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deep water rod</td>\n<td>Carp, Catfish, Dorado, Octopus, Snook, Tuna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Professional rod</td>\n<td>Blue shark, Carp, Catfish, Dorado, Herring, Marlin, Octopus, Sailfish, Smallmouth Bass, Tuna, White shark, Wurmfish\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fish_information_tables\">Fish information tables</span></h3>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed wikitable\" style=\"width: 90%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_shark\" title=\"Blue shark\">Blue shark</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water types</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Sea</td>\n<td>Only surface\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fishing height</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Any</td>\n<td>Special fish tiles only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swim depths</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">250-1000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Equipment</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\">Professional rod\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fishing times</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#90EE90\">Morning 4</td>\n<td>Afternoon 3</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#90EE90\">Evening 4</td>\n<td>Night 2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\">Baits</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#90EE90\" colspan=