div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"R\">R</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n<ul><li>Raspberry</li>\n<li>Romeo</li>\n<li>Ruby</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"S\">S</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n<ul><li>Sad</li>\n<li>Sam</li>\n<li>Scruffy</li>\n<li>Sid</li>\n<li>Small</li>\n<li>Smokey</li>\n<li>Stick</li>\n<li>Stubborn</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"T\">T</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n<ul><li>Tiny</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"U\">U</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"V\">V</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"W\">W</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n<ul><li>Walnut</li>\n<li>Willow</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"X\">X</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Y\">Y</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n</div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Z\">Z</span></h4>\n<div style=\"column-count:3;-moz-column-count:3;-webkit-column-count:3\">\n<ul><li>Zephyr</li></ul>\n</div>', 0),
(13852, 3631, 'Description', 'Description', 'The expression of the mask is that of a predator daring anyone to challenge the wearer in combat.', '<p><i>The expression of the mask is that of a predator daring anyone to challenge the wearer in combat.</i>\n<i></i>\n</p>', 0),
(13853, 3631, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be obtained, with less than a 1% chance, from a Gift pack via the Loyalty program . Historically, could be obtained on the Challenge server.', '<ul><li>Can be obtained, with less than a 1% chance, from a <a href=\"/index.php/Gift_pack\" title=\"Gift pack\">Gift pack</a> via the <a href=\"/index.php/Loyalty_program\" title=\"Loyalty program\">Loyalty program</a>.</li>\n<li>Historically, could be obtained on the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Challenge\" title=\"Challenge\">Challenge</a> server.</li></ul>', 1),
(13854, 3632, 'Description', 'Description', 'An open-faced round-top helm.', '<p><i>An open-faced round-top helm.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(13855, 3632, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be obtained, with less than a 1% chance, from a Gift pack via the Loyalty program . Historically, could be obtained on the Challenge server. The armour value of this helm is still being researched.', '<ul><li>Can be obtained, with less than a 1% chance, from a <a href=\"/index.php/Gift_pack\" title=\"Gift pack\">Gift pack</a> via the <a href=\"/index.php/Loyalty_program\" title=\"Loyalty program\">Loyalty program</a>.</li>\n<li>Historically, could be obtained on the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Challenge\" title=\"Challenge\">Challenge</a> server.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a> value of this helm is still being researched.</li></ul>', 1),
(13856, 3633, 'Moons and Navigation', 'Moons_and_Navigation', '- Valrei : Rises in the west and sets in the east - Jackal : Rises in the east and sets in the west - Seris : (Yet to be researched) - Haven : (Yet to be researched) Moons move on a curve throughout the sky, due to magnetic pull on Wurms planet. Thus, these measurements and directions are generalizations and cannot be exact for the moons\' change from night to night.', '<p>- <b>Valrei</b>: Rises in the west and sets in the east\n</p>\n<p>- <b>Jackal</b>: Rises in the east and sets in the west\n</p>\n<p>- <b>Seris</b>: (Yet to be researched)\n</p>\n<p>- <b>Haven</b>: (Yet to be researched)\n</p>\n<p><i>Moons move on a curve throughout the sky, due to magnetic pull on Wurms planet.</i>\nThus, these measurements and directions are generalizations and cannot be exact for the moons\' change from night to night.\n</p>', 0),
