(15101, 3911, 'Description', 'Description', 'Also known as scrub, these low-growing steppe plants include herbs, certain berries, and materials used in tailoring and dye-making.', '<p><i>Also known as scrub, these low-growing steppe plants include herbs, certain berries, and materials used in tailoring and dye-making.</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r120082\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>', 0),
(15102, 3911, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Lore can vary slightly from one Low brush node to the next due to a number of factors such as season, location, tile type and skill. Resource nodes spawn and disappear randomly over time. It can be a few days or more for new resource nodes to appear on an empty tile. Resource nodes are destroyed if the type of the tile changes, such as paving or packing the tile, or when items are collected from them.', '<ul><li>Lore can vary slightly from one Low brush node to the next due to a number of factors such as season, location, tile type and skill.</li>\n<li>Resource nodes spawn and disappear randomly over time. It can be a few days or more for new resource nodes to appear on an empty tile.</li>\n<li>Resource nodes are destroyed if the type of the tile changes, such as paving or packing the tile, or when items are collected from them.</li></ul>', 1),
