(15104, 3912, 'Description', 'Description', 'Scattered sediment and other detritus lie on the ground. Maybe there\'s something useful in there?', '<p><i>Scattered sediment and other detritus lie on the ground. Maybe there\'s something useful in there?</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r120082\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>', 0),
(15105, 3912, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Lore can vary slightly from one Mineral debris node to the next due to a number of factors such as season, location, tile type and skill. Resource nodes spawn and disappear randomly over time. It can be a few days or more for new resource nodes to appear on an empty tile. Resource nodes are destroyed if the type of the tile changes, such as paving or packing the tile, or when items are collected from them.', '<ul><li>Lore can vary slightly from one Mineral debris node to the next due to a number of factors such as season, location, tile type and skill.</li>\n<li>Resource nodes spawn and disappear randomly over time. It can be a few days or more for new resource nodes to appear on an empty tile.</li>\n<li>Resource nodes are destroyed if the type of the tile changes, such as paving or packing the tile, or when items are collected from them.</li></ul>', 1),
