(15107, 3913, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see plants of the family Lamiaceae, also know as the mint or sage family, most of which are useful as herbs for medicine and cooking.', '<p><i>You see plants of the family Lamiaceae, also know as the mint or sage family, most of which are useful as herbs for medicine and cooking.</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r120082\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>', 0),
