(15110, 3914, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see plants of the family Solanaceae, also known as the nightshades. Some are edible, some are deadly, and most have beautiful flowers.', '<p><i>You see plants of the family Solanaceae, also known as the nightshades. Some are edible, some are deadly, and most have beautiful flowers.</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<link href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r120082\" rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\"/>', 0),
