(15615, 4041, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be sealed with 20 kgs of clay for a different look. Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a crowbar .', '<ul><li>Can be sealed with 20 kgs of <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> for a different look.</li>\n<li>Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a <a href=\"/index.php/Crowbar\" title=\"Crowbar\">crowbar</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
