(15656, 4049, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 log and 1 peg in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Log window .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Peg\" title=\"Peg\">peg</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Log window</b>.</li></ul>', 1),
