(15658, 4049, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a log before improving it. Activate a log (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the log is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>', 3),
(15659, 4049, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be sealed with 20 kgs of clay for a different look. Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a crowbar .', '<ul><li>Can be sealed with 20 kgs of <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> for a different look.</li>\n<li>Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a <a href=\"/index.php/Crowbar\" title=\"Crowbar\">crowbar</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(15660, 4049, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Log arch Log balcony Log canopy Log door Log double door Log double window Log double T arch Log T arch Log wall Log wide window Log window', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_arch\" title=\"Log arch\">Log arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_balcony\" title=\"Log balcony\">Log balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_canopy\" title=\"Log canopy\">Log canopy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_door\" title=\"Log door\">Log door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_double_door\" title=\"Log double door\">Log double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_double_window\" title=\"Log double window\">Log double window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_double_T_arch\" title=\"Log double T arch\">Log double T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_T_arch\" title=\"Log T arch\">Log T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_wall\" title=\"Log wall\">Log wall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_wide_window\" title=\"Log wide window\">Log wide window</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Log window</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
