(15925, 4098, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small chest made from planks.', '<p><i>A small chest made from planks.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(15926, 4098, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Small worn chests are a lootable item from Goblin camps . They can be found in different wood types. Functions as a Container .', '<p>Small worn chests are a lootable item from <a href=\"/index.php/Goblin_camps\" title=\"Goblin camps\">Goblin camps</a>. They can be found in different wood types.\n</p>\n<p>Functions as a <a href=\"/index.php/Container\" title=\"Container\">Container</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(15927, 4099, 'Description', 'Description', 'A crudely built shelter from the elements, barely suitable for use by humans.', '<p><i>A crudely built shelter from the elements, barely suitable for use by humans.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(15928, 4099, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Crude tents are a lootable item from Goblin camps .', '<p>Crude tents are a lootable item from <a href=\"/index.php/Goblin_camps\" title=\"Goblin camps\">Goblin camps</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(15929, 4100, 'Description', 'Description', 'A pile of bones arranged into a religious shrine.', '<p><i>A pile of bones arranged into a religious shrine.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(15930, 4100, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Bone shrine is a lootable item from Goblin camps .', '<p>Bone shrine is a lootable item from <a href=\"/index.php/Goblin_camps\" title=\"Goblin camps\">Goblin camps</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(15931, 4100, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can not be picked up, but pushed/pulled/placed. Can be loaded on a Large cart', '<ul><li>Can not be picked up, but pushed/pulled/placed.</li>\n<li>Can be loaded on a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">Large cart</a></li></ul>', 2),
(15932, 3990, 'Description', 'Description', 'These are the ceiling types you can add to your buildings for a cosmetic upgrade.\nTo build a ceiling, activate a mallet , hammer or trowel , and right-click on an existing roof or upper-story floor. Select Build and a Ceiling type. \nCeilings can NOT be dyed Wood ceiling Pottery brick ceiling Rendered wood ceiling Rustic wood ceiling Squared wood ceiling', '<p>These are the ceiling types you can add to your buildings for a cosmetic upgrade.\nTo build a ceiling, activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a>, and right-click on an existing roof or upper-story floor. Select <i>Build</i> and a Ceiling type. \nCeilings can NOT be dyed\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Wood_ceiling\" title=\"Wood ceiling\">Wood ceiling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_brick_ceiling\" title=\"Pottery brick ceiling\">Pottery brick ceiling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_wood_ceiling\" title=\"Rendered wood ceiling\">Rendered wood ceiling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rustic_wood_ceiling\" title=\"Rustic wood ceiling\">Rustic wood ceiling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Squared_wood_ceiling\" title=\"Squared wood ceiling\">Squared wood ceiling</a></li></ul>', 0),
(15933, 3990, 'Preview', 'Preview', 'Wood ceiling Pottery brick ceiling Rendered wood ceiling Rustic wood ceiling Squared wood ceiling', '<div class=\"toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width:relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed-hover\">\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 456px\"><div style=\"width: 456px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 454px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Wood_ceiling.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"1031\" data-file-width=\"1871\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Wood_ceiling.png/681px-Wood_ceiling.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Wood_ceiling.png/1022px-Wood_ceiling.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/20/Wood_ceiling.png/1361px-Wood_ceiling.png 2x\" width=\"454\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 434px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Wood ceiling\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 947.33333333333px\"><div style=\"width: 947.33333333333px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 945.33333333333px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Potterybrick_ceiling.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"470\" data-file-width=\"1776\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Potterybrick_ceiling.png/1418px-Potterybrick_ceiling.png\" srcset=\"/images/b/bb/Potterybrick_ceiling.png 1.5x\" width=\"946\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 926px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Pottery brick ceiling\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 746.66666666667px\"><div style=\"width: 746.66666666667px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 744.66666666667px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Rendered_ceiling.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"608\" data-file-width=\"1810\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Rendered_ceiling.png/1117px-Rendered_ceiling.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Rendered_ceiling.png/1677px-Rendered_ceiling.png 1.5x, /images/f/f9/Rendered_ceiling.png 2x\" width=\"745\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 725px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Rendered wood ceiling\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 456px\"><div style=\"width: 456px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 454px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Rustic_wood_ceiling.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"1031\" data-file-width=\"1871\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/38/Rustic_wood_ceiling.png/681px-Rustic_wood_ceiling.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/38/Rustic_wood_ceiling.png/1022px-Rustic_wood_ceiling.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/38/Rustic_wood_ceiling.png/1361px-Rustic_wood_ceiling.png 2x\" width=\"454\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 434px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Rustic wood ceiling\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 456px\"><div style=\"width: 456px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 454px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Squared_wood_ceiling.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"1031\" data-file-width=\"1871\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/6f/Squared_wood_ceiling.png/681px-Squared_wood_ceiling.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/6f/Squared_wood_ceiling.png/1022px-Squared_wood_ceiling.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/6f/Squared_wood_ceiling.png/1361px-Squared_wood_ceiling.png 2x\" width=\"454\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 434px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Squared wood ceiling\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>\n</div>', 1),
(15934, 4062, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a double window.', '<p><i>You see a double window. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(15935, 4062, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 log and 1 peg in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Rustic log double window .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Peg\" title=\"Peg\">peg</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Rustic log double window</b>.</li></ul>', 1),
(15936, 4062, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
(15937, 4062, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a log before improving it. Activate a log (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the log is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>', 3),
(15938, 4062, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be sealed with 20 kgs of clay for a different look. Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a crowbar .', '<ul><li>Can be sealed with 20 kgs of <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> for a different look.</li>\n<li>Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a <a href=\"/index.php/Crowbar\" title=\"Crowbar\">crowbar</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
