(15961, 4072, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a log before improving it. Activate a log (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the log is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>', 3),
(15962, 4072, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be sealed with 20 kgs of clay for a different look. Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a crowbar .', '<ul><li>Can be sealed with 20 kgs of <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> for a different look.</li>\n<li>Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a <a href=\"/index.php/Crowbar\" title=\"Crowbar\">crowbar</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(15963, 4072, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Bark log arch Bark log balcony Bark log canopy Bark log door Bark log double door Bark log double window Bark log double T arch Bark log T arch Bark log wall Bark log wide window Bark log window', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_arch\" title=\"Bark log arch\">Bark log arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_balcony\" title=\"Bark log balcony\">Bark log balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_canopy\" title=\"Bark log canopy\">Bark log canopy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_door\" title=\"Bark log door\">Bark log door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_double_door\" title=\"Bark log double door\">Bark log double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_double_window\" title=\"Bark log double window\">Bark log double window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_double_T_arch\" title=\"Bark log double T arch\">Bark log double T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_T_arch\" title=\"Bark log T arch\">Bark log T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_wall\" title=\"Bark log wall\">Bark log wall</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bark log wide window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Bark_log_window\" title=\"Bark log window\">Bark log window</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
(15964, 4050, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see a wide window.', '<p><i>You see a wide window. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(15965, 4050, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 log and 1 peg in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Log wide window .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Peg\" title=\"Peg\">peg</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Log wide window</b>.</li></ul>', 1),
(15966, 4050, 'Modifying', 'Modifying', 'You can turn walls to suit your needs by right-clicking them, and selecting Rotate wall .', '<ul><li>You can turn walls to suit your needs by <b>right-clicking</b> them, and selecting <b>Rotate wall</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
(15967, 4050, 'Improving', 'Improving', 'You must repair any damage on the walls with a log before improving it. Activate a log (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select Repair or Improve . The effective quality of the log is affected by its damage and your Carpentry skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.', '<ul><li>You must <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> any <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> on the walls with a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> before <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improving</a> it.</li>\n<li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> (minimum 16800 grams), right-click the wall and select <i>Repair</i> or <i>Improve</i>.</li>\n<li>The effective <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> is affected by its damage and your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a> skill, it must be higher than the wall\'s current quality.</li></ul>', 3),
(15968, 4050, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be sealed with 20 kgs of clay for a different look. Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a crowbar .', '<ul><li>Can be sealed with 20 kgs of <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> for a different look.</li>\n<li>Clay can be removed from a sealed wall, by using a <a href=\"/index.php/Crowbar\" title=\"Crowbar\">crowbar</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4),
(15969, 4050, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Log arch Log balcony Log canopy Log door Log double door Log double window Log double T arch Log T arch Log wall Log wide window Log window', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_arch\" title=\"Log arch\">Log arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_balcony\" title=\"Log balcony\">Log balcony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_canopy\" title=\"Log canopy\">Log canopy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_door\" title=\"Log door\">Log door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_double_door\" title=\"Log double door\">Log double door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_double_window\" title=\"Log double window\">Log double window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_double_T_arch\" title=\"Log double T arch\">Log double T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_T_arch\" title=\"Log T arch\">Log T arch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_wall\" title=\"Log wall\">Log wall</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Log wide window</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Log_window\" title=\"Log window\">Log window</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 5),
