(15983, 4067, 'Locking', 'Locking', 'It can be locked with a door lock . Any humanoid mob, for example trolls , or player can pass through an unlocked door.', '<ul><li>It can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door lock</a>. Any humanoid mob, for example <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a>, or player can pass through an unlocked door.</li></ul>', 1),
(15984, 4067, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'Have at least 1 log and 1 peg in your inventory. Activate a mallet or hammer and right-click on a wall plan . Select Build and then Bark log double door .', '<ul><li>Have at least 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a> and 1 <a href=\"/index.php/Peg\" title=\"Peg\">peg</a> in your inventory.</li>\n<li><b>Activate</b> a <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> and <b>right-click</b> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <b>Build</b> and then <b>Bark log double door</b>.</li></ul>', 2),
