(17753, 4555, 'Description', 'Description', 'A green, low, slimy mushroom with a wide hat covered with brown specks.', '<p><i>A green, low, slimy mushroom with a wide hat covered with brown specks.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(17754, 4555, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be used to create a healing cover with a potency of 4. You can use a spoon to make it into a container for cooking recipes. The entire mushroom is consumed in the process.', '<ul><li>Can be used to create a <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing cover</a> with a potency of 4.</li>\n<li>You can use a <a href=\"/index.php/Spoon\" title=\"Spoon\">spoon</a> to make it into a container for <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> recipes. The entire mushroom is consumed in the process.</li></ul>', 1),
