(17763, 4558, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be used to create a healing cover with a potency of 2. You can use a spoon to make it into a container for cooking recipes.', '<ul><li>Can be used to create a <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing cover</a> with a potency of 2.</li>\n<li>You can use a <a href=\"/index.php/Spoon\" title=\"Spoon\">spoon</a> to make it into a container for <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> recipes.</li></ul>', 1),
