<td>Adamantine</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>150%</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>7.50%</td>\n<td>10%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brass</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>2.50%</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bronze</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>2.50%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Copper</td>\n<td>-5%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>95%</td>\n<td>-5%</td>\n<td>-10%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Electrum</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>7.50%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Empyrean</td>\n<td>2.5%</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>115%</td>\n<td>17.5%</td>\n<td>7.5%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Glimmersteel</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>125%</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>10%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gold</td>\n<td>-2.50%</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>170%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Iron</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lead</td>\n<td>-5%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>-10%</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Seryll</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>125%</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>7.50%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Silver</td>\n<td>2.50%</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>97.50%</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Steel</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td>2.50%</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tin</td>\n<td>-2.50%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>-5%</td>\n<td>-10%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zinc</td>\n<td>-2.50%</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>75%</td>\n<td>-5%</td>\n<td>-15%</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>', 5),
(18812, 4480, 'Description', 'Description', 'A heavy jacket made from metal chain.', '<p><i>A heavy jacket made from metal chain.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18813, 4480, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour protection for your torso. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to walking speed. The chain jacket is the most difficult piece of the chain armour set to create The quality of the large anvil as well as your chain armour smithing skill affects your creation chance. Creation of the chain jacket is allowed when the combination of the large anvil QL and the chain armour smithing skill gives approximately 66% chance of creating the armour chains', '<ul><li>Armour protection for your torso. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to <a href=\"/index.php/Road\" title=\"Road\">walking</a> speed.</li>\n<li>The chain jacket is the most difficult piece of the <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Chain_armour\" title=\"Category:Chain armour\">chain armour</a> set to create</li>\n<li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the large anvil as well as your chain armour smithing skill affects your creation chance.</li>\n<li>Creation of the chain jacket is allowed when the combination of the large anvil QL and the chain armour smithing skill gives approximately 66% chance of creating the armour chains</li></ul>', 1),
(18814, 2924, 'Description', 'Description', 'Chains sewn into a cylinder to protect the arms.', '<p><i>Chains sewn into a cylinder to protect the arms.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18815, 2924, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour protection for your arms. You will need one for each arm. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to walking speed. The quality of the large anvil affects your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour protection for your arms. You will need one for each arm. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to <a href=\"/index.php/Road\" title=\"Road\">walking</a> speed.</li>\n<li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the large anvil affects your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(18816, 2925, 'Description', 'Description', 'A chain glove.', '<p><i>A chain glove.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18817, 2925, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour protection for your hands. You need one for each hand. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to walking speed. The quality of the large anvil affects your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour protection for your hands. You need one for each hand. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to <a href=\"/index.php/Road\" title=\"Road\">walking</a> speed.</li>\n<li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the large anvil affects your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(18818, 2925, 'Enchantments and runes', 'Enchantments_and_runes', 'Magical enchantments and runes on gloves affect actions that require hands: crafting clay items, improving clay items with the hand, forage, botanise. Since: Patch Notes 05-DEC-2023 Only magical effects such as runes and spell enchantments function for this purpose. For example, Wind of Ages will improve action speed and Circle of Cunning will improve skill gain. The glove is not being used as an actual tool, so it will not receive damage, and its quality, rarity, and material will have no impact on effectiveness. However, like a tool, enchantments will still decay from use. Enchantment/Rune effectiveness is averaged between both gloves. For example, having 100 Wind of Ages on one glove and 50 on the other will be equivalent to having 75 Wind of Ages on a tool, and having a rune on one glove but not the other will result in that rune being half as effective as usual.', '<ul><li>Magical enchantments and runes on gloves affect actions that require hands: crafting clay items, improving clay items with the hand, forage, botanise. Since: <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/199861-patch-notes-05-dec-2023/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patch Notes 05-DEC-2023</a></li>\n<li>Only magical effects such as runes and spell enchantments function for this purpose. For example, Wind of Ages will improve action speed and Circle of Cunning will improve skill gain.</li>\n<li>The glove is not being used as an actual tool, so it will not receive damage, and its quality, rarity, and material will have no impact on effectiveness. However, like a tool, enchantments will still decay from use.</li>\n<li>Enchantment/Rune effectiveness is averaged between both gloves. For example, having 100 Wind of Ages on one glove and 50 on the other will be equivalent to having 75 Wind of Ages on a tool, and having a rune on one glove but not the other will result in that rune being half as effective as usual.</li></ul>', 2),
(18819, 2926, 'Description', 'Description', 'Leg protection made from metal chain. Chain armour for your legs, so you won\'t get injured there as often or as severely. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to walking speed', '<p><i>Leg protection made from metal chain.</i>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Chain_armour\" title=\"Category:Chain armour\">Chain armour</a> for your legs, so you won\'t get <a href=\"/index.php/Wound\" title=\"Wound\">injured</a> there as often or as severely. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to <a href=\"/index.php/Road\" title=\"Road\">walking</a> speed\n</p>', 0),
(18820, 2926, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour protection for your legs. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to walking speed. Creation chances will appear at a little over 10 skill using a 10 ql large anvil. The quality of the large anvil affects your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour protection for your legs. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to <a href=\"/index.php/Road\" title=\"Road\">walking</a> speed.</li>\n<li>Creation chances will appear at a little over 10 skill using a 10 ql large anvil.</li>\n<li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the large anvil affects your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(18821, 4821, 'Description', 'Description', 'A sock made from metal chain.', '<p><i>A sock made from metal chain.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18822, 4821, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour protection for your feet. You will need one for each foot. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to walking speed. The quality of the large anvil affects your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour protection for your feet. You will need one for each foot. Chain armour has a moderate penalty to <a href=\"/index.php/Road\" title=\"Road\">walking</a> speed.</li>\n<li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the large anvil affects your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(18833, 1098, 'Description', 'Description', 'A large heavy shield hammered from a metal sheet.', '<p><i>A large heavy shield hammered from a metal sheet.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18834, 1098, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'A large metal shield is the largest shield . It can be made of any metal . Large metal shields have the greatest chance to block, the highest bonus to shield bashing, and the highest stamina cost of all shields. You get a fast skill gain if you attack cows with just the shield on your left arm ( Circle of cunning and sleep bonus help, too).', '<ul><li>A large metal shield is the largest <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Shields\" title=\"Category:Shields\">shield</a>. It can be made of any <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Metal_lump\" title=\"Metal lump\">metal</a>.</li>\n<li>Large metal shields have the greatest chance to block, the highest bonus to shield bashing, and the highest stamina cost of all shields.</li>\n<li>You get a fast <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Skill\" title=\"Skill\">skill</a> gain if you attack cows with just the shield on your left arm (<a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Sleep_bonus\" title=\"Sleep bonus\">sleep bonus</a> help, too).</li></ul>', 1),
(18835, 1098, 'Skins applicable', 'Skins_applicable', 'Shield of the Ageless Bulwark shield', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Item_skin_token\" title=\"Item skin token\">Shield of the Ageless</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Item_skin_token\" title=\"Item skin token\">Bulwark shield</a></li></ul>', 2),
(18836, 1098, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'When using a large metal shield Shields > Large metal shield Body > Body control Mind > Mind speed When creating a large metal shield Armour smithing > Shield smithing', '<p>When using a large metal shield\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Shields\" title=\"Shields\">Shields</a> &gt; Large metal shield</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body\" title=\"Body\">Body</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_speed\" title=\"Mind speed\">Mind speed</a></li></ul>\n<p>When creating a large metal shield\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour_smithing\" title=\"Armour smithing\">Armour smithing</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Shield_smithing\" title=\"Shield smithing\">Shield smithing</a></li></ul>', 3),
(18837, 1098, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Sturdy Heavy Defender at 50 skill Sturdy Heavy Bastion at 70 skill Sturdy Heavy Bulwark at 90 skill Held the Line at 100 skill', '<ul><li>Sturdy Heavy Defender at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Sturdy Heavy Bastion at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Sturdy Heavy Bulwark at 90 skill</li>\n<li>Held the Line at 100 skill</li></ul>', 4),
(18838, 1098, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Small metal shield Medium metal shield Shield bashing', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Small_metal_shield\" title=\"Small metal shield\">Small metal shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Medium_metal_shield\" title=\"Medium metal shield\">Medium metal shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Shield_bashing\" title=\"Shield bashing\">Shield bashing</a></li></ul>', 5),
(18851, 4138, 'Description', 'Description', 'A clay bowl that could be hardened by fire.', '<p><i>A clay bowl that could be hardened by fire.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18852, 4138, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Place into a campfire , oven , forge or kiln to turn it into a usable pottery bowl .', '<ul><li>Place into a <a href=\"/index.php/Campfire\" title=\"Campfire\">campfire</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Oven\" title=\"Oven\">oven</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">forge</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Kiln\" title=\"Kiln\">kiln</a> to turn it into a usable <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_bowl\" title=\"Pottery bowl\">pottery bowl</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(18853, 4138, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Once hardened into a pottery bowl, it can no longer be improved. Base quality is 20% of your pottery skill, assuming the clay used is of high enough quality to support this. Quality of the bowl does not heat the contents faster.', '<ul><li>Once hardened into a pottery bowl, it can no longer be improved.</li>\n<li>Base quality is 20% of your <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery\" title=\"Pottery\">pottery</a> skill, assuming the clay used is of high enough quality to support this.</li>\n<li>Quality of the bowl does <b>not</b> heat the contents faster.</li></ul>', 2),
(18854, 4138, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Clay flask Clay jar', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Clay_flask\" title=\"Clay flask\">Clay flask</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Clay_jar\" title=\"Clay jar\">Clay jar</a></li></ul>', 3),
(18855, 4136, 'Description', 'Description', 'A clay flask that could be hardened by fire.', '<p><i>A clay flask that could be hardened by fire.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18856, 4136, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Place into a campfire , oven , forge or kiln to turn it into a usable pottery flask .', '<ul><li>Place into a <a href=\"/index.php/Campfire\" title=\"Campfire\">campfire</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Oven\" title=\"Oven\">oven</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">forge</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Kiln\" title=\"Kiln\">kiln</a> to turn it into a usable <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_flask\" title=\"Pottery flask\">pottery flask</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(18857, 4136, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Once hardened into a pottery flask, it can no longer be improved.', '<ul><li>Once hardened into a pottery flask, it can no longer be improved.</li></ul>', 2),
(18858, 4136, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Clay bowl Clay jar', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Clay_bowl\" title=\"Clay bowl\">Clay bowl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Clay_jar\" title=\"Clay jar\">Clay jar</a></li></ul>', 3),
(18859, 4137, 'Description', 'Description', 'A clay jar that could be hardened by fire.', '<p><i>A clay jar that could be hardened by fire.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18860, 4137, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Place into a campfire , oven , forge or kiln to turn it into a usable pottery jar .', '<ul><li>Place into a <a href=\"/index.php/Campfire\" title=\"Campfire\">campfire</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Oven\" title=\"Oven\">oven</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">forge</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Kiln\" title=\"Kiln\">kiln</a> to turn it into a usable <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_jar\" title=\"Pottery jar\">pottery jar</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(18861, 4137, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Once hardened into a pottery jar, it can no longer be improved.', '<ul><li>Once hardened into a pottery jar, it can no longer be improved.</li></ul>', 2),
(18862, 4137, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Clay bowl Clay flask', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Clay_bowl\" title=\"Clay bowl\">Clay bowl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Clay_flask\" title=\"Clay flask\">Clay flask</a></li></ul>', 3),
(18863, 2685, 'Description', 'Description', 'A clay bowl hardened by fire.', '<p><i>A clay bowl hardened by fire.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18864, 2685, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'A clay bowl can be heated in a campfire , stone oven , forge or kiln to become a pottery bowl. A hardened pottery bowl can no longer be improved or repaired. A pottery bowl will hold 9 kg of liquids. A pottery bowl can be used to combine ingredients for recipes that don\'t require cooking or can be heated in an oven for cooked recipes. To find out if the ingredients in a bowl will create something, right-click on the pottery bowl and select Lore .', '<ul><li>A <a href=\"/index.php/Clay_bowl\" title=\"Clay bowl\">clay bowl</a> can be heated in a <a href=\"/index.php/Campfire\" title=\"Campfire\">campfire</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stone_oven\" title=\"Stone oven\">stone oven</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">forge</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Kiln\" title=\"Kiln\">kiln</a> to become a pottery bowl.</li>\n<li>A hardened pottery bowl can no longer be improved or repaired.</li>\n<li>A pottery bowl will hold 9 kg of liquids.</li>\n<li>A pottery bowl can be used to combine ingredients for recipes that don\'t require cooking or can be heated in an oven for cooked recipes.</li>\n<li>To find out if the ingredients in a bowl will create something, right-click on the pottery bowl and select <i>Lore</i>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(18865, 2685, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Pottery flask Pottery jar Cooking utensils', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_flask\" title=\"Pottery flask\">Pottery flask</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_jar\" title=\"Pottery jar\">Pottery jar</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cooking_utensils\" title=\"Cooking utensils\">Cooking utensils</a></li></ul>', 2),
(18871, 4490, 'Description', 'Description', 'Clear, syrupy olive oil with a sweet scent.', '<p><i>Clear, syrupy olive oil with a sweet scent.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18872, 4490, 'Uses', 'Uses', 'Olive oil is used in some cooking recipes. Olive oil is used in the creation of compasses ; to start a compass, combine olive oil with a pottery jar . Olive oil can also be used as fuel in lamps and lanterns . Olive oil is used by spirit templars  to refill off-deed lamps within 24 tiles of deed. An on-deed huge oil barrel or huge tub will be used as the source for refilling.', '<ul><li>Olive oil is used in some <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> recipes.</li>\n<li>Olive oil is used in the creation of <a href=\"/index.php/Compass\" title=\"Compass\">compasses</a>; to start a compass, combine olive oil with a <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_jar\" title=\"Pottery jar\">pottery jar</a>.</li>\n<li>Olive oil can also be used as fuel in <a href=\"/index.php/Lamp\" title=\"Lamp\">lamps</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Lantern\" title=\"Lantern\">lanterns</a>.</li>\n<li>Olive oil is used by spirit templars  to refill off-deed lamps within 24 tiles of deed. An on-deed <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_oil_barrel\" title=\"Huge oil barrel\">huge oil barrel</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_tub\" title=\"Huge tub\">huge tub</a> will be used as the source for refilling.</li></ul>', 1),
(18873, 4490, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Failure to produce olive oil results in the loss of 0.064kg of olives.', '<ul><li>Failure to produce olive oil results in the loss of 0.064kg of olives.</li></ul>', 2),
(18874, 4490, 'Rare Functionality', 'Rare_Functionality', 'Attempting to combine rare olive oil with regular olive oil generates this message. The olive oil or the olive oil would lose its rarity.', '<p>Attempting to combine rare olive oil with regular olive oil generates this message.\n</p>\n<p><i>The olive oil or the olive oil would lose its rarity.</i>\n</p>', 3),
(18880, 4438, 'Stamina Regeneration', 'Stamina_Regeneration', 'Some actions take up more stamina than others, but stamina is regained according to your thirst and food bars. The water bar affects Stamina regen noticeably at 80% The food bar affects Stamina regen noticeably at 25% Stamina can be regained by eating endurance sandwiches and/or drinking wine . One of the most common causes of stamina not regenerating is forgetting to turn off climbing.', '<p>Some actions take up more stamina than others, but stamina is regained according to your <a href=\"/index.php/Water\" title=\"Water\">thirst</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Food\" title=\"Food\">food</a> bars. \n</p>\n<dl><dd><ul><li>The water bar affects Stamina regen noticeably at 80%</li>\n<li>The food bar affects Stamina regen noticeably at 25%</li>\n<li>Stamina can be regained by eating <a href=\"/index.php/Endurance_sandwich\" title=\"Endurance sandwich\">endurance sandwiches</a> and/or drinking <a href=\"/index.php/Wine\" title=\"Wine\">wine</a>.</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<p><b>One of the most common causes of stamina not regenerating is forgetting to turn off climbing.</b>\n</p>', 0),
(18881, 4438, 'Actions that ignore stamina', 'Actions_that_ignore_stamina', 'These actions require the same amount of time to perform at any stamina level. They typically don\'t reduce your stamina, either. This list is only about timers. Doing these actions with no stamina will still reduce your skillgains to almost 0. Fishing Chopping up felled trees (drains stamina) Filleting meat/fish Flattening (drains stamina, aborts with no stamina) Mixing healing covers Praying (drains very little stamina) Prospecting (drains stamina) Repairing Sowing (drains very little stamina) Meditation Channeling Selling (more...)', '<p>These actions require the same amount of time to perform at any stamina level. They typically don\'t reduce your stamina, either. This list is only about timers. <b>Doing these actions with no stamina will still reduce your skillgains to almost 0.</b>\n<b></b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Fishing\" title=\"Fishing\">Fishing</a></li>\n<li>Chopping up <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Felled_tree\" title=\"Felled tree\">felled trees</a> (drains stamina)</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Meat_filet\" title=\"Meat filet\">Filleting</a> meat/fish</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Flattening\" title=\"Flattening\">Flattening</a> (drains stamina, aborts with no stamina)</li>\n<li>Mixing <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing covers</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Praying\" title=\"Praying\">Praying</a> (drains very little stamina)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Prospecting\" title=\"Prospecting\">Prospecting</a> (drains stamina)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">Repairing</a></li>\n<li>Sowing (drains very little stamina)</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Meditation\" title=\"Meditation\">Meditation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Channeling\" title=\"Channeling\">Channeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sell\" title=\"Sell\">Selling</a></li>\n<li>(more...)</li></ul>', 1),
(18882, 4438, 'Warning', 'Warning', 'If you run out of stamina while in the water, you will start to drown . If you run out of stamina in unmounted combat it becomes very hard to escape. If you run out of stamina whilst climbing, you will cease climbing and fall.', '<p>If you run out of stamina while in the water, you will start to <a href=\"/index.php/Drown\" title=\"Drown\">drown</a>.\n</p>\n<p>If you run out of stamina in unmounted combat it becomes very hard to escape.\n</p>\n<p>If you run out of stamina whilst climbing, you will cease climbing and fall.\n</p>', 2),
(18883, 988, 'Description', 'Description', 'Body control is a characteristic that helps with weapon accuracy and stealthing , and determines the mounts a player can ride.', '<p><b>Body control</b> is a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Characteristic\" title=\"Characteristic\">characteristic</a> that helps with weapon accuracy and <a href=\"/index.php/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">stealthing</a>, and determines the <a href=\"/index.php/Mounts\" title=\"Mounts\">mounts</a> a <a href=\"/index.php/Player\" title=\"Player\">player</a> can ride.\n</p>', 0),
(18884, 988, 'Skills', 'Skills', 'Smithing , carpentry , tailoring , and archaeology skills all offer decent Body Control skill, as do archery , shield skills, and some weapon skills. Chopping trees with a longsword and two handed sword also offers good Body Control gains.  Note: this only works until 20 skill, or 20 effective skill on Epic. Archery on an archery target is excellent until about skill level 30.', '<p><a href=\"/index.php/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\">Smithing</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Tailoring\" title=\"Tailoring\">tailoring</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">archaeology</a> skills all offer decent Body Control skill, as do <a href=\"/index.php/Archery\" title=\"Archery\">archery</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Shield\" title=\"Shield\">shield</a> skills, and some weapon skills.\n</p>\n<p>Chopping trees with a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Longsword\" title=\"Longsword\">longsword</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Two_handed_sword\" title=\"Two handed sword\">two handed sword</a> also offers good Body Control gains.  Note: this only works until 20 skill, or 20 effective skill on Epic.\n</p>\n<p>Archery on an <a href=\"/index.php/Archery_target\" title=\"Archery target\">archery target</a> is excellent until about skill level 30.\n</p>', 1),
(18885, 988, 'Body control levels', 'Body_control_levels', 'Body control required Action/ Mount <19.5 Cow 19.5 Donkey / Mule 20.5 Steal 21 Horse 23 Bull 23 Brown Bear 24 zombie rabid hyena 25 Crocodile 26 Unicorn 29 Scorpion ( dominated or zombie ) 31 Hell horse Currently Cows, Donkeys and Mules are the only animals non-premum characters can ride.', '<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Body control required</th>\n<th>Action/<a href=\"/index.php/Mounts\" title=\"Mounts\">Mount</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;19.5</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cow\" title=\"Cow\">Cow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19.5</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Donkey\" title=\"Donkey\">Donkey</a>/<a href=\"/index.php/Mule\" title=\"Mule\">Mule</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20.5</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Steal\" title=\"Steal\">Steal</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Horse\" title=\"Horse\">Horse</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>23</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bull\" title=\"Bull\">Bull</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>23</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Brown_Bear\" title=\"Brown Bear\">Brown Bear</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>zombie <a href=\"/index.php/Rabid_hyena\" title=\"Rabid hyena\">rabid hyena</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Crocodile\" title=\"Crocodile\">Crocodile</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>26</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Unicorn\" title=\"Unicorn\">Unicorn</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Scorpion\" title=\"Scorpion\">Scorpion</a> (<a href=\"/index.php/Dominate\" title=\"Dominate\">dominated</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Zombie\" title=\"Zombie\">zombie</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>31</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Hell_horse\" title=\"Hell horse\">Hell horse</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Currently Cows, Donkeys and Mules are the only animals non-premum characters can ride.\n</p>', 2),
(18886, 988, 'List of skills that raise Body control', 'List_of_skills_that_raise_Body_control', 'Archaeology Restoration Archery Short bow Reflex bow Long bow Carpentry Bowyery Fletching Fine carpentry Ship building Toy Making Climbing Knives Butchering knife Carving knife Smithing Armour smithing Blacksmithing Weapon smithing Shield smithing Locksmithing Metallurgy Swords Longsword Shortsword Two Handed Sword Tailoring Cloth tailoring Leatherworking Thievery Lockpicking Stealing Traps Shields Small wooden shield Medium wooden shield Large wooden shield Small metal shield Medium metal shield Large metal shield For a list of more characteristic-based skill gain, look here .', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">Archaeology</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">Restoration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Archery\" title=\"Archery\">Archery</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Short_bow\" title=\"Short bow\">Short bow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Reflex_bow\" title=\"Reflex bow\">Reflex bow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Long_bow\" title=\"Long bow\">Long bow</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Bowyery\" title=\"Bowyery\">Bowyery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fletching\" title=\"Fletching\">Fletching</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fine_carpentry\" title=\"Fine carpentry\">Fine carpentry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Ship_building\" title=\"Ship building\">Ship building</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Toy_Making\" title=\"Toy Making\">Toy Making</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Climbing\" title=\"Climbing\">Climbing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Knives\" title=\"Knives\">Knives</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Butchering_knife\" title=\"Butchering knife\">Butchering knife</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Carving_knife\" title=\"Carving knife\">Carving knife</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\">Smithing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour_smithing\" title=\"Armour smithing\">Armour smithing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blacksmithing\" title=\"Blacksmithing\">Blacksmithing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Weapon_smithing\" title=\"Weapon smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Shield_smithing\" title=\"Shield smithing\">Shield smithing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Locksmithing\" title=\"Locksmithing\">Locksmithing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Metallurgy\" title=\"Metallurgy\">Metallurgy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Swords\" title=\"Swords\">Swords</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Longsword\" title=\"Longsword\">Longsword</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Shortsword\" title=\"Shortsword\">Shortsword</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Two_handed_sword\" title=\"Two handed sword\">Two Handed Sword</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Tailoring\" title=\"Tailoring\">Tailoring</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Cloth_tailoring\" title=\"Cloth tailoring\">Cloth tailoring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Leatherworking\" title=\"Leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Thievery\" title=\"Thievery\">Thievery</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Lockpicking\" title=\"Lockpicking\">Lockpicking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Stealing\" title=\"Stealing\">Stealing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Traps\" title=\"Traps\">Traps</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Shields\" title=\"Shields\">Shields</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Small_wooden_shield\" title=\"Small wooden shield\">Small wooden shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Medium_wooden_shield\" title=\"Medium wooden shield\">Medium wooden shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Large_wooden_shield\" title=\"Large wooden shield\">Large wooden shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Small_metal_shield\" title=\"Small metal shield\">Small metal shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Medium_metal_shield\" title=\"Medium metal shield\">Medium metal shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Large_metal_shield\" title=\"Large metal shield\">Large metal shield</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>For a list of more characteristic-based skill gain, look <a href=\"/index.php/Characteristics\" title=\"Characteristics\">here</a>.\n</p>', 3),
(18887, 988, 'Messages', 'Messages', 'You now feel confident enough to steal things. When body control rises to 20.5. Stealing is only allowed on PVP servers.', '<p><i>You now feel confident enough to steal things.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>When body control rises to 20.5. Stealing is only allowed on <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/PVP\" title=\"PVP\">PVP</a> servers.</li></ul>', 4),
(18888, 4548, 'Description', 'Description', 'Mind speed is a characteristic with some minor uses: Increasing the casting speed of sorcery spells Ability to focus beyond a certain level Ability to perform attacks of opportunity when fighting Training Fighting sub skills increases mind speed, as well as training fighting with a practice doll .', '<p><b>Mind speed</b> is a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Characteristic\" title=\"Characteristic\">characteristic</a> with some minor uses:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Increasing the casting speed of <a href=\"/index.php/Sorcery\" title=\"Sorcery\">sorcery</a> spells</li>\n<li>Ability to <a href=\"/index.php/Focus\" title=\"Focus\">focus</a> beyond a certain level</li>\n<li>Ability to perform attacks of opportunity when fighting</li></ul>\n<p>Training <a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a> sub skills increases mind speed, as well as training fighting with a <a href=\"/index.php/Practice_doll\" title=\"Practice doll\">practice doll</a>.\n</p>', 0);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(18889, 997, 'List of Skills that Raise Mind Logic', 'List_of_Skills_that_Raise_Mind_Logic', 'Alchemy Natural substances Archaeology Restoration Carpentry Fine Carpentry Fletching Coal-making Cooking Beverages Butchering Dairy Food Making Hot food cooking Digging Firemaking Healing First aid Masonry Stone cutting Mining Miscellaneous items Repairing Nature Gardening Farming Forestry Pottery Smithing Tailoring Cloth tailoring Leatherworking Tracking War machines Thatching NB: List continuously under construction and not complete yet.', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Natural_substances\" title=\"Natural substances\">Natural substances</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">Archaeology</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">Restoration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Fine_Carpentry\" title=\"Fine Carpentry\">Fine Carpentry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fletching\" title=\"Fletching\">Fletching</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Coal-making\" title=\"Coal-making\">Coal-making</a></li>\n<li>Cooking\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Beverages\" title=\"Beverages\">Beverages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Butchering\" title=\"Butchering\">Butchering</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Dairy_Food_Making\" title=\"Dairy Food Making\">Dairy Food Making</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Hot_food_cooking\" title=\"Hot food cooking\">Hot food cooking</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Digging\" title=\"Digging\">Digging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Firemaking\" title=\"Firemaking\">Firemaking</a></li>\n<li>Healing\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/First_aid\" title=\"First aid\">First aid</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">Masonry</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_cutting\" title=\"Stone cutting\">Stone cutting</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mining\" title=\"Mining\">Mining</a></li>\n<li>Miscellaneous items\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">Repairing</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Nature\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Gardening\" title=\"Gardening\">Gardening</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Farming\" title=\"Farming\">Farming</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Forestry\" title=\"Forestry\">Forestry</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Pottery\" title=\"Pottery\">Pottery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\">Smithing</a></li>\n<li>Tailoring\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Cloth_tailoring\" title=\"Cloth tailoring\">Cloth tailoring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Leatherworking\" title=\"Leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Tracking\" title=\"Tracking\">Tracking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/War_machines\" title=\"War machines\">War machines</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Thatching\" title=\"Thatching\">Thatching</a></li></ul>\n<pre>NB: List continuously under construction and not complete yet.\n</pre>', 0),
(18890, 997, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Building wooden house walls is a very fast, if wasteful, way to raise Mind logic.', '<ul><li>Building <a href=\"/index.php/House\" title=\"House\">wooden house</a> walls is a very fast, if wasteful, way to raise Mind logic.</li></ul>', 1),
(18891, 997, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Logician at 50 skill Genius at 70 skill Smarty Pants at 90 skill', '<ul><li>Logician at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Genius at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Smarty Pants at 90 skill</li></ul>', 2),
(18892, 3053, 'Messages', 'Messages', 'You now feel confident enough to attack other people. When soul strength rises to 20.5.', '<dl><dt>You now feel confident enough to attack other people. </dt>\n<dd>When soul strength rises to 20.5.</dd></dl>', 0),
(18893, 3053, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Soul depth', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul_depth\" title=\"Soul depth\">Soul depth</a></li></ul>', 1),
(18894, 4498, 'Description', 'Description', 'A shining basinet helm with a lift up visor.', '<p><i>A shining basinet helm with a lift up visor.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18895, 4498, 'Skins applicable', 'Skins_applicable', 'Mastercrafted Basinet Helm', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Item_skin_token\" title=\"Item skin token\">Mastercrafted Basinet Helm</a></li></ul>', 1),
(18896, 4498, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Protects the head and face, the same as the open helm and great helm . Higher quality large anvils increase your chance at creating.', '<ul><li>Protects the head and face, the same as the <a href=\"/index.php/Open_helm\" title=\"Open helm\">open helm</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Great_helm\" title=\"Great helm\">great helm</a>.</li>\n<li>Higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvils increase your chance at creating.</li></ul>', 2),
(18897, 4498, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 3),
(18898, 4500, 'Description', 'Description', 'A protection closed completely around the lower arm and secured shut with spring snaps.', '<p><i>A protection closed completely around the lower arm and secured shut with spring snaps.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18899, 4500, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour for your arms. You will need one for each arm. Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger walking speed penalties. Higher quality large anvils increase your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour for your arms. You will need one for each arm.</li>\n<li>Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">walking</a> speed penalties.</li>\n<li>Higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvils increase your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(18900, 4500, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 2),
(18901, 4526, 'Description', 'Description', 'A glove made from small plates.', '<p><i>A glove made from small plates.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18902, 4526, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour for your hands. You will need one for each hand. Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger walking speed penalties. Higher quality large anvils increase your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour for your hands. You will need one for each hand.</li>\n<li>Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">walking</a> speed penalties.</li>\n<li>Higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvils increase your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(18903, 4526, 'Enchantments and runes', 'Enchantments_and_runes', 'Magical enchantments and runes on gloves affect actions that require hands: crafting clay items, improving clay items with the hand, forage, botanise. Since: Patch Notes 05-DEC-2023 Only magical effects such as runes and spell enchantments function for this purpose. For example, Wind of Ages will improve action speed and Circle of Cunning will improve skill gain. The glove is not being used as an actual tool, so it will not receive damage, and its quality, rarity, and material will have no impact on effectiveness. However, like a tool, enchantments will still decay from use. Enchantment/Rune effectiveness is averaged between both gloves. For example, having 100 Wind of Ages on one glove and 50 on the other will be equivalent to having 75 Wind of Ages on a tool, and having a rune on one glove but not the other will result in that rune being half as effective as usual.', '<ul><li>Magical enchantments and runes on gloves affect actions that require hands: crafting clay items, improving clay items with the hand, forage, botanise. Since: <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/199861-patch-notes-05-dec-2023/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patch Notes 05-DEC-2023</a></li>\n<li>Only magical effects such as runes and spell enchantments function for this purpose. For example, Wind of Ages will improve action speed and Circle of Cunning will improve skill gain.</li>\n<li>The glove is not being used as an actual tool, so it will not receive damage, and its quality, rarity, and material will have no impact on effectiveness. However, like a tool, enchantments will still decay from use.</li>\n<li>Enchantment/Rune effectiveness is averaged between both gloves. For example, having 100 Wind of Ages on one glove and 50 on the other will be equivalent to having 75 Wind of Ages on a tool, and having a rune on one glove but not the other will result in that rune being half as effective as usual.</li></ul>', 2),
(18904, 4526, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 3),
(18905, 4501, 'Description', 'Description', 'Greaves for the lower part of the legs, a cuisse for the upper part, joined by a poleyne covering the knee.', '<p><i>Greaves for the lower part of the legs, a cuisse for the upper part, joined by a poleyne covering the knee.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18906, 4501, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour for your legs. Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger walking speed penalties. You can create this item with PAS skill of 10 and 10 quality large anvil, which will give you a 6% chance. A higher quality large anvil will increase your chances at creation.', '<ul><li>Armour for your legs.</li>\n<li>Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">walking</a> speed penalties.</li>\n<li>You can create this item with PAS skill of 10 and 10 quality large anvil, which will give you a 6% chance. A higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvil will increase your chances at creation.</li></ul>', 1),
(18907, 4501, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 2),
(18908, 4502, 'Description', 'Description', 'A heavy and intricate set of metal plates, together covering the top of the body.', '<p><i>A heavy and intricate set of metal plates, together covering the top of the body.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18909, 4502, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour for your torso. 10 Plate armour smithing is needed to craft a breast plate. Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger walking speed penalties. Higher quality large anvils increase your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour for your torso.</li>\n<li>10 <a href=\"/index.php/Plate_armour_smithing\" title=\"Plate armour smithing\">Plate armour smithing</a> is needed to craft a breast plate.</li>\n<li>Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">walking</a> speed penalties.</li>\n<li>Higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvils increase your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(18910, 4502, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 2),
(18918, 2721, 'Description', 'Description', 'The skill used for the creation of charcoal piles , which produce charcoal , tar , and ash as they burn. A high skill will result in higher quality piles, which will make more and higher quality products.', '<p>The skill used for the creation of <a href=\"/index.php/Charcoal_pile\" title=\"Charcoal pile\">charcoal piles</a>, which produce <a href=\"/index.php/Charcoal\" title=\"Charcoal\">charcoal</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Tar\" title=\"Tar\">tar</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Ash\" title=\"Ash\">ash</a> as they burn. A high skill will result in higher quality piles, which will make more and higher quality products. \n</p>', 0),
(18919, 2721, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'Coal-making Mind > Mind logic Soul > Soul strength', '<ul><li>Coal-making</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul\" title=\"Soul\">Soul</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_strength\" title=\"Soul strength\">Soul strength</a></li></ul>', 1),
(18920, 2721, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Coaler at 50 skill Renowned Coaler at 70 skill Master Coaler at 90 skill', '<ul><li>Coaler at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Renowned Coaler at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Master Coaler at 90 skill</li></ul>', 2),
(18921, 2721, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Category:Coal-making items', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Coal-making_items\" title=\"Category:Coal-making items\">Category:Coal-making items</a></li></ul>', 3),
(18940, 4282, 'Description', 'Description', 'A key mould fired into a pottery key form. A red pottery form, made after a key , to make an indefinite amount of copies of it. It is the result of firing a key mould made of clay . See key for instructions for how to make key copies . Copies of keys are made using a lump of copper rather than a lump of iron. Notes Upon failure to make a key, .50 Ql lost off the Key form', '<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:157px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Key_form.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-file-height=\"170\" data-file-width=\"155\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"170\" src=\"/images/0/09/Key_form.png\" width=\"155\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/index.php/File:Key_form.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>A <a href=\"/index.php/Key_mould\" title=\"Key mould\">key mould</a> fired into a pottery <a href=\"/index.php/Key\" title=\"Key\">key</a> form.</div></div></div>\n<p>A red pottery form, made after a <a href=\"/index.php/Key\" title=\"Key\">key</a>, to make an indefinite amount of copies of it. It is the result of firing a <a href=\"/index.php/Key_mould\" title=\"Key mould\">key mould</a> made of <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a>.\n</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"/index.php/Key\" title=\"Key\">key</a> for instructions for how to make <a href=\"/index.php/Key_copy\" title=\"Key copy\">key copies</a>. Copies of keys are made using a lump of copper rather than a lump of iron.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Upon failure to make a key, .50 Ql lost off the Key form\n</p>', 0),
(18941, 2973, 'Description', 'Description', 'A lot of sand, enough to raise the ground somewhere.', '<p><i>A lot of sand, enough to raise the ground somewhere.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18942, 2973, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Heaps of sand can be used with clay to make mortar . They can be used to raise the terrain up and change several tile types into sand. Heaps of sand can be dropped in two ways: Dropping them on the ground will raise the tile below you, also turning some tiles to sand tiles (such as dirt , grass , and steppe ). Dropping as a pile will create a heap of sand that you are able to pick back up.', '<ul><li>Heaps of sand can be used with <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> to make <a href=\"/index.php/Mortar\" title=\"Mortar\">mortar</a>.</li>\n<li>They can be used to raise the terrain up and change several tile types into sand.</li>\n<li>Heaps of sand can be dropped in two ways:\n<ul><li>Dropping them <b>on the ground</b> will raise the tile below you, also turning some tiles to sand tiles (such as <a href=\"/index.php/Dirt_tile\" title=\"Dirt tile\">dirt</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Grass_tile\" title=\"Grass tile\">grass</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Steppe_tile\" title=\"Steppe tile\">steppe</a>).</li>\n<li>Dropping <b>as a pile</b> will create a heap of sand that you are able to pick back up.</li></ul></li></ul>', 1),
(18946, 3366, 'Description', 'Description', 'A piece of wood with a bundle of rough wires attached on one end.', '<p><i>A piece of wood with a bundle of rough wires attached on one end.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(18947, 3366, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used in restoration of archaeology fragments. Used to remove dye from items. Used to remove Jackal skins from weapons', '<ul><li>Used in <a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">restoration</a> of archaeology fragments.</li>\n<li>Used to remove <a href=\"/index.php/Dye\" title=\"Dye\">dye</a> from items.</li>\n<li>Used to remove <a href=\"/index.php/Jackal#Jackal_points_and_rewards\" title=\"Jackal\">Jackal skins</a> from weapons</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(18948, 3366, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Will be damaged after only one use, so be sure to repair it immediately. Creation of the metal brush requires at least 0.54kg of wires. You may need to fabricate two 0.4kg wires to have enough.', '<ul><li>Will be <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damaged</a> after only one use, so be sure to <a href=\"/index.php/Repairing\" title=\"Repairing\">repair</a> it immediately.</li>\n<li>Creation of the metal brush requires at least 0.54kg of wires.</li>\n<li>You may need to fabricate two 0.4kg wires to have enough.</li></ul>', 2),
(18953, 3216, 'Description', 'Description', 'Press F2 to see your characteristics. Characteristics help when you perform actions depending on them.  When a new character is created all characteristics start at 19.5.  Like skills they are limited to 20 if you don\'t have premium time.  Points in characteristics are gained much more slowly than those in skills . On PVE: If a character was once premium and then loses premium, their characteristic skills will drop down to 30 (or remain unchanged if lower than 30); however, you can not raise them further until becoming premium again.  On PVP: Characteristics remain capped at 20. Crossing from PVE to PVP will enforce this cap immediately. Body Body strength -  High strength allows you to carry more, take less damage from hits, and do more damage in fighting and destroying walls. 21 strength is needed to get the option to destroy a wall. 20 strength is needed to unpave or dig on roads. 23 strength is needed to load and unload things. 21 strength is needed to prevent damage to a Bag of keeping /Master bag of keeping upon death Body stamina - Body stamina reflects how much stamina you can have in your stamina bar. Body control -  20.50 body control is needed to be able to use the steal command, and to ride certain animals. Body control helps with chance to evade hits during fighting. 21 control is needed to ride a horse. Mind Mind logic - Primarily used by carpentry & smithing , and affects how many action queue slots you have. You also need varying levels of Mind logic to command Boats . Mind Logic is believed to have something to do with Stealth. 20.10 logic is needed to drive a Large cart and Sailboat Mind speed - Primarily used in fighting . Soul Soul strength - Soul strength helps defend against offensive spells cast upon you and casting Dominate and Rebirth . Soul depth - Primarily increased by nature and cooking skills. Increases your chance to attach runes .', '<p>Press F2 to see your characteristics. Characteristics help when you perform actions depending on them.  When a new character is created all characteristics start at 19.5.  Like skills they are limited to 20 if you don\'t have <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Premium\" title=\"Premium\">premium</a> time.  Points in characteristics are gained much more slowly than those in <a href=\"/index.php/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">skills</a>. On PVE: If a character was once premium and then loses premium, their characteristic skills will drop down to 30 (or remain unchanged if lower than 30); however, you can not raise them further until becoming premium again.  On PVP: Characteristics remain capped at 20. Crossing from PVE to PVP will enforce this cap immediately.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Body\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Body_strength\" title=\"Body strength\">Body strength</a> -  High strength allows you to carry more, take less damage from hits, and do more damage in fighting and destroying walls.\n<ul><li>21 strength is needed to get the option to destroy a wall.</li>\n<li>20 strength is needed to unpave or dig on roads.</li>\n<li>23 strength is needed to load and unload things.</li>\n<li>21 strength is needed to prevent damage to a <a href=\"/index.php/Bag_of_keeping\" title=\"Bag of keeping\">Bag of keeping</a>/Master bag of keeping upon death</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body_stamina\" title=\"Body stamina\">Body stamina</a> - Body stamina reflects how much stamina you can have in your stamina bar.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a> -  20.50 body control is needed to be able to use the steal command, and to ride certain animals. Body control helps with chance to evade hits during fighting.\n<ul><li>21 control is needed to ride a horse.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Mind\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a> - Primarily used by <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a> &amp; <a href=\"/index.php/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\">smithing</a>, and affects how many action queue slots you have. You also need varying levels of Mind logic to command <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Boats\" title=\"Boats\">Boats</a>. Mind Logic is believed to have something to do with Stealth.\n<ul><li>20.10 logic is needed to drive a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_cart\" title=\"Large cart\">Large cart</a> and <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sailboat\" title=\"Sailboat\">Sailboat</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind_speed\" title=\"Mind speed\">Mind speed</a> - Primarily used in <a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">fighting</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Soul\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul_strength\" title=\"Soul strength\">Soul strength</a> - Soul strength helps defend against offensive spells cast upon you and casting <a href=\"/index.php/Dominate\" title=\"Dominate\">Dominate</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Rebirth\" title=\"Rebirth\">Rebirth</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul_depth\" title=\"Soul depth\">Soul depth</a> - Primarily increased by <a href=\"/index.php/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">nature</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> skills. Increases your chance to attach <a href=\"/index.php/Runes\" title=\"Runes\">runes</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>', 0);
