a-file-width=\"541\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/8/88/Clothbarding.jpg/514px-Clothbarding.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/8/88/Clothbarding.jpg 1.5x\" width=\"343\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 323px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Cloth barding\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 346px\"><div style=\"width: 346px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 344px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Dyeable_cloth_barding_-_undyed.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"911\" data-file-width=\"1253\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d8/Dyeable_cloth_barding_-_undyed.png/516px-Dyeable_cloth_barding_-_undyed.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d8/Dyeable_cloth_barding_-_undyed.png/775px-Dyeable_cloth_barding_-_undyed.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d8/Dyeable_cloth_barding_-_undyed.png/1032px-Dyeable_cloth_barding_-_undyed.png 2x\" width=\"344\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 324px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Undyed dyeable cloth barding\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 3),
(18995, 1110, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'Tailoring > Cloth tailoring Mind > Mind logic Body > Body control', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Tailoring\" title=\"Tailoring\">Tailoring</a> &gt; Cloth tailoring</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body\" title=\"Body\">Body</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a></li></ul>', 4),
(18996, 1110, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Tailor at 50 skill Dreamweaver at 70 skill Seamster/Seamstress at 90 skill Fateweaver at 100 skill', '<ul><li>Tailor at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Dreamweaver at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Seamster/Seamstress at 90 skill</li>\n<li>Fateweaver at 100 skill</li></ul>', 5),
(18997, 1110, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Category:Cloth tailoring items Tailoring Cloth tailoring Leatherworking', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Cloth_tailoring_items\" title=\"Category:Cloth tailoring items\">Category:Cloth tailoring items</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Tailoring\" title=\"Tailoring\">Tailoring</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cloth tailoring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Leatherworking\" title=\"Leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></li></ul></li></ul>', 6),
(18998, 2512, 'Description', 'Description', 'Dairy food making is a subskill of cooking used to create dairy foods such as cheese, butter, and cream.', '<p>Dairy food making is a subskill of cooking used to create dairy foods such as cheese, butter, and cream.\n</p>', 0),
(18999, 2512, 'Tools Used', 'Tools_Used', 'Cheese drill Fork Spoon', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Cheese_drill\" title=\"Cheese drill\">Cheese drill</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fork\" title=\"Fork\">Fork</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Spoon\" title=\"Spoon\">Spoon</a></li></ul>', 1),
(19000, 2512, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'Cooking > Dairy food making Mind > Mind logic Soul > Soul depth', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">Cooking</a> &gt; Dairy food making</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul\" title=\"Soul\">Soul</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_depth\" title=\"Soul depth\">Soul depth</a></li></ul>', 2),
(19001, 2512, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Cheesemaker at 50 skill Artisan Cheesemaker at 70 skill Master Cheesemaker at 90 skill', '<ul><li>Cheesemaker at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Artisan Cheesemaker at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Master Cheesemaker at 90 skill</li></ul>', 3),
(19002, 2512, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Category:Dairy food making items Cooking Baking Beverages Butchering Dairy food making Hot food cooking Milling', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Dairy_food_making_items\" title=\"Category:Dairy food making items\">Category:Dairy food making items</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">Cooking</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Baking\" title=\"Baking\">Baking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Beverages\" title=\"Beverages\">Beverages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Butchering\" title=\"Butchering\">Butchering</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Dairy food making</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Hot_food_cooking\" title=\"Hot food cooking\">Hot food cooking</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Milling\" title=\"Milling\">Milling</a></li></ul>', 4),
(19006, 4869, 'Description', 'Description', 'Fine-grained brown mortar, perfect for masonry . Commonly used as a masonry material, required to build stone housing , fireplaces , and bridges . Used in the creation of concrete', '<p><i>Fine-grained brown mortar, perfect for <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<p>Commonly used as a masonry material, required to build <a href=\"/index.php/House\" title=\"House\">stone housing</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Fireplace\" title=\"Fireplace\">fireplaces</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Bridge\" title=\"Bridge\">bridges</a>. Used in the creation of <a href=\"/index.php/Concrete\" title=\"Concrete\">concrete</a>\n</p>', 0),
(19007, 4869, 'Creation', 'Creation', 'The quality of the clay used to create the mortar affects your success chance. The maximum quality of the resulting mortar is equal to the sand \'s quality. If you fail to create the mortar, 0.20kg will be consumed from each of the clay and sand.', '<ul><li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> used to create the mortar affects your success chance.</li>\n<li>The maximum quality of the resulting mortar is equal to the <a href=\"/index.php/Heap_of_sand\" title=\"Heap of sand\">sand</a>\'s quality.</li>\n<li>If you fail to create the mortar, 0.20kg will be consumed from each of the clay and sand.</li></ul>', 1),
(19008, 4869, 'Uses', 'Uses', 'Can also be used in the creation of concrete when combined with lye . Mortar can be combined and still used in house building. After each brick is added, 2kgs of mortar will simply be removed from the combined lump.', '<ul><li>Can also be used in the creation of <a href=\"/index.php/Concrete\" title=\"Concrete\">concrete</a> when combined with <a href=\"/index.php/Lye\" title=\"Lye\">lye</a>.</li>\n<li>Mortar can be combined and still used in house building. After each <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">brick</a> is added, 2kgs of mortar will simply be removed from the combined lump.</li></ul>', 2),
(19009, 4869, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Mortar is a bulk item and may be stored in crates and BSBs in default units of 2.0 Kgs Mortar, like clay, takes damage after a couple of hours. To increase its lifetime, put it into a container .', '<ul><li>Mortar is a bulk item and may be stored in crates and BSBs in default units of 2.0 Kgs</li>\n<li>Mortar, like clay, takes <a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> after a couple of hours. To increase its lifetime, put it into a <a href=\"/index.php/Container\" title=\"Container\">container</a>.</li></ul>', 3),
(19010, 4870, 'Description', 'Description', 'A wide metal blade on a shaft, useful in construction and searching through dirt and rocks for useful items.', '<p><i>A wide metal blade on a shaft, useful in construction and searching through dirt and rocks for useful items.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(19011, 4870, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Trowels are used in building masonry items such as walls , fences , and bridges . Trowels are one of the few tools that can be used to investigate tiles for archaeology fragments . A higher quality trowel will perform actions quicker than one of lower quality. The quality of the wooden handle used to create the trowel affects your success chance.', '<ul><li>Trowels are used in building <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Masonry_items\" title=\"Masonry items\">masonry items</a> such as <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Walls\" title=\"Walls\">walls</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Fences\" title=\"Fences\">fences</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Bridge\" title=\"Bridge\">bridges</a>.</li>\n<li>Trowels are one of the few tools that can be used to investigate tiles for <a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">archaeology fragments</a>.</li>\n<li>A higher quality trowel will perform actions quicker than one of lower quality.</li>\n<li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the wooden <a href=\"/index.php/Handle\" title=\"Handle\">handle</a> used to create the trowel affects your success chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(19012, 4871, 'Description', 'Description', 'A flat, faintly pointed broad blade used to smooth out mortar on bricks.', '<p><i>A flat, faintly pointed broad blade used to smooth out mortar on bricks.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(19013, 4871, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used to construct a trowel when attached to a wooden handle .', '<ul><li>Used to construct a <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> when attached to a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Wooden_handle\" title=\"Wooden handle\">wooden handle</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(19014, 4872, 'Port Summary', 'Port_Summary', 'TCP outbound port 80 TCP outbound port 3725 (Pristine) TCP outbound port 3724 (Freedom) TCP outbound port 3723 (Epic)', '<p>TCP outbound port 80\n</p>\n<p>TCP outbound port 3725 (Pristine)\n</p>\n<p>TCP outbound port 3724 (Freedom)\n</p>\n<p>TCP outbound port 3723 (Epic)\n</p>', 0),
(19018, 1897, 'Resources', 'Resources', 'Ore Silver Iron Copper Lead Forests Pine Maple Olive Cedar', '<p><b>Ore</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Silver</li>\n<li>Iron</li>\n<li>Copper</li>\n<li>Lead</li></ul>\n<p><b>Forests</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Pine</li>\n<li>Maple</li>\n<li>Olive</li>\n<li>Cedar</li></ul>', 0),
(19019, 1897, 'Villages', 'Villages', 'Silron Valley', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Silron_Valley\" title=\"Silron Valley\">Silron Valley</a></li></ul>', 1),
(19020, 1897, 'Homesteads', 'Homesteads', 'Silron Forward Observation Post Silron Cattle Ranch Silron Harbor Silron Forestry Engineering Silron Goldmine Silron Trading Post Silron Hunting Lodge Silron Temple of Fo Silron Temple of Magranon Silron Temple of Vynora Silron Northwest Passage Silron Northern Alliance', '<ul><li>Silron Forward Observation Post</li>\n<li>Silron Cattle Ranch</li>\n<li>Silron Harbor</li>\n<li>Silron Forestry Engineering</li>\n<li>Silron Goldmine</li>\n<li>Silron Trading Post</li>\n<li>Silron Hunting Lodge</li>\n<li>Silron Temple of Fo</li>\n<li>Silron Temple of Magranon</li>\n<li>Silron Temple of Vynora</li>\n<li>Silron Northwest Passage</li>\n<li>Silron Northern Alliance</li></ul>', 2),
(19021, 1722, 'Description', 'Description', 'Lockpicking is the skill used when picking locks, such as door locks , gate locks , and large padlocks and small padlocks on large chests , with lock picks , in order to open them without a key.', '<p><b>Lockpicking</b> is the skill used when picking locks, such as <a href=\"/index.php/Door_lock\" title=\"Door lock\">door locks</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Gate_lock\" title=\"Gate lock\">gate locks</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Large_padlock\" title=\"Large padlock\">large padlocks</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Small_padlock\" title=\"Small padlock\">small padlocks</a> on <a href=\"/index.php/Large_chest\" title=\"Large chest\">large chests</a>, with <a href=\"/index.php/Lock_picks\" title=\"Lock picks\">lock picks</a>, in order to open them without a key.\n</p>', 0),
(19022, 1722, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'When you pick open a chest or a boat, you will receive the lock in your inventory (not the key) and it will be unlocked. When you pick open a house door lock or gate lock, the lock stays attached and will remain unlocked for 10 minutes real time. Examining the door will reveal how much time remains. Successfully lockpicking an already unlocked gate or door will reset the lock. On each attempt, regardless of fail or success, you will either break or damage the lock picks. The success rate of lockpicking is effected by the quality of the lock picks, the lockpicking skill, the lock ql, the wall or container ql, container rarity, and for a minor degree its parent skill Thievery . The quality of the lock picks also affects the chances of them just outright breaking. High quality locks will prevent any lockpicking attempt with lock picks that are approximately more than 20 QL lower. There is a 10-minute cooldown between skill gains. Approximately 30 lockpicking is needed to be considered capable. Not all lock types and the stuff they secure are equal in difficulty. As an example larger ships are more difficult than smaller. To make lock picks you need a minimum of 25 effective skill in locksmithing . Lockpicking timers will become shorter as you level and will be 24 seconds at full stamina minimum. House doors that have been picked open may be relocked before ten minutes pass by the writ holder. This is done by unlocking all doors, then relocking them in the writ settings.', '<ul><li>When you pick open a chest or a boat, you will receive the lock in your inventory (not the key) and it will be unlocked. When you pick open a house door lock or gate lock, the lock stays attached and will remain unlocked for 10 minutes real time. Examining the door will reveal how much time remains.</li>\n<li>Successfully lockpicking an already unlocked gate or door will reset the lock.</li>\n<li>On each attempt, regardless of fail or success, you will either break or damage the lock picks.</li>\n<li>The success rate of lockpicking is effected by the quality of the lock picks, the lockpicking skill, the lock ql, the wall or container ql, container rarity, and for a minor degree its parent skill <a href=\"/index.php/Thievery\" title=\"Thievery\">Thievery</a>. The quality of the lock picks also affects the chances of them just outright breaking.</li>\n<li>High quality locks will prevent any lockpicking attempt with lock picks that are approximately more than 20 QL lower.</li>\n<li>There is a 10-minute cooldown between skill gains.</li>\n<li>Approximately 30 lockpicking is needed to be considered capable.</li>\n<li>Not all lock types and the stuff they secure are equal in difficulty. As an example larger ships are more difficult than smaller.</li>\n<li>To make lock picks you need a minimum of 25 <a href=\"/index.php/The_curve\" title=\"The curve\">effective</a> skill in <a href=\"/index.php/Locksmithing\" title=\"Locksmithing\">locksmithing</a>.</li>\n<li>Lockpicking timers will become shorter as you level and will be 24 seconds at full stamina minimum.</li>\n<li>House doors that have been picked open may be relocked before ten minutes pass by the writ holder. This is done by unlocking all doors, then relocking them in the writ settings.</li></ul>', 1),
(19023, 1722, 'Lockpicking on Freedom', 'Lockpicking_on_Freedom', 'Note : It is expressly against the Freedom rules to pick the lock of anything that you do not own. However, none of these rules or limitation are applicable to Chaos Lockpicking is strictly prohibited unless you have ownership of the container/gate you\'re lock picking, IE a chest on your deed or a gate on your deed. Lockpicking abandoned chests that do not belong to you is still a bannable offense.', '<pre> <b>Note : It is expressly against the Freedom rules to pick the lock of anything that you do not own. </b>\n <b>However, none of these rules or limitation are applicable to Chaos</b>\n</pre>\n<p>Lockpicking is strictly prohibited unless you have ownership of the container/gate you\'re lock picking, IE a chest on your deed or a gate on your deed.\n</p>\n<p>Lockpicking abandoned chests that do not belong to you is still a bannable offense.\n</p>', 2),
(19024, 1722, 'Lock quality', 'Lock_quality', 'Lock Description QL range Very poor 1 - 9.99 Poor 10 - 19.99 Below average 20 - 29.99 Okay 30 - 39.99 Above average 40 - 49.99 Pretty good 50 - 59.99 Good 60 - 69.99 Very good 70 - 79.99 Exceptional 80 - 89.99 Fantastic 90 - 99.99', '<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Lock Description</th>\n<th>QL range\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Very poor</td>\n<td>1 - 9.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poor</td>\n<td>10 - 19.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Below average</td>\n<td>20 - 29.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Okay</td>\n<td>30 - 39.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Above average</td>\n<td>40 - 49.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pretty good</td>\n<td>50 - 59.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>60 - 69.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Very good</td>\n<td>70 - 79.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exceptional</td>\n<td>80 - 89.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fantastic</td>\n<td>90 - 99.99\n</td></tr></tbody></table>', 3),
(19025, 1722, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'Thievery > Lockpicking Body > Body control Mind > Mind logic', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Thievery\" title=\"Thievery\">Thievery</a> &gt; Lockpicking</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body\" title=\"Body\">Body</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a></li></ul>', 4),
(19026, 1722, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Lock Breaker at 50 skill Safe Cracker at 70 skill Vault Shadow at 90 skill', '<ul><li>Lock Breaker at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Safe Cracker at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Vault Shadow at 90 skill</li></ul>', 5);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(19034, 3531, 'Acronyms and Abbreviations', 'Acronyms_and_Abbreviations', 'Abbreviation Meaning Area used Notes AH Animal husbandry Action / Skill Allows for the production (breeding) of new creatures Arch Archaeology / Restoration Action / Skill Used for locating, identifying, and combining of fragments of different items BS Blacksmithing Action / Skill Also Body strength or Body stamina Carp Carpentry Action / Skill Skill which uses wood to create wooden items CaS Chain armour smithing Action / Skill Skill used to make chainmail armour for Wurmians and horses CT Cloth tailoring Action / Skill A tailoring subskill used to create and improve cloth items DFM Dairy food making Action / Skill A subskill of cooking used to create dairy foods Dom Dominate Action / Skill Works almost like taming , but has a lower rate of failure FC Fine carpentry Action / Skill more difficult carpentry functions such as creating barrels and carts FS Fight skill Action / Skill Skill used in melee fighting animals and players HFC Hot food cooking Action / Skill Skill used to create cooked food Imp Improve Action / Skill The improvement (or imping) of an item to increase its quality JS Jewelry smithing Action / Skill Skill used to create jewelry items and do fine metalwork LW Leatherworking Action / Skill Skill used to create leather items NS Natural substances Action / Skill Sometimes referred to as natsub - Alchemy subskill used in the creation of useful substances PaS Plate armour smithing Action / Skill Sometimes shortened to PS (Plate smithing) - Skill of creating and improving plate armour for battle Sac Sacrifice Action / Skill To offer something to the gods SC Stone cutting Action / Skill A sub-skill of masonry used in creating stone items WC Woodcutting Action / Skill Skill used in cutting down trees , creating logs , and creating kindling WS Weapon smithing Action / Skill Skill used in creating weapons and tools that use weapon blades BC Body control Characteristic Helps with weapon accuracy and stealthing, and determines the mounts a player can ride BS Body strength Characteristic Also Body stamina or Blacksmithing .  Measure of how much you can carry, drag and damage. ML Mind logic Characteristic Determines action queue size and vehicle command capability CCFP Calories, Carbohydrates, Fats, and Protiens Attribute A measure of how nutritious a food item is CR Combat rating Attribute A measure of how often you miss and get missed in combat DMG Damage Attribute How much wear-and-tear an item has Prem Premium Attribute See Account types Q or QL Quality Attribute A measure of how good something is and how well it works SB Sleep bonus Attribute Your available remaining time of increased skill, characteristic, and stamina gain WT Weight Attribute How heavy an item is, measured in kg GL Global Chat Chat Chat channel extending to all the servers in your cluster o/ Friendly greeting Chat May also be written \\o o7 Respectful greeting Chat also known as a salute PC Price check Trade Chat WTA Want to Auction Trade Chat WTB Want to buy Trade Chat WTS Want to sell Trade Chat WTT Want to trade Trade Chat C Copper Currency 100 Irons - 1/100 of a Silver G Gold Currency 100 Silver I Iron Currency Smallest currently unit in Wurm S Silver Currency 100 Copper - 1/100 of a Gold Fo Fo Deity Fo is the deity of nature Lib Libila Deity Libila is the evil, dark goddess of the Horde of the Summoned Mag Magranon Deity Magranon is the deity of fighting for justice and freedom Vyn Vynora Deity Vynora is the Goddess of knowledge and creation MOI Moment of inspiration Event Also called Rare roll, drumroll. CoD Cash on Delivery General See Wagoner for more information F2P Free to play General See Account types FL Focus level General Your combat focus FPS Frames per Second General A measure of pc performance GUI / UI Graphic user interface General Sometimes just UI, (User interface) KG Kilogram General A measure of weight KPH Kilometers per hour General A measure of speed Perm / Perms Permissions General System allowing or denying privileges and abilities PvE Player versus environment General PvP Player versus player General RNG Random chance General Literally \'random number generator\' a device used by the gods Wogic Wogic General The unique logic and mathematics of Wurm BCU Bulk container unit Item A rack to store bulk storage bins BL The black light, home of the Bone altar Item The light that shines down on the Bone Altar BoK Bag of keeping Item A small container that remains with the player when they respawn from death BSB Bulk storage bin Item A storage bin made from planks and strengthened with iron ribbons for bulk materials FSB Food storage bin Item A storage bin made from planks and strengthened with iron ribbons for unprocessed food items LMC Large magical chest Item Container providing greatly reduced decay on contents LMS Large metal shield Item A large heavy shield hammered from a metal sheet LWS Large wooden shield Item A large sturdy shield made from wooden planks. LPC Large pantry cupboard Item A unit to hold several food storage bins. LSU Large storage unit Item A wooden storage unit with shelves inside to store a large amount of items MBoK Master bag of keeping Item A slightly larger version of the Bag of keeping MMS Medium metal shield Item A round shield made from a hammered metal sheet MWS Medium wooden shield Item A medium sized sturdy shield made from wooden planks with a metal spike. NPC Non playing character Item Implemented to do certain functions such as trade, guard, protect, etc. SP Sleep powder Item This greyish powder, when consumed, will give 1 hour sleep bonus. SMC Small magical chest Item Container providing greatly reduced decay on contents SMS Small metal shield Item A small metal shield with a leather strap SWS Small wooden shield Item A small sturdy shield made from wooden planks. WL The White light, home of the Altar of Three Item The light that shines down on the Altar of Three HotS Horde of the Summoned Kingdom The smallest of the three kingdoms on both Chaos and Epic JK Jenn-Kellon Kingdom The oldest and most populous kingdom MR Mol-Rehan Kingdom The latest arrival to the wild lands PMK Player made kingdom Kingdom A kingdom on a PVP Server created by players Cad Cadence Place PvE server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster Cel Celebration Place PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster Def Defiance Place PvP server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster Deli / Del Deliverance Place PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster Exo Exodus Place PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster Gui Guidance Place A special tutorial server for new players to learn the game GV Golden Valley Place Originally the tutorial server. Some older players remain there Har Harmony Place PvE server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster Ind / Indy Independence Place PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster Mel Melody Place PvE server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster Pri Pristine Place PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster Rel Release Place PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster Xan Xanadu Place PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster AD Animal demise Spells Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage AoE Area of Effect Spells Spell or attack which has a particular effect over an area rather than a specific creature or player. AoSP Aura of shared pain Spells Makes the item it is cast upon cause damage to an opponent when the holder is being hit BotD Blessings of the dark Spells Increases both skill gain and action speed BT Bloodthirst Spells Increases damage CD Cool down Spells Amount of time that must pass before an action can be repeated CoC Circle of cunning Spells Increases skill gain on an item when used as a tool FA Flaming aura Spells A weapon with Flaming aura has a chance to create an additional fire damage wound whenever it does damage FB Frostbrand Spells A weapon enchanted with Frostbrand causes additional frost wounds when it damages an opponent HD Human demise Spells Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage LD Legendary demise Spells Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage LitD Lurker in the dark Spells Also Lurker in the deep - Locate nearby enemy players on PvP servers and mission traitors on PvE servers LitD Lurker in the deep Spells Also Lurker in the dark - Locate rare fishing spot tiles LitW Lurker in the woods Spells Locate nearby champion creatures LT Life transfer Spells Gives a weapon a chance to transfer an amount of health to you when you damage an opponent MD Monster demise Spells Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage MS Mind stealer Spells A weapon enchanted with Mind stealer may transfer skill points to the user Nim Nimbleness Spells Increases chance to hit Op Opulence Spells Makes food items satisfy your character better RoS Rite of spring Spells Priests and followers of Vynora gain 0.2% mind logic towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer RotS Ritual of the Sun Spells Priests and followers of Magranon gain 0.2% body stamina towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer RoD Rite of Death Spells Priests and followers of Libila gain 0.2% soul strength towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer RT Rotting touch Spells Enables the item cast upon to cause more damage over time to people StS Stone strike Spells Improves the success chance of surface mining actions V Venom Spells A weapon enchantment that deals poison wounds WA Web armour Spells May slow down creatures hitting you - Also Wurm Assistant WoA Wind of ages Spells Reduces the time it takes to perform an action BLer Blacklighter Wurmian A player who has joined the Horde of the Summoned and worships the evil Goddess Libila CA Community assistant Wurmian A Wurm Staff member CM Chat moderator Wurmian A Wurm Staff member Dev Developer Wurmian A Wurm Staff member GM Game master Wurmian A Wurm Staff member WLer Whitelighter Wurmian A player who follows one of the \"White Light Gods\": Fo, Magranon or Vynora.', '<div style=\"overflow-x: auto\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible\" style=\"text-align: left; vertical-align:middle;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Abbreviation</th>\n<th>Meaning</th>\n<th>Area<br/>used</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AH\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Animal_husbandry\" title=\"Animal husbandry\">Animal husbandry</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Allows for the production (breeding) of new creatures\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Arch\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">Archaeology</a> / <a href=\"/index.php/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">Restoration</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Used for locating, identifying, and combining of fragments of different items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Blacksmithing\" title=\"Blacksmithing\">Blacksmithing</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Also <a href=\"/index.php/Body_strength\" title=\"Body strength\">Body strength</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Body_stamina\" title=\"Body stamina\">Body stamina</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carp\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">Carpentry</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill which uses wood to create wooden items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CaS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Chain_armour_smithing\" title=\"Chain armour smithing\">Chain armour smithing</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill used to make chainmail armour for Wurmians and horses\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CT\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cloth_tailoring\" title=\"Cloth tailoring\">Cloth tailoring</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>A tailoring subskill used to create and improve cloth items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DFM\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Dairy_food_making\" title=\"Dairy food making\">Dairy food making</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>A subskill of cooking used to create dairy foods\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dom\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Dominate\" title=\"Dominate\">Dominate</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Works almost like <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Taming\" title=\"Taming\">taming</a>, but has a lower rate of failure\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Fine_carpentry\" title=\"Fine carpentry\">Fine carpentry</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>more difficult carpentry functions such as creating barrels and carts\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Fight_skill\" title=\"Fight skill\">Fight skill</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill used in melee fighting animals and players\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HFC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Hot_food_cooking\" title=\"Hot food cooking\">Hot food cooking</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill used to create cooked food\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Imp\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">Improve</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>The improvement (or imping) of an item to increase its quality\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Jewelry_smithing\" title=\"Jewelry smithing\">Jewelry smithing</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill used to create jewelry items and do fine metalwork\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LW\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Leatherworking\" title=\"Leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill used to create leather items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Natural_substances\" title=\"Natural substances\">Natural substances</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Sometimes referred to as natsub - Alchemy subskill used in the creation of useful substances\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PaS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Plate_armour_smithing\" title=\"Plate armour smithing\">Plate armour smithing</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Sometimes shortened to PS (Plate smithing) - Skill of creating and improving plate armour for battle\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sac\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sacrifice\" title=\"Sacrifice\">Sacrifice</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>To offer something to the gods\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_cutting\" title=\"Stone cutting\">Stone cutting</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>A sub-skill of masonry used in creating stone items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Woodcutting\" title=\"Woodcutting\">Woodcutting</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill used in cutting down <a href=\"/index.php/Tree\" title=\"Tree\">trees</a>, creating <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">logs</a>, and creating <a href=\"/index.php/Kindling\" title=\"Kindling\">kindling</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Weapon_smithing\" title=\"Weapon smithing\">Weapon smithing</a>\n</td>\n<td>Action / Skill\n</td>\n<td>Skill used in creating <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Weapons\" title=\"Category:Weapons\">weapons</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Tools\" title=\"Category:Tools\">tools</a> that use weapon blades\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a>\n</td>\n<td>Characteristic\n</td>\n<td>Helps with weapon accuracy and stealthing, and determines the mounts a player can ride\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Body_strength\" title=\"Body strength\">Body strength</a>\n</td>\n<td>Characteristic\n</td>\n<td>Also <a href=\"/index.php/Body_stamina\" title=\"Body stamina\">Body stamina</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Blacksmithing\" title=\"Blacksmithing\">Blacksmithing</a>.  Measure of how much you can carry, drag and damage.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ML\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a>\n</td>\n<td>Characteristic\n</td>\n<td>Determines action queue size and vehicle command capability\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CCFP\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">Calories, Carbohydrates, Fats, and Protiens</a>\n</td>\n<td>Attribute\n</td>\n<td>A measure of how nutritious a food item is\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CR\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Combat_rating\" title=\"Combat rating\">Combat rating</a>\n</td>\n<td>Attribute\n</td>\n<td>A measure of how often you miss and get missed in combat\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DMG\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">Damage</a>\n</td>\n<td>Attribute\n</td>\n<td>How much wear-and-tear an item has\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prem\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Premium\" title=\"Premium\">Premium</a>\n</td>\n<td>Attribute\n</td>\n<td>See <a href=\"/index.php/Account_types\" title=\"Account types\">Account types</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q or QL\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">Quality</a>\n</td>\n<td>Attribute\n</td>\n<td>A measure of how good something is and how well it works\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SB\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Sleep_bonus\" title=\"Sleep bonus\">Sleep bonus</a>\n</td>\n<td>Attribute\n</td>\n<td>Your available remaining time of increased skill, characteristic, and stamina gain\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WT\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Weight\" title=\"Weight\">Weight</a>\n</td>\n<td>Attribute\n</td>\n<td>How heavy an item is, measured in kg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GL\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Chat\" title=\"Chat\"> Global Chat</a>\n</td>\n<td>Chat\n</td>\n<td>Chat channel extending to all the servers in your cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>o/\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Chat\" title=\"Chat\">Friendly greeting</a>\n</td>\n<td>Chat\n</td>\n<td>May also be written \\o\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>o7\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Chat\" title=\"Chat\">Respectful greeting</a>\n</td>\n<td>Chat\n</td>\n<td>also known as a salute\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Trade#Trade_chat\" title=\"Trade\">Price check</a>\n</td>\n<td>Trade Chat\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WTA\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Trade#Trade_chat\" title=\"Trade\">Want to Auction</a>\n</td>\n<td>Trade Chat\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WTB\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Trade#Trade_chat\" title=\"Trade\">Want to buy</a>\n</td>\n<td>Trade Chat\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WTS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Trade#Trade_chat\" title=\"Trade\">Want to sell</a>\n</td>\n<td>Trade Chat\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WTT\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Trade#Trade_chat\" title=\"Trade\">Want to trade</a>\n</td>\n<td>Trade Chat\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bank_of_Wurm\" title=\"Bank of Wurm\">Copper</a>\n</td>\n<td>Currency\n</td>\n<td>100 Irons - 1/100 of a Silver\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bank_of_Wurm\" title=\"Bank of Wurm\">Gold</a>\n</td>\n<td>Currency\n</td>\n<td>100 Silver\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bank_of_Wurm\" title=\"Bank of Wurm\">Iron</a>\n</td>\n<td>Currency\n</td>\n<td>Smallest currently unit in Wurm\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bank_of_Wurm\" title=\"Bank of Wurm\">Silver</a>\n</td>\n<td>Currency\n</td>\n<td>100 Copper - 1/100 of a Gold\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fo\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Fo\" title=\"Fo\">Fo</a>\n</td>\n<td>Deity\n</td>\n<td>Fo is the deity of nature\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lib\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a>\n</td>\n<td>Deity\n</td>\n<td>Libila is the evil, dark goddess of the <a href=\"/index.php/Horde_of_the_Summoned\" title=\"Horde of the Summoned\">Horde of the Summoned</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mag\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Magranon\" title=\"Magranon\">Magranon</a>\n</td>\n<td>Deity\n</td>\n<td>Magranon is the deity of fighting for justice and freedom\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vyn\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a>\n</td>\n<td>Deity\n</td>\n<td>Vynora is the Goddess of knowledge and creation\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MOI\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Rarity_system\" title=\"Rarity system\">Moment of inspiration</a>\n</td>\n<td>Event\n</td>\n<td>Also called Rare roll, drumroll.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CoD\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mailbox#Postage\" title=\"Mailbox\">Cash on Delivery</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>See <a href=\"/index.php/Wagoner\" title=\"Wagoner\">Wagoner</a> for more information\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F2P\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Account_types\" title=\"Account types\">Free to play</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>See <a href=\"/index.php/Account_types\" title=\"Account types\">Account types</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FL\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Focus\" title=\"Focus\">Focus level</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>Your combat focus\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FPS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Frame_rate\" title=\"Frame rate\">Frames per Second</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>A measure of pc performance\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GUI / UI\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Interface_and_controls\" title=\"Interface and controls\">Graphic user interface</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>Sometimes just UI, (User interface)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KG\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Weight\" title=\"Weight\">Kilogram</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>A measure of weight\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KPH\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Speed\" title=\"Speed\">Kilometers per hour</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>A measure of speed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Perm / Perms\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Permissions\" title=\"Permissions\">Permissions</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>System allowing or denying privileges and abilities\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PvE\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/PvE\" title=\"PvE\">Player versus environment</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PvP\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/PvP\" title=\"PvP\">Player versus player</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RNG\n</td>\n<td>Random chance\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>Literally \'random number generator\' a device used by the gods\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wogic\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wogic\" title=\"Wogic\">Wogic</a>\n</td>\n<td>General\n</td>\n<td>The unique logic and mathematics of Wurm\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BCU\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bulk_container_unit\" title=\"Bulk container unit\">Bulk container unit</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A rack to store bulk storage bins\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BL\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bone_Altar\" title=\"Bone Altar\">The black light, home of the Bone altar</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>The light that shines down on the <a href=\"/index.php/Bone_Altar\" title=\"Bone Altar\">Bone Altar</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BoK\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bag_of_keeping\" title=\"Bag of keeping\">Bag of keeping</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A small container that remains with the player when they respawn from death\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BSB\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bulk_storage_bin\" title=\"Bulk storage bin\">Bulk storage bin</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A storage bin made from planks and strengthened with iron ribbons for bulk materials\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FSB\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Food_storage_bin\" title=\"Food storage bin\">Food storage bin</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A storage bin made from planks and strengthened with iron ribbons for unprocessed food items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LMC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Large_magical_chest\" title=\"Large magical chest\">Large magical chest</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>Container providing greatly reduced decay on contents\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LMS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Large_metal_shield\" title=\"Large metal shield\">Large metal shield</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A large heavy shield hammered from a metal sheet\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LWS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Large_wooden_shield\" title=\"Large wooden shield\">Large wooden shield</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A large sturdy shield made from wooden planks.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LPC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Large_pantry_cupboard\" title=\"Large pantry cupboard\">Large pantry cupboard</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A unit to hold several food storage bins.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LSU\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Large_storage_unit\" title=\"Large storage unit\">Large storage unit</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A wooden storage unit with shelves inside to store a large amount of items\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MBoK\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Master_bag_of_keeping\" title=\"Master bag of keeping\">Master bag of keeping</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A slightly larger version of the <a href=\"/index.php/Bag_of_keeping\" title=\"Bag of keeping\">Bag of keeping</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MMS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Medium_metal_shield\" title=\"Medium metal shield\">Medium metal shield</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A round shield made from a hammered metal sheet\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MWS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Medium_wooden_shield\" title=\"Medium wooden shield\">Medium wooden shield</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A medium sized sturdy shield made from wooden planks with a metal spike.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NPC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/NPC\" title=\"NPC\">Non playing character</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>Implemented to do certain functions such as trade, guard, protect, etc.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SP\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Sleep_powder\" title=\"Sleep powder\">Sleep powder</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>This greyish powder, when consumed, will give 1 hour sleep bonus.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Small_magical_chest\" title=\"Small magical chest\">Small magical chest</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>Container providing greatly reduced decay on contents\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SMS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Small_metal_shield\" title=\"Small metal shield\">Small metal shield</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A small metal shield with a leather strap\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SWS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Small_wooden_shield\" title=\"Small wooden shield\">Small wooden shield</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>A small sturdy shield made from wooden planks.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WL\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Altar_of_Three\" title=\"Altar of Three\">The White light, home of the Altar of Three</a>\n</td>\n<td>Item\n</td>\n<td>The light that shines down on the <a href=\"/index.php/Altar_of_Three\" title=\"Altar of Three\">Altar of Three</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HotS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Horde_of_the_Summoned\" title=\"Horde of the Summoned\">Horde of the Summoned</a>\n</td>\n<td>Kingdom\n</td>\n<td>The smallest of the three kingdoms on both Chaos and Epic\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JK\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Jenn-Kellon\" title=\"Jenn-Kellon\">Jenn-Kellon</a>\n</td>\n<td>Kingdom\n</td>\n<td>The oldest and most populous kingdom\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MR\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Mol-Rehan\" title=\"Mol-Rehan\">Mol-Rehan</a>\n</td>\n<td>Kingdom\n</td>\n<td>The latest arrival to the wild lands\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PMK\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Player_made_kingdom\" title=\"Player made kingdom\">Player made kingdom</a>\n</td>\n<td>Kingdom\n</td>\n<td>A kingdom on a PVP Server created by players\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cad\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cadence\" title=\"Cadence\">Cadence</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cel\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Celebration\" title=\"Celebration\">Celebration</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Def\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Defiance\" title=\"Defiance\">Defiance</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvP server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deli / Del\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Deliverance\" title=\"Deliverance\">Deliverance</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exo\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Exodus\" title=\"Exodus\">Exodus</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gui\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Guidance\" title=\"Guidance\">Guidance</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>A special tutorial server for new players to learn the game\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GV\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Golden_Valley\" title=\"Golden Valley\">Golden Valley</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>Originally the tutorial server. Some older players remain there\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Har\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Harmony\" title=\"Harmony\">Harmony</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ind / Indy\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Independence\" title=\"Independence\">Independence</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mel\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Melody\" title=\"Melody\">Melody</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Northern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pri\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Pristine\" title=\"Pristine\">Pristine</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rel\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Release\" title=\"Release\">Release</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Xan\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Xanadu\" title=\"Xanadu\">Xanadu</a>\n</td>\n<td>Place\n</td>\n<td>PvE server in the Southern Freedom Isles cluster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AD\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Animal demise</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AoE\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Area_of_Effect\" title=\"Area of Effect\">Area of Effect</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Spell or attack which has a particular effect over an area rather than a specific creature or player.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AoSP\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Makes the item it is cast upon cause damage to an opponent when the holder is being hit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BotD\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Blessings_of_the_dark\" title=\"Blessings of the dark\">Blessings of the dark</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Increases both skill gain and action speed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BT\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Increases damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CD\n</td>\n<td>Cool down\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Amount of time that must pass before an action can be repeated\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CoC\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Increases skill gain on an item when used as a tool\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FA\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Flaming_aura\" title=\"Flaming aura\">Flaming aura</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>A weapon with Flaming aura has a chance to create an additional fire damage wound whenever it does damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FB\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Frostbrand\" title=\"Frostbrand\">Frostbrand</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>A weapon enchanted with Frostbrand causes additional frost wounds when it damages an opponent\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HD\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Human demise</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LD\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Legendary demise</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LitD\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Lurker_in_the_dark\" title=\"Lurker in the dark\">Lurker in the dark</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Also <a href=\"/index.php/Lurker_in_the_deep\" title=\"Lurker in the deep\">Lurker in the deep</a> - Locate nearby enemy players on PvP servers and mission traitors on PvE servers\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LitD\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Lurker_in_the_deep\" title=\"Lurker in the deep\">Lurker in the deep</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Also <a href=\"/index.php/Lurker_in_the_dark\" title=\"Lurker in the dark\">Lurker in the dark</a> - Locate rare fishing spot tiles\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LitW\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Lurker_in_the_woods\" title=\"Lurker in the woods\">Lurker in the woods</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Locate nearby champion creatures\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LT\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Life_transfer\" title=\"Life transfer\">Life transfer</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Gives a weapon a chance to transfer an amount of health to you when you damage an opponent\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MD\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Monster demise</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Demise spells are weapon enchantments that increase damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Mind_stealer\" title=\"Mind stealer\">Mind stealer</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>A weapon enchanted with Mind stealer may transfer skill points to the user\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nim\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Nimbleness\" title=\"Nimbleness\">Nimbleness</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Increases chance to hit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Op\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Opulence\" title=\"Opulence\">Opulence</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Makes food items satisfy your character better\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RoS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Rite_of_spring\" title=\"Rite of spring\">Rite of spring</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Priests and followers of Vynora gain 0.2% <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">mind logic</a> towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RotS\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Ritual_of_the_Sun\" title=\"Ritual of the Sun\">Ritual of the Sun</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Priests and followers of Magranon gain 0.2% <a href=\"/index.php/Body_stamina\" title=\"Body stamina\">body stamina</a> towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RoD\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rite_of_Death\" title=\"Rite of Death\">Rite of Death</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Priests and followers of Libila gain 0.2% <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_strength\" title=\"Soul strength\">soul strength</a> towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RT\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Rotting_touch\" title=\"Rotting touch\">Rotting touch</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Enables the item cast upon to cause more damage over time to people\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StS\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_strike\" title=\"Stone strike\">Stone strike</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Improves the success chance of surface mining actions\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Venom\" title=\"Venom\">Venom</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>A weapon enchantment that deals poison wounds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WA\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Web_armour\" title=\"Web armour\">Web armour</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>May slow down creatures hitting you - Also Wurm Assistant\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WoA\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>\n</td>\n<td>Spells\n</td>\n<td>Reduces the time it takes to perform an action\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLer\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Blacklighter\" title=\"Blacklighter\">Blacklighter</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wurmian\n</td>\n<td>A player who has joined the Horde of the Summoned and worships the evil Goddess Libila\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CA\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wurm_staff\" title=\"Wurm staff\">Community assistant</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wurmian\n</td>\n<td>A Wurm Staff member\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CM\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wurm_staff\" title=\"Wurm staff\">Chat moderator</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wurmian\n</td>\n<td>A Wurm Staff member\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dev\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wurm_staff\" title=\"Wurm staff\">Developer</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wurmian\n</td>\n<td>A Wurm Staff member\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GM\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wurm_staff\" title=\"Wurm staff\">Game master</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wurmian\n</td>\n<td>A Wurm Staff member\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WLer\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Whitelighter\" title=\"Whitelighter\">Whitelighter</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wurmian\n</td>\n<td>A player who follows one of the \"White Light Gods\": Fo, Magranon or Vynora.\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>', 0);
