d align=\"CENTER\">A.CD.FGHIJ.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">A.CD.FGHIJ..\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">A.CD.FGHIJ...\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">60 to 69.99\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABC\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F.H\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F.HI\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F.HIJ\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F.HIJK\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F.HIJK.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD.F.HIJK..\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">70 to 79.99\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABC\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDE\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF.H\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF.HI\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF.HIJ\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF.HIJ.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF.HIJ..\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF.HIJ...\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">80 to 89.99\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.E\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EF\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EFG\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EFGH\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EFGHI\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EFGHIJ\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EFGHIJK\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EFGHIJK.\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">.BC.EFGHIJK..\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">&gt;=90\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABC\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCD\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDE\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEF\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEFG\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEFGH\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEFGHI\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\">ABCDEFGHIJ\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\"> ?\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\"> ?\n</td>\n<td align=\"CENTER\"> ?\n</td></tr></tbody></table>', 1),
(19812, 4614, 'Examples', 'Examples', 'Edmazur 20 QL - .dm...r 30 QL - Ed.a.u. Lewisthefreeman 60 QL - Lewi.t.efre....', '<p><b>Edmazur</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>20 QL - .dm...r</li>\n<li>30 QL - Ed.a.u.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Lewisthefreeman</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>60 QL - Lewi.t.efre....</li></ul>', 2),
(19816, 3402, 'Description', 'Description', 'This Libila spell is available to priests at 30 faith . It is used to enchant a mailbox to allow them to send and receive mail between players. The power and effect of spell is given in the bracket [x] Ranging from 0 to 104. The spell can be cast multiple times to try to improve the effect of it; failure does not destroy the mailbox. Success of casting the spell depends on your channeling skill. A higher power increases how keen (fast) the Messengers are to work for you. In other words, mail is delivered faster if the mailbox has a higher cast on it. The amount of time this takes is 101 minutes - enchant power . A cast of 70 will result in a approximate delivery time of 1/2 hour. Dark messenger can also be cast on fountains and wells to turn them into wishing wells , which can then be used to make wishes by activating a coin and right-clicking the fountain or well. Failure to cast uses 6 favor. Dark messenger is also used on a strange device to create one of the four types of turrets: Acid turret - Cast inside caves . Frost turret - Cast near water . Fire turret - Cast near a glowing item or by lava . Lightning turret - Cast high upon a mountain. Priests of Fo have an equivalent spell with the same function called courier .', '<p>This <a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a> spell is available to <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priests</a> at 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>. It is used to enchant a mailbox to allow them to send and receive <a href=\"/index.php/Mail\" title=\"Mail\">mail</a> between players. \n</p>\n<p>The power and effect of spell is given in the bracket [x] Ranging from 0 to 104. \n</p>\n<p>The spell can be cast multiple times to try to improve the effect of it; failure does not destroy the mailbox. Success of casting the spell depends on your channeling skill. A higher power increases how keen (fast) the Messengers are to work for you. In other words, mail is delivered faster if the mailbox has a higher cast on it. The amount of time this takes is <b>101 minutes - enchant power</b>.\n</p>\n<p>A cast of 70 will result in a approximate delivery time of 1/2 hour. \n</p>\n<p>Dark messenger can also be cast on fountains and wells to turn them into <a href=\"/index.php/Wishing_well\" title=\"Wishing well\">wishing wells</a>, which can then be used to make wishes by activating a coin and right-clicking the fountain or well.\n</p>\n<p>Failure to cast uses 6 favor.\n</p>\n<p>Dark messenger is also used on a <a href=\"/index.php/Strange_device\" title=\"Strange device\">strange device</a> to create one of the four types of turrets:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Acid_turret\" title=\"Acid turret\">Acid turret</a> - Cast inside <a href=\"/index.php/Cave\" title=\"Cave\">caves</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Frost_turret\" title=\"Frost turret\">Frost turret</a> - Cast near <a href=\"/index.php/Water\" title=\"Water\">water</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fire_turret\" title=\"Fire turret\">Fire turret</a> - Cast near a <a href=\"/index.php/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\">glowing item</a> or by <a href=\"/index.php/Lava\" title=\"Lava\">lava</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Lightning_turret\" title=\"Lightning turret\">Lightning turret</a> - Cast high upon a mountain.</li></ul>\n<p>Priests of <a href=\"/index.php/Fo\" title=\"Fo\">Fo</a> have an equivalent spell with the same function called <a href=\"/index.php/Courier\" title=\"Courier\">courier</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(19817, 3402, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a mailbox or strange device Select Spells > Dark messenger', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mailbox\" title=\"Mailbox\">mailbox</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Strange_device\" title=\"Strange device\">strange device</a></li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Dark messenger</i></li></ol>', 1),
(19821, 5060, 'Description', 'Description', 'This spell is available at 30 faith . It is used to enchant a mailbox to allow them to send and receive mail between players. The power and effect of spell is given in the bracket [x] Ranging from 0 to 104. The spell can be cast multiple times to try to improve the effect of it; failure does not destroy the mailbox. Success of casting the spell depends on your channeling skill. A higher power increases how keen (fast) the Messengers are to work for you. In other words, mail is delivered faster if the mailbox has a higher cast on it. The amount of time this takes is 101 minutes - enchant power . A cast of 70 will result in a approximate delivery time of 1/2 hour. Courier can also be cast on fountains and wells to turn them into wishing wells , which can then be used to make wishes by activating a coin and right-clicking the fountain or well. Failure to cast uses 6 favor. Courier is also used on a strange device to create one of the four types of turrets: Acid turret - Cast inside caves . Frost turret - Cast near water . Fire turret - Cast near a glowing item or by lava . Lightning turret - Cast high upon a mountain. Priests of Libila have an equivalent spell with the same function called Dark messenger .', '<p>This spell is available at 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>. It is used to enchant a mailbox to allow them to send and receive <a href=\"/index.php/Mail\" title=\"Mail\">mail</a> between players.\n</p>\n<p>The power and effect of spell is given in the bracket [x] Ranging from 0 to 104. \n</p>\n<p>The spell can be cast multiple times to try to improve the effect of it; failure does not destroy the mailbox. Success of casting the spell depends on your channeling skill. A higher power increases how keen (fast) the Messengers are to work for you. In other words, mail is delivered faster if the mailbox has a higher cast on it. The amount of time this takes is <b>101 minutes - enchant power</b>. \n</p>\n<p>A cast of 70 will result in a approximate delivery time of 1/2 hour. \n</p>\n<p>Courier can also be cast on fountains and wells to turn them into <a href=\"/index.php/Wishing_well\" title=\"Wishing well\">wishing wells</a>, which can then be used to make wishes by activating a coin and right-clicking the fountain or well.\n</p>\n<p>Failure to cast uses 6 favor.\n</p>\n<p>Courier is also used on a <a href=\"/index.php/Strange_device\" title=\"Strange device\">strange device</a> to create one of the four types of turrets:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Acid_turret\" title=\"Acid turret\">Acid turret</a> - Cast inside <a href=\"/index.php/Cave\" title=\"Cave\">caves</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Frost_turret\" title=\"Frost turret\">Frost turret</a> - Cast near <a href=\"/index.php/Water\" title=\"Water\">water</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fire_turret\" title=\"Fire turret\">Fire turret</a> - Cast near a <a href=\"/index.php/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\">glowing item</a> or by <a href=\"/index.php/Lava\" title=\"Lava\">lava</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Lightning_turret\" title=\"Lightning turret\">Lightning turret</a> - Cast high upon a mountain.</li></ul>\n<p>Priests of <a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a> have an equivalent spell with the same function called <a href=\"/index.php/Dark_messenger\" title=\"Dark messenger\">Dark messenger</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(19822, 5060, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click on the item you wish to enchant. Select Spells > Courier', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click on the item you wish to enchant.</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Courier</i></li></ol>', 1),
(19827, 5062, 'Description', 'Description', 'A fine sandwich.', '<p><i>A fine sandwich.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(19828, 5062, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Endurance sandwiches will restore stamina when eaten. This makes sandwiches very useful for climbing and other stamina intensive actions and activities. The amount of stamina restored depends on the quality of the sandwich. Endurance sandwiches can be eaten when full, though only one bite will be consumed per action. Topping QL determines success chance. Bread QL determines maximum QL of sandwich. Endurance sandwiches have a nutritional value of 60% regardless of QL. Does not give a temporary affinity as other cooked meals do. Other types of sandwiches exist; they refill stamina as well as giving a temporary affinity, but cannot be consumed when full.', '<ul><li>Endurance sandwiches will restore <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stamina\" title=\"Stamina\">stamina</a> when eaten. This makes sandwiches very useful for <a href=\"/index.php/Climbing\" title=\"Climbing\">climbing</a> and other stamina intensive actions and activities. The amount of stamina restored depends on the quality of the sandwich.</li>\n<li>Endurance sandwiches can be eaten when full, though only one bite will be consumed per action.</li>\n<li>Topping QL determines success chance.</li>\n<li>Bread QL determines maximum QL of sandwich.</li>\n<li>Endurance sandwiches have a <a href=\"/index.php/Nutrition\" title=\"Nutrition\">nutritional</a> value of 60% regardless of QL.</li>\n<li>Does not give a temporary affinity as other <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooked meals</a> do.</li>\n<li>Other types of sandwiches exist; they refill stamina as well as giving a temporary affinity, but cannot be consumed when full.</li></ul>', 1),
(19829, 5064, 'Description', 'Description', 'Marsh is a form of vegetation similar to grass found close to or under water . However, its uses are more restricted.', '<p><b>Marsh</b> is a form of vegetation similar to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Grass\" title=\"Grass\">grass</a> found close to or under <a href=\"/index.php/Water_tile\" title=\"Water tile\">water</a>. However, its uses are more restricted.\n</p>', 0),
(19830, 5064, 'Reclaiming', 'Reclaiming', 'Digging marsh with a shovel does not convert it into dirt as it does with grass. It can only be converted into other tile types by paving it with floor boards , after which it can be unpaved and will become a dirt tile that can be paved as usual.', '<p>Digging marsh with a <a href=\"/index.php/Shovel\" title=\"Shovel\">shovel</a> does not convert it into <a href=\"/index.php/Dirt_tile\" title=\"Dirt tile\">dirt</a> as it does with grass. It can only be converted into other tile types by paving it with <a href=\"/index.php/Floor_board\" title=\"Floor board\">floor boards</a>, after which it can be unpaved and will become a dirt tile that can be <a href=\"/index.php/Paving\" title=\"Paving\">paved</a> as usual.\n</p>', 1),
(19831, 5064, 'Tips', 'Tips', 'Marsh does not spread to any other tiles. The following types of Resource nodes can spawn on Marsh tiles: Swampy puddle , Rotting wood , Mints , Mineral debris , Umbellifers , Nightshades , Vines and Critter nest .', '<ul><li>Marsh does not spread to any other tiles.</li>\n<li>The following types of <a href=\"/index.php/Resource_nodes\" title=\"Resource nodes\">Resource nodes</a> can spawn on Marsh tiles: <a href=\"/index.php/Swampy_puddle\" title=\"Swampy puddle\">Swampy puddle</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Rotting_wood\" title=\"Rotting wood\">Rotting wood</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mints\" title=\"Mints\">Mints</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mineral_debris\" title=\"Mineral debris\">Mineral debris</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Umbellifers\" title=\"Umbellifers\">Umbellifers</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Nightshades\" title=\"Nightshades\">Nightshades</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Vines\" title=\"Vines\">Vines</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Critter_nest\" title=\"Critter nest\">Critter nest</a>.</li></ul>', 2),
(19840, 3517, 'Description', 'Description', 'A few handfuls of pumpkin seed. It can be used to sow with, but pumpkins can be quite hard to grow to acceptable quality.', '<p><i>A few handfuls of pumpkin seed. It can be used to sow with, but pumpkins can be quite hard to grow to acceptable quality.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(19841, 3517, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Pumpkin seeds are a farming product used to grow Pumpkins .', '<ul><li><b>Pumpkin seeds</b> are a <a href=\"/index.php/Farming\" title=\"Farming\">farming</a> product used to grow <a href=\"/index.php/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkins</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(19842, 3517, 'Method', 'Method', 'Pumpkin seeds can be sown on a dirt tile to grow Pumpkins . To get a seed, right-click a Pumpkin and choose Crush . The Pumpkin must be full weight (1.00 kg). Pumpkin seeds can also be found by Foraging at Animal burrow and Critter nest Resource nodes .', '<ul><li>Pumpkin seeds can be <a href=\"/index.php/Farming\" title=\"Farming\">sown</a> on a <a href=\"/index.php/Dirt_tile\" title=\"Dirt tile\">dirt tile</a> to grow <a href=\"/index.php/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkins</a>.</li>\n<li>To get a seed, right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a> and choose <i>Crush</i>. The Pumpkin must be full weight (1.00 kg).</li>\n<li>Pumpkin seeds can also be found by <a href=\"/index.php/Foraging\" title=\"Foraging\">Foraging</a> at <a href=\"/index.php/Animal_burrow\" title=\"Animal burrow\">Animal burrow</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Critter_nest\" title=\"Critter nest\">Critter nest</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Resource_nodes\" title=\"Resource nodes\">Resource nodes</a>.</li></ul>', 2);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(19845, 5069, 'Types', 'Types', 'Seed Use Edible Finding Method Barley [1] flour , healing cover (potency 2) botanizing Cabbage seeds cabbage Pick seeds Carrot seeds carrot Pick seeds Corn [2] cooking , cooking oil , healing cover (potency 1) foraging Cotton seeds cotton , cooking oil no Pick seeds Cucumber seeds cucumber Pick seeds Lettuce seeds Lettuce Pick seeds Oats [1] flour botanizing Onion [2] cooking foraging Paprika seeds cooking Pick seeds Peas [2] pea pod , cooking Pick seeds Potato [2] cooking foraging Pumpkin seeds pumpkin Pick seeds Reed seeds Reed plants No Pick seeds Rice Rice Farming , foraging Rye [1] flour botanizing Strawberry seeds strawberries Pick seeds Sugar beet seeds sugar beet Pick seeds Tomato seeds tomato Pick seeds Turmeric seeds cooking Pick seeds Wemp seeds wemp plants ( ropes and bow string ) no Pick seeds Wheat [1] flour , healing cover (potency 1) botanizing ↑ 1.0 1.1 1.2 1.3 Needs to be harvested using a scythe . Also considered a cereal in Wurm. ↑ 2.0 2.1 2.2 2.3 Considered a vegetable in Wurm.', '<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Seed</th>\n<th>Use</th>\n<th><a href=\"/index.php/Food\" title=\"Food\">Edible</a></th>\n<th>Finding Method\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Barley\" title=\"Barley\">Barley</a></b><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-cereal_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-cereal-1\">[1]</a></sup></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Flour\" title=\"Flour\">flour</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing cover</a> (potency 2)</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Green-check.png\"><img alt=\"Green-check.png\" data-file-height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"20\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/20px-Green-check.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/30px-Green-check.png 1.5x, /images/b/b3/Green-check.png 2x\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" width=\"20\"/></a></div></div></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Botanizing\" title=\"Botanizing\">botanizing</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Cabbage_seeds\" title=\"Cabbage seeds\">Cabbage seeds</a></b></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cabbage\" title=\"Cabbage\">cabbage</a></td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Green-check.png\"><img alt=\"Green-check.png\" data-file-height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"20\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/20px-Green-check.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/30px-Green-check.png 1.5x, /images/b/b3/Green-check.png 2x\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" width=\"20\"/></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Pick seeds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Carrot_seeds\" title=\"Carrot seeds\">Carrot seeds</a></b></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Carrot\" title=\"Carrot\">carrot</a></td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Green-check.png\"><img alt=\"Green-check.png\" data-file-height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"20\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/20px-Green-check.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/30px-Green-check.png 1.5x, /images/b/b3/Green-check.png 2x\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" width=\"20\"/></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Pick seeds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Corn\" title=\"Corn\">Corn</a></b><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-veggie_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-veggie-2\">[2]</a></sup></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking_oil\" title=\"Cooking oil\">cooking oil</a>, healing cover (potency 1)</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Green-check.png\"><img alt=\"Green-check.png\" data-file-height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"20\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/20px-Green-check.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/30px-Green-check.png 1.5x, /images/b/b3/Green-check.png 2x\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" width=\"20\"/></a></div></div></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Foraging\" title=\"Foraging\">foraging</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Cotton_seeds\" title=\"Cotton seeds\">Cotton seeds</a></b></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cotton\" title=\"Cotton\">cotton</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking_oil\" title=\"Cooking oil\">cooking oil</a></td>\n<td>no</td>\n<td>Pick seeds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Cucumber_seeds\" title=\"Cucumber seeds\">Cucumber seeds</a></b></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cucumber\" title=\"Cucumber\">cucumber</a></td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Green-check.png\"><img alt=\"Green-check.png\" data-file-height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"20\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/20px-Green-check.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/30px-Green-check.png 1.5x, /images/b/b3/Green-check.png 2x\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" width=\"20\"/></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Pick seeds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Lettuce_seeds\" title=\"Lettuce seeds\">Lettuce seeds</a></b></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Lettuce\" title=\"Lettuce\">Lettuce</a></td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Green-check.png\"><img alt=\"Green-check.png\" data-file-height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"20\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/20px-Green-check.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b3/Green-check.png/30px-Green-check.png 1.5x, /images/b/b3/Green-check.png 2x\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" width=\"20\"/></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Pick seeds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/index.php/Oats\" title=\"Oats\">Oats</a></b><sup class=\"refere