(20401, 5190, 'Types of Doors', 'Types_of_Doors', 'These are the door types you can build on a house. Gates may also be considered a type of door and may be built inside houses.\nTo build a door, activate a hammer , mallet , or trowel and right click the wall plan . Select Build and a door type. Wooden Doors Wooden door Wooden double doors Wooden portcullis Wooden canopy Log Doors Log canopy Log door Log double door Hardwood Log Doors Hardwood log canopy Hardwood log door Hardwood log double door Bark Log Doors Bark log canopy Bark log door Bark log double door Rustic Log Doors Rustic log canopy Rustic log door Rustic log double door Plain Stone Doors Plain stone door Plain stone double door Plain stone portcullis Stone Doors Stone double door Stone door Stone portcullis Timber Framed Doors Timber framed door Timber framed double door Sandstone Doors Sandstone double door Sandstone door Sandstone portcullis Slate Doors Slate double door Slate door Slate portcullis Rendered Doors Rendered double door Rendered door Rendered portcullis Rounded Stone Doors Rounded stone double door Rounded stone door Rounded stone portcullis Pottery Doors Pottery double door Pottery door Pottery portcullis Marble Doors Marble double door Marble door Marble portcullis', '<p>These are the door types you can build on a house. <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Gates\" title=\"Category:Gates\">Gates</a> may also be considered a type of door and may be built inside houses.\nTo build a door, activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a>, or <a href=\"/index.php/Trowel\" title=\"Trowel\">trowel</a> and right click the <a href=\"/index.php/Wall_plan\" title=\"Wall plan\">wall plan</a>. Select <i>Build</i> and a door type.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Wooden_Doors\">Wooden Doors</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed-hover\">\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 200px\"><div style=\"width: