(20422, 5049, 'Pictures and Material Requirements', 'Pictures_and_Material_Requirements', 'Chain Armour Iron chain armour Steel chain armour Brass chain armour Bronze chain armour Copper chain armour Lead chain armour Tin chain armour Zinc chain armour Gold chain armour Silver chain armour Adamantine chain armour Glimmersteel chain armour Seryll chain armour Creation requirements: Chain coif 0.40 kg Chain jacket 2.20 kg Chain sleeve 0.70 kg Chain gauntlet 0.30 kg Chain pants 2.20 kg Chain boot 0.70 kg Full Set	        8.20 kg Cloth Armour \"Classic\"/original full cloth jacket set: Blue cloth hood , red cloth jacket , red striped cloth sleeves cloth pants , cloth gloves , cloth shoes \"Classic\"/original full cloth shirt set: Blue cloth hood , cloth shirt , red striped cloth sleeves cloth pants , cloth gloves , cloth shoes Black clothes: Black belted vest , black cloth sleeves black cloth pants Red clothes: Red cloth tunic , red cloth sleeves Green clothes: Green cloth tunic , green cloth sleeves green cloth pants Dyeable clothes (shown without dye): White cloth hood , White cloth jacket , plain white cloth pants Patchwork pants shown with cloth shirt Brown striped breeches shown with cloth shirt Dragon Scale Armour Creation Material Requirements Dragon scale jacket - 2.20 kg Dragon scale pants - 1.20 kg Dragon scale boot - 0.50 kg Dragon scale sleeve - 0.40 kg Dragon scale glove - 0.30 kg Full Set - 5.80 kg Notes Dragon scale armour is improved with regular leather . There is no head protection piece made from scale. Different color scales can be combined, but the color of scale will be the one that is currently active . Drake Hide Armour Black drake Blue drake Green drake Red drake White drake Creation requirements Drake hide jacket - 0.60 kg Drake hide pants - 0.50 kg Drake hide boot - 0.40 kg Drake hide cap - 0.30 kg Drake hide sleeve - 0.30 kg Drake hide glove - 0.20 kg Full Set (No cap) - 2.90 kg Full Set (With cap) - 3.20 kg Leather Armour Plate Armour Iron p