lepics.png\" title=\"Comparison of different scale armour colors on male wurmian.\"><img alt=\"Comparison of different scale armour colors on male wurmian.\" data-file-height=\"295\" data-file-width=\"733\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"295\" src=\"/images/e/e1/Scalepics.png\" width=\"733\"/></a>\n</p><p><b>Creation Material Requirements</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Dragon_scale_jacket\" title=\"Dragon scale jacket\">Dragon scale jacket</a> - 2.20 kg</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Dragon_scale_pants\" title=\"Dragon scale pants\">Dragon scale pants</a> - 1.20 kg</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Dragon_scale_boot\" title=\"Dragon scale boot\">Dragon scale boot</a> - 0.50 kg</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Dragon_scale_sleeve\" title=\"Dragon scale sleeve\">Dragon scale sleeve</a> - 0.40 kg</li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Dragon_scale_glove\" title=\"Dragon scale glove\">Dragon scale glove</a> - 0.30 kg</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Full Set - 5.80 kg</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Notes</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Dragon scale armour is <a href=\"/index.php/Improve\" title=\"Improve\">improved</a> with regular <a href=\"/index.php/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">leather</a>.</li>\n<li>There is no head protection piece made from scale.</li>\n<li>Different color scales can be combined, but the color of scale will be the one that is currently <a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">active</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drake_Hide_Armour\">Drake Hide Armour</span></h3>\n<div class=\"toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width:relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n<p><br/>\n<a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Drake_hide_armour.jpg\" title=\"A male player wearing a full set of black drake hide armour.\"><img alt=\"A male player wearing a full set of black drake hide armour.\" data-file-height=\"715\" data-file-width=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"179\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/07/Drake_hide_armour.jpg/200px-Drake_hide_armour.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/07/Drake_hide_armour.jpg/300px-Drake_hide_armour.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/07/Drake_hide_armour.jpg/400px-Drake_hide_armour.jpg 2x\" width=\"200\"/></a>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:50.5px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Black_drake.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"914\" data-file-width=\"333\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"329\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/0f/Black_drake.jpg/120px-Black_drake.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/0f/Black_drake.jpg/180px-Black_drake.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/0f/Black_drake.jpg/240px-Black_drake.jpg 2x\" width=\"120\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Black drake\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:47px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Blue_drake.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"888\" data-file-width=\"317\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"336\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/40/Blue_drake.jpg/120px-Blue_drake.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/40/Blue_drake.jpg/180px-Blue_drake.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/40/Blue_drake.jpg/240px-Blue_drake.jpg 2x\" width=\"120\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Blue drake\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:39px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Green_drake.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"907\" data-file-width=\"309\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"352\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/be/Green_drake.jpg/120px-Green_drake.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/be/Green_drake.jpg/180px-Green_drake.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/be/Green_drake.jpg/240px-Green_drake