/470px-Armormetals-plate-glimmersteel-basinet.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c9/Armormetals-plate-glimmersteel-basinet.jpg/626px-Armormetals-plate-glimmersteel-basinet.jpg 2x\" width=\"209\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 189px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Glimmersteel plate armour with basinet helm\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 210.66666666667px\"><div style=\"width: 210.66666666667px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 208.66666666667px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Armormetals-plate-seryll-open.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"991\" data-file-width=\"827\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/aa/Armormetals-plate-seryll-open.jpg/313px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-open.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/aa/Armormetals-plate-seryll-open.jpg/470px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-open.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/aa/Armormetals-plate-seryll-open.jpg/626px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-open.jpg 2x\" width=\"209\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 189px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Seryll plate armour with open helm\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 210.66666666667px\"><div style=\"width: 210.66666666667px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 208.66666666667px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Armormetals-plate-seryll-great.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"991\" data-file-width=\"827\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/Armormetals-plate-seryll-great.jpg/313px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-great.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9f/Armormetals-plate-seryll-great.jpg/470px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-great.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9f/Armormetals-plate-seryll-great.jpg/626px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-great.jpg 2x\" width=\"209\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 189px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Seryll plate armour with great helm\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 210.66666666667px\"><div style=\"width: 210.66666666667px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 208.66666666667px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Armormetals-plate-seryll-basinet.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"991\" data-file-width=\"827\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/c7/Armormetals-plate-seryll-basinet.jpg/313px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-basinet.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/c7/Armormetals-plate-seryll-basinet.jpg/470px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-basinet.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/c7/Armormetals-plate-seryll-basinet.jpg/626px-Armormetals-plate-seryll-basinet.jpg 2x\" width=\"209\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytextwrapper\" style=\"width: 189px\"><div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>Seryll plate armour with basinet helm\n</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Creation requirements:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Basinet_helm\" title=\"Basinet helm\">Basinet helm</a>	1.78 kg</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Great_helm\" title=\"Great helm\">Great helm</a>        1.87 kg</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Open_helm\" title=\"Open helm\">Open helm</a>	        1.21 kg</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Breast_plate\" title=\"Breast plate\">Breast plate</a>	5.72 kg</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Plate_vambrace\" title=\"Plate vambrace\">Plate vambrace</a>	2.42 kg</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Plate_gauntlet\" title=\"Plate gauntlet\">Plate gauntlet</a>    0.88 kg</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Plate_leggings\" title=\"Plate leggings\">Plate leggings</a>	4.62 kg</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Plate_sabatons\" title=\"Plate sabatons\">Plate sabatons</a>	1.87 kg</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Studded_Leather_Armour\">Studded Leather Armour</span></h3>\n<div class=\"toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width:relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed-hover\">\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 238px\"><div style=\"width: 238px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 236px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Studded_leather_armour.jpg\"><img alt=\"Studded leather armour.jpg\" data-file-height=\"720\" data-file-width=\"680\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Studded_leather_armour.jpg/354px-Studded_leather_armour.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Studded_leather_armour.jpg/532px-Studded_leather_armour.jpg 1.5x, /images/f/f5/Studded_leather_armour.jpg 2x\" width=\"236\"/></a></div></div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 4);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(20423, 5049, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Category:Armour', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Armour\" title=\"Category:Armour\">Category:Armour</a></li></ul>', 5),
(20429, 3846, 'Current State', 'Current_State', 'Champions have been discontinued until further notice as of the update on July 05, 2022.', '<p>Champions have been discontinued until further notice as of the update on July 05, 2022.\n</p>', 0),
(20430, 3846, 'The Altar of Three text', 'The_Altar_of_Three_text', 'Your faith and soul are strong enough to become a Champion of <god>. \nThe decision to do this is dangerous. \nYou will immediately get a boost of power, granted by <god>. \nYou will get some temporary bonuses to your characteristics (5 points each) and certain other skills. \nYou will be able to withstand a lot more physical damage. \nChampions are expected to face dangers and assault the enemy. \nThis means that unless they enter enemy territory now and then they will lose certain powers. Your faith and favor will be set to max, and you may not lose or change deity.\nBut first and foremost, your name will live in the history of Wurm forever!', '<pre>Your faith and soul are strong enough to become a Champion of &lt;god&gt;. \nThe decision to do this is dangerous. \nYou will immediately get a boost of power, granted by &lt;god&gt;. \nYou will get some temporary bonuses to your characteristics (5 points each) and certain other skills. \nYou will be able to withstand a lot more physical damage. \nChampions are expected to face dangers and assault the enemy. \nThis means that unless they enter enemy territory now and then they will lose certain powers. \n</pre>\n<pre>Your faith and favor will be set to max, and you may not lose or change deity.\nBut first and foremost, your name will live in the history of Wurm forever!\n</pre>', 1),
(20431, 3846, 'Champion points', 'Champion_points', 'You start out with 0 champion points. You gain 3 points for draining an enemy deed with 5+ guards. You gain 30 points for being involved in a kill on an enemy champion. You gain 1 point when you record a kill on an enemy with 50+ fight skill. You may gain point like this 1 time per day from the same player and 10 times from the same player. You also get the champion points worth of any battle points you gain from any kill. You lose 1 champion point per week down to 0. You lose 1 champion point per successful item enchant spell. Losing champion status Champions have 3 lives. When they lose all 3 they are no longer a champion. When you lose champion status 1 point is removed from each characteristics skill in addition to the 5 you gained when you became champion. Prayer and Exorcism will be reset to 30, if you were above 30 when you champed. If you were below you will go back to the skill you were at. Your channeling is reset to what it was before. Faith is set to 50. You can only be a champion for a maximum of 6 months.  One month is 30 real life days. You can\'t become a champion again for the next real life 6 months. You can do /suicide to remove your championhood only on your last life.', '<ul><li>You start out with 0 champion points.</li>\n<li>You gain 3 points for draining an enemy deed with 5+ guards.</li>\n<li>You gain 30 points for being involved in a kill on an enemy champion.</li>\n<li>You gain 1 point when you record a kill on an enemy with 50+ fight skill. You may gain point like this 1 time per day from the same player and 10 times from the same player.</li>\n<li>You also get the champion points worth of any battle points you gain from any kill.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>You lose 1 champion point per week down to 0.</li>\n<li>You lose 1 champion point per successful item enchant spell.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Losing_champion_status\">Losing champion status</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Champions have 3 lives. When they lose all 3 they are no longer a champion.</li>\n<li>When you lose champion status 1 point is removed from each characteristics skill in addition to the 5 you gained when you became champion.</li>\n<li>Prayer and Exorcism will be reset to 30, if you were above 30 when you champed. If you were below you will go back to the skill you were at.</li>\n<li>Your channeling is reset to what it was before.</li>\n<li>Faith is set to 50.</li>\n<li>You can only be a champion for a maximum of 6 months.  One month is 30 real life days.</li>\n<li>You can\'t become a champion again for the next real life 6 months.</li>\n<li>You can do /suicide to remove your championhood only on your last life.</li></ul>', 2),
(20432, 3846, 'Becoming a champion', 'Becoming_a_champion', 'Becoming a champion is only possible on the Chaos server. To become a champion, you will need to be a priest with 50+ faith . If you are a follower of Fo or Vynora , you will need to have 25 soul depth . If you are a follower of Magranon or Libila , you will need to have 25 soul strength . Followers of the White Light gods have to visit the Altar of Three to become a champion. Followers of Libila have to visit the Bone Altar to become a champion. To trigger championhood you must right click the altar and press the alternative \"Realdeath\" Once you trigger championhood, a server wide event message is spread informing everybody on the server that you are now a champion. e.g <Player name> is now a Champion of <God name>!', '<ul><li>Becoming a champion is only possible on the <a href=\"/index.php/Chaos\" title=\"Chaos\">Chaos</a> server.</li>\n<li>To become a champion, you will need to be a <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priest</a> with 50+ <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>.</li>\n<li>If you are a follower of <a href=\"/index.php/Fo\" title=\"Fo\">Fo</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a>, you will need to have 25 <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_depth\" title=\"Soul depth\">soul depth</a>.</li>\n<li>If you are a follower of <a href=\"/index.php/Magranon\" title=\"Magranon\">Magranon</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a>, you will need to have 25 <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_strength\" title=\"Soul strength\">soul strength</a>.</li>\n<li>Followers of the <a href=\"/index.php/White_Light\" title=\"White Light\">White Light</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Gods\" title=\"Gods\">gods</a> have to visit the <a href=\"/index.php/Altar_of_Three\" title=\"Altar of Three\">Altar of Three</a> to become a champion.</li>\n<li>Followers of <a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a> have to visit the <a href=\"/index.php/Bone_Altar\" title=\"Bone Altar\">Bone Altar</a> to become a champion.</li>\n<li>To trigger championhood you must right click the altar and press the alternative \"Realdeath\"</li>\n<li>Once you trigger championhood, a server wide event message is spread informing everybody on the server that you are now a champion.</li></ul>\n<p>e.g <i>&lt;Player name&gt; is now a Champion of &lt;God name&gt;!</i>\n</p>', 3),
(20433, 3846, 'Bonuses', 'Bonuses', '+5 to all characteristics skills. Faith set to 99.99 (you can continue to pray & gain faith, but only at about 0.000010). You can however sermon and gain faith as normal. Faith bonus is set to 50 when not in another gods influence. 50 is added to all of the skills Praying , Channeling and exorcism , up to a maximum of 80. You receive a 60% damage reduction bonus which stacks with armour, so you will take lower damage wounds from hits compared to a normal player. You will get a new title : Champion of <your god>(this title can not be turned off, but it does not affect other titles. So you can be a \'Blacksmith Champion of Fo\' for example). You can\'t lose your deity. On death, you will not lose any battle rank .', '<ul><li>+5 to all <a href=\"/index.php/Characteristics\" title=\"Characteristics\">characteristics</a> skills.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">Faith</a> set to 99.99 (you can continue to pray &amp; gain faith, but only at about 0.000010). You can however sermon and gain faith as normal.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Faith_bonus\" title=\"Faith bonus\">Faith bonus</a> is set to 50 when not in another gods influence.</li>\n<li>50 is added to all of the skills <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Praying\" title=\"Praying\">Praying</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Channeling\" title=\"Channeling\">Channeling</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Exorcism\" title=\"Exorcism\">exorcism</a>, up to a maximum of 80.</li>\n<li>You receive a 60% damage reduction bonus which stacks with armour, so you will take lower damage wounds from hits compared to a normal player.</li>\n<li>You will get a new <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Title\" title=\"Title\">title</a>: Champion of &lt;your god&gt;(this title can not be turned off, but it does not affect other titles. So you can be a \'Blacksmith Champion of Fo\' for example).</li>\n<li>You can\'t lose your deity.</li>\n<li>On death, you will not lose any <a href=\"/index.php/Battle_rank\" title=\"Battle rank\">battle rank</a>.</li></ul>', 4),
(20463, 2571, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small pointy wooden stick used to mould and make decorations in clay.', '<p><i>A small pointy wooden stick used to mould and make decorations in clay.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(20464, 2571, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used to finish or improve clay pottery items.', '<ul><li>Used to finish or improve <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery\" title=\"Pottery\">pottery</a> items.</li></ul>', 1),
(20465, 2571, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Spatula', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Spatula\" title=\"Spatula\">Spatula</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20466, 4520, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'If repairing requires raw materials like a plank , log , stone shards , wood scrap or stone brick , activate the material needed first, then right-click the structure Vynora priests can use the Mend spell to repair otherwise unrepairable items. If you try to repair a house wall within some other deed\'s perimeter, you will get the error message \"<Deed Name> does not allow that.\" The timer on repairing is affected by your mind logic and repairing skill. The amount of QL reduction from repairing is affected by your repair skill in comparison to the items QL.', '<ul><li>If repairing requires <a href=\"/index.php/Raw_materials\" title=\"Raw materials\">raw materials</a> like a <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">log</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_shards\" title=\"Stone shards\">stone shards</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wood_scrap\" title=\"Wood scrap\">wood scrap</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">stone brick</a>, activate the material needed first, then right-click the structure</li>\n<li>Vynora priests can use the <a href=\"/index.php/Mend\" title=\"Mend\">Mend</a> spell to repair otherwise unrepairable items.</li>\n<li>If you try to repair a house wall within some other deed\'s perimeter, you will get the error message \"&lt;Deed Name&gt; does not allow that.\"</li>\n<li>The timer on repairing is affected by your <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">mind logic</a> and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>The amount of QL reduction from repairing is affected by your repair skill in comparison to the items QL.</li></ul>', 0),
(20467, 4520, 'Materials and damage reduction', 'Materials_and_damage_reduction', 'Each material used will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. Material Structure/Item Clay all variations of rendered fence Log Wooden palisade gate , Palisade Marble brick Marble wall /door/window, etc., all variations of Marble fence Plank Crude wooden fence , Wooden fence , Wooden fence gate , Low rope fence / High rope fence , Wooden house walls /windows/doors/roofs Pottery brick Pottery brick wall /windows/doors, etc, all variations of Pottery fence Rounded stone Rounded stone walls /windows/doors, all variations of Rounded stone fence Stone shards Stone wall , low stone wall Stone brick All variations of Chain fence , all variations of Iron fence , Tall stone wall , Stone house walls /windows/doors, Plain stone walls /windows/doors. Rendered walls /windows/doors Sandstone brick Sandstone wall , all variations of Sandstone fence Slate brick Slate brick walls /windows/doors, all variations of Slate fence Wood scrap Woven fence Not an all-inclusive list - please add any additional items/materials to the above table that are not included.', '<p>Each material used will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<th>Structure/Item\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">Clay</a></td>\n<td>all variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_fence\" title=\"Rendered fence\">rendered fence</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Log\" title=\"Log\">Log</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_palisade_gate\" title=\"Wooden palisade gate\">Wooden palisade gate</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Palisade\" title=\"Palisade\">Palisade</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_brick\" title=\"Marble brick\">Marble brick</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Marble_wall\" title=\"Marble wall\">Marble wall</a>/door/window, etc., all variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Marble_fence\" title=\"Marble fence\">Marble fence</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">Plank</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Crude_wooden_fence\" title=\"Crude wooden fence\">Crude wooden fence</a>,<a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_fence\" title=\"Wooden fence\">Wooden fence</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_fence_gate\" title=\"Wooden fence gate\">Wooden fence gate</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Low_rope_fence\" title=\"Low rope fence\">Low rope fence</a>/<a href=\"/index.php/High_rope_fence\" title=\"High rope fence\">High rope fence</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_house_wall\" title=\"Wooden house wall\">Wooden house walls</a>/windows/doors/roofs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_brick\" title=\"Pottery brick\">Pottery brick</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_brick_wall\" title=\"Pottery brick wall\">Pottery brick wall</a>/windows/doors, etc, all variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery_fence\" title=\"Pottery fence\">Pottery fence</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone\" title=\"Rounded stone\">Rounded stone</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_wall\" title=\"Rounded stone wall\">Rounded stone walls</a>/windows/doors, all variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Rounded_stone_fence\" title=\"Rounded stone fence\">Rounded stone fence</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_shards\" title=\"Stone shards\">Stone shards</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_wall\" title=\"Stone wall\">Stone wall</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Low_stone_wall\" title=\"Low stone wall\">low stone wall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_brick\" title=\"Stone brick\">Stone brick</a></td>\n<td>All variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Chain_fence\" title=\"Chain fence\">Chain fence</a>, all variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_fence\" title=\"Iron fence\">Iron fence</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Tall_stone_wall\" title=\"Tall stone wall\">Tall stone wall</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Stone_house_wall\" title=\"Stone house wall\">Stone house walls</a>/windows/doors, <a href=\"/index.php/Plain_stone_wall\" title=\"Plain stone wall\">Plain stone walls</a>/windows/doors. <a href=\"/index.php/Rendered_wall\" title=\"Rendered wall\">Rendered walls</a>/windows/doors\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_brick\" title=\"Sandstone brick\">Sandstone brick</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_wall\" title=\"Sandstone wall\">Sandstone wall</a>, all variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Sandstone_fence\" title=\"Sandstone fence\">Sandstone fence</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick\" title=\"Slate brick\">Slate brick</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Slate_brick_wall\" title=\"Slate brick wall\">Slate brick walls</a>/windows/doors, all variations of <a href=\"/index.php/Slate_fence\" title=\"Slate fence\">Slate fence</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wood_scrap\" title=\"Wood scrap\">Wood scrap</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Woven_fence\" title=\"Woven fence\">Woven fence</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i>Not an all-inclusive list - please add any additional items/materials to the above table that are not included.</i>\n</p>', 1),
(20468, 4520, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'Repairing Mind > Mind logic', '<ul><li>Repairing</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">Mind logic</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20469, 4520, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Repairman/Repairwoman at 50 skill Materia Tamer at 70 skill Master Fixer at 90 skill Damage Control at 100 skill', '<ul><li>Repairman/Repairwoman at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Materia Tamer at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Master Fixer at 90 skill</li>\n<li>Damage Control at 100 skill</li></ul>', 3),
(20479, 1494, 'Denominations', 'Denominations', 'The Bank of Wurm states the lowest currency unit in Wurm to be one iron coin (1i). Iron (i) Copper (c) Silver (s) Gold (g) 1 0.01 0.0001 0.000001 100 1 0.01 0.0001 10,000 100 1 0.01 1,000,000 10,000 100 1', '<p>The <b>Bank of Wurm</b> states the lowest currency unit in Wurm to be one iron coin (1i).\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"75\">Iron (i)\n</th>\n<th width=\"75\">Copper (c)\n</th>\n<th width=\"75\">Silver (s)\n</th>\n<th width=\"75\">Gold (g)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>0.0001</td>\n<td>0.000001\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>0.0001\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.01\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1,000,000</td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr></tbody></table>', 0),
(20480, 1494, 'Images', 'Images', 'Iron coin Copper coin Silver coin Gold coin', '<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 210px\"><div style=\"width: 210px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 205px;\"><div style=\"margin:77px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Iron_coin.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"267\" data-file-width=\"309\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"151\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a1/Iron_coin.png/175px-Iron_coin.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a1/Iron_coin.png/263px-Iron_coin.png 1.5x, /images/a/a1/Iron_coin.png 2x\" width=\"175\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Iron coin</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 210px\"><div style=\"width: 210px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 205px;\"><div style=\"margin:78.5px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Copper_coin.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"219\" data-file-width=\"259\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"148\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/eb/Copper_coin.png/175px-Copper_coin.png\" srcset=\"/images/e/eb/Copper_coin.png 1.5x\" width=\"175\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Copper coin</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 210px\"><div style=\"width: 210px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 205px;\"><div style=\"margin:78.5px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Silver_coin.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"281\" data-file-width=\"332\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"148\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/3c/Silver_coin.png/175px-Silver_coin.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3c/Silver_coin.png/263px-Silver_coin.png 1.5x, /images/3/3c/Silver_coin.png 2x\" width=\"175\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Silver coin</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 210px\"><div style=\"width: 210px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 205px;\"><div style=\"margin:74px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Gold_coin.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"273\" data-file-width=\"305\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"157\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d1/Gold_coin.png/175px-Gold_coin.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d1/Gold_coin.png/263px-Gold_coin.png 1.5x, /images/d/d1/Gold_coin.png 2x\" width=\"175\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Gold coin</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>', 1),
(20481, 1494, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Bank account Miron - the unit used in Wurm\'s economy logging system Shopping contains a calculator for adding up different amounts of coins. Good for working out just how much something will cost you.', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Bank_account\" title=\"Bank account\">Bank account</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Miron\" title=\"Miron\">Miron</a> - the unit used in Wurm\'s economy logging system</li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://spreadsheets.google.com/spreadsheet/ccc?key=0Ap6FPstOZmfTdGJyRXVlNEFtVGt6NmtYLWQxLW96QlE&amp;hl=en_US\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shopping</a> contains a calculator for adding up different amounts of coins. Good for working out just how much something will cost you.</li></ul>', 2),
(20482, 5214, 'Description', 'Description', 'A large spoon. It is used in some cooking recipes as a tool for stirring or blending ingredients.', '<p><i>A large spoon.</i>\n</p>\n<p>It is used in some <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> recipes as a tool for stirring or blending ingredients.\n</p>', 0),
(20483, 5214, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Can be made out of any metal .', '<ul><li>Can be made out of any <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Metal\" title=\"Metal\">metal</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(20484, 5214, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Cooking utensils', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cooking_utensils\" title=\"Cooking utensils\">Cooking utensils</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20488, 1391, 'Description', 'Description', 'A statue is a decorative item that can be made of a number of materials and is placed to decorate your deed or home.', '<p>A statue is a decorative item that can be made of a number of materials and is placed to decorate your deed or home. \n</p>', 0),
(20489, 1391, 'How to Create, Get, or Find Statues', 'How_to_Create.2C_Get.2C_or_Find_Statues', 'Statues in Wurm can be created or obtained in a wide variety of ways. Creation - Stonecutting Some statues are created with the stonecutting skill, using stone shards or marble shards . Statue of boy Statue of demon Statue of dog Statue of girl Statue of horse Statue of nymph Statue of Tich - the marble version of this statue is made with stone cutting. Statue of troll Creation - Jewelrysmithing These statuettes are small statues made using a forge and blacksmithing tools. Some are used for religious purposes. Statuette Statuette of Fo Statuette of Libila Statuette of Magranon Statuette of Vynora Creation - Masonry These are large statues created from colossus bricks , clay , and planks . Colossus Colossus of Fo Colossus of Magranon Colossus of Vynora Colossus of Libila Gifts/Special Events These statues were gifts for premium players for holidays or special events. Snowman statue - Given as a gift to premium players for Christmas 2018. Puzzle king\'s crystal ball - Obtained through the successful completion of the Puzzle Labyrinth Adventure on Xanadu. Challenge statue - Obtained previously on Chaos by completing challenges. Players now have a chance to receive one by purchasing a Gift pack at the token with Marks. Figurine of Grimbleat - Given as a gift to premium players for \"door knocking\" during the Halloween 2024 event. HOTA These statues are rewards for winning the Hunt of the Ancients on PVP servers. Hota statue Archaeology & Restoration These statues are created by finding and combining fragments discovered using archaeology . Statue of drake Statue of eagle Statue of Fo Statue of goblin Statue of guard Statue of hell horse Statue of jackal\'s revenge Statue of kyklops Statue of lava fiend Statue of libila Statue of magranon Statue of mountain lion Statue of pumpkin terror Statue of rift beast Statue of Tich - metal or marble versions of this statue are made with archaeology fragments. Statue of Unicorn Statue of Vynora Statue of worg These statuettes are small statues created by finding and combining fragments discovered using archaeology . Statuette of axeman Statuette of digger Statuette of miner Statuette of swordsman Treasure Hunt Statues These statues are found in treasure chests found by using treasure maps. Statue of crab Statue of octopus Statue of whale and dolphin Skinned Statuettes These statues are made by applying a skin (from the Loyalty program ) over a generic metal statuette. Dragon Statuette Bear Army Statuette Statuette of the Avenger', '<p>Statues in Wurm can be created or obtained in a wide variety of ways. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation_-_Stonecutting\">Creation - Stonecutting</span></h3>\n<p>Some statues are created with the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stonecutting\" title=\"Stonecutting\">stonecutting</a> skill, using <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stone_shard\" title=\"Stone shard\">stone shards</a> or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Marble_shard\" title=\"Marble shard\">marble shards</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_boy\" title=\"Statue of boy\">Statue of boy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_demon\" title=\"Statue of demon\">Statue of demon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_dog\" title=\"Statue of dog\">Statue of dog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_girl\" title=\"Statue of girl\">Statue of girl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_horse\" title=\"Statue of horse\">Statue of horse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_nymph\" title=\"Statue of nymph\">Statue of nymph</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_Tich\" title=\"Statue of Tich\">Statue of Tich</a> - the marble version of this statue is made with stone cutting.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_troll\" title=\"Statue of troll\">Statue of troll</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation_-_Jewelrysmithing\">Creation - Jewelrysmithing</span></h3>\n<p>These statuettes are small statues made using a forge and blacksmithing tools. Some are used for religious purposes.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">Statuette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Fo\" title=\"Statuette of Fo\">Statuette of Fo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Libila\" title=\"Statuette of Libila\">Statuette of Libila</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Magranon\" title=\"Statuette of Magranon\">Statuette of Magranon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Vynora\" title=\"Statuette of Vynora\">Statuette of Vynora</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation_-_Masonry\">Creation - Masonry</span></h3>\n<p>These are large statues created from <a href=\"/index.php/Colossus_brick\" title=\"Colossus brick\">colossus bricks</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Clay\" title=\"Clay\">clay</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">planks</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Colossus\" title=\"Colossus\">Colossus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Colossus_of_Fo\" title=\"Colossus of Fo\">Colossus of Fo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Colossus_of_Magranon\" title=\"Colossus of Magranon\">Colossus of Magranon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Colossus_of_Vynora\" title=\"Colossus of Vynora\">Colossus of Vynora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Colossus_of_Libila\" title=\"Colossus of Libila\">Colossus of Libila</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Gifts/Special_Events\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gifts.2FSpecial_Events\">Gifts/Special Events</span></h3>\n<p>These statues were gifts for premium players for holidays or special events.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Snowman_statue\" title=\"Snowman statue\">Snowman statue</a> - Given as a gift to premium players for Christmas 2018.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Puzzle_king%27s_crystal_ball\" title=\"Puzzle king\'s crystal ball\">Puzzle king\'s crystal ball</a> - Obtained through the successful completion of the Puzzle Labyrinth Adventure on Xanadu.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Challenge_statue\" title=\"Challenge statue\">Challenge statue</a> - Obtained previously on Chaos by completing challenges. Players now have a chance to receive one by purchasing a Gift pack at the token with Marks.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Figurine_of_Grimbleat\" title=\"Figurine of Grimbleat\">Figurine of Grimbleat</a> - Given as a gift to premium players for \"door knocking\" during the Halloween 2024 event.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"HOTA\">HOTA</span></h3>\n<p>These statues are rewards for winning the Hunt of the Ancients on PVP servers. \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Hota_statue\" title=\"Hota statue\">Hota statue</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Archaeology_&amp;_Restoration\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Archaeology_.26_Restoration\">Archaeology &amp; Restoration</span></h3>\n<p>These statues are created by finding and <a href=\"/index.php/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">combining</a> fragments discovered using <a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">archaeology</a>. \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_drake\" title=\"Statue of drake\">Statue of drake</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_eagle\" title=\"Statue of eagle\">Statue of eagle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_Fo\" title=\"Statue of Fo\">Statue of Fo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_goblin\" title=\"Statue of goblin\">Statue of goblin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_guard\" title=\"Statue of guard\">Statue of guard</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_hell_horse\" title=\"Statue of hell horse\">Statue of hell horse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_jackal%27s_revenge\" title=\"Statue of jackal\'s revenge\">Statue of jackal\'s revenge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_kyklops\" title=\"Statue of kyklops\">Statue of kyklops</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_lava_fiend\" title=\"Statue of lava fiend\">Statue of lava fiend</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_libila\" title=\"Statue of libila\">Statue of libila</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_magranon\" title=\"Statue of magranon\">Statue of magranon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_mountain_lion\" title=\"Statue of mountain lion\">Statue of mountain lion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_pumpkin_terror\" title=\"Statue of pumpkin terror\">Statue of pumpkin terror</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_rift_beast\" title=\"Statue of rift beast\">Statue of rift beast</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_Tich\" title=\"Statue of Tich\">Statue of Tich</a> - metal or marble versions of this statue are made with archaeology fragments.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_Unicorn\" title=\"Statue of Unicorn\">Statue of Unicorn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_Vynora\" title=\"Statue of Vynora\">Statue of Vynora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_worg\" title=\"Statue of worg\">Statue of worg</a></li></ul>\n<p>These statuettes are small statues created by finding and <a href=\"/index.php/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">combining</a> fragments discovered using <a href=\"/index.php/Archaeology\" title=\"Archaeology\">archaeology</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_axeman\" title=\"Statuette of axeman\">Statuette of axeman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_digger\" title=\"Statuette of digger\">Statuette of digger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_miner\" title=\"Statuette of miner\">Statuette of miner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_swordsman\" title=\"Statuette of swordsman\">Statuette of swordsman</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Treasure_Hunt_Statues\">Treasure Hunt Statues</span></h3>\n<p>These statues are found in treasure chests found by using treasure maps.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_crab\" title=\"Statue of crab\">Statue of crab</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_octopus\" title=\"Statue of octopus\">Statue of octopus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statue_of_whale_and_dolphin\" title=\"Statue of whale and dolphin\">Statue of whale and dolphin</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Skinned_Statuettes\">Skinned Statuettes</span></h3>\n<p>These statues are made by applying a skin (from the <a href=\"/index.php/Loyalty_program\" title=\"Loyalty program\">Loyalty program</a>) over a generic metal statuette. \n</p>\n<ul><li>Dragon Statuette</li>\n<li>Bear Army Statuette</li>\n<li>Statuette of the Avenger</li></ul>', 1),
(20504, 3445, 'Description', 'Description', 'A nice orange pumpkin.', '<p><i>A nice orange pumpkin.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(20505, 3445, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used in the construction of a practice doll . Can be used in cooking to make heavy meals as it adds 1kg of weight and is counted as a vegetable. Can be used to create a jack-o-lantern . Has a potency of 1 when used to create a healing cover .', '<ul><li>Used in the construction of a <a href=\"/index.php/Practice_doll\" title=\"Practice doll\">practice doll</a>.</li>\n<li>Can be used in <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> to make heavy meals as it adds 1kg of weight and is counted as a vegetable.</li>\n<li>Can be used to create a <a href=\"/index.php/Carved_pumpkin\" title=\"Carved pumpkin\">jack-o-lantern</a>.</li>\n<li>Has a potency of 1 when used to create a <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing cover</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(20506, 3445, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Crush to get pumpkin seeds which can then be sown . During Halloween, the pumpkin model is usually changed to that of a Jack-O-Lantern . The item itself does not change, unless carved (see carved pumpkin ). Pumpkins can also be found by Botanizing at Vines Resource nodes .', '<ul><li>Crush to get <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Pumpkin_seed\" title=\"Pumpkin seed\">pumpkin seeds</a> which can then be <a href=\"/index.php/Farming\" title=\"Farming\">sown</a>.</li>\n<li>During Halloween, the pumpkin model is usually changed to that of a <a href=\"/index.php/Carved_pumpkin\" title=\"Carved pumpkin\">Jack-O-Lantern</a>. The item itself does not change, unless carved (see <a href=\"/index.php/Carved_pumpkin\" title=\"Carved pumpkin\">carved pumpkin</a>).</li>\n<li>Pumpkins can also be found by <a href=\"/index.php/Botanizing\" title=\"Botanizing\">Botanizing</a> at <a href=\"/index.php/Vines\" title=\"Vines\">Vines</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Resource_nodes\" title=\"Resource nodes\">Resource nodes</a>.</li></ul>', 2),
(20507, 5221, 'Purpose', 'Purpose', 'The test server exists to test large game updates before they are added to the main servers. The test server is also used to test new Wurm client releases. The test client connects to the test server. This client may have bugs, crashes and bad performance. It can be accessed through the launcher.', '<ul><li>The test server exists to test large game updates before they are added to the main servers.</li>\n<li>The test server is also used to test new Wurm client releases.</li>\n<li>The test client connects to the test server. This client may have bugs, crashes and bad performance. It can be accessed through the launcher.</li></ul>', 0),
(20508, 5221, 'Test server Rules and Instructions', 'Test_server_Rules_and_Instructions', 'On the test server, there is no need to register an account, just fill in a name and password. Things you do on this server will not affect your character on the normal server. The test server may be reset or restarted at any time, without any warning. Make sure you read the forum thread here as it has important information and rules.', '<ul><li>On the test server, there is no need to register an account, just fill in a name and password. Things you do on this server will not affect your character on the normal server. The test server may be reset or restarted at any time, without any warning.</li>\n<li>Make sure you read the forum thread <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/152678-test-server-guide/\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a> as it has important information and rules.</li></ul>', 1),
(20509, 5221, 'Current test sessions', 'Current_test_sessions', 'All current test sessions are now shown on the forums found here : http://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/forum/127-public-test-board/', '<ul><li>All current test sessions are now shown on the forums found here : <a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/forum/127-public-test-board/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/forum/127-public-test-board/</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20510, 5221, 'Previous test sessions', 'Previous_test_sessions', 'These sessions were done a long time ago and the list itself was never updated. Please see the link for current sessions above for more recent tests. Religion System Update See thread Boats & Archery Able to make and test boats Testing archery Fighting fix (07-10-23 to 07-11-22) Features in testing: New fighting system The Guide Mol-Rehan Ridable carts and boats Improvements to unique animals The new fighting system was quite extensive: Combat window Autofight and manual fighting options Stealth Sparring and duelling Targeting Stances Explicit distance and footing Special moves Kill-based skillgain for the main fighting skill PVP death penalty affects fighting skill only Normalized wounds (100 damage = 100% health loss) Health display', '<p>These sessions were done a long time ago and the list itself was never updated. Please see the link for current sessions above for more recent tests.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Religion_System_Update\">Religion System Update</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://wurmonline.com/forum/index.php?topic=27021.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">See thread</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Boats_&amp;_Archery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Boats_.26_Archery\">Boats &amp; Archery</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Able to make and test boats</li>\n<li>Testing archery</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Fighting_fix_(07-10-23_to_07-11-22)\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fighting_fix_.2807-10-23_to_07-11-22.29\">Fighting fix (07-10-23 to 07-11-22)</span></h3>\n<p>Features in testing: \n</p>\n<ul><li>New <a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">fighting</a> system</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/index.php/Guide\" title=\"Guide\">Guide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mol-Rehan\" title=\"Mol-Rehan\">Mol-Rehan</a></li>\n<li>Ridable carts and boats</li>\n<li>Improvements to <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Unique_creatures\" title=\"Category:Unique creatures\">unique</a> animals</li></ul>\n<p>The new fighting system was quite extensive:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Combat window</li>\n<li>Autofight and manual fighting options</li>\n<li>Stealth</li>\n<li>Sparring and duelling</li>\n<li>Targeting</li>\n<li>Stances</li>\n<li>Explicit distance and footing</li>\n<li>Special moves</li>\n<li>Kill-based skillgain for the main fighting skill</li>\n<li>PVP death penalty affects fighting skill only</li>\n<li>Normalized wounds (100 damage = 100% health loss)</li>\n<li>Health display</li></ul>', 3),
(20514, 5223, 'Description', 'Description', 'Retirement for the Old and Insane is a size 20 village located on the South East of the Mol-Rehan Home server and\n```Woodscove`` MR-Wild', '<p><b>Retirement for the Old and Insane</b> is a size 20 <a href=\"/index.php/Settlement\" title=\"Settlement\">village</a> located on the South East of the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mol-Rehan_Home\" title=\"Mol-Rehan Home\">Mol-Rehan Home</a> server and\n```Woodscove`` MR-Wild\n</p>', 0),
(20515, 5223, 'Citizens', 'Citizens', 'Mayor Dadd [Lumberjack] [Mason] [Miner] [Digger] [Handyman] Elders Maximustehgreat [Digger] [Excavator] [Lumberjack] [Mason] [handyman] [Trollslayer] [Miner] [Archer] Spyfox [Miner] [Mason] [Handyman] [Digger] [Trollslayer] Sinner [Giantslayer] Ruthie Violet [Mason] [Digger] [Tanner] [Trollslayer] Fooli [Digger] [Trollslayer] [Miner] Crazybill [Digger] [Excavator] [Land shaper] [handyman] [Miner] Active Citizens Sixiron Forrestgrump Mevin Spirit Riverboy Drega Tantrum Rosie', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mayor\">Mayor</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Dadd\" title=\"Player:Dadd\">Dadd</a> [Lumberjack] [Mason] [Miner] [Digger] [Handyman]</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elders\">Elders</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Maximustehgreat\" title=\"Player:Maximustehgreat\">Maximustehgreat</a> [Digger] [Excavator] [Lumberjack] [Mason] [handyman] [Trollslayer] [Miner] [Archer]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Spyfox\" title=\"Player:Spyfox\">Spyfox</a> [Miner] [Mason] [Handyman] [Digger] [Trollslayer]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Sinner\" title=\"Player:Sinner\">Sinner</a> [Giantslayer]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ruthie\" title=\"Player:Ruthie\">Ruthie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Violet\" title=\"Player:Violet\">Violet</a> [Mason] [Digger] [Tanner] [Trollslayer]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Fooli\" title=\"Player:Fooli\">Fooli</a> [Digger] [Trollslayer] [Miner]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Crazybill\" title=\"Player:Crazybill\">Crazybill</a> [Digger] [Excavator] [Land shaper] [handyman] [Miner]</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Active_Citizens\">Active Citizens</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Sixiron\" title=\"Player:Sixiron\">Sixiron</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Forrestgrump\" title=\"Player:Forrestgrump\">Forrestgrump</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Mevin\" title=\"Player:Mevin\">Mevin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Spirit\" title=\"Player:Spirit\">Spirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Riverboy\" title=\"Player:Riverboy\">Riverboy</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Drega\" title=\"Player:Drega\">Drega</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Tantrum\" title=\"Player:Tantrum\">Tantrum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Rosie\" title=\"Player:Rosie\">Rosie</a></li></ul>', 1),
(20516, 5223, 'Past Citizens Of Woodscove', 'Past_Citizens_Of_Woodscove', 'Hogue Derelict Dramen Hubble Darkreaper Condor Vinarom Cleonweiss Andrewmiller Graylord Mikes TheLimeGoblin Harbinger Regulator Funkychunkk Diopall Doxdox Lokivan Fevfev Nevax Retro Zooyork Perkins Larken Shep Darius Terasar Shadyus Chavkilltwo Tommty Walkerboh Alexgodis Maz Relichunter Candee Demondan Schiff Fez Icarusthegreat Shangtsung Deride Kame Arkanor Jamesmax Apologies to anyone I have missed off this list.', '<ul><li>Hogue</li>\n<li>Derelict</li>\n<li>Dramen</li>\n<li>Hubble</li>\n<li>Darkreaper</li>\n<li>Condor</li>\n<li>Vinarom</li>\n<li>Cleonweiss</li>\n<li>Andrewmiller</li>\n<li>Graylord</li>\n<li>Mikes</li>\n<li>TheLimeGoblin</li>\n<li>Harbinger</li>\n<li>Regulator</li>\n<li>Funkychunkk</li>\n<li>Diopall</li>\n<li>Doxdox</li>\n<li>Lokivan</li>\n<li>Fevfev</li>\n<li>Nevax</li>\n<li>Retro</li>\n<li>Zooyork</li>\n<li>Perkins</li>\n<li>Larken</li>\n<li>Shep</li>\n<li>Darius</li>\n<li>Terasar</li>\n<li>Shadyus</li>\n<li>Chavkilltwo</li>\n<li>Tommty</li>\n<li>Walkerboh</li>\n<li>Alexgodis</li>\n<li>Maz</li>\n<li>Relichunter</li>\n<li>Candee</li>\n<li>Demondan</li>\n<li>Schiff</li>\n<li>Fez</li>\n<li>Icarusthegreat</li>\n<li>Shangtsung</li>\n<li>Deride</li>\n<li>Kame</li>\n<li>Arkanor</li>\n<li>Jamesmax</li></ul>\n<p>Apologies to anyone I have missed off this list.\n</p>', 2),
(20517, 5223, 'Citizens Kicked out/Exiled for their behavior/actions.', 'Citizens_Kicked_out.2FExiled_for_their_behavior.2Factions.', 'Cubeman Cardboardboxprocessor Wesnc Louischalma A note to anyone thinking of taking these players in to their village, Items and belongings will go missing.\nIf you have Accepted any of these players it will most definitely result in your villages failure, And Goals, achievements will be ruined due to harassment and behavior. Definitely Not Worth your time, You have Been warned!', '<ul><li>Cubeman</li>\n<li>Cardboardboxprocessor</li>\n<li>Wesnc</li>\n<li>Louischalma</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\nA note to anyone thinking of taking these players in to their village, Items and belongings will go missing.\nIf you have Accepted any of these players it will most definitely result in your villages failure, And Goals, achievements will be ruined due to harassment and behavior.\n</p>\n<p>Definitely Not Worth your time, You have Been warned!\n</p>', 3),
(20518, 5224, 'Hierarchy', 'Hierarchy', 'Sovereign Algoron - Head of the Council of Lords Blacksmith , Excavator , Miner , Keeper of Faith , Mason , Handyman and Trollslayer Lord-Knights Iambob - Council of Lords member Digger , Keeper of Faith , and Trollslayer BikerDuck - Council of Lords member Meria Keeper of Faith and Trollslayer Knights Page Peasants Phoenyx Trollslayer Denna Zigen Recruits', '<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sovereign\">Sovereign</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Algoron\" title=\"Player:Algoron\">Algoron</a> - Head of the Council of Lords</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Blacksmithing\" title=\"Blacksmithing\">Blacksmith</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Digging\" title=\"Digging\">Excavator</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mining\" title=\"Mining\">Miner</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Keeper_of_Faith\" title=\"Keeper of Faith\">Keeper of Faith</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">Mason</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Titles\" title=\"Titles\">Handyman</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Titles\" title=\"Titles\">Trollslayer</a></li></ul></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lord-Knights\">Lord-Knights</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">Iambob</a> - Council of Lords member</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Digging\" title=\"Digging\">Digger</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Keeper_of_Faith\" title=\"Keeper of Faith\">Keeper of Faith</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Titles\" title=\"Titles\">Trollslayer</a></li></ul></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Undefined_player\" title=\"Undefined player\">BikerDuck</a> - Council of Lords member</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Meria\" title=\"Player:Meria\">Meria</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Keeper_of_Faith\" title=\"Keeper of Faith\">Keeper of Faith</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Titles\" title=\"Titles\">Trollslayer</a></li></ul></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knights\">Knights</span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Page\">Page</span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Peasants\">Peasants</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Phoenyx\" title=\"Player:Phoenyx\">Phoenyx</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trollslayer\" title=\"Trollslayer\">Trollslayer</a></li></ul></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Player:Denna\" title=\"Player:Denna\">Denna</a></li>\n<li>Zigen</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recruits\">Recruits</span></h3>', 0),
(20519, 5224, 'Open positions', 'Open_positions', 'Weapons smith(s) Carpenter(s) Shield smith Medic Masons(s)', '<ul><li>Weapons smith(s)</li>\n<li>Carpenter(s)</li>\n<li>Shield smith</li>\n<li>Medic</li>\n<li>Masons(s)</li></ul>', 1),
(20520, 5224, 'Local resources', 'Local_resources', 'Silver - 50QL Copper - 50QL Iron - 32QL, 36QL and 50QL Zinc - 36QL Clay Sand Moss Tar', '<ul><li>Silver - 50QL</li>\n<li>Copper - 50QL</li>\n<li>Iron - 32QL, 36QL and 50QL</li>\n<li>Zinc - 36QL</li>\n<li>Clay</li>\n<li>Sand</li>\n<li>Moss</li>\n<li>Tar</li></ul>', 2),
(20521, 5224, 'Screenshots', 'Screenshots', 'About 2 weeks in to construction 2 & 1/2 weeks From the Switch backs Switch backs Switch Backs at night As of Nov. 29th', '<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i81.photobucket.com/albums/j202/HanzoIga/wurm037.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">About 2 weeks in to construction</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i81.photobucket.com/albums/j202/HanzoIga/wurm042.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">2 &amp; 1/2 weeks</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i81.photobucket.com/albums/j202/HanzoIga/wurm035.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">From the Switch backs</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i81.photobucket.com/albums/j202/HanzoIga/wurm029.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Switch backs</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i81.photobucket.com/albums/j202/HanzoIga/wurm023.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Switch Backs at night</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i81.photobucket.com/albums/j202/HanzoIga/wurm047.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">As of Nov. 29th</a></li></ul>', 3),
(20522, 5224, 'News', 'News', 'Deed disbanded to move to Independence server, July 2009', '<p>Deed disbanded to move to <a href=\"/index.php/Independence\" title=\"Independence\">Independence</a> server, July 2009\n</p>', 4),
(20523, 5224, 'Jobs', 'Jobs', 'None at this time.', '<p>None at this time.\n</p>', 5),
(20524, 5224, 'External links', 'External_links', 'Map to & from New Town', '<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://i81.photobucket.com/albums/j202/HanzoIga/Small.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map to &amp; from New Town</a></li></ul>', 6);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(20525, 5226, 'Description', 'Description', 'Weight is how heavy an item is.', '<p><b>Weight</b> is how heavy an <a href=\"/index.php/Item\" title=\"Item\">item</a> is. \n</p>', 0),
(20526, 5226, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The maximum amount of weight a player can carry is 7 multiplied by their strength . Weight in Wurm is measured in kilograms (kg), so 10.0 weight would be 10kg. Small items may weigh only a fraction of a kilogram. This is expressed in decimals. For example, a ring may weigh just 0.05kg. At the other end of the spectrum, an unfinished boat can weigh thousands of kilograms.', '<ul><li>The maximum amount of weight a <a href=\"/index.php/Player\" title=\"Player\">player</a> can carry is 7 multiplied by their <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">strength</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Weight in Wurm is measured in kilograms (kg), so 10.0 weight would be 10kg.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Small items may weigh only a fraction of a kilogram. This is expressed in decimals. For example, a <a href=\"/index.php/Ring\" title=\"Ring\">ring</a> may weigh just 0.05kg. At the other end of the spectrum, an unfinished <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Boat\" title=\"Boat\">boat</a> can weigh thousands of kilograms.</li></ul>', 1),
(20527, 5226, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Encumbered Slope Speed', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Encumbered\" title=\"Encumbered\">Encumbered</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Slope\" title=\"Slope\">Slope</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Speed\" title=\"Speed\">Speed</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20528, 3378, 'Description', 'Description', 'Sparring (Right-click on opponent, select Sparring - Spar) is a \"friendly\" fight between two opponents, to which both parties must consent in order to take place.  As such, it is a relatively safe and controlled PvP fight that can happen on PvE servers.', '<p>Sparring (Right-click on opponent, select Sparring - Spar) is a \"friendly\" fight between two opponents, to which both parties must consent in order to take place.  As such, it is a relatively safe and controlled PvP fight that can happen on PvE servers. \n</p>', 0),
(20529, 3378, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'No fighting or weapon skill is gained by sparring, although any weapon, some items, and even weaponless fighting approaches can be used. The server issues a \"Stop\" message just before the losing party is killed which automatically then stops the sparring match.  The winner may not loot the loser, who should still be alive at the end of the spar.', '<ul><li>No fighting or weapon skill is gained by sparring, although any weapon, some items, and even weaponless fighting approaches can be used.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The server issues a \"Stop\" message just before the losing party is killed which automatically then stops the sparring match.  The winner may not loot the loser, who should still be alive at the end of the spar.</li></ul>', 1),
(20530, 3378, 'Warnings', 'Warnings', 'On occasion, lag experienced during the latter part of the sparring match can cause the match to erroneously continue on to a kill. For this reason, players are best served by paying attention during the match so as to stop it should it not stop on its own due to lag or connection issues. Just as in regular combat, damage inflicted in sparring is real damage, to the player and their armour and weapons. It is therefore recommended players also be able to heal, in some fashion, after the fight so as to avoid the continued worsening of injuries which can lead to death.', '<ul><li>On occasion, lag experienced during the latter part of the sparring match can cause the match to erroneously continue on to a kill. For this reason, players are best served by paying attention during the match so as to stop it should it not stop on its own due to lag or connection issues.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Just as in regular combat, damage inflicted in sparring is real damage, to the player and their armour and weapons. It is therefore recommended players also be able to heal, in some fashion, after the fight so as to avoid the continued worsening of injuries which can lead to death.</li></ul>', 2),
(20531, 3378, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Dueling', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Dueling\" title=\"Dueling\">Dueling</a></li></ul>', 3),
(20532, 4297, 'Description', 'Description', 'A medium sized battle axe head.', '<p><i>A medium sized battle axe head.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(20533, 4297, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Used to construct a Large axe when attached to a shaft .', '<ul><li>Used to construct a <a href=\"/index.php/Large_axe\" title=\"Large axe\">Large axe</a> when attached to a <a href=\"/index.php/Shaft\" title=\"Shaft\">shaft</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(20534, 4297, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Small axe head Huge axe head', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Small_axe_head\" title=\"Small axe head\">Small axe head</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Huge_axe_head\" title=\"Huge axe head\">Huge axe head</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20535, 3048, 'Description', 'Description', 'Altars in Wurm are used as the focus for religious rituals, including praying to a Wurm diety in order to gain religious faith , and sacrificing goods and animals. There are four primary types of altars: Stone altar (includes stone, marble, slate and sandstone) Wooden altar Silver altar Gold altar stone altar wooden altar silver altar golden altar There are also two special types of altars on PvP servers which are not craftable by players: Bone Altar Altar of Three', '<p>Altars in Wurm are used as the focus for <a href=\"/index.php/Religion\" title=\"Religion\">religious</a> rituals, including <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Praying\" title=\"Praying\">praying</a> to a Wurm diety in order to gain religious <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>, and <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sacrificing\" title=\"Sacrificing\">sacrificing</a> goods and animals. \n</p>\n<p>There are four primary types of altars:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Stone_altar\" title=\"Stone altar\">Stone altar</a> (includes stone, marble, slate and sandstone)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_altar\" title=\"Wooden altar\">Wooden altar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Silver_altar\" title=\"Silver altar\">Silver altar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Gold_altar\" title=\"Gold altar\">Gold altar</a></li></ul></dd></dl>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\"><div style=\"width: 185px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><div style=\"margin:19px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Stone_altar.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"191\" data-file-width=\"202\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"142\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/ef/Stone_altar.png/150px-Stone_altar.png\" srcset=\"/images/e/ef/Stone_altar.png 1.5x\" width=\"150\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>stone altar\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\"><div style=\"width: 185px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Wooden_altar.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"448\" data-file-width=\"392\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"150\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f8/Wooden_altar.png/131px-Wooden_altar.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f8/Wooden_altar.png/197px-Wooden_altar.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f8/Wooden_altar.png/262px-Wooden_altar.png 2x\" width=\"131\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>wooden altar\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\"><div style=\"width: 185px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><div style=\"margin:42px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Silver_altar.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"438\" data-file-width=\"687\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5e/Silver_altar.png/150px-Silver_altar.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5e/Silver_altar.png/225px-Silver_altar.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5e/Silver_altar.png/300px-Silver_altar.png 2x\" width=\"150\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>silver altar\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185px\"><div style=\"width: 185px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 180px;\"><div style=\"margin:34px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Gold_altar.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"214\" data-file-width=\"287\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"112\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d1/Gold_altar.png/150px-Gold_altar.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d1/Gold_altar.png/225px-Gold_altar.png 1.5x, /images/d/d1/Gold_altar.png 2x\" width=\"150\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>golden altar\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>There are also two special types of altars on PvP servers which are not craftable by players:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Bone_Altar\" title=\"Bone Altar\">Bone Altar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Altar_of_Three\" title=\"Altar of Three\">Altar of Three</a></li></ul></dd></dl>', 0),
(20536, 3048, 'Domain', 'Domain', 'The domain of a deity provides bonuses to all their followers, priests and champions. An altar provides a portal from which a deity may funnel their domain into the lands of Wurm and also a place where followers may pray or sacrifice in respect to their deity. When standing on a tile in the domain of your deity any follower, priest or champion will receive a small bonus to some of their skills, such as fighting skill. These bonuses vary between gods. The strength of the bonus is affected by many variables such as the follower\'s faith and alignment, the distance from the altar, and the altar\'s QL.  The material type of an altar has no effect on domain influence or bonuses; it is strictly cosmetic. The distance of influence for a domain depends entirely on the QL of nearby altar(s). The highest quality, and therefore most influential, will control the domain in the area. In the below example, an altar of F o and an altar of M agranon are within 4 tiles of each other.  The resulting domain influence for each tile is pictured.', '<p>The domain of a deity provides bonuses to all their followers, priests and champions. An altar provides a portal from which a deity may funnel their domain into the lands of Wurm and also a place where followers may pray or sacrifice in respect to their deity.\n</p>\n<p>When standing on a tile in the domain of your deity any follower, priest or champion will receive a small bonus to some of their skills, such as fighting skill. These bonuses vary between gods. The strength of the bonus is affected by many variables such as the follower\'s faith and alignment, the distance from the altar, and the altar\'s QL.  The material type of an altar has no effect on domain influence or bonuses; it is strictly cosmetic.\n</p>\n<p>The distance of influence for a domain depends entirely on the QL of nearby altar(s). The highest quality, and therefore most influential, will control the domain in the area.\n</p>\n<p>In the below example, an altar of <b>F</b>o and an altar of <b>M</b>agranon are within 4 tiles of each other.  The resulting domain influence for each tile is pictured.\n</p>\n<p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Altardomain.jpg\"><img alt=\"Altardomain.jpg\" data-file-height=\"624\" data-file-width=\"659\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"624\" src=\"/images/4/45/Altardomain.jpg\" width=\"659\"/></a>\n</p>', 1),
(20537, 3048, 'Destroying an altar', 'Destroying_an_altar', 'It is possible to destroy an altar via the \"desecration\" action.  To desecrate an altar of your own faith, you must go \"unfaithful\" in the action bar. If you desecrate an altar of your deity you stop following that god and have your faith and favor reset to 0. Exorcism skill is gained. The altar is removed from the game. You can also bash an Altar with a maul or similar item to destroy an altar.', '<p>It is possible to destroy an altar via the \"desecration\" action.  To desecrate an altar of your own faith, you must go \"unfaithful\" in the action bar. If you desecrate an altar of your deity you stop following that god and have your faith and favor reset to 0. <a href=\"/index.php/Exorcism\" title=\"Exorcism\">Exorcism</a> skill is gained. The altar is removed from the game.\n</p>\n<p>You can also bash an Altar with a maul or similar item to destroy an altar.\n</p>', 2),
(20538, 3048, 'Note', 'Note', 'Any items placed on the altar do not get sacrificed - only items placed inside the altar do. Rarity in altars adds faith bonus and improves alignment gains in sermons. Faith bonus for altar rarity is an extra 1% for rare, 2% for supreme, and 3% for fantastic. While with normal status, an altar gives 4 alignment gain, rarity is as follows: 5 for rare, 6 for supreme, and 7 for fantastic. Sacrificing items at an altar requires one to have at least 10 faith with the deity that the altar belongs to.', '<ul><li>Any items placed on the altar do not get sacrificed - only items placed inside the altar do.</li>\n<li>Rarity in altars adds faith bonus and improves alignment gains in sermons. Faith bonus for altar rarity is an extra 1% for rare, 2% for supreme, and 3% for fantastic. While with normal status, an altar gives 4 alignment gain, rarity is as follows: 5 for rare, 6 for supreme, and 7 for fantastic.</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sacrificing\" title=\"Sacrificing\">Sacrificing</a> items at an altar requires one to have at least 10 faith with the deity that the altar belongs to.</li></ul>', 3),
(20539, 3048, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Religion Priest', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Religion\" title=\"Religion\">Religion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">Priest</a></li></ul>', 4),
(20580, 2385, 'Description', 'Description', 'The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly. Dragons are unique creatures that spawn randomly. There is usually only one dragon of each type per map , unless they are hatched from huge eggs . Adult Dragons Black dragon Blue dragon Green dragon Red dragon White dragon Provides dragon scale to premium players in local when slain. Hatchlings Black dragon hatchling Blue dragon hatchling Green dragon hatchling Red dragon hatchling White dragon hatchling Provides drake hide to premium players in local when slain.', '<p><i>The dragon hatchling is not as large as a full-grown dragon and unable to fly.</i>\n</p>\n<p><b>Dragons</b> are unique <a href=\"/index.php/Creatures\" title=\"Creatures\">creatures</a> that <a href=\"/index.php/Spawn\" title=\"Spawn\">spawn</a> randomly. There is usually only one dragon of each type per <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Map\" title=\"Map\">map</a>, unless they are hatched from <a href=\"/index.php/Huge_egg\" title=\"Huge egg\">huge eggs</a>.  \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Adult_Dragons\">Adult Dragons</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon\" title=\"Black dragon\">Black dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_dragon\" title=\"Blue dragon\">Blue dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Green_dragon\" title=\"Green dragon\">Green dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Red_dragon\" title=\"Red dragon\">Red dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon\" title=\"White dragon\">White dragon</a></li></ul>\n<p>Provides <a href=\"/index.php/Dragon_scale\" title=\"Dragon scale\">dragon scale</a> to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Premium\" title=\"Premium\">premium</a> players in <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Local\" title=\"Local\">local</a> when slain.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hatchlings\">Hatchlings</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Black_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Black dragon hatchling\">Black dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Blue_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Blue dragon hatchling\">Blue dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Green_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Green dragon hatchling\">Green dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Red_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"Red dragon hatchling\">Red dragon hatchling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/White_dragon_hatchling\" title=\"White dragon hatchling\">White dragon hatchling</a></li></ul>\n<p>Provides <a href=\"/index.php/Drake_hide\" title=\"Drake hide\">drake hide</a> to <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Premium\" title=\"Premium\">premium</a> players in <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Local\" title=\"Local\">local</a> when slain.\n</p>', 0),
(20581, 2385, 'Abilities', 'Abilities', 'Can climb everything. The aggro range of the dragon depends on what type. It is highly unpredictable and will change every time you run from it. Hits very quickly. Has bashing, slashing, biting, hitting, and tail whip attacks. Can bash down or damage walls or fences as well as break cave walls . Note: Dragons can instantly bash down any walls at any QL. They have been seen breaking down house walls or sometimes just walking through them. Cannot run out of stamina . Moves quite fast, but can be outrun by a player running on cobblestone . Black dragon hatchlings are known to throw players . This can be in any direction and varies from about 5 to 20 tiles. Note: Players can be thrown over walls. If you are thrown while inside a cave , then you are teleported to the surface.', '<ul><li>Can climb everything.</li>\n<li>The aggro range of the dragon depends on what type. It is highly unpredictable and will change every time you run from it.</li>\n<li>Hits very quickly.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>Has bashing, slashing, biting, hitting, and tail whip attacks.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Can bash down or damage <a href=\"/index.php/Wall\" title=\"Wall\">walls</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Fence\" title=\"Fence\">fences</a> as well as break <a href=\"/index.php/Cave_wall\" title=\"Cave wall\">cave walls</a>.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><i>Note: Dragons can instantly bash down any walls at any QL. They have been seen breaking down house walls or sometimes just walking through them.</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Cannot run out of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stamina\" title=\"Stamina\">stamina</a>.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>Moves quite fast, but can be outrun by a <a href=\"/index.php/Player\" title=\"Player\">player</a> running on <a href=\"/index.php/Cobblestone\" title=\"Cobblestone\">cobblestone</a>.</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Black dragon hatchlings are known to throw <a href=\"/index.php/Player\" title=\"Player\">players</a>. This can be in any direction and varies from about 5 to 20 tiles.</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><i>Note: Players can be thrown over walls. If you are thrown while inside a <a href=\"/index.php/Cave\" title=\"Cave\">cave</a>, then you are teleported to the surface.</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>', 1),
(20582, 2385, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Dragons cannot fly. When killed, gives every attacker the title Dragonslayer . Dragons cannot spawn on deeds. Hatchlings and dragons are different species, a hatchling will never grow up to become a dragon', '<ul><li>Dragons cannot fly.</li>\n<li>When killed, gives every attacker the title <a href=\"/index.php/Titles#Special_titles\" title=\"Titles\">Dragonslayer</a>.</li>\n<li>Dragons cannot spawn on deeds.</li>\n<li>Hatchlings and dragons are different species, a hatchling will never grow up to become a dragon</li></ul>', 2),
(20583, 2385, 'Images', 'Images', 'A red dragon A green dragon A white dragon A black dragon', '<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Reddragon.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"546\" data-file-width=\"542\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"120\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d3/Reddragon.jpg/119px-Reddragon.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d3/Reddragon.jpg/179px-Reddragon.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d3/Reddragon.jpg/238px-Reddragon.jpg 2x\" width=\"119\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>A red dragon\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:32.5px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Greendragon.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"1013\" data-file-width=\"1437\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/e0/Greendragon.jpg/120px-Greendragon.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e0/Greendragon.jpg/180px-Greendragon.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e0/Greendragon.jpg/240px-Greendragon.jpg 2x\" width=\"120\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>A green dragon\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:18px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Whitedragon.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"527\" data-file-width=\"554\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"114\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/62/Whitedragon.jpg/120px-Whitedragon.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/62/Whitedragon.jpg/180px-Whitedragon.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/62/Whitedragon.jpg/240px-Whitedragon.jpg 2x\" width=\"120\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>A white dragon\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:25px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Blackdragon.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"451\" data-file-width=\"542\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5f/Blackdragon.jpg/120px-Blackdragon.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5f/Blackdragon.jpg/180px-Blackdragon.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5f/Blackdragon.jpg/240px-Blackdragon.jpg 2x\" width=\"120\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<p>A black dragon\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>', 3),
(20597, 3281, 'Trinket exchange', 'Trinket_exchange', 'Up to five trinkets can be exchanged at a time. Each exchange gives every set up to and including the number of trinkets exchanged. Example: exchanging 4 trinkets gets you the sets 1+2+3+4. 1 trinket 80-99 QL spyglass 2 trinkets 30 QL butchering knife 30 QL water skin 30 QL iron pickaxe 30 QL carving knife 30 QL axe (note: carpentry item, will burn) 40 QL pelt 80 QL resurrection stone 3 trinkets 30 QL leather boot x2 30 QL leather cap 30 QL leather glove x2 30 QL leather pants 30 QL leather jacket 30 QL leather sleeve x2 30 QL iron shield 4 trinkets 50 QL iron lantern 70 QL iron compass 5 trinkets 80 QL resurrection stone x3', '<p>Up to five trinkets can be exchanged at a time. Each exchange gives every set up to and including the number of trinkets exchanged. Example: exchanging 4 trinkets gets you the sets 1+2+3+4.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1_trinket\">1 trinket</span></h3>\n<ul><li>80-99 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Spyglass\" title=\"Spyglass\">spyglass</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2_trinkets\">2 trinkets</span></h3>\n<ul><li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Butchering_knife\" title=\"Butchering knife\">butchering knife</a></li>\n<li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Water_skin\" title=\"Water skin\">water skin</a></li>\n<li>30 QL <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Iron_pickaxe\" title=\"Iron pickaxe\">iron pickaxe</a></li>\n<li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Carving_knife\" title=\"Carving knife\">carving knife</a></li>\n<li>30 QL <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Axe\" title=\"Axe\">axe</a> (note: carpentry item, will burn)</li>\n<li>40 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Pelt\" title=\"Pelt\">pelt</a></li>\n<li>80 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Resurrection_stone\" title=\"Resurrection stone\">resurrection stone</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"3_trinkets\">3 trinkets</span></h3>\n<ul><li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Leather_boot\" title=\"Leather boot\">leather boot</a> x2</li>\n<li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Leather_cap\" title=\"Leather cap\">leather cap</a></li>\n<li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Leather_glove\" title=\"Leather glove\">leather glove</a> x2</li>\n<li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Leather_pants\" title=\"Leather pants\">leather pants</a></li>\n<li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Leather_jacket\" title=\"Leather jacket\">leather jacket</a></li>\n<li>30 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Leather_sleeve\" title=\"Leather sleeve\">leather sleeve</a> x2</li>\n<li>30 QL <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Iron_shield\" title=\"Iron shield\">iron shield</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"4_trinkets\">4 trinkets</span></h3>\n<ul><li>50 QL <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Iron_lantern\" title=\"Iron lantern\">iron lantern</a></li>\n<li>70 QL <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Iron_compass\" title=\"Iron compass\">iron compass</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"5_trinkets\">5 trinkets</span></h3>\n<ul><li>80 QL <a href=\"/index.php/Resurrection_stone\" title=\"Resurrection stone\">resurrection stone</a> x3</li></ul>', 0),
(20598, 5241, 'Impact', 'Impact', 'It is contested that the Wurmageddon was actually a benefit to Wurm; the restart ushered in important bug fixes and new players. Many people relished the idea of starting over again, but many more were disheartened at the loss of their towns and their efforts. The long term impact of Wurmageddon is yet to be observed properly.', '<p>It is contested that the Wurmageddon was actually a benefit to Wurm; the restart ushered in important bug fixes and new players. Many people relished the idea of starting over again, but many more were disheartened at the loss of their towns and their efforts. The long term impact of Wurmageddon is yet to be observed properly.\n</p>', 0),
(20599, 2019, 'Players', 'Players', 'Raffeh - Mayor Arlan - Co-Mayor Tzen - Citizen Rapidkill - Citizen Ferality - Citizen Yodaman - Citizen', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Raffeh\" title=\"User:Raffeh\">Raffeh</a> - Mayor</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Arlan\" title=\"User:Arlan\">Arlan</a> - Co-Mayor</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Tzen\" title=\"User:Tzen\">Tzen</a> - Citizen</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Rapidkill\" title=\"User:Rapidkill\">Rapidkill</a> - Citizen</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Ferality\" title=\"User:Ferality\">Ferality</a> - Citizen</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Yodaman\" title=\"User:Yodaman\">Yodaman</a> - Citizen</li></ul>', 0),
(20600, 2019, 'Preists', 'Preists', 'Raff - Preist Alt ( Vynora ) Taval - Preist Alt ( Fo )', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Raff\" title=\"User:Raff\">Raff</a> - Preist Alt ( Vynora )</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/User:Taval\" title=\"User:Taval\">Taval</a> - Preist Alt ( Fo )</li></ul>', 1),
(20601, 2019, 'Allys', 'Allys', 'Ghosted Lion\'s Gate Roadside Rosewood Manor Sanctum', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ghosted\" title=\"Player:Ghosted\">Ghosted</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Lion%27s_Gate\" title=\"Lion\'s Gate\">Lion\'s Gate</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Roadside\" title=\"Roadside\">Roadside</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Rosewood_Manor\" title=\"Rosewood Manor\">Rosewood Manor</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sanctum\" title=\"Sanctum\">Sanctum</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20602, 2019, 'Merchants', 'Merchants', 'Shore Haven Merchant (Merchant Row [NT])', '<p>Shore Haven Merchant (Merchant Row [NT])\n</p>', 3),
(20603, 2019, 'Directions', 'Directions', '1. Go north from NT until you reach Vean\'s Place. 2. Go north from Vean\'s Place along the road until you get to the east of old Lion\'s Gate and continue north on that road. 3. Go north over the peat field and follow the road north. 4. Find the sign that says \"Road to Shore Haven\" and take a left turn. 5. Follow that road west and you will get to Shore Haven.', '<p><img alt=\"ntshdirectionscy2.png\" src=\"http://img507.imageshack.us/img507/4103/ntshdirectionscy2.png\"/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>1. Go north from NT until you reach Vean\'s Place.</li>\n<li>2. Go north from Vean\'s Place along the road until you get to the east of old Lion\'s Gate and continue north on that road.</li>\n<li>3. Go north over the peat field and follow the road north.</li>\n<li>4. Find the sign that says \"Road to Shore Haven\" and take a left turn.</li>\n<li>5. Follow that road west and you will get to Shore Haven.</li></ul>', 4),
(20685, 5244, '071221', '071221', 'Make sure to log on and visit Santa Claus with your premium account between the 24th and 26th swedish time for a gift! First aid now removes a bit more damage A bug when secondary attacks replaced primary weapon attack was fixed. The bug that made actions happen too fast was probably fixed but couldn Mycelium growth was a bit bugged and should work better.', '<ul><li>Make sure to log on and visit Santa Claus with your premium account between the 24th and 26th swedish time for a gift!</li>\n<li><i>First aid now removes a bit more damage</i></li>\n<li>A bug when secondary attacks replaced primary weapon attack was fixed.</li>\n<li><i>The bug that made actions happen too fast was probably fixed but couldn</i></li>\n<li>Mycelium growth was a bit bugged and should work better.</li></ul>', 0),
(20686, 5244, '071217', '071217', 'The insane block odds for armour was lowered and now depends more on quality More special typed creature should appear and also keep their types after the next reboot. You no longer gain archery skills from targets if your archery skill is higher then 40 or your bow skill is higher than 30. A bug with mycelium previously made it possible to spread outside the HOTS kingdom The special creature types were not saved over restarts. Found a bug with village voting', '<ul><li>The insane block odds for armour was lowered and now depends more on quality</li>\n<li><i>More special typed creature should appear and also keep their types after the next reboot.</i></li>\n<li>You no longer gain archery skills from targets if your archery skill is higher then 40 or your bow skill is higher than 30.</li>\n<li><i>A bug with mycelium previously made it possible to spread outside the HOTS kingdom</i></li>\n<li>The special creature types were not saved over restarts.</li>\n<li><i>Found a bug with village voting</i></li></ul>', 1),
(20687, 5244, '071212', '071212', 'Fixed zombie instadeath on raised. The creature type does not work yet though. You should now be able to string a bow that is wielded.', '<ul><li>Fixed zombie instadeath on raised. The creature type does not work yet though.</li>\n<li>You should now be able to string a bow that is wielded.</li></ul>', 2),
(20688, 5244, '071210', '071210', 'Removed the ondeath skillgain for spirit and kingdom guards because of the excessive spawn rate these creatures have.', '<ul><li>Removed the ondeath skillgain for spirit and kingdom guards because of the excessive spawn rate these creatures have.</li></ul>', 3),
(20689, 5244, '071205', '071205', 'A bug made all wounds act like bad wounds.', '<ul><li>A bug made all wounds act like bad wounds.</li></ul>', 4),
(20690, 5244, '071203', '071203', 'Short sword damage was increased a bit and large axes were made a bit slower. Stealth login bug fixed Falling damage was increased by 1/4th. RT wounds are no longer separate wounds Enemies of a village should now be able to pass through picked gates. Healing has been changed and should now closely match the thread in general forum. Thanks for the well written suggestions! Your combat focus level level should now decrease properly while not engaged. You will lose half your combat focus level immediately if you attack a creature instead of a player in order to prevent boosting. A bug made farwalker items inject money into the economy, so I had to remove the possibility to sell them to the traders for now. A bug where deed money when disbanding did not end up in the current mayors pocket was fixed. You now gain bow skill when shooting at live targets Uniques should not become locked up as much and heal a bit better.', '<ul><li>Short sword damage was increased a bit and large axes were made a bit slower.</li>\n<li><i>Stealth login bug fixed</i></li>\n<li>Falling damage was increased by 1/4th.</li>\n<li><i>RT wounds are no longer separate wounds</i></li>\n<li>Enemies of a village should now be able to pass through picked gates.</li>\n<li><i>Healing has been changed and should now closely match the thread in general forum. Thanks for the well written suggestions!</i></li>\n<li>Your combat focus level level should now decrease properly while not engaged. You will lose half your combat focus level immediately if you attack a creature instead of a player in order to prevent boosting.</li>\n<li><i>A bug made farwalker items inject money into the economy, so I had to remove the possibility to sell them to the traders for now.</i></li>\n<li>A bug where deed money when disbanding did not end up in the current mayors pocket was fixed.</li>\n<li><i>You now gain bow skill when shooting at live targets</i></li>\n<li>Uniques should not become locked up as much and heal a bit better.</li></ul>', 5),
(20691, 5244, '071127', '071127', 'Creature lairs should spawn more creatures. Fishing is close to impossible in small bodies (less then 4x4) of water now. Newbie items should no longer be improvable nor be lost on death. Skillgain over 20 from woodcutting is now restricted properly to hatchets. The trader now buys back farwalker items Uniques were made tougher. Aged creatures were also beefed up a bit Archery targets no longer yield archery skill if it\'s above 40. Light guards were made tougher. The time it takes to sow crops is now effected by skill and the seed quality Firstaid damage reduction further tweaked in order to promote other ways of healing. Also increased the need for healing covers for severe wounds Combat focus level now decreases by 1 per 3 seconds while you are not fighting. You may check it using the command /fl You should not have to wear the shield now every time you logon in order to get the shieldbash icon Bugs with speed modification when climbing and stealthing fixed.', '<ul><li>Creature lairs should spawn more creatures.</li>\n<li><i>Fishing is close to impossible in small bodies (less then 4x4) of water now.</i></li>\n<li>Newbie items should no longer be improvable nor be lost on death.</li>\n<li><i>Skillgain over 20 from woodcutting is now restricted properly to hatchets.</i></li>\n<li>The trader now buys back farwalker items</li>\n<li><i>Uniques were made tougher. Aged creatures were also beefed up a bit</i></li>\n<li>Archery targets no longer yield archery skill if it\'s above 40.</li>\n<li><i>Light guards were made tougher.</i></li>\n<li>The time it takes to sow crops is now effected by skill and the seed quality</li>\n<li><i>Firstaid damage reduction further tweaked in order to promote other ways of healing. </i></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><i>Also increased the need for healing covers for severe wounds</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Combat focus level now decreases by 1 per 3 seconds while you are not fighting. You may check it using the command /fl</li>\n<li><i>You should not have to wear the shield now every time you logon in order to get the shieldbash icon</i></li>\n<li>Bugs with speed modification when climbing and stealthing fixed.</li></ul>', 6),
(20692, 5244, '071126', '071126', 'Archery skillgain was slowed down pending some kind of solution. Armour evasion was reinstated. All creatures now have armour damage reduction again. Armour damage reduction for players worked all the time. Fixed a bug where overall fight skill gain was set too low after loosing premium. You no longer lose reputation for killing when duelling The failure rate of the crown of might is now a bit more humane Improving rates were set to old ones Throwing liquid should disappear in it disappearing now. Hatchet damage for trees was upped Skillgain for fighting was lowered some Firstaid damage reduction tweaked A bug with upkeep made all of it to back into the economy Trader demand is or will soon be reset You may no longer use a farwalker item if a player enemy has been nearby for one minute or more. Fixed a severe cause for lag. Reconnection problems near newtown should be less common. Practice dolls receive and do less damage now There are sounds when creatures are hit by unique attacks now Taunting should work now The Nickname special move was renamed to Carver. Wall and fence damage was increased. Still have to come up with a solution to the old archers archery issue.', '<ul><li>Archery skillgain was slowed down pending some kind of solution.</li>\n<li><i>Armour evasion was reinstated. All creatures now have armour damage reduction again. Armour damage reduction for players worked all the time.</i></li>\n<li>Fixed a bug where overall fight skill gain was set too low after loosing premium.</li>\n<li><i>You no longer lose reputation for killing when duelling</i></li>\n<li>The failure rate of the crown of might is now a bit more humane</li>\n<li><i>Improving rates were set to old ones</i></li>\n<li>Throwing liquid should disappear in it disappearing now.</li>\n<li><i>Hatchet damage for trees was upped</i></li>\n<li>Skillgain for fighting was lowered some</li>\n<li><i>Firstaid damage reduction tweaked</i></li>\n<li>A bug with upkeep made all of it to back into the economy</li>\n<li><i>Trader demand is or will soon be reset</i></li>\n<li>You may no longer use a farwalker item if a player enemy has been nearby for one minute or more.</li>\n<li><i>Fixed a severe cause for lag.</i></li>\n<li>Reconnection problems near newtown should be less common.</li>\n<li><i>Practice dolls receive and do less damage now</i></li>\n<li>There are sounds when creatures are hit by unique attacks now</li>\n<li><i>Taunting should work now</i></li>\n<li>The Nickname special move was renamed to Carver.</li>\n<li><i>Wall and fence damage was increased.</i></li>\n<li>Still have to come up with a solution to the old archers archery issue.</li></ul>', 7),
(20693, 5244, '071121', '071121', 'Spirit and tower guards now use armour modifiers so they are tougher. The crown of might now has a failure rate depending on the soul strength of the target creature. Armour damage was reduced. Improving was made too easy and had to be nerfed. Healing time and bandage used greatly reduced. Removed permadeath due to strength loss for basic accounts for now.', '<ul><li><i> Spirit and tower guards now use armour modifiers so they are tougher.</i></li>\n<li>The crown of might now has a failure rate depending on the soul strength of the target creature.</li>\n<li><i> Armour damage was reduced. </i></li>\n<li>Improving was made too easy and had to be nerfed.</li>\n<li><i> Healing time and bandage used greatly reduced.</i></li>\n<li>Removed permadeath due to strength loss for basic accounts for now.</li></ul>', 8),
(20694, 5244, '071121', '071121_2', 'The trader supply-demand algorithm got a kick and is now working much better. Improving new items have a flatter ql gain. Restoring old weapon quality works pretty much like before. Fletching was made faster. There is now a price column in trade windows. It may be a bit incorrect at times since the prices varies with amount You can now set the description of items of up to 20 letters The friends list should now be sorted in structure management. Hatchets should be used for woodcutting and now have no limit in skillgain to trees but should be poor in combat. You need to create special hatchet axe heads now. Resurrection stones can only be purchased from the traders for real silver now (this was the intention from the beginning, but there was a bug before) Mycelium growth bugs should be fixed.', '<ul><li><i>The trader supply-demand algorithm got a kick and is now working much better.</i></li>\n<li>Improving new items have a flatter ql gain. Restoring old weapon quality works pretty much like before. Fletching was made faster.</li>\n<li><i>There is now a price column in trade windows. It may be a bit incorrect at times since the prices varies with amount</i></li>\n<li>You can now set the description of items of up to 20 letters</li>\n<li><i>The friends list should now be sorted in structure management.</i></li>\n<li>Hatchets should be used for woodcutting and now have no limit in skillgain to trees but should be poor in combat. You need to create special hatchet axe heads now.</li>\n<li><i>Resurrection stones can only be purchased from the traders for real silver now (this was the intention from the beginning, but there was a bug before)</i></li>\n<li>Mycelium growth bugs should be fixed.</li></ul>', 9),
(20695, 5244, '071114 (testserver)', '071114_.28testserver.29', 'You should now see legal messages when attacking same-side guards again. You may now start focusing in battles immediately. There is now a price column in trade windows. Damage from fighting was reduced even further You can now set the description of items of up to 20 letters The friends list should now be sorted in structure management. Hatchets now have no limit in skill-gain on trees but should be poor in combat Balanced the fight styles some. Aggressive will now parry and block 1/3d of normal. You should no longer need to become unlawful in order to attack the enemies settlements. Special moves were made cheaper Certain actions that received out-of-range messages while moving should no longer do so.', '<ul><li><i>You should now see legal messages when attacking same-side guards again.</i></li>\n<li><i>You may now start focusing in battles immediately.</i></li>\n<li>There is now a price column in trade windows.</li>\n<li><i>Damage from fighting was reduced even further</i></li>\n<li>You can now set the description of items of up to 20 letters</li>\n<li><i>The friends list should now be sorted in structure management.</i></li>\n<li>Hatchets now have no limit in skill-gain on trees but should be poor in combat</li>\n<li><i>Balanced the fight styles some. Aggressive will now parry and block 1/3d of normal.</i></li>\n<li>You should no longer need to become unlawful in order to attack the enemies settlements.</li>\n<li><i>Special moves were made cheaper</i></li>\n<li>Certain actions that received out-of-range messages while moving should no longer do so.</li></ul>', 10),
(20696, 5244, '071113 (testserver)', '071113_.28testserver.29', 'Removed the possibility for shovels and pickaxes to become stuck. Shields should now be harder to use against good archers, but easier against unskilled archers. Fighting skillgain for killing enemies was lowered. You now get 10% of the skill gain if a guard or spirit was involved in the killing\' Short and medium bow damage was increased. Damage is however now reduced too far outside perfect range. Archery was made harder to hit. Archery skill will increase faster Bugs with archery facing should be fixed. The difference in to-hit chance between lower and higher skilled players increased.', '<ul><li>Removed the possibility for shovels and pickaxes to become stuck.</li>\n<li><i>Shields should now be harder to use against good archers, but easier against unskilled archers.</i></li>\n<li>Fighting skillgain for killing enemies was lowered.</li>\n<li><i>You now get 10% of the skill gain if a guard or spirit was involved in the killing\'</i></li>\n<li>Short and medium bow damage was increased. Damage is however now reduced too far outside perfect range.</li>\n<li><i>Archery was made harder to hit. Archery skill will increase faster</i></li>\n<li>Bugs with archery facing should be fixed.</li>\n<li><i>The difference in to-hit chance between lower and higher skilled players increased. </i></li></ul>', 11),
(20697, 5244, '071109 (testserver)', '071109_.28testserver.29', 'Made some changes to equal defensive and aggressive a bit. You now stop sneaking when casting or performing archery Damage to weapons and armour reduced Skillgain for fighting styles and weapons increased. Archery should have a bit harder to hit depending on armour. You should now see when your pet tries to attack someone. You will now change stances in a more appropriate way when autofighting.', '<ul><li>Made some changes to equal defensive and aggressive a bit.</li>\n<li><i>You now stop sneaking when casting or performing archery</i></li>\n<li>Damage to weapons and armour reduced</li>\n<li><i>Skillgain for fighting styles and weapons increased.</i></li>\n<li>Archery should have a bit harder to hit depending on armour.</li>\n<li><i>You should now see when your pet tries to attack someone.</i></li>\n<li>You will now change stances in a more appropriate way when autofighting.</li></ul>', 12),
(20698, 5244, '071108 (testserver)', '071108_.28testserver.29', 'Tweaked damage armour reduction for non-unique creatures. This means they will take much more damage from a succcesful hit. You now get free attacks on people who fumble Bows now do a bit more damage Secondary weapons now attack. Some special moves for swords were messed up and should be cleared Attack text changed from move in to attack to include weapon type You may now switch targets while fighting If your selected target is too far away, you will now still change stances.', '<ul><li><i>Tweaked damage armour reduction for non-unique creatures. This means they will take much more damage from a succcesful hit. </i></li>\n<li>You now get free attacks on people who fumble</li>\n<li><i>Bows now do a bit more damage</i></li>\n<li>Secondary weapons now attack.</li>\n<li><i>Some special moves for swords were messed up and should be cleared</i></li>\n<li>Attack text changed from move in to attack to include weapon type</li>\n<li><i>You may now switch targets while fighting</i></li>\n<li>If your selected target is too far away, you will now still change stances.</li></ul>', 13),
(20699, 5244, '071106 (testserver)', '071106_.28testserver.29', 'Fixed bugs where you parried too easily, especially when exhausted Bug where you gained your opponent fight type skill fixed. You are now supposed to gain skills when sparring and doing damage. Bug with targeting fixed. Carts should no longer show damage like creatures. Wound descriptions changed.', '<ul><li><i>Fixed bugs where you parried too easily, especially when exhausted</i></li>\n<li>Bug where you gained your opponent fight type skill fixed.</li>\n<li><i>You are now supposed to gain skills when sparring and doing damage.</i></li>\n<li>Bug with targeting fixed.</li>\n<li><i>Carts should no longer show damage like creatures.</i></li>\n<li>Wound descriptions changed.</li></ul>', 14),
(20700, 5244, '071102 (testserver)', '071102_.28testserver.29', 'Removed the slowdown. In general fighting should be much faster. Bug removed: Age modifier was applied to players which made you hit much less. Weapon damage was dramatically increased. Increased the parry/shield penalty when moving a lot. If you are moving you will only parry and use  the shield at all if you have weapon/shield skill overs 40.', '<ul><li><i>Removed the slowdown. In general fighting should be much faster.</i></li>\n<li>Bug removed: Age modifier was applied to players which made you hit much less.</li>\n<li><i>Weapon damage was dramatically increased.</i></li>\n<li>Increased the parry/shield penalty when moving a lot. If you are moving you will only parry and use  the shield at all if you have weapon/shield skill overs 40.</li></ul>', 15),
(20701, 5244, '071101 (testserver)', '071101_.28testserver.29', 'Trying a version where you slow down in fighting. It will still be possible to escape just harder. More items then deeds are required to be purchased with coins only now, such as resurrection stones. Removed the round-type of fight that was being tested and reverted to flowing realtime instead.', '<ul><li>Trying a version where you slow down in fighting. It will still be possible to escape just harder.</li>\n<li><i>More items then deeds are required to be purchased with coins only now, such as resurrection stones.</i></li>\n<li>Removed the round-type of fight that was being tested and reverted to flowing realtime instead.</li></ul>', 16),
(20702, 5244, '071030 (testserver)', '071030_.28testserver.29', 'A bug set creature wounds to a very low severity when hit in the same spot. Axes no longer parry You may see some obscure numbers in spam mode that may help you detect imbalances. You should hit more overall Autoattack is more inventive and adaptive Autofighting should be saved now.', '<ul><li>A bug set creature wounds to a very low severity when hit in the same spot.</li>\n<li><i>Axes no longer parry</i></li>\n<li>You may see some obscure numbers in spam mode that may help you detect imbalances.</li>\n<li><i>You should hit more overall</i></li>\n<li>Autoattack is more inventive and adaptive</li>\n<li><i>Autofighting should be saved now.</i></li></ul>', 17);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(20703, 5244, '071029 (testserver)', '071029_.28testserver.29', 'The code erroneously checked if the attacker was aggressive instead of the defender when determining parry and shield block. Left hand shouldn\'t attack while wielding two handed weapons. Special moves should now work Thrown creatures should not become invisible A too large strength damage multiplier was removed, lowering damage again in many cases. Various null-pointers and other small exceptions fixed. Normal style now has a higher chance of hitting, aggressive does more damage, and defensive parries and blocks. Dragon fire effect goes away faster. Max sum damage of wounds should be about 100 now. Fixed a bug with the artifacts. Summoned artifacts will not work like the true ones that are hidden though so they will be hard to test Fixed various other bugs from the bug thread in the forums Certain animals will now die from starvation', '<ul><li><i>The code erroneously checked if the attacker was aggressive instead of the defender when determining parry and shield block.</i></li>\n<li>Left hand shouldn\'t attack while wielding two handed weapons.</li>\n<li><i>Special moves should now work</i></li>\n<li>Thrown creatures should not become invisible</li>\n<li><i>A too large strength damage multiplier was removed, lowering damage again in many cases.</i></li>\n<li>Various null-pointers and other small exceptions fixed.</li>\n<li><i>Normal style now has a higher chance of hitting, aggressive does more damage, and defensive parries and blocks.</i></li>\n<li>Dragon fire effect goes away faster.</li>\n<li><i>Max sum damage of wounds should be about 100 now.</i></li>\n<li>Fixed a bug with the artifacts. Summoned artifacts will not work like the true ones that are hidden though so they will be hard to test</li>\n<li><i>Fixed various other bugs from the bug thread in the forums</i></li>\n<li>Certain animals will now die from starvation</li></ul>', 18),
(20704, 5244, '071016 (testserver)', '071016_.28testserver.29', 'Sowing crops now give a little farming skill. You may now use stealth mode, which may make you invisible to many other creatures and players. You may now duel and spar Soup is created more often now if you use a lot of liquid when cooking. Mycelium infected thorns now hurt as well, but HOTS half as much! Archery now uses the main archery skill to hit with the bow skill as a bonus modifier Finally lowered the crazy prices on the most expensive deeds.', '<ul><li>Sowing crops now give a little farming skill.</li>\n<li><i>You may now use stealth mode, which may make you invisible to many other creatures and players.</i></li>\n<li>You may now duel and spar</li>\n<li><i>Soup is created more often now if you use a lot of liquid when cooking.</i></li>\n<li>Mycelium infected thorns now hurt as well, but HOTS half as much!</li>\n<li><i>Archery now uses the main archery skill to hit with the bow skill as a bonus modifier</i></li>\n<li>Finally lowered the crazy prices on the most expensive deeds.</li></ul>', 19),
(20705, 5244, '070828', '070828', 'The Colossus! Rename the unfinished one to x before you drop it and it will be renamed \"Colossus of x\"! Settlement guards should help each other better outside the deed now', '<ul><li>The Colossus! Rename the unfinished one to x before you drop it and it will be renamed \"Colossus of x\"!</li>\n<li><i>Settlement guards should help each other better outside the deed now</i></li></ul>', 20),
(20706, 5244, '070823', '070823', 'You will now only block with the shield against archers if the archers is on your left side or slightly ahead to the right. Standing still increases the chance of blocking. The chance that an arrow bounces off your armour has been decreased.', '<ul><li><i>You will now only block with the shield against archers if the archers is on your left side or slightly ahead to the right. Standing still increases the chance of blocking.</i></li>\n<li>The chance that an arrow bounces off your armour has been decreased.</li></ul>', 21),
(20707, 5244, '070822', '070822', 'Plate and chain mail now takes less damage from piercing attacks such as arrows. Chain also takes less damage from slashing as well Shields will now be effective against arrows even when moving. If it was made a special action you would still be prone. Rotting touch will now add infected wounds, also for arrows The difficulty to hit the legs, the face and the head with arrows was increased. War arrows were made easier to make and improve', '<ul><li><i>Plate and chain mail now takes less damage from piercing attacks such as arrows. Chain also takes less damage from slashing as well</i></li>\n<li>Shields will now be effective against arrows even when moving. If it was made a special action you would still be prone.</li>\n<li><i>Rotting touch will now add infected wounds, also for arrows</i></li>\n<li>The difficulty to hit the legs, the face and the head with arrows was increased.</li>\n<li><i>War arrows were made easier to make and improve</i></li></ul>', 22),
(20708, 5244, '070820', '070820', 'Fixed a bug where flaming aura damage on arrows was too high. Effective faith is now 30 for non-premium priests.', '<ul><li><i>Fixed a bug where flaming aura damage on arrows was too high.</i></li>\n<li>Effective faith is now 30 for non-premium priests.</li></ul>', 23),
(20709, 5244, '070817', '070817', 'Your selected fighting mode should now persist over logons A bug where zombies could be dominated by magranon priests was fixed.', '<ul><li><i>Your selected fighting mode should now persist over logons</i></li>\n<li>A bug where zombies could be dominated by magranon priests was fixed.</li></ul>', 24),
(20710, 5244, '070718', '070718', 'Bugfixes with mailboxes. They now have more fitting names. If the mailbox does not work you may need to reenchant it. A fatigue-limited antimacroing system has been put in place, so GMs may manually create simple checks to catch players macroing. The fatigue limits have been increased. Only the most active players will ever notice this system. Only premium players may now drain tokens', '<ul><li><i>Bugfixes with mailboxes. They now have more fitting names. If the mailbox does not work you may need to reenchant it. </i></li>\n<li>A fatigue-limited antimacroing system has been put in place, so GMs may manually create simple checks to catch players macroing. The fatigue limits have been increased. Only the most active players will ever notice this system.</li>\n<li><i>Only premium players may now drain tokens</i></li></ul>', 25),
(20711, 5244, '070716', '070716', 'You may now construct mailboxes. They need a rare spiritual enchantment in order to work though.', '<ul><li><i>You may now construct mailboxes. They need a rare spiritual enchantment in order to work though.</i></li></ul>', 26),
(20712, 5244, '070711', '070711', 'Aggressive creatures did not always attack you when you started taming them. This became a problem so now there is higher risk involved There were several problems fixed which caused uniques to receive too much damage. Dropping dirt and sand will now only change rock, sand, dirt, packed dirt and steppe tiles. The weather has been stabilized and crops now grow at normal rates again.', '<ul><li><i>Aggressive creatures did not always attack you when you started taming them. This became a problem so now there is higher risk involved</i></li>\n<li>There were several problems fixed which caused uniques to receive too much damage.</li>\n<li><i>Dropping dirt and sand will now only change rock, sand, dirt, packed dirt and steppe tiles.</i></li>\n<li>The weather has been stabilized and crops now grow at normal rates again.</li></ul>', 27),
(20713, 5244, '070706', '070706', 'You should now be able to spawn at allied settlements if you die within 50 tiles of their center. As an effect of this you may only be invited to join another village once every 24 hours. Becoming mayor by deed giveaway will still work any number of times. Repairing wooden fences now remove more damage.', '<ul><li>You should now be able to spawn at allied settlements if you die within 50 tiles of their center. As an effect of this you may only be invited to join another village once every 24 hours. Becoming mayor by deed giveaway will still work any number of times.</li>\n<li><i>Repairing wooden fences now remove more damage.</i></li></ul>', 28),
(20714, 5244, '070703', '070703', 'Removed the possibility to spawn at an ally for now since it was abused. The spawn points outside your village is calculated somewhat different to make them less prone to spawncamping.', '<ul><li>Removed the possibility to spawn at an ally for now since it was abused. The spawn points outside your village is calculated somewhat different to make them less prone to spawncamping.</li></ul>', 29),
(20715, 5244, '070702', '070702', 'Fixed a bug with nodrop items A bug that caused fields and trees to grow 5 times to fast was fixed Catapults should no longer fire backwards', '<ul><li>Fixed a bug with nodrop items</li>\n<li><i>A bug that caused fields and trees to grow 5 times to fast was fixed</i></li>\n<li>Catapults should no longer fire backwards</li></ul>', 30),
(20716, 5244, '070626', '070626', 'Bags of Keeping now take no damage when you die if you have strength above 21 or faith above 35. You may now build low stone walls near mine entrances no matter how steep it is.', '<ul><li><i>Bags of Keeping now take no damage when you die if you have strength above 21 or faith above 35.</i></li>\n<li>You may now build low stone walls near mine entrances no matter how steep it is.</li></ul>', 31),
(20717, 5244, '070626', '070626_2', 'Instead of rejecting non-premiums from the wild server, the following steps has been taken: Non-premium players will now be considered alts and suffer real death if they die too frequently without raising their strength again. Bags of Keeping now take 0.3 damage when the owner dies. This is because they were used to suicide-trade. You may now lay floor boards in marsh. Fixed a server check that was missing that made fence sections destroyable because of lag.', '<ul><li>Instead of rejecting non-premiums from the wild server, the following steps has been taken:</li></ul>\n<ol><li>Non-premium players will now be considered alts and suffer real death if they die too frequently without raising their strength again.</li>\n<li>Bags of Keeping now take 0.3 damage when the owner dies. This is because they were used to suicide-trade.</li></ol>\n<ul><li><i>You may now lay floor boards in marsh. </i></li>\n<li>Fixed a server check that was missing that made fence sections destroyable because of lag.</li></ul>', 32),
(20718, 5244, '070621', '070621', 'Max fatigue time was lowered from 12 to 8 hours max. After the weekend we will see if it can be lowered further. Uniques had their damage dealt increase severely.', '<ul><li>Max fatigue time was lowered from 12 to 8 hours max. After the weekend we will see if it can be lowered further.</li>\n<li><i>Uniques had their damage dealt increase severely. </i></li></ul>', 33),
(20719, 5244, '070615', '070615', 'You now stop climbing due to exhaustion when you have less stamina left.', '<ul><li>You now stop climbing due to exhaustion when you have less stamina left.</li></ul>', 34),
(20720, 5244, '070613', '070613', 'Fixed a bug where you could get citizen damage bonus to fences and walls if the guards were dead. You may no longer start climbing when you are exhausted', '<ul><li>Fixed a bug where you could get citizen damage bonus to fences and walls if the guards were dead.</li>\n<li><i>You may no longer start climbing when you are exhausted</i></li></ul>', 35),
(20721, 5244, '070613', '070613_2', 'Taming timer was halved Creatures will no longer attack large groups of players, and hyenas/boars/gorillas will not hunt the same way either', '<ul><li>Taming timer was halved</li>\n<li>Creatures will no longer attack large groups of players, and hyenas/boars/gorillas will not hunt the same way either</li></ul>', 36),
(20722, 5244, '070612', '070612', 'Taming timer was increased. You now gain less skill from shooting arrow shafts compared to real arrows.', '<ul><li>Taming timer was increased.</li>\n<li>You now gain less skill from shooting arrow shafts compared to real arrows.</li></ul>', 37),
(20723, 5244, '070611', '070611', 'Fixed a possibility to tame through doors.', '<ul><li>Fixed a possibility to tame through doors.</li></ul>', 38),
(20724, 5244, '070606', '070606', 'Fixed a bug with managing merchant prices.', '<ul><li><i>Fixed a bug with managing merchant prices.</i></li></ul>', 39),
(20725, 5244, '070530', '070530', 'Now when you lose priesthood your faith is set to 20', '<ul><li><i> Now when you lose priesthood your faith is set to 20 </i></li></ul>', 40),
(20726, 5244, '070528', '070528', 'New accounts now start out with 19.5 in body stats in order to show that there is progress there as well. Those stats will gain faster up to 20 Tempering metal now uses variable amounts of water', '<ul><li>New accounts now start out with 19.5 in body stats in order to show that there is progress there as well. Those stats will gain faster up to 20</li>\n<li><i> Tempering metal now uses variable amounts of water </i></li></ul>', 41),
(20727, 5244, '070524', '070524', 'Whitelight (not Horde of the Summoned) players on the wildserver may now attack each other without skill or reputation loss. Inside villages the justice system should work as usual.', '<ul><li>Whitelight (not Horde of the Summoned) players on the wildserver may now attack each other without skill or reputation loss. Inside villages the justice system should work as usual.</li></ul>', 42),
(20728, 5244, '070521', '070521', 'Size 5 homestead deeds may now not be disbanded the first week after having been planted since it was abused. An bug where you sometimes could shieldbash a creature without fighting was fixed. In order to prevent peaceful, risk free skillgrinding player vs player combat yields no skill gain until we have made it so that only kills yield skills. This has high priority.', '<ul><li>Size 5 homestead deeds may now not be disbanded the first week after having been planted since it was abused.</li>\n<li><i>An bug where you sometimes could shieldbash a creature without fighting was fixed.</i></li>\n<li>In order to prevent peaceful, risk free skillgrinding player vs player combat yields no skill gain until we have made it so that only kills yield skills. This has high priority.</li></ul>', 43),
(20729, 5244, '070516', '070516', 'The command /gofemale has been readded where you may turn into a female character. WARNING: This is permanent and irreversible!', '<ul><li>The command /gofemale has been readded where you may turn into a female character. WARNING: This is permanent and irreversible!</li></ul>', 44),
(20730, 5244, '070511', '070511', 'There were 14 days reimbursement premium days missing in many cases. Fixed. Those players who had purchased 100 silver only received 5 of them. Fixed.', '<ul><li><i>There were 14 days reimbursement premium days missing in many cases. Fixed. </i></li>\n<li>Those players who had purchased 100 silver only received 5 of them. Fixed.</li></ul>', 45),
(20731, 5244, '070507', '070507', 'In order to make battle rank system less abusable, only premium players will gain and lose battle rank. Transfer bug fixed. Respawn bug fixed. Reimbursement bugs fixed. The premium time available from the village token will often be a bit incorrect due to the complexity of the formula involved. Report any large deviations of course. Trader price of spyglasses has been lowered to 5 coppers since they were being used to drain the traders of money. Resurrection stones are now nodrop so they will stay with you if you die. Traders only sell them and the price is set to 5 silver. Because of the overuse of size 5 homestead deeds and the landhogging it involved, upkeep on them is now 3 times as expensive. The other homestead deeds have lower prices. You will now leave a corpse if you die as a newbie', '<ul><li><i>In order to make battle rank system less abusable, only premium players will gain and lose battle rank.</i></li>\n<li>Transfer bug fixed. Respawn bug fixed. Reimbursement bugs fixed. The premium time available from the village token will often be a bit incorrect due to the complexity of the formula involved. Report any large deviations of course.</li>\n<li><i>Trader price of spyglasses has been lowered to 5 coppers since they were being used to drain the traders of money.</i></li>\n<li>Resurrection stones are now nodrop so they will stay with you if you die. Traders only sell them and the price is set to 5 silver.</li>\n<li><i> Because of the overuse of size 5 homestead deeds and the landhogging it involved, upkeep on them is now 3 times as expensive. The other homestead deeds have lower prices. </i></li>\n<li>You will now leave a corpse if you die as a newbie</li></ul>', 46),
(20732, 5244, '070505', '070505', 'Ore distribution is now less regional Kingdom and village guards now refrain from attacking the powerful uniques, since they consider it suicide. Uniques should ignore them. There is a new item available in shops. It is a one-shot item that when you use it will keep your items safe in 50% of the time and cut your skill loss in half. The effect stays until you die. Note that you may lose these at death if you carry a lot of them (they are not No-Drop)', '<ul><li><i>Ore distribution is now less regional</i></li>\n<li>Kingdom and village guards now refrain from attacking the powerful uniques, since they consider it suicide. Uniques should ignore them.</li>\n<li><i>There is a new item available in shops. It is a one-shot item that when you use it will keep your items safe in 50% of the time and cut your skill loss in half. The effect stays until you die. Note that you may lose these at death if you carry a lot of them (they are not No-Drop)</i></li></ul>', 47),
(20733, 5244, '070423', '070423', 'Draining from a deeds upkeep will now drain at least 75 copper coins (of which you will receive a fraction). The 7 days grace period has been removed also. A crash bug was fixed. Magranon priests now need soul strength in order to become champions of Magranon. A bug with converting between the white light religions was fixed. You should now be able to plan buildings on planks.', '<ul><li><i>Draining from a deeds upkeep will now drain at least 75 copper coins (of which you will receive a fraction). The 7 days grace period has been removed also.</i></li>\n<li>A crash bug was fixed.</li>\n<li><i>Magranon priests now need soul strength in order to become champions of Magranon.</i></li>\n<li>A bug with converting between the white light religions was fixed.</li>\n<li><i>You should now be able to plan buildings on planks.</i></li></ul>', 48),
(20734, 5244, '070419', '070419', 'Only premium players with 21 strength may dig on, unpave, drop dirt on (no 21 strength required), and flatten near roads in order to reduce the widespread griefing. Vynora priest restrictions removed. CMs may now use red colored chat. Enemy creatures will no longer affect the test feature with enemy presence (only players will) Unique creatures will now never run out of stamina. Treating wounds with healing covers is now a bit easier', '<ul><li><i>Only premium players with 21 strength may dig on, unpave, drop dirt on (no 21 strength required), and flatten near roads in order to reduce the widespread griefing. Vynora priest restrictions removed.</i></li>\n<li>CMs may now use red colored chat.</li>\n<li><i>Enemy creatures will no longer affect the test feature with enemy presence (only players will)</i></li>\n<li>Unique creatures will now never run out of stamina.</li>\n<li><i>Treating wounds with healing covers is now a bit easier</i></li></ul>', 49),
(20735, 5244, '070416', '070416', 'In about a week the minimum settlement drain amount will rise to about 75 coppers in order to get rid of cheap obstructing homestead deeds. This means you may want to consider upping your defenses if the deed is located in a warzone. Test Feature: In order to promote warfare on the wild server (mainly to make it harder for wl priests to cohort with HOTS), long-term enemy presence will make the other side gain less (0.8 times) skill for non-aggressive tasks. After a while more you gain bonuses to aggressive spells, attacks, and damage while fighting players. You will notice when this kicks in. In order to make it harder to detect players, all enemy kingdom creatures have the same effect. Libila priests may now mine. You may no longer destroy house walls in your own kingdom on a home server unless you are guest, owner, or citizen of the same village as the structure. Expanding a deed now a) gives half the money back for the old deed to the mayor and b) keeps the old upkeep c) adds a months worth of light upkeep. You may only destroy your own kingdoms guard towers if they are made by you, or is located on your settlement.', '<ul><li><i>In about a week the minimum settlement drain amount will rise to about 75 coppers in order to get rid of cheap obstructing homestead deeds. This means you may want to consider upping your defenses if the deed is located in a warzone.</i></li>\n<li><b>Test Feature:</b> In order to promote warfare on the wild server (mainly to make it harder for wl priests to cohort with HOTS), long-term enemy presence will make the other side gain less (0.8 times) skill for non-aggressive tasks. After a while more you gain bonuses to aggressive spells, attacks, and damage while fighting players. You will notice when this kicks in. In order to make it harder to detect players, all enemy kingdom creatures have the same effect.</li>\n<li><i>Libila priests may now mine.</i></li>\n<li>You may no longer destroy house walls in your own kingdom on a home server unless you are guest, owner, or citizen of the same village as the structure.</li>\n<li><i>Expanding a deed now a) gives half the money back for the old deed to the mayor and b) keeps the old upkeep c) adds a months worth of light upkeep.</i></li>\n<li>You may only destroy your own kingdoms guard towers if they are made by you, or is located on your settlement.</li></ul>', 50),
(20736, 5244, '070408', '070408', 'Watch out for the easter bunny! An exploit where dominated animals did not fight back when attacked near cave openings should be fixed. Report if it is still bugged and be warned that demotion is at hand if you are caught doing it. Some players were demoted already and more may follow. Contact the GM', '<ul><li><i>Watch out for the easter bunny!</i></li>\n<li>An exploit where dominated animals did not fight back when attacked near cave openings should be fixed. Report if it is still bugged and be warned that demotion is at hand if you are caught doing it. Some players were demoted already and more may follow. Contact the GM</li></ul>', 51),
(20737, 5244, '070404', '070404', 'You will no longer receive notification about when you are being ignored by another player. Left hand speed was increased somewhat. It was severely bugged before thought so it probably wont increase much more if anything. Guard Towers now have slightly more influence. Size 5 homesteads have less influence The sceptre of ascension is more powerful when desecrating other altars. Shield bashing now does some damage.', '<ul><li><i>You will no longer receive notification about when you are being ignored by another player.</i></li>\n<li>Left hand speed was increased somewhat. It was severely bugged before thought so it probably wont increase much more if anything.</li>\n<li><i>Guard Towers now have slightly more influence. Size 5 homesteads have less influence</i></li>\n<li>The sceptre of ascension is more powerful when desecrating other altars.</li>\n<li><i>Shield bashing now does some damage.</i></li></ul>', 52),
(20738, 5244, '070402', '070402', 'Hits to eyes should be much more rare now. A bug with secondary weapons made them attack too frequently. Animals will now turn towards you when you try to tame them. A bug with locate artifact fixed.', '<ul><li><i>Hits to eyes should be much more rare now.</i></li>\n<li>A bug with secondary weapons made them attack too frequently.</li>\n<li><i>Animals will now turn towards you when you try to tame them.</i></li>\n<li>A bug with locate artifact fixed.</li></ul>', 53),
(20739, 5244, '070313', '070313', 'Creatures now look around for enemies periodically. Bug with stealing and detection fixed. Taming distance has been diminished so you now need to be closer to the animal. The reputation of a criminal is not reset to 0 any longer when he/she is killed by the guards. He/She has to spawn outside the village instead.', '<ul><li>Creatures now look around for enemies periodically.</li>\n<li><i>Bug with stealing and detection fixed.</i></li>\n<li>Taming distance has been diminished so you now need to be closer to the animal.</li>\n<li><i>The reputation of a criminal is not reset to 0 any longer when he/she is killed by the guards. He/She has to spawn outside the village instead.</i></li></ul>', 54),
(20740, 5244, '070308', '070308', 'Rafts and carts now move more smoothly. Flower generation was altered a bit. A bug with faith bonus for Magranon made it affect fighting skill gain and weapon damage for everyone with high enough faith and favor. Bug with giving pets commands on fields fixed.', '<ul><li>Rafts and carts now move more smoothly.</li>\n<li><i>Flower generation was altered a bit.</i></li>\n<li>A bug with faith bonus for Magranon made it affect fighting skill gain and weapon damage for everyone with high enough faith and favor.</li>\n<li><i>Bug with giving pets commands on fields fixed.</i></li></ul>', 55),
(20741, 5244, '070301', '070301', 'Rafts and carts now use a new system when dragged that uses less network and server resources. Still a bit ugly but it will look better next week again. Bug with the killing arrow disappearing fixed. You may no longer add both FA and RT enchants to a weapon. Consider old weapons with both enchants treasures:) Flowers now spread to nearby dirt tiles.', '<ul><li>Rafts and carts now use a new system when dragged that uses less network and server resources. Still a bit ugly but it will look better next week again.</li>\n<li><i>Bug with the killing arrow disappearing fixed.</i></li>\n<li>You may no longer add both FA and RT enchants to a weapon. Consider old weapons with both enchants treasures:)</li>\n<li><i>Flowers now spread to nearby dirt tiles.</i></li></ul>', 56),
(20742, 5244, '070227', '070227', 'Pottery skillgain was made faster. Log weight was lowered a bit in order to reduce the amount of scrap produced. Door and gate locks were not sacrificing properly. This has hopefully been fixed.', '<ul><li><i>Pottery skillgain was made faster.</i></li>\n<li>Log weight was lowered a bit in order to reduce the amount of scrap produced.</li>\n<li><i>Door and gate locks were not sacrificing properly. This has hopefully been fixed.</i></li></ul>', 57),
(20743, 5244, '070222', '070222', 'Containers and unfinished items may no longer be enchanted. The only effect the option had was the possibility to destroy them.', '<ul><li><i>Containers and unfinished items may no longer be enchanted. The only effect the option had was the possibility to destroy them.</i></li></ul>', 58),
(20744, 5244, '070221', '070221', 'The absorb rate was made quicker. Found a/the bug with FA-wounds.(!) Spells cast on items may now fail again and even destroy the item.', '<ul><li><i>The absorb rate was made quicker.</i></li>\n<li>Found a/the bug with FA-wounds.(!)</li>\n<li><i>Spells cast on items may now fail again and even destroy the item.</i></li></ul>', 59),
(20745, 5244, '070219', '070219', 'Flower patches are now generated by the server that you may replant if your gardening skill is high enough. The flower descriptions and names will change later. HOTS members may now absorb mycelium at a slower rate. You will now take a reputation hit again when attacking someone considered innocent (non-HOTS only).', '<ul><li><i>Flower patches are now generated by the server that you may replant if your gardening skill is high enough. The flower descriptions and names will change later.</i></li>\n<li>HOTS members may now absorb mycelium at a slower rate.</li>\n<li>You will now take a reputation hit again when attacking someone considered innocent (non-HOTS only).</li></ul>', 60),
(20746, 5244, '070213', '070213', 'Street lamps now decay slower. Alignment requirement removed when changing religion now. Fixed a bug with village motto having \" characters. A strange disease runs through the land, driving cows mad and killing them off at a high rate.', '<ul><li>Street lamps now decay slower.</li>\n<li><i>Alignment requirement removed when changing religion now.</i></li>\n<li>Fixed a bug with village motto having \" characters.</li>\n<li><i>A strange disease runs through the land, driving cows mad and killing them off at a high rate.</i></li></ul>', 61),
(20747, 5244, '070209', '070209', 'Bug fixes with lamp. Crocodiles are even harder to tame. Lava fiends may now be dominated. Chicken pox runs through the land, killing off hens, chickens and roosters at a high rate.', '<ul><li>Bug fixes with lamp.</li>\n<li>Crocodiles are even harder to tame. Lava fiends may now be dominated.</li>\n<li>Chicken pox runs through the land, killing off hens, chickens and roosters at a high rate.</li></ul>', 62),
(20748, 5244, '070208', '070208', 'Newbies now have 24 hours faint free light. Lots of icons mapped. Thanks Kilean for helping out. Added floor boards and street lamps. Butchering skill progress increased.', '<ul><li><i>Newbies now have 24 hours faint free light.</i></li>\n<li>Lots of icons mapped. Thanks Kilean for helping out.</li>\n<li><i>Added floor boards and street lamps.</i></li>\n<li>Butchering skill progress increased.</li></ul>', 63),
(20749, 5244, '070206', '070206', 'Bug where premium HOTS could swim to home fixed. Short sword damage was lowered. You may now cultivate moss.', '<ul><li><i>Bug where premium HOTS could swim to home fixed.</i></li>\n<li>Short sword damage was lowered.</li>\n<li><i>You may now cultivate moss.</i></li></ul>', 64),
(20750, 5244, '070201', '070201', 'Twohanded sword damage upped. Crocodiles are now aggressive and harder to tame. Mining bug fixed.', '<ul><li><i>Twohanded sword damage upped.</i></li>\n<li>Crocodiles are now aggressive and harder to tame.</li>\n<li><i>Mining bug fixed.</i></li></ul>', 65),
(20751, 5244, '070123', '070123', 'Bug where you were able to found settlements in the wrong places fixed. Guards dying at spawn fixed. New technology was found that made mortar require less sand and clay. The erosion caused by masons before was reported to be massive:) A player corpse may now be looted by his/her friends, fellow citizens, or allies given that he or she is still online.', '<ul><li><i>Bug where you were able to found settlements in the wrong places fixed.</i></li>\n<li>Guards dying at spawn fixed.</li>\n<li><i>New technology was found that made mortar require less sand and clay. The erosion caused by masons before was reported to be massive:)</i></li>\n<li>A player corpse may now be looted by his/her friends, fellow citizens, or allies given that he or she is still online.</li></ul>', 66),
(20752, 5244, '070122', '070122', 'Signs may now only be turned by the person planting it or citizens of the village. The check for skill 30 in masonry in order to build stone house walls now works. A bug with village skill decay bonus was fixed. You should now be able to sacrifice locks as well. Also found a bug with sacrificing keys. You should now be able to found settlements as close as 50 tiles away from a homestead, or 20 tiles if the homestead accepts settlements that close. Dogs now swim.', '<ul><li><i>Signs may now only be turned by the person planting it or citizens of the village.</i></li>\n<li>The check for skill 30 in masonry in order to build stone house walls now works.</li>\n<li><i>A bug with village skill decay bonus was fixed.</i></li>\n<li>You should now be able to sacrifice locks as well. Also found a bug with sacrificing keys.</li>\n<li><i>You should now be able to found settlements as close as 50 tiles away from a homestead, or 20 tiles if the homestead accepts settlements that close.</i></li>\n<li>Dogs now swim.</li></ul>', 67),
(20753, 5244, '070116', '070116', 'Settlements now receive a bonus to skill decay that grows over time. Signs may now be removed by the person who planted it or the citizens if planted in a settlement. Yet another fix to stone house walls improvement and repair. You are now able to sacrifice unused keys.', '<ul><li>Settlements now receive a bonus to skill decay that grows over time.</li>\n<li><i>Signs may now be removed by the person who planted it or the citizens if planted in a settlement.</i></li>\n<li>Yet another fix to stone house walls improvement and repair.</li>\n<li><i>You are now able to sacrifice unused keys.</i></li></ul>', 68),
(20754, 5244, '070115', '070115', 'The sever crashed because it was unable to create native threads. This should be or will be remedied shortly if the current configuration does not work. Stone house walls now requires stone bricks to be improved and repaired.', '<ul><li>The sever crashed because it was unable to create native threads. This should be or will be remedied shortly if the current configuration does not work.</li>\n<li><i>Stone house walls now requires stone bricks to be improved and repaired.</i></li></ul>', 69),
(20755, 5244, '070113', '070113', 'The fairly annoying bug where the brick you were holding when building house walls was deleted fixed. You now need a trowel instead, which is more in line with the need for a hammer when building normal walls as well. Trading with traders fixed.', '<ul><li><i>The fairly annoying bug where the brick you were holding when building house walls was deleted fixed. You now need a trowel instead, which is more in line with the need for a hammer when building normal walls as well.</i></li>\n<li>Trading with traders fixed.</li></ul>', 70),
(20756, 5244, '070112', '070112', 'You may now build stone house walls if you have masonry skill 30. Flaming aura damage was lowered to 1/3d.', '<ul><li><i>You may now build stone house walls if you have masonry skill 30.</i></li>\n<li>Flaming aura damage was lowered to 1/3d.</li></ul>', 71),
(20757, 5244, '070110', '070110', 'The game servers now have double the amount of RAM and upgraded operating systems and java versions in order to increase stability. Shields now take 1/5th of the damage they used to. Sleeping in beds should work again.', '<ul><li>The game servers now have double the amount of RAM and upgraded operating systems and java versions in order to increase stability.</li>\n<li><i>Shields now take 1/5th of the damage they used to.</i></li>\n<li>Sleeping in beds should work again.</li></ul>', 72),
(20758, 5244, '070109', '070109', 'Fixed a possible reason for finishing lag, and the ghost items. Coloring items on the ground should work again and colored carts as well.', '<ul><li>Fixed a possible reason for finishing lag, and the ghost items.</li>\n<li><i>Coloring items on the ground should work again and colored carts as well.</i></li></ul>', 73),
(20759, 5244, '070104', '070104', 'Fixed another crash bug. Guard towers may no longer be constructed near the huge altars.', '<ul><li>Fixed another crash bug.</li>\n<li><i>Guard towers may no longer be constructed near the huge altars.</i></li></ul>', 74),
(20760, 5244, '070103', '070103', 'After several days of burning agony since the dawn of the new millennium, the lands of Wurm suddenly heaved and shattered, forming new islands. Rafts float again. You may no longer deed the area within 100 tiles of the huge altars on the wild server. You may no longer build fences within 20 tiles of the huge altars on the wild server. Fixed the bug that made the server shut down yesterday.', '<ul><li>After several days of burning agony since the dawn of the new millennium, the lands of Wurm suddenly heaved and shattered, forming new islands.</li>\n<li>Rafts float again.</li>\n<li>You may no longer deed the area within 100 tiles of the huge altars on the wild server.</li>\n<li>You may no longer build fences within 20 tiles of the huge altars on the wild server.</li>\n<li>Fixed the bug that made the server shut down yesterday.</li></ul>', 75),
(20764, 1501, 'Description', 'Description', 'A brass lamp with a wick.', '<p><i>A brass lamp with a wick.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(20765, 1501, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Is used as a personal light source. Fill it with 0.13 kg of olive oil or tar , then light it with a steel and flint . Brass oil lamps will burn indefinitely if on-deed. The lamp quality determines how far it can illuminate. Brass oil lamps have been shown to be marginally more fuel efficient compared to iron lanterns, and also decay much slower. Dye only affects the light given, not the appearance of the item.', '<ul><li>Is used as a personal light source.</li>\n<li>Fill it with 0.13 kg of <a href=\"/index.php/Olive_oil\" title=\"Olive oil\">olive oil</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Tar\" title=\"Tar\">tar</a>, then light it with a <a href=\"/index.php/Steel_and_flint\" title=\"Steel and flint\">steel and flint</a>.</li>\n<li>Brass oil lamps will burn indefinitely if on-deed.</li>\n<li>The lamp quality determines how far it can illuminate.</li>\n<li>Brass oil lamps have been shown to be marginally more fuel efficient compared to iron lanterns, and also decay much slower.</li>\n<li>Dye only affects the light given, not the appearance of the item.</li></ul>', 1),
(20766, 1501, 'Other personal lamp options', 'Other_personal_lamp_options', 'Lantern Carved pumpkin Torch Metal torch Candle Items with glow runes attached', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Lantern\" title=\"Lantern\">Lantern</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Carved_pumpkin\" title=\"Carved pumpkin\">Carved pumpkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Torch\" title=\"Torch\">Torch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Metal_torch\" title=\"Metal torch\">Metal torch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Candle\" title=\"Candle\">Candle</a></li>\n<li>Items with glow <a href=\"/index.php/Runes\" title=\"Runes\">runes</a> attached</li></ul>', 2),
(20775, 5249, 'Description', 'Description', 'A brick designed to fit in a Colossus.', '<p><i>A brick designed to fit in a Colossus.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(20776, 5249, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Used to create a colossus . Also used in creating rough cobblestone pavement.', '<ul><li>Used to create a <a href=\"/index.php/Colossus\" title=\"Colossus\">colossus</a>.</li>\n<li>Also used in creating <a href=\"/index.php/Rough_cobblestone\" title=\"Rough cobblestone\">rough cobblestone</a> pavement.</li></ul>', 1),
(20777, 5251, 'Description', 'Description', 'A wooden mailbox fashioned in the way of a small house. - Courier or Dark Messenger has been cast on it, so it seems to be possessed by something.', '<p><i>A wooden <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Mailbox\" title=\"Mailbox\">mailbox</a> fashioned in the way of a small house.</i> - <i>Courier or Dark Messenger has been cast on it, so it seems to be possessed by something.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(20778, 5251, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Once enchanted with Courier or Dark messenger by a priest , the mailbox can be used to transport mail to other players. The mailboxes used to send and receive must both be enchanted. A failure on casting cannot shatter the mailbox. Enchanting multiple times has a chance of improving the cast without any risk. The quality of the finished mailbox does not affect the mail system but will reduce the decay rate of the mailbox itself. The quality of the spell cast will affect how fast mail travels from the mailbox. The plank QL increases the chance of success. It is not easy to create at very low fine carpentry , but, as usual, the quality of materials helps with the chance to successfully attach them. Upon failure to create, the small nails will be damaged a bit. It may not be loaded or picked up after completion, but it may be pushed.', '<ul><li>Once enchanted with <a href=\"/index.php/Courier\" title=\"Courier\">Courier</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Dark_messenger\" title=\"Dark messenger\">Dark messenger</a> by a <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priest</a>, the mailbox can be used to transport <a href=\"/index.php/Mail\" title=\"Mail\">mail</a> to other players.</li>\n<li>The mailboxes used to send and receive must both be enchanted.</li>\n<li>A failure on casting cannot shatter the mailbox. Enchanting multiple times has a chance of improving the cast without any risk.</li>\n<li>The quality of the finished mailbox does not affect the mail system but will reduce the decay rate of the mailbox itself. The quality of the spell cast will affect how fast mail travels from the mailbox.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/index.php/Plank\" title=\"Plank\">plank</a> QL increases the chance of success. It is not easy to create at very low <a href=\"/index.php/Fine_carpentry\" title=\"Fine carpentry\">fine carpentry</a>, but, as usual, the quality of materials helps with the chance to successfully attach them.</li>\n<li>Upon failure to create, the <a href=\"/index.php/Small_nails\" title=\"Small nails\">small nails</a> will be damaged a bit.</li>\n<li>It may not be loaded or picked up after completion, but it may be pushed.</li></ul>', 1),
(20779, 5251, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Mail Spirit mansion Spirit cottage Spirit castle', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Mail\" title=\"Mail\">Mail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Spirit_mansion\" title=\"Spirit mansion\">Spirit mansion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Spirit_cottage\" title=\"Spirit cottage\">Spirit cottage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Spirit_castle\" title=\"Spirit castle\">Spirit castle</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20861, 3367, 'Description', 'Description', 'Temperature is an important factor in crafting many objects for certain skills, such as smithing , pottery , and cooking . An object needs to be raised to a specific temperature in order to be worked with, usually needing to reach the \"glowing\" levels. The temperature scale has 7 divisions: Warm Very warm Hot Searing hot Glowing dimly from the heat - red indicator - sufficiently hot to work with the item. Glowing brightly from the heat - blue indicator - very hot (more than required) and will remain hot for a while. Glowing white-hot - white indicator - at or near maximum temperature possible (way more than required) and will remain hot for a long time.', '<p>Temperature is an important factor in crafting many objects for certain skills, such as <a href=\"/index.php/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\">smithing</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Pottery\" title=\"Pottery\">pottery</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a>. An object needs to be raised to a specific temperature in order to be worked with, usually needing to reach the \"glowing\" levels.\n</p>\n<p>The temperature scale has 7 divisions:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Warm</b></li>\n<li><b>Very warm</b></li>\n<li><b>Hot</b></li>\n<li><b>Searing hot</b></li>\n<li><b>Glowing dimly from the heat</b> - red indicator - sufficiently hot to work with the item.</li>\n<li><b>Glowing brightly from the heat</b> - blue indicator - very hot (more than required) and will remain hot for a while.</li>\n<li><b>Glowing white-hot</b> - white indicator - at or near maximum temperature possible (way more than required) and will remain hot for a long time.</li></ul>', 0),
(20862, 3367, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The time it takes items to heat up depends on the quality of the item and heating apparatus ( campfire , stone forge , stone oven , etc). Higher quality metal lumps will retain their heat longer than lower quality lumps when removed from a forge. Food may or may not need to reach \"glowing\" depending on what\'s being cooked.', '<ul><li>The time it takes items to heat up depends on the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the item and heating apparatus (<a href=\"/index.php/Campfire\" title=\"Campfire\">campfire</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stone_forge\" title=\"Stone forge\">stone forge</a>, <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Stone_oven\" title=\"Stone oven\">stone oven</a>, etc).</li>\n<li>Higher quality metal lumps will retain their heat longer than lower quality lumps when removed from a forge.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Food\" title=\"Food\">Food</a> may or may not need to reach \"glowing\" depending on what\'s being cooked.</li></ul>', 1),
(20863, 3367, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Fuel', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Fuel\" title=\"Fuel\">Fuel</a></li></ul>', 2),
(20866, 5277, 'Description', 'Description', 'Special moves are gained when you have enough skill in a specific weapon. You can only perform special moves with your primary weapon (a weapon equipped in your right hand), and in certain stances. \nEach class of weapon has six special moves, two of which are generic and shared among all weapons in that kingdom. Special moves cost more stamina to use than regular attacks, but instead inflict unique effects on the opponent. Failing to perform the move will cost you 1/3 of the original stamina cost. The chance to hit is based on your primary weapon skill and the difficulty of the move. Special moves cannot be parried, blocked, or dodged. Special moves cannot be initiated if the opponent takes a protective stance that protects the area you are aiming at.  You will not be able to execute special moves in a fight until after you are into the fight and can focus.', '<p>Special moves are gained when you have enough skill in a specific weapon. You can only perform special moves with your primary weapon (a weapon equipped in your right hand), and in certain stances. \nEach class of weapon has six special moves, two of which are generic and shared among all weapons in that kingdom. Special moves cost more stamina to use than regular attacks, but instead inflict unique effects on the opponent. Failing to perform the move will cost you 1/3 of the original stamina cost. The chance to hit is based on your primary weapon skill and the difficulty of the move. Special moves cannot be parried, blocked, or dodged. Special moves cannot be initiated if the opponent takes a protective stance that protects the area you are aiming at.  You will not be able to execute special moves in a fight until after you are into the fight and can focus.\n</p>', 0);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
