h=\"934\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"150\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/d9/Tomato-harvest.jpg/193px-Tomato-harvest.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d9/Tomato-harvest.jpg/289px-Tomato-harvest.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d9/Tomato-harvest.jpg/385px-Tomato-harvest.jpg 2x\" width=\"193\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Tomato</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 235px\"><div style=\"width: 235px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 230px;\"><div style=\"margin:27px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Wemp-harvest.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"398\" data-file-width=\"631\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"126\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/94/Wemp-harvest.png/200px-Wemp-harvest.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/94/Wemp-harvest.png/300px-Wemp-harvest.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/94/Wemp-harvest.png/400px-Wemp-harvest.png 2x\" width=\"200\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Wemp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 235px\"><div style=\"width: 235px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 230px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Wheat-harvest.png\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"534\" data-file-width=\"708\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"150\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/76/Wheat-harvest.png/199px-Wheat-harvest.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/76/Wheat-harvest.png/298px-Wheat-harvest.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/76/Wheat-harvest.png/398px-Wheat-harvest.png 2x\" width=\"199\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Wheat</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>', 9),
(23792, 4433, 'Description', 'Description', 'A fillet of meat.', '<p><i>A fillet of meat.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(23793, 4433, 'See also', 'See_also', 'A piece of meat that has been cut into pieces with a butchering knife or carving knife . Meat', '<ul><li>A piece of meat that has been cut into pieces with a <a href=\"/index.php/Butchering_knife\" title=\"Butchering knife\">butchering knife</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Carving_knife\" title=\"Carving knife\">carving knife</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/index.php/Meat\" title=\"Meat\">Meat</a>\n</p>', 1),
(23797, 3236, 'Description', 'Description', 'A fillet of fish.', '<p><i>A fillet of fish.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(23798, 3236, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Activate a butchering knife or carving knife , right-click a fish , and select Fillet. Fish must weigh more than 0.65kg in order to make fillets. A fish fillet is a 0.3kg fillet of fish used in cooking .', '<ul><li>Activate a <a href=\"/index.php/Butchering_knife\" title=\"Butchering knife\">butchering knife</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Carving_knife\" title=\"Carving knife\">carving knife</a>, right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">fish</a>, and select Fillet.</li>\n<li>Fish must weigh more than 0.65kg in order to make fillets.</li>\n<li>A <b>fish fillet</b> is a 0.3kg fillet of <a href=\"/index.php/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">fish</a> used in <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(23799, 3236, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Fish', '<p><a href=\"/index.php/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">Fish</a>\n</p>', 2),
(23800, 5983, 'Description', 'Description', 'Venom is a spell given to priests of Fo at 62 faith. It is a weapon enchantment that deals poison wounds to opponents when struck with it.', '<p><b>Venom</b> is a spell given to priests of Fo at 62 faith. It is a weapon enchantment that deals poison wounds to opponents when struck with it.\n</p>', 0),
(23801, 5983, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate a statuette of Fo Right-click on an item Select Spells > Venom', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> a <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Fo\" title=\"Statuette of Fo\">statuette of Fo</a></li>\n<li>Right-click on an item</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Venom</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23802, 5983, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Wounds caused by this enchantment bypass the glancing effect of armour in PVE , in PVP sets the glance rate of the targets armour to 20%. Has no effect on glance rate against Uniques . This spell will stack with Blessings of the dark , Circle of cunning , Demise spells , Mind stealer , Nimbleness and Wind of ages . This spell will not stack with Bloodthirst , Flaming aura , Frostbrand , Life transfer , Essence drain , and Rotting touch . Can be reflected back by Aura of shared pain .', '<ul><li>Wounds caused by this enchantment bypass the glancing effect of armour in <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/PVE\" title=\"PVE\">PVE</a>, in <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/PVP\" title=\"PVP\">PVP</a> sets the glance rate of the targets armour to 20%.</li>\n<li>Has no effect on glance rate against <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Uniques\" title=\"Uniques\">Uniques</a>.</li>\n<li>This spell will stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Blessings_of_the_dark\" title=\"Blessings of the dark\">Blessings of the dark</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Demise spells</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_stealer\" title=\"Mind stealer\">Mind stealer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Nimbleness\" title=\"Nimbleness\">Nimbleness</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>.</li>\n<li>This spell will <b>not</b> stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Flaming_aura\" title=\"Flaming aura\">Flaming aura</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Frostbrand\" title=\"Frostbrand\">Frostbrand</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Life_transfer\" title=\"Life transfer\">Life transfer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Essence_drain\" title=\"Essence drain\">Essence drain</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Rotting_touch\" title=\"Rotting touch\">Rotting touch</a>.</li>\n<li>Can be reflected back by <a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>.</li></ul>', 2),
(23803, 2315, 'Description', 'Description', 'Wild growth is an area of effect spell given to priests of Fo at 41 faith. An invigorating energy flows through you into the ground and reaches the roots of plants and trees. It nurtures trees advancing their growth and tends fields within a small radius around the caster.  It will not advance field age, just tend the field and give increased harvest as if you had manually farmed the field.', '<p><b>Wild growth</b> is an area of effect spell given to priests of Fo at 41 faith.\n</p>\n<p><i>An invigorating energy flows through you into the ground and reaches the roots of plants and trees.</i>\n</p>\n<p>It nurtures trees advancing their growth and tends fields within a small radius around the caster.  It will not advance field age, just tend the field and give increased harvest as if you had manually farmed the field.\n</p>', 0),
(23804, 2315, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate a statuette of Fo Right-click a tile Select Spells > Wild growth', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> a <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Fo\" title=\"Statuette of Fo\">statuette of Fo</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a tile</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Wild growth</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23805, 2315, 'Range', 'Range', 'The range affected by the spell is determined by the power of the cast (up to 4 tiles radius) Higher Channeling will increase the chance it hits more Tiles . Linking with another Fo priest increases the range but makes the spell harder to cast.', '<ul><li>The range affected by the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Spell\" title=\"Spell\">spell</a> is determined by the power of the cast (up to 4 tiles radius)</li>\n<li>Higher <a href=\"/index.php/Channeling\" title=\"Channeling\">Channeling</a> will increase the chance it hits more <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">Tiles</a>.\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Link\" title=\"Link\">Linking</a> with another <a href=\"/index.php/Fo\" title=\"Fo\">Fo</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priest</a> increases the range but makes the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Spell\" title=\"Spell\">spell</a> harder to cast.</li></ul></li></ul>', 2),
(23806, 2315, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Gives the same chance of increased crop yields as tending the field with a rake does. Trees and bushes are set one growth step up, fresh planted sprouts take around 4 casts to get the tree/bush to mature Trees and bushes fresh planted and grown in season do not yield a harvest . Cutting a sprout and casting Wild growth has a high chance to give the tree/bush a sprout again This is highly useful to get a lot of sprouts if the area is dense filled with the same type of tree/bush Casting Wild Growth is effective in increasing hedge growth stages. (One cast per growth stage for hedges) Note: If casting on deed, it is recommended that you are a villager of that deed. Otherwise you may receive the following message \"You are not allowed to affect the hedges in [settlement name].\" When casting on the center tile to affect hedges in the 3x3 area, the hedges on the NW tile borders will be affected while the SE will not. Trees and bushes go through 15 stages and each cast will advance them one stage. Taking a sprout will retreat a tree back one stage and pruning will retreat the tree to very old. Shriveled trees do not replant themselves, a grass tile results, when wild growth advances their age. Tree and bush stages are: young, young, young, mature, mature, mature, mature-sprouting, old, old-sprouting, old, old-sprouting, very old, very old-sprouting, overaged, shriveled. Age Weight Sprout Young 1.60 KG Young 3.20 KG Young 4.80 KG Mature 11.2 KG Mature 11.2 KG Mature 11.2 KG Mature 11.2 KG Yes Old 106.67 KG Old 120 KG Yes Old 133.33 KG Old 146.67 KG Yes Very old 160 KG Very old 173.33 KG Yes Overaged 186.67 KG Shriveled 4.80 KG', '<ul><li>Gives the same chance of increased crop yields as tending the field with a rake does.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Tree\" title=\"Tree\">Trees</a> and bushes are set one growth step up, fresh planted sprouts take around 4 casts to get the tree/bush to mature</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trees\" title=\"Trees\">Trees</a> and bushes fresh planted and grown in <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Season\" title=\"Season\">season</a> <b>do not</b> yield a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Harvest\" title=\"Harvest\">harvest</a>.</li>\n<li>Cutting a sprout and casting <b>Wild growth</b> has a high chance to give the tree/bush a sprout again\n<ul><li>This is highly useful to get a lot of sprouts if the area is dense filled with the same type of tree/bush</li></ul></li>\n<li>Casting Wild Growth is effective in increasing hedge growth stages. (One cast per growth stage for hedges)\n<ul><li>Note: If casting on deed, it is recommended that you are a villager of that deed. Otherwise you may receive the following message \"You are not allowed to affect the hedges in [settlement name].\"</li></ul></li>\n<li>When casting on the center tile to affect hedges in the 3x3 area, the hedges on the NW tile borders will be affected while the SE will not.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Trees and bushes go through 15 stages and each cast will advance them one stage. Taking a sprout will retreat a tree back one stage and <a href=\"/index.php/Forestry#Pruning\" title=\"Forestry\">pruning</a> will retreat the tree to very old.</li>\n<li>Shriveled trees do not replant themselves, a grass tile results, when wild growth advances their age.</li>\n<li>Tree and bush stages are: young, young, young, mature, mature, mature, mature-sprouting, old, old-sprouting, old, old-sprouting, very old, very old-sprouting, overaged, shriveled.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Age\n</th>\n<th>Weight\n</th>\n<th>Sprout\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Young</td>\n<td>1.60 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Young</td>\n<td>3.20 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Young</td>\n<td>4.80 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mature</td>\n<td>11.2 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mature</td>\n<td>11.2 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mature</td>\n<td>11.2 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mature</td>\n<td>11.2 KG</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Old</td>\n<td>106.67 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Old</td>\n<td>120 KG</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Old</td>\n<td>133.33 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Old</td>\n<td>146.67 KG</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Very old</td>\n<td>160 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Very old</td>\n<td>173.33 KG</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overaged</td>\n<td>186.67 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shriveled</td>\n<td>4.80 KG</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>', 3),
(23807, 1725, 'Description', 'Description', 'Rotting gut is a damage-dealing spell given to priests of Libila. It can be cast on creatures or other players, and gives the target an acid wound, with damage based on the power of the cast.', '<p><b>Rotting gut</b> is a damage-dealing spell given to priests of Libila. It can be cast on creatures or other players, and gives the target an acid wound, with damage based on the power of the cast.\n</p>', 0),
(23808, 1725, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Rotting gut has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Rotting gut has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes.\n</p>', 1),
(23809, 3406, 'Description', 'Description', 'Worm brains is a damage-dealing spell given to priests of Libila. It can be cast on creatures or other players, and gives the target an internal head wound with damage depending on casting power. Internal wounds can\'t be healed with cotton.', '<p><b>Worm brains</b> is a damage-dealing spell given to priests of Libila. It can be cast on creatures or other players, and gives the target an internal head wound with damage depending on casting power. <a href=\"/index.php/Wound#Wound_Types\" title=\"Wound\">Internal wounds</a> can\'t be healed with cotton.\n</p>', 0),
(23810, 3406, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Worm brains has a maximum resistance duration of 5 minutes. This spell, Inferno , and Hypothermia share a resistance timer.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Worm brains has a maximum resistance duration of 5 minutes.\n</p>\n<p>This spell, <a href=\"/index.php/Inferno\" title=\"Inferno\">Inferno</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Hypothermia\" title=\"Hypothermia\">Hypothermia</a> share a resistance timer.\n</p>', 1),
(23811, 3406, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate a statuette of Libila Right-click another player, or creature Select Spells > Worm brains', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> a <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Libila\" title=\"Statuette of Libila\">statuette of Libila</a></li>\n<li>Right-click another player, or creature</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Worm brains</i></li></ol>', 2),
(23815, 2978, 'Description', 'Description', 'A piece of cloth, about an arm length square. A square piece of cloth is made from string of cloth .', '<p><i>A piece of cloth, about an arm length square.</i>\n</p>\n<p>A <b>square piece of cloth</b> is made from <a href=\"/index.php/String_of_cloth\" title=\"String of cloth\">string of cloth</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(23816, 2978, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Cloth armour Dredge Satchel Sheet of cloth Small square sail Square sail Triangular sail Wooden altar Market stall Range pole Flag Kingdom flag Banner Kingdom banner Tall Kingdom banner', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cloth_armour\" title=\"Cloth armour\">Cloth armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Dredge\" title=\"Dredge\">Dredge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Satchel\" title=\"Satchel\">Satchel</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sheet_of_cloth\" title=\"Sheet of cloth\">Sheet of cloth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Small_square_sail\" title=\"Small square sail\">Small square sail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Square_sail\" title=\"Square sail\">Square sail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Triangular_sail\" title=\"Triangular sail\">Triangular sail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_altar\" title=\"Wooden altar\">Wooden altar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Market_stall\" title=\"Market stall\">Market stall</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Range_pole\" title=\"Range pole\">Range pole</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Flag\" title=\"Flag\">Flag</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Kingdom_flag\" title=\"Kingdom flag\">Kingdom flag</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Banner\" title=\"Banner\">Banner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Kingdom_banner\" title=\"Kingdom banner\">Kingdom banner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Tall_Kingdom_banner\" title=\"Tall Kingdom banner\">Tall Kingdom banner</a></li></ul>', 1),
(23817, 2978, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The quality of the floor loom affects the success chance. Maximum combined weight is 19.20 kg (0.30 kg piece x 64 pieces) A square of cotton cloth can be used to bandage wounds Low quality square pieces of cloth can be foraged from Flotsam Resource nodes', '<ul><li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Floor_loom\" title=\"Floor loom\">floor loom</a> affects the success chance.</li>\n<li>Maximum combined weight is 19.20 kg (0.30 kg piece x 64 pieces)</li>\n<li>A square of cotton cloth can be used to bandage <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Wounds\" title=\"Wounds\">wounds</a></li>\n<li>Low quality square pieces of cloth can be foraged from <a href=\"/index.php/Flotsam\" title=\"Flotsam\">Flotsam</a> <a href=\"/index.php/Resource_nodes\" title=\"Resource nodes\">Resource nodes</a></li></ul>', 2),
(23818, 2736, 'Description', 'Description', 'A fine string of cloth wound around a piece of wood .', '<p><i>A fine <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">string of cloth</a> wound around a piece of <a href=\"/index.php/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a>.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(23819, 2736, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The quality of the wooden spindle very minorly affects chance of success on creation. Maximum combined weight is 12.80Kg', '<ul><li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Wooden_spindle\" title=\"Wooden spindle\">wooden spindle</a> very minorly affects chance of success on creation.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Maximum combined weight is 12.80Kg</li></ul>', 1),
(23820, 2736, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Candle First aid Fishing line Floor Loom Meditation rugs Square piece of cloth Yoyo Hay bundle', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Candle\" title=\"Candle\">Candle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/First_aid\" title=\"First aid\">First aid</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fishing_line\" title=\"Fishing line\">Fishing line</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Floor_Loom\" title=\"Floor Loom\">Floor Loom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Meditating_rugs\" title=\"Category:Meditating rugs\">Meditation rugs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Square_piece_of_cloth\" title=\"Square piece of cloth\">Square piece of cloth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Yoyo\" title=\"Yoyo\">Yoyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Hay_bundle\" title=\"Hay bundle\">Hay bundle</a></li></ul>', 2),
(23824, 5991, 'Description', 'Description', 'Linking is the process by which multiple priests can add their favor to a main priest who need additional favor to cast higher level spells. This will allow the recipient access to your favor but not the other way around.', '<p><b>Linking</b> is the process by which multiple <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priests</a> can add their favor to a main priest who need additional favor to cast higher level spells. This will allow the recipient access to your favor but not the other way around. \n</p>', 0),
(23825, 5991, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your statuette (Priests that are linking together must be of the same god). Right-click on the priest you want to give favor to, select \'Link\'. Each priest that wants to add favor must do this to the main priest who will be doing the casting. To terminate the link, right-click a tile and select \'Link\'. Priest 2, 70 favor --> (gives 50 favor)--> Priest 1 (the caster),100 favor to start, 110 extra favor from linking, 210 total favor Priest 3, 80 favor --->(gives 60 favor)-->', '<ul><li>Activate your statuette (Priests that are linking together must be of the same god).</li>\n<li>Right-click on the priest you want to give favor to, select \'Link\'. Each priest that wants to add favor must do this to the <b>main priest</b> who will be doing the casting.</li>\n<li>To terminate the link, right-click a tile and select \'Link\'.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p>Priest 2, 70 favor --&gt; (gives 50 favor)--&gt;    \n</p>\n<pre>                                          Priest 1 (the caster),100 favor to start, 110 extra favor from linking, 210 total favor\n</pre>\n<p>Priest 3, 80 favor ---&gt;(gives 60 favor)--&gt;\n</p>', 1);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(23826, 5991, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Linked priests will only share their total favor minus 20. Linking does not increase the rate at which favor regenerates. If for example you were to break the link you\'d still have the same amount of favor that you would have had if you were unlinked. (Linking adds the 2 priest\'s favor together. It does not grant you faster charging times for a single character.) Certain high-end spells can only be cast by linking, as they require more than 99 favor. Linking can only be done by priests or champions, and only between those of the same god . The Event windows says the link works over 4 tiles but testing has revealed link hold over 200 tiles but transfer of favor only happens over a max of 10 tiles. [13:00:28] <Sincor> [13:00:19] You link your faith with Lithane and he may now use your favor to cast spells while you\'re within about 4 tiles. Each link increases the difficulty of the spell being cast by 3. For example, being linked to 3 other priests would increase the difficulty by 9. The maximum number of links you can have is [(channeling skill / 10) +1}] Example - 5 channeling = 1 possible link, 11 channeling = 2 links, 72 channeling = 8 possible links Instead of reducing favor regeneration, linking now reduces channeling skill gain depending on the number of links. For up to two links there is no skillgain penalty. For more than two additional linked characters, the penalty is 15% less skillgain for each linked character. The penalty is capped up to 90% less skillgain. In order to cast a spell while linked, the following 2 conditions must be true: Total available group favor must be at least the minimum favor cost for that spell. Available favor = [(combined favor of recipient and linkers) - (20 * number of linkers)] Even if the linkers have enough favor to cast the spell, the recipient must still reach a minimum favor level depending on the spell. Example - Opulence or bless requires the recipient to reach at least 10 favor, CoC & WoA require at least 15 favor.]', '<ul><li>Linked priests will only share their total favor minus 20.</li>\n<li>Linking does not increase the rate at which favor regenerates. If for example you were to break the link you\'d still have the same amount of favor that you would have had if you were unlinked. (Linking adds the 2 priest\'s favor together. It does not grant you faster charging times for a single character.)</li>\n<li>Certain high-end spells can only be cast by linking, as they require more than 99 favor.</li>\n<li>Linking can only be done by priests or champions, and only between those of the same <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/God\" title=\"God\">god</a>.</li>\n<li>The Event windows says the link works over 4 tiles but testing has revealed link hold over 200 tiles but transfer of favor only happens over a max of 10 tiles.</li></ul>\n<p><i></i>\n[13:00:28] &lt;Sincor&gt; [13:00:19] You link your faith with Lithane and he may now use your favor to cast spells while you\'re within about 4 tiles.\n<i></i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Each link increases the difficulty of the spell being cast by 3. For example, being linked to 3 other priests would increase the difficulty by 9.</li>\n<li>The maximum number of links you can have is [(channeling skill / 10) +1}] Example - 5 channeling = 1 possible link, 11 channeling = 2 links, 72 channeling = 8 possible links</li>\n<li>Instead of reducing favor regeneration, linking now reduces channeling skill gain depending on the number of links.\n<ul><li>For up to two links there is no skillgain penalty.</li>\n<li>For more than two additional linked characters, the penalty is 15% less skillgain for each linked character. The penalty is capped up to 90% less skillgain.</li></ul></li>\n<li>In order to cast a spell while linked, the following 2 conditions must be true:</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ol><li>Total available group favor must be at least the minimum favor cost for that spell. Available favor = [(combined favor of recipient and linkers) - (20 * number of linkers)]</li>\n<li>Even if the linkers have enough favor to cast the spell, the recipient must still reach a minimum favor level depending on the spell. Example - Opulence or bless requires the recipient to reach at least 10 favor, CoC &amp; WoA require at least 15 favor.]</li></ol></dd></dl>', 2),
(23827, 5993, 'Description', 'Description', 'Genesis can be cast on zombies and has a chance of harming or killing them by removing the evil presence within the creature. This gives them an internal damage wound between 50 and 120 damage depending on the power of the cast, which ignores armour (but not other damage reduction, such as from Body strength ). It can also be cast on animals to remove any bad traits they may have. It will remove 1 bad trait per cast and always the 1st one mentioned when examining the animal.', '<p><b>Genesis</b> can be cast on <a href=\"/index.php/Zombie\" title=\"Zombie\">zombies</a> and has a chance of harming or killing them by removing the evil presence within the creature. This gives them an internal damage wound between 50 and 120 damage depending on the power of the cast, which ignores armour (but not other damage reduction, such as from <a href=\"/index.php/Body_strength\" title=\"Body strength\">Body strength</a>).\n</p>\n<p><br/>\nIt can also be cast on <a href=\"/index.php/Creatures\" title=\"Creatures\">animals</a> to remove any bad traits they may have. It will remove 1 bad trait per cast and always the 1st one mentioned when examining the animal.\n</p>', 0),
(23828, 5993, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a creature Select Spells > Genesis', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a creature</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Genesis</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23829, 5994, 'Description', 'Description', 'Removes any spell from an area, creature/player, or item enchant.\nHas a 6 tile range when used on players and creatures. Has a difficulty of 20 when cast on an item, and difficulty based on distance when cast on creatures or tiles. When affecting a creature, the spell will reduce the power of any enchantments currently affecting that creature, but repeated castings will be less effective, similar to the resistance granted by damaging and healing spells.', '<p>Removes any spell from an area, creature/player, or item enchant.\nHas a 6 tile range when used on players and creatures.\n</p>\n<p>Has a difficulty of 20 when cast on an item, and difficulty based on distance when cast on creatures or tiles.\n</p>\n<p>When affecting a creature, the spell will reduce the power of any enchantments currently affecting that creature, but repeated castings will be less effective, similar to the resistance granted by damaging and healing spells.\n</p>', 0),
(23830, 5994, 'Order of Removal', 'Order_of_Removal', 'The spell enchantment, rune, or other effect listed first when the target is examined, will be removed first, including imbues and metallic liquid.', '<ul><li>The spell enchantment, rune, or other effect listed first when the target is examined, will be removed first, including imbues and metallic liquid.</li></ul>', 1),
(23831, 5994, 'Messages', 'Messages', 'The protection force is too high : happened when the item was not in the inventory and on blessed items. Nothing seems to happen : You failed to channel enough power to remove the enchant. You remove the Circle of cunning enchantment : The enchant got removed.', '<ul><li><b>The protection force is too high</b>: happened when the item was not in the inventory and on blessed items.</li>\n<li><b>Nothing seems to happen</b>: You failed to channel enough power to remove the enchant.</li>\n<li><b>You remove the Circle of cunning enchantment</b>: The enchant got removed.</li></ul>', 2),
(23832, 5995, 'Description', 'Description', 'Locates rare fishing spot tiles. These tiles do not move or disappear on their own. The tiles will change to a different special fish type at the beginning of a season change. Tiles can disappear if the terrain around them is modified. Must be cast on a pendulum . The range is dependent on the server size: 2048 tile servers will be power / 100 x 64 = tile radius. 4096 servers will be power / 100 x 128  = tile radius. 8192 servers will be power / 100 x 256 = tile radius. Example: A cast power of 75 will give you 48, 96, 192 tile radius respectively.', '<p>Locates rare fishing spot tiles. These tiles do not move or disappear on their own. The tiles will change to a different special fish type at the beginning of a season change. Tiles can disappear if the terrain around them is modified.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Must be cast on a <a href=\"/index.php/Pendulum\" title=\"Pendulum\">pendulum</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>The range is dependent on the server size:\n</p>\n<ul><li>2048 tile servers will be power / 100 x 64 = tile radius.</li>\n<li>4096 servers will be power / 100 x 128  = tile radius.</li>\n<li>8192 servers will be power / 100 x 256 = tile radius.</li></ul>\n<p>Example: A cast power of 75 will give you 48, 96, 192 tile radius respectively.\n</p>', 0),
(23833, 5995, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a pendulum . Select Spells > Lurker in the deep', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Pendulum\" title=\"Pendulum\">pendulum</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Lurker in the deep</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23834, 5995, 'Enchanted pendulum', 'Enchanted_pendulum', 'The QL of the pendulum seems to affect the chance of getting a reading and the power level of the spell seems to affect the range at which fish are detected. Use Using the pendulum damages it over time. You concentrate on the silver pendulum. Using the enchanted pendulum takes 12 seconds with full stamina, Wind of ages reduces this time. The silver pendulum doesn\'t seem to move. No rare fish in the range of your pendulum, you have to search somewhere else. You fail to make sense of the silver pendulum. You didn\'t succeed, just retry. Note that if you are too far away from a fishing spot you get more \'fails\'. The fishing spot is in front of you pretty close by. Some tiles away. The fishing spot is in front of you very close. Only a few tiles. The fishing spot is in front of you a stone\'s throw away! One more tile to go. You are practically standing on the fishing spot! Don\'t wait, start fishing !', '<p>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/QL\" title=\"QL\">QL</a> of the pendulum seems to affect the chance of getting a reading and the power level of the spell seems to affect the range at which <a href=\"/index.php/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">fish</a> are detected.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Use\">Use</span></h3>\n<p>Using the pendulum damages it over time.\n</p>\n<p><i>You concentrate on the silver pendulum.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Using the enchanted pendulum takes 12 seconds with full stamina, <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a> reduces this time.</li></ul>\n<p><i>The silver pendulum doesn\'t seem to move.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>No rare fish in the range of your pendulum, you have to search somewhere else.</li></ul>\n<p><i>You fail to make sense of the silver pendulum.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>You didn\'t succeed, just retry. Note that if you are too far away from a fishing spot you get more \'fails\'.</li></ul>\n<p><i>The fishing spot is in front of you pretty close by.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Some tiles away.</li></ul>\n<p><i>The fishing spot is in front of you very close.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Only a few tiles.</li></ul>\n<p><i>The fishing spot is in front of you a stone\'s throw away!</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>One more tile to go.</li></ul>\n<p><i>You are practically standing on the fishing spot!</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Don\'t wait, start <a href=\"/index.php/Fishing\" title=\"Fishing\">fishing</a>!</li></ul>', 2),
(23835, 5996, 'Description', 'Description', 'Pendulums enchanted with this spell can be used to locate nearby enemy players on PvP servers and mission traitors on PvE servers. Range is (power of cast). For example, the range on a cast of power 50 is 50 tiles. Range may be modified by pendulum material bonus , e.g., a 100 power cast on a gold pendulum (+10% Pendulum AoE) = 110 tiles', '<p><a href=\"/index.php/Pendulum\" title=\"Pendulum\">Pendulums</a> enchanted with this spell can be used to locate nearby enemy players on PvP servers and <a href=\"/index.php/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">mission</a> traitors on PvE servers.\n</p>\n<p>Range is (power of cast). For example, the range on a cast of power 50 is 50 tiles.<br/>\nRange may be modified by pendulum <a href=\"/index.php/Metal_lumps#Special\" title=\"Metal lumps\">material bonus</a>, e.g., a 100 power cast on a gold pendulum (+10% Pendulum AoE) = 110 tiles\n</p>', 0),
(23836, 5996, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a pendulum . Select Spells > Lurker in the dark', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Pendulum\" title=\"Pendulum\">pendulum</a>.</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Lurker in the dark</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23837, 5996, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'This spell does not track hostile monsters.', '<ul><li>This spell does not track hostile monsters.</li></ul>', 2),
(23838, 5997, 'Description', 'Description', 'Creates a bright light item A creation spell that generates an item similar to a torch called a light token. A brightly glowing white stone', '<p><i>Creates a bright light item</i>\n</p>\n<p>A creation spell that generates an item similar to a <a href=\"/index.php/Torch\" title=\"Torch\">torch</a> called a light token.\n</p>\n<p><i>A brightly glowing white stone</i>\n</p>', 0),
(23839, 5997, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a tile , item, player, or creature. Select Spells > Light token', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a>, item, player, or creature.</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Light token</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23840, 5997, 'Effects', 'Effects', 'A light token is generated which appears in the players inventory.  It can be traded, dropped and picked up. The token decays rapidly whilst in an inventory but can last hours (quality dependant) if dropped inside a mine; they cannot be repaired.  The light emitted generally matches the brightness of a similar object of the same quality.', '<p>A light token is generated which appears in the players inventory.  It can be traded, dropped and picked up. The token decays rapidly whilst in an inventory but can last hours (quality dependant) if dropped inside a mine; they cannot be repaired.  The light emitted generally matches the brightness of a similar object of the same quality.\n</p>', 2),
(23841, 5997, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'It has been observed that QL50 tokens held in the inventory last for 15 minutes while QL72 last for 22 minutes. Light tokens will last significantly longer underground; QL 75-85 tokens having taken only 28-45 damage after 2 hours. Brightness goes up when placed on top of altar', '<ul><li>It has been observed that QL50 tokens held in the inventory last for 15 minutes while QL72 last for 22 minutes.</li>\n<li>Light tokens will last significantly longer underground; QL 75-85 tokens having taken only 28-45 damage after 2 hours.</li>\n<li>Brightness goes up when placed on top of altar</li></ul>', 3),
(23842, 5998, 'Description', 'Description', 'A priest spell that temporarily increases the climbing skill of the target. It may be recast upon the target in attempt to improve the power/duration.', '<p>A <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priest</a> spell that temporarily increases the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Climb\" title=\"Climb\">climbing</a> skill of the target. It may be recast upon the target in attempt to improve the power/duration.\n</p>', 0),
(23843, 5998, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a player Select Spells > Goat shape', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a player</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Goat shape</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23844, 5999, 'Description', 'Description', 'Creates a burn wound at the chest, has a 10 tile range. Damage ignores armour.', '<p>Creates a burn wound at the chest, has a 10 tile range.\n</p>\n<p>Damage ignores armour.\n</p>', 0),
(23845, 5999, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a player or creature Select Spells > Fireheart', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a player or creature</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Fireheart</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23846, 5999, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Fireheart has a maximum resistance duration of 2.5 minutes.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Fireheart has a maximum resistance duration of 2.5 minutes.\n</p>', 2),
(23847, 6000, 'Description', 'Description', 'Envelopes in fire A ranged offensive spell with a casting distance of 4 tiles.', '<p><i>Envelopes in fire</i>\n</p>\n<p>A ranged offensive spell with a casting distance of 4 tiles.\n</p>', 0),
(23848, 6000, 'Effects', 'Effects', 'A single tile is hit by a vortex of fire and the surrounding 4 tiles in each direction are set alight.  Hostile targets occupying the initial tile are wounded by burns and any hostile targets within the area of effect are damaged over time for the duration of the spell. Damage ignores armour and is applied repeatedly, with damage depending on the power of the cast.', '<p>A single tile is hit by a vortex of fire and the surrounding 4 tiles in each direction are set alight.  Hostile targets occupying the initial tile are wounded by burns and any hostile targets within the area of effect are damaged over time for the duration of the spell.\n</p>\n<p>Damage ignores armour and is applied repeatedly, with damage depending on the power of the cast.\n</p>', 1),
(23849, 6000, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a tile Select Spells > Fire pillar', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a></li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Fire pillar</i></li></ol>', 2),
(23850, 6000, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Fire pillar has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Fire pillar has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes.\n</p>', 3),
(23851, 6000, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Supposedly, a high-power cast is able to destroy enchanted grass and trees. Non-aggressive and non-hostile targets are not affected by the spell, even if sparring.', '<ul><li>Supposedly, a high-power cast is able to destroy enchanted grass and trees.</li>\n<li>Non-aggressive and non-hostile targets are not affected by the spell, even if sparring.</li></ul>', 4),
(23852, 6001, 'Description', 'Description', 'Refreshes all allies in the area, restoring their stamina.', '<p>Refreshes all allies in the area, restoring their stamina.\n</p>', 0),
(23853, 6001, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Although this spell is available at 40 faith a priest does not have the required favor to cast immediately, unless linking with another priest is used.', '<p>Although this spell is available at 40 faith a priest does not have the required favor to cast immediately, unless linking with another priest is used.\n</p>', 1),
(23854, 6001, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Second Wind', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Second_Wind\" title=\"Second Wind\">Second Wind</a></li></ul>', 2),
(23855, 6002, 'Description', 'Description', 'Smells ores and rock depth. Doesn\'t work underground. Worked on dirt of depth 190 but not depth 230. The actual maximum is probably 200 dirt. Note that a metre is 10 dirt. This will also analyze the rock layer underneath the player, with effectiveness depending on cast power.', '<p>Smells ores and rock depth. Doesn\'t work underground. Worked on dirt of depth 190 but not depth 230. The actual maximum is probably 200 dirt. Note that a metre is 10 dirt.\n</p>\n<p>This will also <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Analyze\" title=\"Analyze\">analyze</a> the rock layer underneath the player, with effectiveness depending on cast power.\n</p>', 0),
(23856, 6002, 'Messages', 'Messages', 'Failure You start to cast \'Mole Senses\'. For a short while you go almost blind, but you smell the earth with incredible accuracy. You fail to smell the rock here. It is probably too deep down. Success (Rock) You start to cast \'Mole Senses\'. For a short while you go almost blind, but you smell the earth with incredible accuracy. You smell the rock less than 13 metres below you. Hmm it seems to be rock.', '<p><b>Failure</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>You start to cast \'Mole Senses\'.</li>\n<li>For a short while you go almost blind, but you smell the earth with incredible accuracy.</li>\n<li>You fail to smell the rock here. It is probably too deep down.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Success (Rock)</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>You start to cast \'Mole Senses\'.</li>\n<li>For a short while you go almost blind, but you smell the earth with incredible accuracy.</li>\n<li>You smell the rock less than 13 metres below you.</li>\n<li>Hmm it seems to be rock.</li></ul>', 1),
(23857, 6003, 'Description', 'Description', 'Strongwall changes open cave tiles to cave walls or reinforces existing cave walls.', '<p>Strongwall changes open cave tiles to <a href=\"/index.php/Cave_wall\" title=\"Cave wall\">cave walls</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Support_beam\" title=\"Support beam\">reinforces</a> existing cave walls. \n</p>', 0),
(23858, 6003, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'This spell always succeeds, even though it has a difficulty of 70. Can be used on any cave wall to make a reinforced wall. Can be used on any cave floor to recreate a stone pillar (wall) Can not be used on any cave floor to reinforce the ground for pavement. You can only collapse tiles like a shaker orb The spell can be cast on mine entrances to close them, including from outside, similar to a shaker orb . Attached mine doors must be destroyed before strong wall can be cast on the entrance. Be careful as a reinforced tile can only be removed by the mayor of the deed (or any person with permission) or through the use of Disintegrate . You must have the permissions \'build\', \'drop\', and \'cast spells (deity)\' to cast this spell on deed. Libila priests may only cast this spell on PvP servers. The tile will keep its original quality, regardless of if it was a rock or vein tile before being mined out. Mining out a vein and casting strong wall on same floor tile WILL NOT get you a new vein but a rock wall. (i.e. mining a wall out and strong walling a new wall in same tile  does not affect the tile\'s quality). Reinforced tiles can be removed through the use of the Disintegrate spell or mined out on deed.', '<ul><li>This spell always succeeds, even though it has a difficulty of 70.</li>\n<li>Can be used on any cave wall to make a reinforced wall.</li>\n<li>Can be used on any cave floor to recreate a stone pillar (wall)</li>\n<li>Can not be used on any cave floor to reinforce the ground for pavement. You can only collapse tiles like a <a href=\"/index.php/Shaker_orb\" title=\"Shaker orb\">shaker orb</a></li>\n<li>The spell can be cast on mine entrances to close them, including from outside, similar to a <a href=\"/index.php/Shaker_orb\" title=\"Shaker orb\">shaker orb</a>.</li>\n<li>Attached mine doors must be destroyed before strong wall can be cast on the entrance.</li>\n<li>Be careful as a reinforced tile can only be removed by the mayor of the deed (or any person with permission) or through the use of <a href=\"/index.php/Disintegrate\" title=\"Disintegrate\">Disintegrate</a>.</li>\n<li>You must have the permissions \'build\', \'drop\', and \'cast spells (deity)\' to cast this spell on deed.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a> priests may only cast this spell on PvP servers.</li>\n<li>The tile will keep its original quality, regardless of if it was a rock or vein tile before being mined out.\n<ul><li>Mining out a vein and casting strong wall on same floor tile WILL NOT get you a new vein but a rock wall. (i.e. mining a wall out and strong walling a new wall in same tile  does not affect the tile\'s quality).</li></ul></li>\n<li>Reinforced tiles can be removed through the use of the <a href=\"/index.php/Disintegrate\" title=\"Disintegrate\">Disintegrate</a> spell or mined out on deed.</li></ul>', 1),
(23859, 6003, 'Warnings', 'Warnings', 'You should remove the items first. You can\'t cast the spell on a floor of a cave tile occupied by a creature (or by yourself) or any by any items. That tile is occupied by creatures. You can\'t cast the spell on a floor of a cave tile occupied by a creature (or by yourself). You do not have permission to do that. You need the permissions \'build\', \'drop\', and \'cast spells (deity)\' to cast Strongwall on a deed.', '<dl><dt>You should remove the items first. </dt>\n<dd>You can\'t cast the spell on a floor of a cave tile occupied by a creature (or by yourself) or any by any items.</dd>\n<dt>That tile is occupied by creatures. </dt>\n<dd>You can\'t cast the spell on a floor of a cave tile occupied by a creature (or by yourself).</dd>\n<dt>You do not have permission to do that. </dt>\n<dd>You need the permissions \'build\', \'drop\', and \'cast spells (deity)\' to cast Strongwall on a deed.</dd></dl>', 2),
(23860, 6004, 'Description', 'Description', 'Disintegrate is a spell used underground to destroy rock tiles and reinforced tiles. Metal veins have not been tested extensively. The spell is available for Magranon on PvE based servers and all priests on PvP. Its use is tied into the mining role for deeds . This means on freedom servers, only players that have mining permissions can disintegrate inside a deed. Anyone can disintegrate off deed. You must have multiple mining permissions: Mine rock, mine iron veins, mine other veins, tunnel, mine floor, add/remove reinforcements as well as cast deity spells to cast this on deed. On PVP servers, you can only disintegrate reinforced tiles inside enemy settlements if they were drained during the last 2 hours.', '<p><b>Disintegrate</b> is a spell used <a href=\"/index.php/Mining\" title=\"Mining\">underground</a> to destroy <a href=\"/index.php/Rock_tile\" title=\"Rock tile\">rock tiles</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Support_beam\" title=\"Support beam\">reinforced</a> tiles. Metal <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Vein\" title=\"Vein\">veins</a> have not been tested extensively. The spell is available for <a href=\"/index.php/Magranon\" title=\"Magranon\">Magranon</a> on PvE based servers and all priests on PvP.\n</p>\n<p>Its use is tied into the <a href=\"/index.php/Mining\" title=\"Mining\">mining</a> role for <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Deed\" title=\"Deed\">deeds</a>. This means on freedom servers, only players that have mining permissions can disintegrate inside a deed. Anyone can disintegrate off deed. You must have multiple mining permissions: Mine rock, mine iron veins, mine other veins, tunnel, mine floor, add/remove reinforcements as well as cast deity spells to cast this on deed. \n</p>\n<p>On PVP servers, you can only disintegrate reinforced tiles inside enemy settlements if they were drained during the last 2 hours.\n</p>', 0),
(23861, 6004, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Disintegrate removes chunks from a vein or wall at 3 times the cast power of ore/rock from the wall. You lose the rock or ore when using disintegrate. event messages after cast: You chip away at the ... vein and remove a small chunk of material. 0-75 You chip away at the ... vein and remove a chunk of material. 75-150 You chip away at the ... vein and remove a large chunk of material. 150-250 You chip away at the ... vein and remove a huge chunk of material. 250+', '<p>Disintegrate removes chunks from a vein or wall at 3 times the cast power of ore/rock from the wall. You lose the rock or ore when using disintegrate.\n</p>\n<p>event messages after cast:\n</p>\n<ul><li>You chip away at the ... vein and remove a small chunk of material. 0-75</li>\n<li>You chip away at the ... vein and remove a chunk of material. 75-150</li>\n<li>You chip away at the ... vein and remove a large chunk of material. 150-250</li>\n<li>You chip away at the ... vein and remove a huge chunk of material. 250+</li></ul>', 1),
(23862, 6004, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'When a disintegrate cast results in the last bit of a wall being destroyed, it will result in the same floor slope as a \"mine forward\" action. If side shafts are attempted, it will not crack the rock tile and will only waste favor. If you are too deep under water to mine, it will not work and will only waste favor. (Needs further testing, it does make the amount of ore of a vein go down.) Can be used to create an exit from a mine (follows same rules as manually mining), but cannot be used to create a tunnel from the outside. Mining or disintegrate from inside a mine will not result in the 20 entrance slope, it instead connects to the 2 lowest tile corners. Any item, corpse, player, mine door or altar in the way will result in \'Item in the way\' error. The chances are very low – 2% for a 50 power cast and 10% if you manage to cast a 90 power spell which is hard enough for a difficulty 70 spell. This goes up to 25% at 95 power and 50 percent at 98%.', '<ul><li>When a disintegrate cast results in the last bit of a wall being destroyed, it will result in the same floor slope as a \"mine forward\" action.</li>\n<li>If side shafts are attempted, it will not crack the rock tile and will only waste favor.</li>\n<li>If you are too deep under water to mine, it will not work and will only waste favor. (Needs further testing, it does make the amount of ore of a vein go down.)</li>\n<li>Can be used to create an exit from a mine (follows same rules as manually mining), but cannot be used to create a tunnel from the outside.\n<ul><li>Mining or disintegrate from inside a mine will not result in the 20 entrance slope, it instead connects to the 2 lowest tile corners.</li>\n<li>Any item, corpse, player, mine door or altar in the way will result in \'Item in the way\' error.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The chances are very low – 2% for a 50 power cast and 10% if you manage to cast a 90 power spell which is hard enough for a difficulty 70 spell. This goes up to 25% at 95 power and 50 percent at 98%.</li></ul>', 2),
(23863, 1211, 'Description', 'Description', 'Nolocate is an enchantment that can be cast on a bracelet , ring , or necklace .  This spell has a chance to hide you when jewelry with the enchantment is worn.', '<p>Nolocate is an enchantment that can be cast on a <a href=\"/index.php/Bracelet\" title=\"Bracelet\">bracelet</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Ring\" title=\"Ring\">ring</a>, or <a href=\"/index.php/Necklace\" title=\"Necklace\">necklace</a>.  This spell has a <b>chance</b> to hide you when jewelry with the enchantment is worn.\n</p>', 0),
(23864, 1211, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Items enchanted with this spell need to be worn for it to have an effect. The chance that it will hide you from Locate soul is (quality + power)/2. This value also determines the duration of Locate soul resistance if the player is successfully detected. Reduces the range at which Lurker in the dark can locate the player, down to a minimum of 50 tiles. The enchantment loses 1 power per 5 locate attempts, regardless of whether or not it blocks location. If you are wearing multiple of these items only the item with the highest enchant will count. Players often refer to the spell as \"nolo\". It is most often cast on a ring.', '<ul><li>Items enchanted with this spell need to be <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Equip\" title=\"Equip\">worn</a> for it to have an effect.</li>\n<li>The chance that it will hide you from <a href=\"/index.php/Locate_soul\" title=\"Locate soul\">Locate soul</a> is (quality + power)/2. This value also determines the duration of <a href=\"/index.php/Locate_soul#Resistance\" title=\"Locate soul\">Locate soul resistance</a> if the player is successfully detected.</li>\n<li>Reduces the range at which <a href=\"/index.php/Lurker_in_the_dark\" title=\"Lurker in the dark\">Lurker in the dark</a> can locate the player, down to a minimum of 50 tiles.</li>\n<li>The enchantment loses 1 power per 5 locate attempts, regardless of whether or not it blocks location.</li>\n<li>If you are wearing multiple of these items only the item with the highest enchant will count.</li>\n<li>Players often refer to the spell as \"nolo\".</li>\n<li>It is most often cast on a ring.</li></ul>', 1),
(23865, 6006, 'Description', 'Description', 'Drives away enemy creatures.', '<p>Drives away enemy creatures.\n</p>', 0),
(23866, 6006, 'Notes', 'Notes', '\'Enemy creature\' means enemy kingdom, not aggressive creatures (wildlife is neutral). Neutral and same kingdom creatures are unaffected.', '<ul><li>\'Enemy creature\' means enemy kingdom, not aggressive creatures (wildlife is neutral).</li>\n<li>Neutral and same kingdom creatures are unaffected.</li></ul>', 1),
(23867, 6007, 'Description', 'Description', 'Phantasms has two possible effects, depending on whether it\'s cast on a player or a non-player creature. Players : Causes the outlines of enemies and allies to swap randomly every few seconds. Non-player creatures : Causes the target to attack a nearby unit that is hostile to the caster.', '<p>Phantasms has two possible effects, depending on whether it\'s cast on a player or a non-player creature.\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Players</b>: Causes the outlines of enemies and allies to swap randomly every few seconds.</li>\n<li><b>Non-player creatures</b>: Causes the target to attack a nearby unit that is hostile to the caster.</li></ul>', 0),
(23868, 3521, 'Description', 'Description', 'Web Armour has been cast on it, so it may slow down creatures when they hit this armour. May slow down creatures hitting you.  (This refers to walking / running / possibly swimming speed, not swing timer or other combat rating)', '<p><i>Web Armour has been cast on it, so it may slow down creatures when they hit this armour.</i>\n</p>\n<p>May slow down creatures hitting you.  (This refers to walking / running / possibly swimming speed, not swing timer or other combat rating)\n</p>', 0),
(23869, 3521, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'This spell will not stack with Aura of shared pain .', '<p>This spell will not stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>.\n</p>', 1),
(23870, 6009, 'Description', 'Description', 'A spell available to priests of Libila at 33 faith . Creates a 3x3 area of mycelium from grass and dirt tiles, can be cast on deep underwater tiles.', '<p>A spell available to priests of <a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a> at 33 <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>. Creates a 3x3 area of <a href=\"/index.php/Mycelium\" title=\"Mycelium\">mycelium</a> from grass and dirt tiles, can be cast on deep underwater tiles.\n</p>', 0),
(23871, 6009, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a tile Select Spells > Corrupt', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a></li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Corrupt</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23872, 6009, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Does not work on PvE servers.', '<ul><li>Does not work on PvE servers.</li></ul>', 2),
(23873, 6010, 'Description', 'Description', 'Increases the players combat rating.', '<p>Increases the players combat rating. \n</p>', 0),
(23874, 6010, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'You can only have a single Truehit effect active. Any subsequent casts from the first will attempt to improve the power. Very good for channeling skill gain due to the favor cost and ability to repeatedly cast on self. Power increases length of effect, can be several minutes for a 50 power cast.', '<ul><li>You can only have a single Truehit effect active. Any subsequent casts from the first will attempt to improve the power.</li>\n<li>Very good for <a href=\"/index.php/Channeling\" title=\"Channeling\">channeling</a> skill gain due to the favor cost and ability to repeatedly cast on self. Power increases length of effect, can be several minutes for a 50 power cast.</li></ul>', 1),
(23875, 994, 'Description', 'Description', 'Bloodthirst has been cast on it, so it will do more damage the more you hit creatures or players. Increases damage dealt to an opponent, and may also apply a small infection wound. Its power may be increased by killing other creatures, including players .', '<p><i>Bloodthirst has been cast on it, so it will do more damage the more you hit creatures or players.</i>\n</p>\n<p>Increases damage dealt to an opponent, and may also apply a small <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Infection\" title=\"Infection\">infection</a> wound. Its power may be increased by killing other creatures, including <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Players\" title=\"Players\">players</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(23876, 994, 'Power', 'Power', 'Unlike other enchantments, Bloodthirst\'s power is rated between 0 and 10,000. The initial cast is limited to about 1,000 power. Power is increased by killing creatures: Killing a player will increase the power by 30 points. Killing non-player creatures increases the power by their combat rating . Increasing the power by killing non-player creatures will scale down to half their combat rating after 5,000 to 7,500 accumulated power.', '<p>Unlike other enchantments, Bloodthirst\'s power is rated between 0 and 10,000. The initial cast is limited to about 1,000 power.\n</p>\n<p>Power is increased by killing creatures:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Killing a player will increase the power by 30 points.</li>\n<li>Killing non-player creatures increases the power by their <a href=\"/index.php/Combat_rating\" title=\"Combat rating\">combat rating</a>.\n<ul><li>Increasing the power by killing non-player creatures will scale down to half their combat rating after 5,000 to 7,500 accumulated power.</li></ul></li></ul>', 1),
(23877, 994, 'Damage', 'Damage', 'Bloodthirst adds up to 33% damage to the wound caused by the weapon, depending on the power of the enchantment. There is also an (enchantment power)/100,000 chance of applying an infection wound to the target. For example, at 7500 power, the chance would be 7.5% per successful attack. Applying this wound ignores armour glance rates. Infection wounds heal or worsen every minute, instead of every 10 minutes like most wounds. Infection wounds may rapidly worsen if not bandaged or treated.', '<p>Bloodthirst adds up to 33% damage to the wound caused by the weapon, depending on the power of the enchantment.\n</p>\n<p>There is also an (enchantment power)/100,000 chance of applying an infection wound to the target. For example, at 7500 power, the chance would be 7.5% per successful attack.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Applying this wound ignores armour glance rates.</li>\n<li>Infection wounds heal or worsen every minute, instead of every 10 minutes like most wounds.</li>\n<li>Infection wounds may rapidly worsen if not bandaged or treated.</li></ul>', 2),
(23878, 994, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'It can be placed on bows. In order to increase the power, you must get the killing blow on the creature. The assistance of guards will not reduce the amount of points, except for trolls, which seem to give no points when killed together with guards. Uniques don\'t give any points. This spell will stack with Aura of shared pain , Blessings of the dark , Circle of cunning , Demise spells , Mind stealer , Nimbleness , Web armour and Wind of ages . This spell will not stack with Flaming aura , Frostbrand , Life transfer , Rotting touch , Essence drain and Venom .', '<ul><li>It can be placed on bows.</li>\n<li>In order to increase the power, you must get the killing blow on the creature.</li>\n<li>The assistance of guards will not reduce the amount of points, except for trolls, which seem to give no points when killed together with guards.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Unique\" title=\"Unique\">Uniques</a> don\'t give any points.</li>\n<li>This spell will stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Blessings_of_the_dark\" title=\"Blessings of the dark\">Blessings of the dark</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Demise spells</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_stealer\" title=\"Mind stealer\">Mind stealer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Nimbleness\" title=\"Nimbleness\">Nimbleness</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Web_armour\" title=\"Web armour\">Web armour</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>.</li>\n<li>This spell will <b>not</b> stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Flaming_aura\" title=\"Flaming aura\">Flaming aura</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Frostbrand\" title=\"Frostbrand\">Frostbrand</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Life_transfer\" title=\"Life transfer\">Life transfer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Rotting_touch\" title=\"Rotting touch\">Rotting touch</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Essence_drain\" title=\"Essence drain\">Essence drain</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Venom\" title=\"Venom\">Venom</a>.</li></ul>', 3),
(23879, 994, 'Chart of Bloodthirst Gains per Kill', 'Chart_of_Bloodthirst_Gains_per_Kill', 'Age and traits matter. Young, Adolescent, Mature, Aged, Old, and Venerable are each 1 point apart. For example, a mature troll is 13 points, an aged troll is 14 points, an old troll is 15 points, and a venerable troll is 16 points. Hardened, Fierce, etc. also add points to the total Bloodthirst gained. This is harder to accurately measure without a large dataset to examine. A venerable Greenish goblin, for example, gives 25 points! There are hidden decimal points in cast power.  So a venerable black wolf may give 9 points of Bloodthirst, but you may see a gain of 10 due to rounding. This chart gives the approximate gain in bloodthirst for an aged creature with no special traits: Mob BT Gain Hell horse 11 Hell hound 16 Hell scorpious 20 Lava fiend 15 Huge Spider 12 Black wolf 7 Scorpion 9 Crocodile 10 Wild cat 2 Black bear 13 Cave bug 6 Large rat 2 Anaconda 15 Mountain lion 4 Fog spider 18 Cow 1 Pig 3 Wild boar 14 Seal 10 Bull 5 Lava spider 20 Troll 14 Goblin 22 Unicorn 12', '<ul><li>Age and traits matter.</li>\n<li>Young, Adolescent, Mature, Aged, Old, and Venerable are each 1 point apart.</li>\n<li>For example, a mature troll is 13 points, an aged troll is 14 points, an old troll is 15 points, and a venerable troll is 16 points.</li>\n<li>Hardened, Fierce, etc. also add points to the total Bloodthirst gained. This is harder to accurately measure without a large dataset to examine. A venerable Greenish goblin, for example, gives 25 points!</li>\n<li>There are hidden decimal points in cast power.  So a venerable black wolf may give 9 points of Bloodthirst, but you may see a gain of 10 due to rounding.</li></ul>\n<p>This chart gives the <i>approximate</i> gain in bloodthirst for an aged creature with no special traits:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th data-sort-type=\"text\">Mob\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">BT Gain\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Hell_horse\" title=\"Hell horse\">Hell horse</a>\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Hell_hound\" title=\"Hell hound\">Hell hound</a>\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Hell_scorpious\" title=\"Hell scorpious\">Hell scorpious</a>\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Lava_fiend\" title=\"Lava fiend\">Lava fiend</a>\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Huge_Spider\" title=\"Huge Spider\">Huge Spider</a>\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Black_wolf\" title=\"Black wolf\">Black wolf</a>\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Scorpion\" title=\"Scorpion\">Scorpion</a>\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Crocodile\" title=\"Crocodile\">Crocodile</a>\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wild_cat\" title=\"Wild cat\">Wild cat</a>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Black_bear\" title=\"Black bear\">Black bear</a>\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cave_bug\" title=\"Cave bug\">Cave bug</a>\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Large_rat\" title=\"Large rat\">Large rat</a>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Anaconda\" title=\"Anaconda\">Anaconda</a>\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Mountain_lion\" title=\"Mountain lion\">Mountain lion</a>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Fog_spider\" title=\"Fog spider\">Fog spider</a>\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Cow\" title=\"Cow\">Cow</a>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Pig\" title=\"Pig\">Pig</a>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Wild_boar\" title=\"Wild boar\">Wild boar</a>\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Seal\" title=\"Seal\">Seal</a>\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Bull\" title=\"Bull\">Bull</a>\n</td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Lava_spider\" title=\"Lava spider\">Lava spider</a>\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">Troll</a>\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">Goblin</a>\n</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/index.php/Unicorn\" title=\"Unicorn\">Unicorn</a>\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr></tbody></table>', 4);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(23880, 3404, 'Description', 'Description', 'It temporarily covers an area in fungus, inflicting poison wounds to enemies that step in the fungus. Can be cast on any type of tile. Comparable to Fire pillar and Ice pillar . Damage ignores armour and is applied repeatedly, with damage depending on the power of the cast.', '<p>It temporarily covers an area in fungus, inflicting poison wounds to enemies that step in the fungus. Can be cast on any type of tile. Comparable to <a href=\"/index.php/Fire_pillar\" title=\"Fire pillar\">Fire pillar</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Ice_pillar\" title=\"Ice pillar\">Ice pillar</a>.\n</p>\n<p>Damage ignores armour and is applied repeatedly, with damage depending on the power of the cast.\n</p>', 0),
(23881, 3404, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a tile Select Spells > Fungus trap', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a></li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Fungus trap</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23882, 3404, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Fungus trap has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes. Fungus traps', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Fungus trap has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes.\n</p>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:452px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-file-height=\"768\" data-file-width=\"1366\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"253\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/75/Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg/450px-Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/75/Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg/675px-Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/75/Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg/900px-Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg 2x\" width=\"450\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/index.php/File:Image-Fungus_trap.jpeg\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>Fungus traps</div></div></div>', 2),
(23883, 3426, 'Description', 'Description', 'Damages enemies within an area between 7x7 tiles and 11x11 tiles in size, depending on casting power, and heals allied players. Heals up to 3 wounds per target, and a minimum of 3 wounds total even if no damage is dealt. Each additional target damaged allows an additional 3 total wounds to be healed.', '<p>Damages enemies within an area between 7x7 tiles and 11x11 tiles in size, depending on casting power, and heals allied players.\n</p>\n<p>Heals up to 3 wounds per target, and a minimum of 3 wounds total even if no damage is dealt. Each additional target damaged allows an additional 3 total wounds to be healed.\n</p>', 0),
(23884, 3426, 'Healing resistance', 'Healing_resistance', 'Healing spells and enchantments grant the healed player a healing resistance effect. This effect is applied based on how much health is healed, and will reduce all further healing on the target from any healing spells or enchantments. This includes healing spells as well as weapon enchantments that heal the player, such as Life transfer . The maximum duration of healing resistance is approximately 20 minutes, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 10 minutes of healing resistance remaining, you will receive heals at 50% normal effectiveness.', '<p>Healing spells and enchantments grant the healed <a href=\"/index.php/Player\" title=\"Player\">player</a> a healing resistance effect. This effect is applied based on how much health is healed, and will reduce all further healing on the target from any healing spells or enchantments. This includes healing spells as well as weapon enchantments that heal the player, such as <a href=\"/index.php/Life_transfer\" title=\"Life transfer\">Life transfer</a>.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of healing resistance is approximately 20 minutes, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 10 minutes of healing resistance remaining, you will receive heals at 50% normal effectiveness.\n</p>', 1),
(23885, 3426, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Scorn of Libila has a maximum resistance duration of 5 minutes. This resistance timer is used for the damaging effect only; the healing effect is resisted by healing resistance, as described above.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Scorn of Libila has a maximum resistance duration of 5 minutes. This resistance timer is used for the damaging effect only; the healing effect is resisted by healing resistance, as described above.\n</p>', 2),
(23886, 3426, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'This spell will have a chance to heal any passives within it\'s range instead of the player.', '<ul><li>This spell will have a chance to heal any passives within it\'s range instead of the player.</li></ul>', 3),
(23887, 6014, 'Description', 'Description', 'Can be cast on both aggressive and non-aggressive creatures, and enemy players if on a pvp server. Removes one fifth of a creatures strength. Decreases a small portion of one characteristic in small intervals during a period, which is dependent of the power of the cast.', '<p>Can be cast on both aggressive and non-aggressive creatures, and enemy players if on a pvp server.\n</p>\n<p>Removes one fifth of a creatures strength.\n</p>\n<p>Decreases a small portion of one characteristic in small intervals during a period, which is dependent of the power of the cast.\n</p>', 0),
(23888, 6014, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a player or creature Select Spells > Weakness', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a player or creature</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Weakness</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23889, 6015, 'Description', 'Description', 'Summons your best friends.', '<p>Summons your best friends.\n</p>', 0),
(23890, 6015, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Summons zombies, doesn\'t require corpses. Requires linking to cast. Does not work on PvE servers.', '<ul><li>Summons zombies, doesn\'t require corpses.</li>\n<li>Requires <a href=\"/index.php/Linking\" title=\"Linking\">linking</a> to cast.</li>\n<li>Does not work on PvE servers.</li></ul>', 1),
(23891, 993, 'Description', 'Description', 'Blessings of the dark increases both skill gain and action speed when using a tool enchanted with it. This functions as a combination of Circle of cunning and Wind of ages ; for example, a 50 power cast of this spell has the same effect as a 50 cast of both Circle of cunning and Wind of ages.', '<p>Blessings of the dark increases both skill gain and action speed when using a tool enchanted with it. This functions as a combination of <a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>; for example, a 50 power cast of this spell has the same effect as a 50 cast of both Circle of cunning and Wind of ages.\n</p>', 0),
(23892, 993, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'This spell has the same difficulty of Circle of cunning and Wind of ages, and therefore the same chance of shattering items. However, its favor cost is slightly higher. This spell will not stack with Circle of cunning, Nimbleness, or Wind of ages.', '<ul><li>This spell has the same difficulty of Circle of cunning and Wind of ages, and therefore the same chance of shattering items. However, its favor cost is slightly higher.</li>\n<li>This spell will not stack with Circle of cunning, Nimbleness, or Wind of ages.</li></ul>', 1),
(23893, 6017, 'Description', 'Description', 'Causes rotting wounds in an area. The area affected ranges from 5x5 to 9x9, depending on the power of the cast.', '<p>Causes rotting wounds in an area.\n</p>\n<p>The area affected ranges from 5x5 to 9x9, depending on the power of the cast.\n</p>', 0),
(23894, 6017, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Pain rain has a maximum resistance duration of 4 minutes.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Pain rain has a maximum resistance duration of 4 minutes.\n</p>', 1),
(23895, 6018, 'Description', 'Description', 'Temporarily increases effective body strength and soul strength to a degree depending on the power of the cast. This has about half the effectiveness of Forest giant strength , which only affects body strength. Last for power of the cast / 3 minutes.', '<p>Temporarily increases effective <a href=\"/index.php/Body_strength\" title=\"Body strength\">body strength</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_strength\" title=\"Soul strength\">soul strength</a> to a degree depending on the power of the cast.\n</p>\n<p>This has about half the effectiveness of <a href=\"/index.php/Forest_giant_strength\" title=\"Forest giant strength\">Forest giant strength</a>, which only affects body strength.\n</p>\n<p>Last for power of the cast / 3 minutes.\n</p>', 0),
(23896, 6018, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a player Select Spells > Hell strength', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a player</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Hell strength</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23897, 6019, 'Description', 'Description', 'Rebirths corpses in the area. Requires linking with multiple priest. Will display an area event message when successfully cast. The number of corpses affected is limited by the power of the cast.', '<p><a href=\"/index.php/Rebirth\" title=\"Rebirth\">Rebirths</a> corpses in the area. Requires <a href=\"/index.php/Linking\" title=\"Linking\">linking</a> with multiple priest. Will display an area event message when successfully cast.\n</p>\n<p>The number of corpses affected is limited by the power of the cast.\n</p>', 0),
(23898, 6019, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a tile or item. Select Spells > Land of the dead', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a> or item.</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Land of the dead</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23899, 6019, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Does not work on PvE servers.', '<ul><li>Does not work on PvE servers.</li></ul>', 2),
(23906, 2912, 'Description', 'Description', 'Channeling is the skill used in the casting of spells in order to enchant items . You will need to be a priest and have your god\'s statuette activated in order to channel. Channeling uses favor . The mechanism of casting takes into account a number of factors. When a cast is made, channeling skill, alignment , and spell difficulty are used to generate a result. This result can be successful or unsuccessful. As your skills and attributes improve the chance and degree of an unsuccessful cast will be reduced but never completely removed. If the spell casting succeeded a power rating is generated, if it is a spell that has a power rating.', '<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Channeling</a> is the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Skill\" title=\"Skill\">skill</a> used in the casting of <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Spells\" title=\"Category:Spells\">spells</a> in order to enchant <a href=\"/index.php/Item\" title=\"Item\">items</a>. You will need to be a <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priest</a> and have your god\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a> activated in order to channel. Channeling uses <a href=\"/index.php/Favor\" title=\"Favor\">favor</a>.\n</p>\n<p>The mechanism of casting takes into account a number of factors. When a cast is made, channeling skill, <a href=\"/index.php/Alignment\" title=\"Alignment\">alignment</a>, and spell difficulty are used to generate a result. This result can be successful or unsuccessful. As your skills and attributes improve the chance and degree of an unsuccessful cast will be reduced but never completely removed.\n</p>\n<p>If the spell casting succeeded a power rating is generated, if it is a spell that has a power rating.\n</p>', 0),
(23907, 2912, 'Spell casting', 'Spell_casting', 'When you cast a spell on an item there are several possible outcomes. The messages given are different depending on item and spell, so here are some general things that happen to various items. Successful attempts: You succeed to cast the spell and full favor for the spell is drained You succeed and the item is updated with a higher power rating than it had before, full favor for the spell is drained You succeed to cast the spell, but you frown since the power rating was lower than the previous, full favor for the spell is drained Unsuccessful attempts: The item gives a resonating sound but stays intact, a small amount of favor is drained The item gives a resonating sound and takes some damage, a small amount of favor is drained The item is shattered, a small amount of favor is drained Casting mechanics The successful casts have a value of 0 or higher, and the unsuccessful a negative value. If the absolute value of the unsuccessful cast is lower than a third of the QL of the item then nothing happens. If the cast falls between one third of the QL and the QL then the item takes damage. If the absolute value of the unsuccessful cast is higher than the QL of the item it is shattered. Higher QL items are therefore less likely to shatter than low QL ones. Some examples of how it works: A 30QL item will shatter if the power of the cast is worse than -30 and take damage if the power is  worse than -10 A 30QL item will remain unharmed if the power of the cast is -9 or higher A 90QL item will shatter only if the cast is worse than -90 and take damage starting at a power of -30 A 90QL item will remain unharmed if the power of the cast is -29 or higher The absolute range of power generated is not actually known, but from observations it is seen to range from at least -250 to + 103. At low skill levels on harder spells it is quite easy to get higher negative casts and unless you use higher quality items you can shatter a significant portion of the items being cast on. As you raise your skills and attributes you will be able to see the median moving. An important note is that the system is such that it is impossible to guarantee that an item being cast on will not shatter. At higher skills with higher quality items it will be very unlikely but it cannot be ruled out even then.', '<p>When you cast a spell on an item there are several possible outcomes. The messages given are different depending on item and spell, so here are some general things that happen to various items.\n</p>\n<p>Successful attempts:\n</p>\n<ul><li>You succeed to cast the spell and full favor for the spell is drained</li>\n<li>You succeed and the item is updated with a higher power rating than it had before, full favor for the spell is drained</li>\n<li>You succeed to cast the spell, but you frown since the power rating was lower than the previous, full favor for the spell is drained</li></ul>\n<p>Unsuccessful attempts:\n</p>\n<ul><li>The item gives a resonating sound but stays intact, a small amount of favor is drained</li>\n<li>The item gives a resonating sound and takes some damage, a small amount of favor is drained</li>\n<li>The item is shattered, a small amount of favor is drained</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Casting_mechanics\">Casting mechanics</span></h3>\n<p>The successful casts have a value of 0 or higher, and the unsuccessful a negative value. If the absolute value of the unsuccessful cast is lower than a third of the QL of the item then nothing happens. If the cast falls between one third of the QL and the QL then the item takes damage. If the absolute value of the unsuccessful cast is higher than the QL of the item it is shattered. Higher QL items are therefore less likely to shatter than low QL ones.\n</p>\n<p>Some examples of how it works:\n</p>\n<ul><li>A 30QL item will shatter if the power of the cast is worse than -30 and take damage if the power is  worse than -10</li>\n<li>A 30QL item will remain unharmed if the power of the cast is -9 or higher</li>\n<li>A 90QL item will shatter only if the cast is worse than -90 and take damage starting at a power of -30</li>\n<li>A 90QL item will remain unharmed if the power of the cast is -29 or higher</li></ul>\n<p>The absolute range of power generated is not actually known, but from observations it is seen to range from at least -250 to + 103. At low skill levels on harder spells it is quite easy to get higher negative casts and unless you use higher quality items you can shatter a significant portion of the items being cast on. As you raise your skills and attributes you will be able to see the median moving.\n</p>\n<p>An important note is that the system is such that it is impossible to guarantee that an item being cast on will not shatter. At higher skills with higher quality items it will be very unlikely but it cannot be ruled out even then.\n</p>', 1),
(23908, 2912, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The QL, enchantments, and rarity status of a statuette are not known to affect success chance when casting.', '<ul><li>The QL, enchantments, and rarity status of a statuette are not known to affect success chance when casting.</li></ul>', 2),
(23909, 2912, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'Religion > Channeling Soul > Soul strength Soul > Soul depth', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Religion\" title=\"Religion\">Religion</a> &gt; Channeling</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul\" title=\"Soul\">Soul</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_strength\" title=\"Soul strength\">Soul strength</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul\" title=\"Soul\">Soul</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Soul_depth\" title=\"Soul depth\">Soul depth</a></li></ul>', 3),
(23910, 2912, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Channeler at 50 skill Conduit at 70 skill Casting Specialist at 90 skill Shattered at 100 skill', '<ul><li>Channeler at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Conduit at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Casting Specialist at 90 skill</li>\n<li>Shattered at 100 skill</li></ul>', 4),
(23911, 2912, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Religion Alignment Spells Table of spells Enchantments', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Religion\" title=\"Religion\">Religion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Alignment\" title=\"Alignment\">Alignment</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Spells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Table_of_spells\" title=\"Table of spells\">Table of spells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Enchantment_spells\" title=\"Category:Enchantment spells\">Enchantments</a></li></ul>', 5),
(23912, 6024, 'Description', 'Description', 'Locates a player and their corpse. Can be countered with the spell Nolocate . The information provided works similarly to tracking , based on the direction you are facing when the cast ends.\nThere will be a window displayed in which to enter the name of the player you are seeking. It will also tell you if the corpse or player is above or below ground.\nLocate soul has a 2-minute cooldown between casts.', '<p>Locates a player and their corpse. Can be countered with the spell <a href=\"/index.php/Nolocate\" title=\"Nolocate\">Nolocate</a>. The information provided works similarly to <a href=\"/index.php/Tracking\" title=\"Tracking\">tracking</a>, based on the direction you are facing when the cast ends.\nThere will be a window displayed in which to enter the name of the player you are seeking. It will also tell you if the corpse or player is above or below ground.\nLocate soul has a 2-minute cooldown between casts.\n</p>', 0),
(23913, 6024, 'Example', 'Example', '[20:40:16] You start to cast \'Locate Soul\'. [20:40:25] You succeed [20:40:29] You are practically standing on the Funkiey! [20:40:29] The corpse of Funkiey is quite some distance away ahead of you to the left.', '<p><span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> [20:40:16] You start to cast \'Locate Soul\'.<br/>[20:40:25] You succeed<br/>[20:40:29] You are practically standing on the Funkiey!<br/>[20:40:29] The corpse of Funkiey is quite some distance away ahead of you to the left. </span>\n</p>', 1),
(23914, 6024, 'Resistance', 'Resistance', 'When located successfully by another player, players obtain \"Locate Resistance\" with a duration based on the highest Nolocate power jewelry the detected player has equipped. This resistance prevents the player from being located again by any player until it expires. At 100 Nolocate, this duration is 5 minutes. Being located by other players in your kingdom will not apply a cooldown, even if you have Nolocate.', '<p>When located successfully by another player, players obtain \"Locate Resistance\" with a duration based on the highest <a href=\"/index.php/Nolocate\" title=\"Nolocate\">Nolocate</a> power jewelry the detected player has equipped. This resistance prevents the player from being located again by any player until it expires. At 100 Nolocate, this duration is 5 minutes. Being located by other players in your kingdom will not apply a cooldown, even if you have Nolocate.\n</p>', 2),
(23915, 6024, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a tile Select Spells > Locate soul', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a></li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Locate soul</i></li></ol>', 3),
(23916, 6024, 'Distances', 'Distances', 'Distance Message 0 tiles You are practically standing on the <player>! 1-3 tiles The <player> is in front of you a stone\'s throw away! 4-5 tiles The <player> is in front of you very close. 6-9 tiles The <player> is in front of you pretty close by. 10-19 tiles The <player> is in front of you fairly close by. 20-49 tiles The <player> is some distance away in front of you. 50-199 tiles The <player> is quite some distance away in front of you. 200-499 tiles The <player> is rather a long distance away in front of you. 500-999 tiles The <player> is pretty far away in front of you. 1000+ tiles The <player> is far away in front of you. 2000+ The <player> is very far away in front of you.', '<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Distance</th>\n<th>Message\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0 tiles</td>\n<td>You are practically standing on the &lt;player&gt;!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-3 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is in front of you a stone\'s throw away!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4-5 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is in front of you very close.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6-9 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is in front of you pretty close by.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10-19 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is in front of you fairly close by.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20-49 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is some distance away in front of you.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50-199 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is quite some distance away in front of you.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200-499 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is rather a long distance away in front of you.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500-999 tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is pretty far away in front of you.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000+ tiles</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is far away in front of you.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000+</td>\n<td>The &lt;player&gt; is very far away in front of you.\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>', 4),
(23917, 6024, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Maximum range of 500 tiles on Chaos server.', '<ul><li>Maximum range of 500 tiles on <a href=\"/index.php/Chaos\" title=\"Chaos\">Chaos</a> server.</li></ul>', 5),
(23918, 6025, 'Description', 'Description', 'Reveal settlements locates nearby settlements by revealing distance and direction relative to the player\'s current position and direction faced. (Example: The Enclave is quite some distance away in front of you.)', '<p><b>Reveal settlements</b> locates nearby settlements by revealing distance and direction relative to the player\'s current position and direction faced. (Example: The Enclave is quite some distance away in front of you.)\n</p>', 0),
(23919, 6025, 'Distances', 'Distances', '\'quite some distance away\' - Over 60 tiles away', '<p>\'quite some distance away\' - Over 60 tiles away\n</p>', 1),
(23920, 991, 'Description', 'Description', 'Nimbleness has been cast on it, so it increase the chance to hit. A spell available to Vynora priests at 30 faith , but requires 60 favor to cast.', '<p><i>Nimbleness has been cast on it, so it increase the chance to hit.</i>\n</p>\n<p>A spell available to <a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a> priests at 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>, but requires 60 <a href=\"/index.php/Favor\" title=\"Favor\">favor</a> to cast.\n</p>', 0),
(23921, 991, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate a statuette of Vynora Right-click an item Select Spells > Nimbleness', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> a <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Vynora\" title=\"Statuette of Vynora\">statuette of Vynora</a></li>\n<li>Right-click an item</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Nimbleness</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23922, 991, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'This spell is stackable with Aura of shared pain , Circle of cunning , Flaming aura , Frostbrand , Life transfer , Mind stealer , Rotting touch , Venom , and Demise spells . This spell will not stack with Blessings of the dark or Wind of ages .', '<p>This spell is stackable with <a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Flaming_aura\" title=\"Flaming aura\">Flaming aura</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Frostbrand\" title=\"Frostbrand\">Frostbrand</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Life_transfer\" title=\"Life transfer\">Life transfer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_stealer\" title=\"Mind stealer\">Mind stealer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Rotting_touch\" title=\"Rotting touch\">Rotting touch</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Venom\" title=\"Venom\">Venom</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Demise spells</a>.\n</p>\n<p>This spell will not stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Blessings_of_the_dark\" title=\"Blessings of the dark\">Blessings of the dark</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>.\n</p>', 2),
(23926, 1724, 'Description', 'Description', 'Area damage spell. When targeted at a creature it deals two wounds, one to the head and one to the body. Damage ignores armour and is applied repeatedly, with damage depending on the power of the cast. Can be used to convert a grass , enchanted grass or enchanted tree tile into tundra .', '<p>Area damage spell. When targeted at a creature it deals two wounds, one to the head and one to the body.\n</p>\n<p>Damage ignores armour and is applied repeatedly, with damage depending on the power of the cast. \n</p>\n<p>Can be used to convert a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Grass\" title=\"Grass\">grass</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Enchanted_grass\" title=\"Enchanted grass\">enchanted grass</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Enchanted_tree\" title=\"Enchanted tree\">enchanted tree</a> tile into <a href=\"/index.php/Tundra\" title=\"Tundra\">tundra</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(23927, 1724, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a tile Select Spells > Ice pillar', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a></li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Ice pillar</i></li></ol>', 1),
(23928, 1724, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Ice pillar has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Ice pillar has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes.\n</p>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:452px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Ice_pillar.jpg\"><img alt=\"Ice pillar.jpg\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-file-height=\"600\" data-file-width=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"338\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/79/Ice_pillar.jpg/450px-Ice_pillar.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/79/Ice_pillar.jpg/675px-Ice_pillar.jpg 1.5x, /images/7/79/Ice_pillar.jpg 2x\" width=\"450\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/index.php/File:Ice_pillar.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div></div></div></div>', 2),
(23929, 6029, 'Description', 'Description', 'Increases defenses.\nGives the affected player a defensive combat rating bonus.', '<p>Increases defenses.\nGives the affected player a defensive combat rating bonus.\n</p>', 0),
(23930, 6029, 'Cast text', 'Cast_text', '[21:50:54] You start to cast \'Excel\' on Funkiey. [21:51:13] You cast \'Excel\' on Funkiey. [21:51:13] Funkiey now has smooth combat movement.', '<p><span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> [21:50:54] You start to cast \'Excel\' on Funkiey.<br/>\n[21:51:13] You cast \'Excel\' on Funkiey.<br/>\n[21:51:13] Funkiey now has smooth combat movement.<br/> </span>\n</p>', 1),
(23931, 6029, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click a player Select Spells > Excel', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click a player</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Excel</i></li></ol>', 2),
(23932, 6030, 'Description', 'Description', 'Causes area damage to creatures and environment. Tornado will cause trees to be felled, with QL based on the power of the cast. It does not do damage to enchanted trees or bushes. Trees felled by this spell have a lesser amount of wood than when felled by chopping down. The area of effect is between 5x5 and 9x9 tiles, depending on the power of the cast, and damage to players ignores armour.', '<p>Causes area damage to creatures and environment.\n</p>\n<p>Tornado will cause trees to be felled, with QL based on the power of the cast. It does not do damage to enchanted trees or bushes. Trees felled by this spell have a lesser amount of wood than when felled by chopping down.\n</p>\n<p>The area of effect is between 5x5 and 9x9 tiles, depending on the power of the cast, and damage to players ignores armour.\n</p>', 0),
(23933, 6030, 'Cast text', 'Cast_text', '[18:29:06] You start to cast \'Tornado\'.\n[18:29:35] You succeed\n[18:29:35] You call upon the wind of Vynora.', '<pre>[18:29:06] You start to cast \'Tornado\'.\n[18:29:35] You succeed\n[18:29:35] You call upon the wind of Vynora.\n</pre>', 1),
(23934, 6030, 'Offensive spell resistance', 'Offensive_spell_resistance', 'Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell. The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell. Tornado has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes.', '<p>Many offensive spells in the game now also have their own resistances. These function identically to the healing resistance above, but have much lower maximum duration for their resistance values. The duration of this effect is based on how much damage is done, and will reduce all further damage on the target from the same spell.\n</p>\n<p>The maximum duration of resistance various depending on the spell, and the reduction scales linearly from that mark. For example, if you have 1 minute of resistance remaining and the spell has a maximum resistance duration of 2 minutes, you will receive 50% normal damage from a further cast of that spell.\n</p>\n<p>Tornado has a maximum resistance duration of 3 minutes.\n</p>', 2),
(23935, 990, 'Description', 'Description', 'A weapon enchanted with Frostbrand causes additional frost wounds when it damages an opponent.', '<p>A weapon enchanted with Frostbrand causes additional frost wounds when it damages an opponent.\n</p>', 0),
(23936, 990, 'Spell text', 'Spell_text', 'Example of a hit with an Frostbrand enchanted maul: You maul Young champion crocodile deadly hard in the chest and harm it. Your weapon freezes Young champion crocodile.', '<p>Example of a hit with an Frostbrand enchanted maul:<br/>\n<span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> You maul Young champion crocodile deadly hard in the chest and harm it. </span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> Your weapon freezes Young champion crocodile. </span>\n</p>', 1),
(23937, 990, 'Method', 'Method', 'Activate your deity\'s statuette Right-click an item Select Spells > Frostbrand', '<ol><li><a href=\"/index.php/Activate\" title=\"Activate\">Activate</a> your deity\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Statuette\" title=\"Statuette\">statuette</a></li>\n<li>Right-click an item</li>\n<li>Select <i>Spells</i> &gt; <i>Frostbrand</i></li></ol>', 2),
(23938, 990, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'This spell will stack with Aura of shared pain , Blessings of the dark , Circle of cunning , Demise spells , Mind stealer , Nimbleness , Web armour and Wind of ages . This spell will not stack with Bloodthirst , Flaming aura , Life transfer , Rotting touch , Essence drain , and Venom . Can be reflected back by Aura of shared pain .', '<ul><li>This spell will stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Blessings_of_the_dark\" title=\"Blessings of the dark\">Blessings of the dark</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Demise spells</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_stealer\" title=\"Mind stealer\">Mind stealer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Nimbleness\" title=\"Nimbleness\">Nimbleness</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Web_armour\" title=\"Web armour\">Web armour</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>.</li>\n<li>This spell will <b>not</b> stack with <a href=\"/index.php/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Flaming_aura\" title=\"Flaming aura\">Flaming aura</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Life_transfer\" title=\"Life transfer\">Life transfer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Rotting_touch\" title=\"Rotting touch\">Rotting touch</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Essence_drain\" title=\"Essence drain\">Essence drain</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Venom\" title=\"Venom\">Venom</a>.</li>\n<li>Can be reflected back by <a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>.</li></ul>', 3),
(23939, 918, 'Description', 'Description', 'Mind Stealer has been cast on it, so it will steal skill knowledge from some creatures. Killing a non-player creature with a weapon enchanted with Mind stealer may transfer skill points to the player. When a creature is killed, the game chooses a random skill or characteristic the creature has, and if the creature has more points in that skill than the player does, the player gains points in that skill. The amount of skill gained by the player depends on how much more skill the creature has compared to the player, and the power level of the Mind stealer enchantment. Mind stealer may also be cast on arrows. When cast on arrows, skill is transferred on successful hits rather than kills. This spell is stackable with Aura of shared pain , Blessings of the dark , Circle of cunning , Flaming aura , Frostbrand , Life transfer , Nimbleness , Rotting touch , Venom , Wind of ages , and Demise spells . Skills known to be stolen: Weaponless fighting Body strength Body stamina Body control Soul depth Soul strength Huge club Lockpicking Medium wooden shield Mind speed', '<p><i>Mind Stealer has been cast on it, so it will steal skill knowledge from some creatures.</i>\n</p>\n<p>Killing a non-player creature with a weapon enchanted with Mind stealer may transfer skill points to the player. When a creature is killed, the game chooses a random skill or characteristic the creature has, and if the creature has more points in that skill than the player does, the player gains points in that skill. The amount of skill gained by the player depends on how much more skill the creature has compared to the player, and the power level of the Mind stealer enchantment.\n</p>\n<p>Mind stealer may also be cast on arrows. When cast on arrows, skill is transferred on successful hits rather than kills.\n</p>\n<p>This spell is stackable with <a href=\"/index.php/Aura_of_shared_pain\" title=\"Aura of shared pain\">Aura of shared pain</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Blessings_of_the_dark\" title=\"Blessings of the dark\">Blessings of the dark</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Flaming_aura\" title=\"Flaming aura\">Flaming aura</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Frostbrand\" title=\"Frostbrand\">Frostbrand</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Life_transfer\" title=\"Life transfer\">Life transfer</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Nimbleness\" title=\"Nimbleness\">Nimbleness</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Rotting_touch\" title=\"Rotting touch\">Rotting touch</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Venom\" title=\"Venom\">Venom</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Demise_spells\" title=\"Demise spells\">Demise spells</a>.\n</p>\n<p>Skills known to be stolen:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Weaponless_fighting\" title=\"Weaponless fighting\">Weaponless fighting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body_strength\" title=\"Body strength\">Body strength</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body_stamina\" title=\"Body stamina\">Body stamina</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul_depth\" title=\"Soul depth\">Soul depth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Soul_strength\" title=\"Soul strength\">Soul strength</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Huge_club\" title=\"Huge club\">Huge club</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Lockpicking\" title=\"Lockpicking\">Lockpicking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Medium_wooden_shield\" title=\"Medium wooden shield\">Medium wooden shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind_speed\" title=\"Mind speed\">Mind speed</a></li></ul>', 0),
(23943, 3427, 'Description', 'Description', 'Damages enemy structures and deals crushing wounds to all creatures with a 3x3 area of the player, with damage depending on power of the cast.', '<p>Damages enemy structures and deals crushing wounds to all creatures with a 3x3 area of the player, with damage depending on power of the cast.\n</p>', 0),
(23944, 6035, '091229', '091229', 'Upkeep should now be added as traders sell things instead of buys Bloodthirst strength is now added in melee only and the efficiency depends on weapon quality level as well. It will be added in archery the next update. Mail CoD prices were a bit miscalculated and were usually about 10 copper too expensive. The Vessel spell now usually requires at least 5 favor to put into the gem. The bug where creating items used up too little material was fixed.', '<ul><li>Upkeep should now be added as traders sell things instead of buys</li>\n<li>Bloodthirst strength is now added in melee only and the efficiency depends on weapon quality level as well. It will be added in archery the next update.</li>\n<li>Mail CoD prices were a bit miscalculated and were usually about 10 copper too expensive.</li>\n<li>The Vessel spell now usually requires at least 5 favor to put into the gem.</li>\n<li>The bug where creating items used up too little material was fixed.</li></ul>', 0),
(23945, 6035, '091221', '091221', 'The new religion code is now live. The change contains more spells, the ability to link casters, the need to keep your alignment in check by for instance taking confession or holding sermons. Most functionality is like before though. In order to reduce the incitament for everyone to become a priest, priests gain basic body and mind characteristics slower. Some changes were implemented to make it easier on newbies like large anvil weight, fireplace heating and less-than-20 skill gain speed. Bugs with vehicles/boats and entering caves were fixed so mounts and vehicles shouldn\'t get stuck or disappear. You\'ve heard it before but this time should be different. Champions can take more damage. Secondary weapon attacks had a bug which made them attack too often. This has been fixed so test it out on something harmless. A lot of other small changes and bugfixes were introduced that should have a positive effect on the game. The reason that this is released a few days before christmas is so that we have time to detect any really bad bugs before the holidays. In any case, this update will fix more bugs than it causes.', '<ul><li>The new religion code is now live. The change contains more spells, the ability to link casters, the need to keep your alignment in check by for instance taking confession or holding sermons. Most functionality is like before though. In order to reduce the incitament for everyone to become a priest, priests gain basic body and mind characteristics slower.</li>\n<li>Some changes were implemented to make it easier on newbies like large anvil weight, fireplace heating and less-than-20 skill gain speed.</li>\n<li>Bugs with vehicles/boats and entering caves were fixed so mounts and vehicles shouldn\'t get stuck or disappear. You\'ve heard it before but this time should be different.</li>\n<li>Champions can take more damage.</li>\n<li>Secondary weapon attacks had a bug which made them attack too often. This has been fixed so test it out on something harmless.</li>\n<li>A lot of other small changes and bugfixes were introduced that should have a positive effect on the game.</li>\n<li>The reason that this is released a few days before christmas is so that we have time to detect any really bad bugs before the holidays. In any case, this update will fix more bugs than it causes.</li></ul>', 1);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(23946, 6035, '091030', '091030', 'When you lead or ride creatures they no longer should suffocate in rock Domestic creatures should move more often between reboots. The previous Mol Rehan server was upgraded to 16GB RAM yesterday and today we asked our hosting company to install 64-bit linux on the machine.  When that is done we\'ll prepare the system a while then move wild there. We expect that to happen next week or the week after.', '<ul><li>When you lead or ride creatures they no longer should suffocate in rock</li>\n<li>Domestic creatures should move more often between reboots.</li>\n<li>The previous Mol Rehan server was upgraded to 16GB RAM yesterday and today we asked our hosting company to install 64-bit linux on the machine.  When that is done we\'ll prepare the system a while then move wild there. We expect that to happen next week or the week after.</li></ul>', 2),
(23947, 6035, '091026', '091026', 'The bug where you could raise 3 corners of a road section by flattening was removed so that it prevents raising on all 4 corners instead. The strength requirement to remove paved tiles was lowered to 20.', '<ul><li>The bug where you could raise 3 corners of a road section by flattening was removed so that it prevents raising on all 4 corners instead.</li>\n<li>The strength requirement to remove paved tiles was lowered to 20.</li></ul>', 3),
(23948, 6035, '091020', '091020', 'You may now buy premium time at settlement tokens for silver coins ingame. The cost is 10 silver, and 3 silver is returned to the traders. You may now travel between the wild server and the freedom server using portals found in the capitals. On freedom there are portals in Samling and Freedom Market. The cost for using a portal is 10 silver coins deducted from your bank account. You can only bring no-drop and newbie items as well as coins in order to reduce local trade disruption. If you have above 50 in Archery or Fighting skill, those skills will suffer a 5% penalty. The reasoning behind these penalties is described in the web forum. The bug where animals attached to the wrong vehicle when hitched was fixed.', '<ul><li>You may now buy premium time at settlement tokens for silver coins ingame. The cost is 10 silver, and 3 silver is returned to the traders.</li>\n<li>You may now travel between the wild server and the freedom server using portals found in the capitals. On freedom there are portals in Samling and Freedom Market. The cost for using a portal is 10 silver coins deducted from your bank account. You can only bring no-drop and newbie items as well as coins in order to reduce local trade disruption. If you have above 50 in Archery or Fighting skill, those skills will suffer a 5% penalty. The reasoning behind these penalties is described in the web forum.</li>\n<li>The bug where animals attached to the wrong vehicle when hitched was fixed.</li></ul>', 4),
(23949, 6035, '091015', '091015', 'There is now a setting in deed management that may allow anyone to put personal merchants on your deed Skillgain for meditation should now be easier and more consistent The rubberband bug got another kick You may no longer allow people from opposing kingdoms to pass your mine doors', '<ul><li>There is now a setting in deed management that may allow anyone to put personal merchants on your deed</li>\n<li>Skillgain for meditation should now be easier and more consistent</li>\n<li>The rubberband bug got another kick</li>\n<li>You may no longer allow people from opposing kingdoms to pass your mine doors</li></ul>', 5),
(23950, 6035, '091009', '091009', 'A bug where you could send containers via mail COD much cheaper than if prepaid was fixed. The bug with small carts getting stuck at cave entrances was fixed. We had problems with the shop and registration system being unavailable the last 16 hours but it is now online again.', '<ul><li>A bug where you could send containers via mail COD much cheaper than if prepaid was fixed.</li>\n<li>The bug with small carts getting stuck at cave entrances was fixed.</li>\n<li>We had problems with the shop and registration system being unavailable the last 16 hours but it is now online again.</li></ul>', 6),
(23951, 6035, '091008', '091008', 'Fixed a bug where riding out from a cave sometimes didn\'t show the rider Fixed a bug where dragging a cart out from a cave seemed to make the passengers stay in the cave The rubberband bug where you sometimes could not move after disembarking should be fixed but it could not be reproduced.', '<ul><li>Fixed a bug where riding out from a cave sometimes didn\'t show the rider</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug where dragging a cart out from a cave seemed to make the passengers stay in the cave</li>\n<li>The rubberband bug where you sometimes could not move after disembarking should be fixed but it could not be reproduced.</li></ul>', 7),
(23952, 6035, '091005', '091005', 'Various bugfixes: Using freedom portals, fat level decrease, creating grooming brushes and puppets now work as intended. The fat decrease bug was what caused creatures to sometimes die prematurely this weekend Animal breeding skill was renamed to Animal husbandry instead. Grooming gives lower skillgain now since it was too high during the weekend Erupting is now limited in various ways and moved to another level Large carts are no longer lockable', '<ul><li>Various bugfixes: Using freedom portals, fat level decrease, creating grooming brushes and puppets now work as intended. The fat decrease bug was what caused creatures to sometimes die prematurely this weekend</li>\n<li>Animal breeding skill was renamed to Animal husbandry instead. Grooming gives lower skillgain now since it was too high during the weekend</li>\n<li>Erupting is now limited in various ways and moved to another level</li>\n<li>Large carts are no longer lockable</li></ul>', 8),
(23953, 6035, '091002', '091002', 'Apparently people breed creatures much to gain skill, so we added another way to gain that skill for domestic animals: by grooming. You will be able to use a brush made from wood and wemp fibre on your creatures as they get dirty or need attention. Grooming also helps prevent disease and depression. Your creatures may now (rarely) catch diseases. Now, please do not panic:) See how often or rarely it happens - it is easy to prevent. Diseases arise mainly from two factors: large amounts (three or more on one tile) of creatures in small spaces, and other diseased animals or players. Diseases cause them to lose fat faster and also to die after a while. To remove disease, put the creature isolated, well fed and groom it. If a creature needs to be groomed which happens after about two days, examining it will say \"This creature could use some grooming\". The two meditation paths that previously was virtually impossible to find now is more available. You can now create puppets to play with. Skill decay rates have been drastically changed. You will now not decay skills until after two weeks of not using them. The accumulated skill loss will be the same. You can now enchant things like buckets, loom, dredge and fruit press. I found a reason that could have made creatures move away from grass. It is still unverified.', '<ul><li>Apparently people breed creatures much to gain skill, so we added another way to gain that skill for domestic animals: by grooming. You will be able to use a brush made from wood and wemp fibre on your creatures as they get dirty or need attention. Grooming also helps prevent disease and depression.</li>\n<li>Your creatures may now (rarely) catch diseases. Now, please do not panic:) See how often or rarely it happens - it is easy to prevent. Diseases arise mainly from two factors: large amounts (three or more on one tile) of creatures in small spaces, and other diseased animals or players. Diseases cause them to lose fat faster and also to die after a while. To remove disease, put the creature isolated, well fed and groom it. If a creature needs to be groomed which happens after about two days, examining it will say \"This creature could use some grooming\".</li>\n<li>The two meditation paths that previously was virtually impossible to find now is more available.</li>\n<li>You can now create puppets to play with.</li>\n<li>Skill decay rates have been drastically changed. You will now not decay skills until after two weeks of not using them. The accumulated skill loss will be the same.</li>\n<li>You can now enchant things like buckets, loom, dredge and fruit press.</li>\n<li>I found a reason that could have made creatures move away from grass. It is still unverified.</li></ul>', 9),
(23954, 6035, '090923', '090923', 'A few bugs that qualified as or were perceived as exploits were fixed - attacking through mine doors, twigging in combat, and climbing with a cart. Right now only the wild server is updated with these fixes. I walked through the code that verify commands from the client. Not many holes were found - actually less than I expected. I granted Wollschaf the wish of buckets using WOA when harvesting maple sap since he reported a bug with it. Rejoice!', '<ul><li>A few bugs that qualified as or were perceived as exploits were fixed - attacking through mine doors, twigging in combat, and climbing with a cart. Right now only the wild server is updated with these fixes.</li>\n<li>I walked through the code that verify commands from the client. Not many holes were found - actually less than I expected.</li>\n<li>I granted Wollschaf the wish of buckets using WOA when harvesting maple sap since he reported a bug with it. Rejoice!</li></ul>', 10),
(23955, 6035, '090922', '090922', 'Parts of the database on the wild server was rolled back to yesterday as the white light altar was destroyed because of a missing check on the server allowing it to be moved into lava. The effects of this is large on the server population so a rollback was warranted. The server is designed to handle erroneous input but as this event shows there are situations that lack protection. As we have opened the client to send any command to the server at any time these types of bugs were expected and we are improving the protection. We do however expect you to report such errors instead of intentionally creating havoc since it steals time from normal development. Regarding punishment: A lot of the players had a very good time because of these bugs and a lot of the GM\'s as well. It was done in the open and a lot of players dragged all sorts of items around. It caused commotion and excitement. I like that and I think most of us do. It seems to me the wild server needed some action like this. I rolled most of the damage back such as the faith and favor loss, but yes some people lost some skills including the people who did this. The intention was not malicious or egoistic but rather playful and it was done by so many players so there will be no bans for this.', '<ul><li>Parts of the database on the wild server was rolled back to yesterday as the white light altar was destroyed because of a missing check on the server allowing it to be moved into lava. The effects of this is large on the server population so a rollback was warranted.</li>\n<li>The server is designed to handle erroneous input but as this event shows there are situations that lack protection. As we have opened the client to send any command to the server at any time these types of bugs were expected and we are improving the protection. We do however expect you to report such errors instead of intentionally creating havoc since it steals time from normal development.</li>\n<li>Regarding punishment: A lot of the players had a very good time because of these bugs and a lot of the GM\'s as well. It was done in the open and a lot of players dragged all sorts of items around. It caused commotion and excitement. I like that and I think most of us do. It seems to me the wild server needed some action like this. I rolled most of the damage back such as the faith and favor loss, but yes some people lost some skills including the people who did this. The intention was not malicious or egoistic but rather playful and it was done by so many players so there will be no bans for this.</li></ul>', 11),
(23956, 6035, '090921', '090921', 'The problems involving some misplaced items on the wild server was solved, and the items were returned to where they were this friday. No rollback was required. The wild server players received sleep bonus as a small compensation for the hassle. Please forward any remaining issues to Rolf. Boat permissions should now be properly set on the wild server as you embark as captain on the ship. Skill level 15 is now required in meditation in order to embark on a philosophical path.', '<ul><li>The problems involving some misplaced items on the wild server was solved, and the items were returned to where they were this friday. No rollback was required. The wild server players received sleep bonus as a small compensation for the hassle. Please forward any remaining issues to Rolf.</li>\n<li>Boat permissions should now be properly set on the wild server as you embark as captain on the ship.</li>\n<li>Skill level 15 is now required in meditation in order to embark on a philosophical path.</li></ul>', 12),
(23957, 6035, '090915', '090915', 'Fixed a bug with hitching, failed to reproduce others. Hopefully it works now Vehicles on mine doors should not get stuck in the same way any longer A bug where an animal trait could get lost at a restart was fixed, also breeding timer A bug with cooking and salt was fixed There is now a /lives command for champions to show how many respawns they have left A secret feature was introduced which will be announced more later Kingdom animals should no longer attack innocent horses and the like', '<ul><li>Fixed a bug with hitching, failed to reproduce others. Hopefully it works now</li>\n<li>Vehicles on mine doors should not get stuck in the same way any longer</li>\n<li>A bug where an animal trait could get lost at a restart was fixed, also breeding timer</li>\n<li>A bug with cooking and salt was fixed</li>\n<li>There is now a /lives command for champions to show how many respawns they have left</li>\n<li>A secret feature was introduced which will be announced more later</li>\n<li>Kingdom animals should no longer attack innocent horses and the like</li></ul>', 13),
(23958, 6035, '090904', '090904', 'Priests with faith 40+ may now inaugurate other players with 30 faith as priests on the freedom server. Large carts are now a lot harder to drag but they move 3 times faster when driven. If that still is too slow it will have to be increased again. You should no longer be able to build walls on the other side of a wall. Trap damage was toned down a bit for the most powerful ones. Foraging and botanizing should start yielding more results.', '<ul><li>Priests with faith 40+ may now inaugurate other players with 30 faith as priests on the freedom server.</li>\n<li>Large carts are now a lot harder to drag but they move 3 times faster when driven. If that still is too slow it will have to be increased again.</li>\n<li>You should no longer be able to build walls on the other side of a wall.</li>\n<li>Trap damage was toned down a bit for the most powerful ones.</li>\n<li>Foraging and botanizing should start yielding more results.</li></ul>', 14),
(23959, 6035, '090831', '090831', 'Because they pose too much of a threat, the bear population has been declared to become extint on the Golden Valley server. There was a change in the creature movement code in order to make animals stop entering buildings.', '<ul><li>Because they pose too much of a threat, the bear population has been declared to become extint on the Golden Valley server.</li>\n<li>There was a change in the creature movement code in order to make animals stop entering buildings.</li></ul>', 15),
(23960, 6035, '090828', '090828', 'Some bugs player placement on vehicles was fixed. Driving into a cave still has a graphical bug. Fixed a bug where liquids moved between containers lost data Meat and fish filets now decay four times slower. As usual, add salt or move to a container to slow decay even more. Added combat moves for freedom You should now retarget someone who is embarking or disembarking a boat Wooden mine doors no longer requires 21 strength to be placed so they may now be placed by most people The fire effect from dragons now disappear Piles now disappear when they contain few items Non-aggressive creatures will now usually avoid traps unless they are ridden by enemies Boarding vehicles no longer removes yourself from local Female horse corpse models should show correctly now', '<ul><li>Some bugs player placement on vehicles was fixed. Driving into a cave still has a graphical bug.</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug where liquids moved between containers lost data</li>\n<li>Meat and fish filets now decay four times slower. As usual, add salt or move to a container to slow decay even more.</li>\n<li>Added combat moves for freedom</li>\n<li>You should now retarget someone who is embarking or disembarking a boat</li>\n<li>Wooden mine doors no longer requires 21 strength to be placed so they may now be placed by most people</li>\n<li>The fire effect from dragons now disappear</li>\n<li>Piles now disappear when they contain few items</li>\n<li>Non-aggressive creatures will now usually avoid traps unless they are ridden by enemies</li>\n<li>Boarding vehicles no longer removes yourself from local</li>\n<li>Female horse corpse models should show correctly now</li></ul>', 16),
(23961, 6035, '090810', '090810', 'Performing tricky actions when you are being attacked now makes you more vulnerable than before. This affects all non-combat actions such as tracking, spellcasting, bandaging but also actions that open you up for attacks such as taunting.', '<ul><li>Performing tricky actions when you are being attacked now makes you more vulnerable than before. This affects all non-combat actions such as tracking, spellcasting, bandaging but also actions that open you up for attacks such as taunting.</li></ul>', 17),
(23962, 6035, '090803', '090803', 'Raw meat now has the same decay rate as corpses. Food now takes damage as you insert it into banks. The bug where traps dealt spell damage against uniques was fixed. Traps will still do some damage on them though until next restart to gather information on the effect of normal traps in case someone decides to try. Rope value was changed so that normal ropes that are very easy to make have a lot lower value while cordage ropes had its value doubled. There was an armour bug when you hit a companion with an arrow that was fixed.', '<ul><li>Raw meat now has the same decay rate as corpses.</li>\n<li>Food now takes damage as you insert it into banks.</li>\n<li>The bug where traps dealt spell damage against uniques was fixed. Traps will still do some damage on them though until next restart to gather information on the effect of normal traps in case someone decides to try.</li>\n<li>Rope value was changed so that normal ropes that are very easy to make have a lot lower value while cordage ropes had its value doubled.</li>\n<li>There was an armour bug when you hit a companion with an arrow that was fixed.</li></ul>', 18),
(23963, 6035, '090715', '090715', 'The old Jenn-Kellon and Mol Rehan home servers have being taken offline. You will not be able to log on to them again. The old home servers accounts are migrated to the wild server. The artifacts on the wild server have respawned in other places during this downtime. PvP on the wild server is now allowed again. The portals to the freedom lands have disappeared and sailing there is no longer possible. The free settlement disbanding that was in place these last few weeks is removed so now you will loose half the deed cost again if you disband.', '<ul><li>The old Jenn-Kellon and Mol Rehan home servers have being taken offline. You will not be able to log on to them again.</li>\n<li>The old home servers accounts are migrated to the wild server.</li>\n<li>The artifacts on the wild server have respawned in other places during this downtime.</li>\n<li>PvP on the wild server is now allowed again.</li>\n<li>The portals to the freedom lands have disappeared and sailing there is no longer possible.</li>\n<li>The free settlement disbanding that was in place these last few weeks is removed so now you will loose half the deed cost again if you disband.</li></ul>', 19),
(23964, 6035, '090713', '090713', 'Planting mixed seeds now should work, making it possible to spread steppe. A bug that affected some timing issues where for instance food levels dropped too quickly was fixed. It also affected mounts and in those rare cases you may end up being kicked from the vehicle or mount.', '<ul><li>Planting mixed seeds now should work, making it possible to spread steppe.</li>\n<li>A bug that affected some timing issues where for instance food levels dropped too quickly was fixed. It also affected mounts and in those rare cases you may end up being kicked from the vehicle or mount.</li></ul>', 20),
(23965, 6035, '090706', '090706', 'Nutrition level now goes down with every step when you fast. Fixed a bug where digging on protected tiles was sometimes allowed. You may now destroy locked buildings on the wild server without skill loss penalty if they are not deeded. If a guard detects you your reputation may take a hit but the skill loss penalty is reserved for deeded structures. A bug that allowed you to collapse a cave entrance beneath a mine door was fixed so that you now need to destroy the mine door first.', '<ul><li>Nutrition level now goes down with every step when you fast.</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug where digging on protected tiles was sometimes allowed.</li>\n<li>You may now destroy locked buildings on the wild server without skill loss penalty if they are not deeded. If a guard detects you your reputation may take a hit but the skill loss penalty is reserved for deeded structures.</li>\n<li>A bug that allowed you to collapse a cave entrance beneath a mine door was fixed so that you now need to destroy the mine door first.</li></ul>', 21),
(23966, 6035, '090703', '090703', 'If a ship can not cross the border to the next server, the client will now make it stop a few tiles from it. This should prevent throwing people out of their boats as it reaches the border, thereby preventing some drowning situations. Market stalls can now be destroyed by their creators.', '<ul><li>If a ship can not cross the border to the next server, the client will now make it stop a few tiles from it. This should prevent throwing people out of their boats as it reaches the border, thereby preventing some drowning situations.</li>\n<li>Market stalls can now be destroyed by their creators.</li></ul>', 22),
(23967, 6035, '090627', '090627', 'The problems where items and creatures suddenly went invisible until next restart should be gone now. I destroyed most bears and wolves on the free Golden Valley server, but there are still a lot too many creatures making it a more dangerous place than it is supposed to be. Unless players manage to kill off these creatures we\'ll probably do it next restart scheduled Monday.', '<ul><li>The problems where items and creatures suddenly went invisible until next restart should be gone now.</li>\n<li>I destroyed most bears and wolves on the free Golden Valley server, but there are still a lot too many creatures making it a more dangerous place than it is supposed to be. Unless players manage to kill off these creatures we\'ll probably do it next restart scheduled Monday.</li></ul>', 23),
(23968, 6035, '090615', '090615', 'The chance to find salt has increased. Existing salt spots moved. There are some changes to the requirements for destroying buildings which usually make you require 21 strength. These will be sorted out next update so that you can destroy your own buildings. You were able to loose reputation while catapulting on non-pvp servers which should no longer be possible. Road decay on premium servers was made a lot less common.', '<ul><li>The chance to find salt has increased. Existing salt spots moved.</li>\n<li>There are some changes to the requirements for destroying buildings which usually make you require 21 strength. These will be sorted out next update so that you can destroy your own buildings.</li>\n<li>You were able to loose reputation while catapulting on non-pvp servers which should no longer be possible.</li>\n<li>Road decay on premium servers was made a lot less common.</li></ul>', 24),
(23969, 6035, '090612', '090612', 'The release date for the Freedom lands is set to Wednesday the 17th 18:00 hrs CEST. You will be able to sail there, south of the existing home servers and the wild server. An FAQ should be available pretty soon explaining some other details. The bug where boats no longer transferred properly between servers was fixed. Anchors now transfer properly with the boat as well. The portals to the home servers from Golden Valley will close during the weekend. Tower guards now only attack creatures that you have targeted or is fighting. So they will not randomly hunt any longer when you say \"help\".', '<ul><li>The release date for the Freedom lands is set to Wednesday the 17th 18:00 hrs CEST. You will be able to sail there, south of the existing home servers and the wild server. An FAQ should be available pretty soon explaining some other details.</li>\n<li>The bug where boats no longer transferred properly between servers was fixed. Anchors now transfer properly with the boat as well.</li>\n<li>The portals to the home servers from Golden Valley will close during the weekend.</li>\n<li>Tower guards now only attack creatures that you have targeted or is fighting. So they will not randomly hunt any longer when you say \"help\".</li></ul>', 25),
(23970, 6035, '090610', '090610', 'The servers now run freedom code, which means that on the home servers it should work like it will on the freedom servers. The preliminary date for the freedom server release is on Monday 15th, so some large scale tests will not hurt. The wild server lacks the area of influence that home servers have. You should be able to duel but otherwise most things should be locked down now. Some flattening bugs were fixed and it should work more properly again.', '<ul><li>The servers now run freedom code, which means that on the home servers it should work like it will on the freedom servers. The preliminary date for the freedom server release is on Monday 15th, so some large scale tests will not hurt. The wild server lacks the area of influence that home servers have. You should be able to duel but otherwise most things should be locked down now.</li>\n<li>Some flattening bugs were fixed and it should work more properly again.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 26),
(23971, 6035, '090608', '090608', 'Gravel, slabs, planks and cobblestone now use a different algorithm to determine whether they decay or not. If they are not walked upon for a day or two there is a small chance that they will decay. A hint on wishing wells: The value of the coin is the base when calculating the chance for the wish to come true. You may even be better off sacrificing one higher value coin than several small value coins. Game masters may protect tiles such as roads from terraforming. This feature is supposed to be used on the non-pvp servers mainly. If you change kingdom on the wild server and return to your old home server you will be kicked out from the village. Your old village will start disbanding if you are the mayor and it is not a homestead. If it is a homestead the effects are uncertain this update but you will probably be hunted on your own deed. In the next update homesteads will also start disbanding as you return. Mounts will start changing speed due to traits a while after you mount now, in order to make it better for riding competitions.', '<ul><li>Gravel, slabs, planks and cobblestone now use a different algorithm to determine whether they decay or not. If they are not walked upon for a day or two there is a small chance that they will decay.</li>\n<li>A hint on wishing wells: The value of the coin is the base when calculating the chance for the wish to come true. You may even be better off sacrificing one higher value coin than several small value coins.</li>\n<li>Game masters may protect tiles such as roads from terraforming. This feature is supposed to be used on the non-pvp servers mainly.</li>\n<li>If you change kingdom on the wild server and return to your old home server you will be kicked out from the village. Your old village will start disbanding if you are the mayor and it is not a homestead. If it is a homestead the effects are uncertain this update but you will probably be hunted on your own deed. In the next update homesteads will also start disbanding as you return.</li>\n<li>Mounts will start changing speed due to traits a while after you mount now, in order to make it better for riding competitions.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 27),
(23972, 6035, '090605', '090605', 'Wurm Online is now 3 years old (the 6th)! As a celebration to the 3 year anniversary certain priests may now create wishing wells. Needless to say they have secret functionality. An old bug related to creatures and items disappearing was found and dealt with. Golden Valley players can no longer go unfaithful or unlawful Golden Valley traders no longer sell deeds. You\'re not really supposed to deed that server but the existing ones will be allowed to remain.', '<ul><li>Wurm Online is now 3 years old (the 6th)! As a celebration to the 3 year anniversary certain priests may now create wishing wells. Needless to say they have secret functionality.</li>\n<li>An old bug related to creatures and items disappearing was found and dealt with.</li>\n<li>Golden Valley players can no longer go unfaithful or unlawful</li>\n<li>Golden Valley traders no longer sell deeds. You\'re not really supposed to deed that server but the existing ones will be allowed to remain.</li></ul>', 28),
(23973, 6035, '090529', '090529', 'Tower guards no longer automatically clear the area around their towers. You now have to manually write help or guards! in local chat and they will try to help you with your target or opponent. If you are not engaged or target a creature they will start killing off aggressive creatures at random instead. The reason for this change is that more often than not people wanted wildlife to stay alive nearby.', '<ul><li>Tower guards no longer automatically clear the area around their towers. You now have to manually write help or guards! in local chat and they will try to help you with your target or opponent. If you are not engaged or target a creature they will start killing off aggressive creatures at random instead. The reason for this change is that more often than not people wanted wildlife to stay alive nearby.</li></ul>', 29),
(23974, 6035, '090528', '090528', 'The finishing lag problems on the wild server lead to a bug fix where tower guards now hunt through locked house doors. I haven\'t received any reports yet but they probably enter through locked fences as well.', '<ul><li>The finishing lag problems on the wild server lead to a bug fix where tower guards now hunt through locked house doors. I haven\'t received any reports yet but they probably enter through locked fences as well.</li></ul>', 30),
(23975, 6035, '090525', '090525', 'You should not receive those out of synch commands on boats any more. A lot of other bugs that were related to this problem were also fixed in the process. Crocodiles now move like other creatures. Free disbands are now effective. You will receive a new trader deed only once as you plant the deed again if you have a village size 10+. The reason for the wild finishing lag was tower guards not being able to pass through doors, trying to find a way. Fixed . Boat locks can no longer be used to lock large carts since that was unintended.', '<ul><li>You should not receive those out of synch commands on boats any more. A lot of other bugs that were related to this problem were also fixed in the process.</li>\n<li>Crocodiles now move like other creatures.</li>\n<li>Free disbands are now effective. You will receive a new trader deed only once as you plant the deed again if you have a village size 10+.</li>\n<li>The reason for the wild finishing lag was tower guards not being able to pass through doors, trying to find a way. <b>Fixed</b>.</li>\n<li>Boat locks can no longer be used to lock large carts since that was unintended.</li></ul>', 31),
(23976, 6035, '090520', '090520', 'Swimming now works as intended and is required. You will start drowning as you approach low stamina - so be careful out there!', '<ul><li>Swimming now works as intended and is required. You will start drowning as you approach low stamina - so be careful out there!</li></ul>', 32),
(23977, 6035, '090515', '090515', 'There was a difficulty cap before for skill checks which was removed. This should not have a big impact on normal gameplay but for high skills certain actions may have become harder. Rank for banned players was reset. Villages where the mayor was banned have been turned into democracies so that you can vote for a new mayor. Some bug fixes with creature breeding not updating their model. Offline creatures now loose loyalty as if they were ingame.', '<ul><li>There was a difficulty cap before for skill checks which was removed. This should not have a big impact on normal gameplay but for high skills certain actions may have become harder.</li>\n<li>Rank for banned players was reset. Villages where the mayor was banned have been turned into democracies so that you can vote for a new mayor.</li>\n<li>Some bug fixes with creature breeding not updating their model.</li>\n<li>Offline creatures now loose loyalty as if they were ingame.</li></ul>', 33),
(23978, 6035, '090512', '090512', 'Good and high nutrition food fills better again Salt is more common and if included in meals will lower decay to half. Raw meat and fish is now low nutrition and cooked meat is medium nutrition Fat and nourishment (nutrition level) now has some effect on wound recovery Dominated creatures now loose some loyalty when they are hurt - the more powerful the creature is the easier it becomes aggravated. Boats now have a kingdom flag set by whoever mounts as driver. Current boats have their flag set to the current server. New boats from the person who creates them. You will be able to pick boats with enemy kingdom flag on the current home servers. Fasting bug was fixed. Flattening close to houses and fences now should be fixed.', '<ul><li>Good and high nutrition food fills better again</li>\n<li>Salt is more common and if included in meals will lower decay to half.</li>\n<li>Raw meat and fish is now low nutrition and cooked meat is medium nutrition</li>\n<li>Fat and nourishment (nutrition level) now has some effect on wound recovery</li>\n<li>Dominated creatures now loose some loyalty when they are hurt - the more powerful the creature is the easier it becomes aggravated.</li>\n<li>Boats now have a kingdom flag set by whoever mounts as driver. Current boats have their flag set to the current server. New boats from the person who creates them. You will be able to pick boats with enemy kingdom flag on the current home servers.</li>\n<li>Fasting bug was fixed.</li>\n<li>Flattening close to houses and fences now should be fixed.</li></ul>', 34),
(23979, 6035, '090508', '090508', 'Food changed. There now is a nutrition level that affects how soon you get hungry. You gain skill a bit better with higher nutrition levels in your body as well. High nutrition food decays a lot faster though so it must be more fresh than travel food. Good idea Joss! Hopefully this change will make life for newbies a bit easier but we\'ll see during the weekend. We have gathered information about client cheats for a while. If you are one of those who have used modified clients you may email [email protected] This e-mail address is being protected from spambots. You need JavaScript enabled to view it and provide information about which tool you used. Instead of a permanent ban you will merely have your skills reset to max 20. If you decide not to email us, please offload any deeds and writs so that your fellow villagers don\'t get into trouble when you get permanently banned. Found the reason why you can not ride newly bred creatures - they kept their childhood skills. New creatures that are born will be ridable. Added debug functionality to try and figure out why creatures go invisible at times since I can not reproduce it on the test server. A big warm welcome to all new players from PC Gamer UK. We hope you will enjoy Wurm Online!', '<ul><li>Food changed. There now is a nutrition level that affects how soon you get hungry. You gain skill a bit better with higher nutrition levels in your body as well. High nutrition food decays a lot faster though so it must be more fresh than travel food. Good idea Joss! Hopefully this change will make life for newbies a bit easier but we\'ll see during the weekend.</li>\n<li>We have gathered information about client cheats for a while. If you are one of those who have used modified clients you may email <a class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"4e272d262b2f3a2b2a0e393b3c2321202227202b602d2123\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\">[email protected]</a> This e-mail address is being protected from spambots. You need JavaScript enabled to view it and provide information about which tool you used. Instead of a permanent ban you will merely have your skills reset to max 20. If you decide not to email us, please offload any deeds and writs so that your fellow villagers don\'t get into trouble when you get permanently banned.</li>\n<li>Found the reason why you can not ride newly bred creatures - they kept their childhood skills. New creatures that are born will be ridable.</li>\n<li>Added debug functionality to try and figure out why creatures go invisible at times since I can not reproduce it on the test server.</li>\n<li>A big warm welcome to all new players from PC Gamer UK. We hope you will enjoy Wurm Online!</li></ul>', 35),
(23980, 6035, '090505', '090505', 'A new client was released, version 2.6.21. If you experience problems with the movement keys (WASD) not working any longer, delete the old ones and log on again. The old keybinds are found in your Wurm folder/Config/whatever config you\'re currently using/keybindings.txt Fixed a bug where targeting was lost as you mounted.', '<ul><li>A new client was released, version 2.6.21. If you experience problems with the movement keys (WASD) not working any longer, delete the old ones and log on again. The old keybinds are found in your Wurm folder/Config/whatever config you\'re currently using/keybindings.txt</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug where targeting was lost as you mounted.</li></ul>', 36),
(23981, 6035, '090428', '090428', 'Most creatures will be better at detecting enemies in certain circumstances. This should affect for instance spawning towerguards but may make raiding a bit more dangerous as well. Thank you Drega for raising the issue. You will no longer be able to lead away a creature dominated by someone else. Thank you Nosyt for this report!', '<ul><li>Most creatures will be better at detecting enemies in certain circumstances. This should affect for instance spawning towerguards but may make raiding a bit more dangerous as well. Thank you Drega for raising the issue.</li>\n<li>You will no longer be able to lead away a creature dominated by someone else. Thank you Nosyt for this report!</li></ul>', 37),
(23982, 6035, '090424', '090424', 'Mounts move a little bit faster Horse and foal corpses should start to have the right color You will get the option to tracking without holding an item again Breeding times were still too long and should improve.', '<ul><li>Mounts move a little bit faster</li>\n<li>Horse and foal corpses should start to have the right color</li>\n<li>You will get the option to tracking without holding an item again</li>\n<li>Breeding times were still too long and should improve.</li></ul>', 38),
(23983, 6035, '090421', '090421', 'With this update you get the sounds and music that Joss Sanglier has made for Wurm. Visit sanglier.co.uk to find out more about him and read his blog. Enjoy! The movement code on the server was cleaned up a bit. It will solve or help find the problems that make you have to use /stuck all the time. Riding was changed so that you can no longer ride on tiles that are too steep in any direction, so you can\'t just ride up or down any mountain. There will also be some slowdown while riding upwards. There was a bug with focusing. You now need to be within fight distance in order to focus.', '<ul><li>With this update you get the sounds and music that Joss Sanglier has made for Wurm. Visit sanglier.co.uk to find out more about him and read his blog. Enjoy!</li>\n<li>The movement code on the server was cleaned up a bit. It will solve or help find the problems that make you have to use /stuck all the time.</li>\n<li>Riding was changed so that you can no longer ride on tiles that are too steep in any direction, so you can\'t just ride up or down any mountain. There will also be some slowdown while riding upwards.</li>\n<li>There was a bug with focusing. You now need to be within fight distance in order to focus.</li></ul>', 39),
(23984, 6035, '090415', '090415', 'The new client version should remove some of the invisibility problems that have been prevalent for a while. There should also be an improvement for people who could not get picking to work. There are still some problems with \"color bleeding\" instead but we\'re looking at that as well. Thank you Pryath for working hard on this! Carts are now dragged in the proper direction again.', '<ul><li>The new client version should remove some of the invisibility problems that have been prevalent for a while. There should also be an improvement for people who could not get picking to work. There are still some problems with \"color bleeding\" instead but we\'re looking at that as well. Thank you Pryath for working hard on this!</li>\n<li>Carts are now dragged in the proper direction again.</li></ul>', 40),
(23985, 6035, '090410', '090410', 'This year the good ole easter bunny hides enough eggs for everyone. Starting some time on saturday around the world you will be able to hunt for you own egg. These hidden eggs will be gone after about 48 hours and then you will not be able to find them any longer. The bunny may also make live appearances but will not have many eggs to throw after placing the majority already. The bunny will only let premium players find eggs, since otherwise heshe promotes the creation of throw-away free accounts.', '<ul><li>This year the good ole easter bunny hides enough eggs for everyone. Starting some time on saturday around the world you will be able to hunt for you own egg. These hidden eggs will be gone after about 48 hours and then you will not be able to find them any longer. The bunny may also make live appearances but will not have many eggs to throw after placing the majority already. The bunny will only let premium players find eggs, since otherwise heshe promotes the creation of throw-away free accounts.</li></ul>', 41),
(23986, 6035, '090403', '090403', 'Some bug fixes for riding, especially at cave openings as a passenger. Still not thoroughly tested but better. You should now only be teleported across the map when relogging on a boat and not for instance while on a horse.', '<ul><li>Some bug fixes for riding, especially at cave openings as a passenger. Still not thoroughly tested but better.</li>\n<li>You should now only be teleported across the map when relogging on a boat and not for instance while on a horse.</li></ul>', 42),
(23987, 6035, '090326', '090326', 'Mounts and large carts are in! The large cart models needs to be rotated though and it will happen soon enough. You can breed better horses. A saddle and horseshoes will increase speed. Welcome the new client! Mainly Dashiva has done absolutely wonders with it! Thanks also to the other client team members - Pryath, Pidgeon, Kilean and Egal. There was always bonus for casting dominating spells versus creatures. This bonus was removed since creatures are a lot tougher now. The game now tries to determine whether you overkill someone for skill and will stop giving you fightskill for that. A few players who had exploited overkilling above 50 lost 5 points in skill. You will no longer be kicked out of unlocked boats when relogging. Focusing will be smoother in combat.', '<ul><li>Mounts and large carts are in! The large cart models needs to be rotated though and it will happen soon enough.</li>\n<li>You can breed better horses. A saddle and horseshoes will increase speed.</li>\n<li>Welcome the new client! Mainly Dashiva has done absolutely wonders with it! Thanks also to the other client team members - Pryath, Pidgeon, Kilean and Egal.</li>\n<li>There was always bonus for casting dominating spells versus creatures. This bonus was removed since creatures are a lot tougher now.</li>\n<li>The game now tries to determine whether you overkill someone for skill and will stop giving you fightskill for that. A few players who had exploited overkilling above 50 lost 5 points in skill.</li>\n<li>You will no longer be kicked out of unlocked boats when relogging.</li>\n<li>Focusing will be smoother in combat.</li></ul>', 43),
(23988, 6035, '090323', '090323', 'In melee, shields now block only once per about 10 seconds, which roughly correspond to the attack rate of the off-hand weapon. This should make the use of off hand weapons interesting again. It will also make it harder to fight, so beware. It has been too easy to solo things for quite a while now. Combat distance is now the same for more actions. Before attack range and stance change range were different but it caused confusion. The new distance is´in between. The penalty in enemy lands is temporarily increased even more now while the home servers increase their defenses. Bashing walls and picking doors is now possible for players from enemy kingdoms on home servers. As is catapult usage. Wild boars and gorillas now attack players from the opposite kingdom. Creatures require less food overall. Using teleportation twigs and rocks should be nearly impossible now in combat so don\'t count on it. Corpses left on home servers by people from other kingdoms will now be lootable by everyone. Breeding was disabled in order to find the cause for the lag on the Jenn Kellon home server. Pregnant creatures will still give birth. You should be able to create saddles and girth now.', '<ul><li>In melee, shields now block only once per about 10 seconds, which roughly correspond to the attack rate of the off-hand weapon. This should make the use of off hand weapons interesting again. It will also make it harder to fight, so beware. It has been too easy to solo things for quite a while now.</li>\n<li>Combat distance is now the same for more actions. Before attack range and stance change range were different but it caused confusion. The new distance is´in between.</li>\n<li>The penalty in enemy lands is temporarily increased even more now while the home servers increase their defenses.</li>\n<li>Bashing walls and picking doors is now possible for players from enemy kingdoms on home servers. As is catapult usage.</li>\n<li>Wild boars and gorillas now attack players from the opposite kingdom.</li>\n<li>Creatures require less food overall.</li>\n<li>Using teleportation twigs and rocks should be nearly impossible now in combat so don\'t count on it.</li>\n<li>Corpses left on home servers by people from other kingdoms will now be lootable by everyone.</li>\n<li>Breeding was disabled in order to find the cause for the lag on the Jenn Kellon home server. Pregnant creatures will still give birth.</li>\n<li>You should be able to create saddles and girth now.</li></ul>', 44),
(23989, 6035, '090321', '090321', 'It was too easy to raid home servers of course. The negative effects of visiting enemy home servers have been increased. Kingdom animal spawns have increased. Enemies may now drain home server deeds. The bug where you could drown on land was fixed. Swimming also drains more stamina now.', '<ul><li>It was too easy to raid home servers of course. The negative effects of visiting enemy home servers have been increased. Kingdom animal spawns have increased. Enemies may now drain home server deeds.</li>\n<li>The bug where you could drown on land was fixed. Swimming also drains more stamina now.</li></ul>', 45);
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `heading`, `heading_id`, `content_text`, `content_html`, `section_order`) VALUES
(23990, 6035, '090320', '090320', 'You probably and hopefully play Wurm because you like the game. You probably want to have a safe experience with slow foreseeable well tested changes. Unfortunately that does not fit well with the state that this game is in. We try to make that evident in many places, for instance in our forums and when you register a character. The dramatic changes listed below may make you want to quit Wurm. If that is so I am sorry but from my perspective these changes are needed since they push the game in the direction where I see the future and survival of Wurm. You may see the opposite. If so the future will tell who is right. Hopefully you will come back one day and try it out again - you are more than welcome! Before you quit though - stay and see what happens. It may not be as bad as you think. - Rolf Overall fight skills were modified by a factor of *0.7 which means that someone who had fight skill 70 will now have 49. You no longer gain fight skill for killing players of the same kingdom. Before this modification, the approximately 15 players who had higher than 75 fighting skill were set to 75. You will now start to drown if you swim too far without stamina, taking (admittedly weird) drowning wounds that heal faster than normal. These wounds will probably be replaced some day with a proper drowning feature. Because of the drowning change. you may now move between all servers if you are a paying customer, visiting and raiding enemy home servers. If you die, you will be teleported to the closest wild server and you will of course loose all equipment where you died. There will never be a good moment to introduce this. I have tried to warn. We will see how bad it gets. It may give new blood to HOTS, who may access both enemy home servers easier because of their central location. If you see enemies approaching - change to heavy guards and change back when the enemies leave. Try to steal the boats from any raiding parties, gather up and annihilate them for a nice booty. Wurm home servers were never intended to be totally safe. I still expect them to be fairly safe though, especially inland and on the opposite side of the border to the wild server. Lastly, you may start to create some equipment used for mounts. Enjoy!', '<ul><li>You probably and hopefully play Wurm because you like the game. You probably want to have a safe experience with slow foreseeable well tested changes. Unfortunately that does not fit well with the state that this game is in. We try to make that evident in many places, for instance in our forums and when you register a character. The dramatic changes listed below may make you want to quit Wurm. If that is so I am sorry but from my perspective these changes are needed since they push the game in the direction where I see the future and survival of Wurm. You may see the opposite. If so the future will tell who is right. Hopefully you will come back one day and try it out again - you are more than welcome! Before you quit though - stay and see what happens. It may not be as bad as you think. - Rolf</li>\n<li>Overall fight skills were modified by a factor of *0.7 which means that someone who had fight skill 70 will now have 49. You no longer gain fight skill for killing players of the same kingdom. Before this modification, the approximately 15 players who had higher than 75 fighting skill were set to 75.</li>\n<li>You will now start to drown if you swim too far without stamina, taking (admittedly weird) drowning wounds that heal faster than normal. These wounds will probably be replaced some day with a proper drowning feature.</li>\n<li>Because of the drowning change. you may now move between all servers if you are a paying customer, visiting and raiding enemy home servers. If you die, you will be teleported to the closest wild server and you will of course loose all equipment where you died. There will never be a good moment to introduce this. I have tried to warn. We will see how bad it gets. It may give new blood to HOTS, who may access both enemy home servers easier because of their central location. If you see enemies approaching - change to heavy guards and change back when the enemies leave. Try to steal the boats from any raiding parties, gather up and annihilate them for a nice booty. Wurm home servers were never intended to be totally safe. I still expect them to be fairly safe though, especially inland and on the opposite side of the border to the wild server.</li>\n<li>Lastly, you may start to create some equipment used for mounts. Enjoy!</li></ul>', 46),
(23991, 6035, '090306', '090306', 'The anticipated lair spawn rate increase is now effective. Creature lairs should become more common. Corrosive traps are now improvable. You now gain more fighting skill for pvp kills. Removed the money bonus for joining MR. On the wild server, setting KOS on a settlement now make guard tower guards hostile to that player in the perimeter as a way to make it harder for spy alt accounts. You receive warnings if you enter the perimeter while being KOS. A bug where a trader could act like personal merchant and claim to be out of money was fixed. You now have to either crush wemp and get fibre or pick the seeds from it! Whoo! A bug with finishing containers was fixed. Shield min damage was changed to 0.1 A bug with entering caves was fixed', '<ul><li>The anticipated lair spawn rate increase is now effective. Creature lairs should become more common.</li>\n<li>Corrosive traps are now improvable.</li>\n<li>You now gain more fighting skill for pvp kills.</li>\n<li>Removed the money bonus for joining MR.</li>\n<li>On the wild server, setting KOS on a settlement now make guard tower guards hostile to that player in the perimeter as a way to make it harder for spy alt accounts. You receive warnings if you enter the perimeter while being KOS.</li>\n<li>A bug where a trader could act like personal merchant and claim to be out of money was fixed.</li>\n<li>You now have to either crush wemp and get fibre or pick the seeds from it! Whoo!</li>\n<li>A bug with finishing containers was fixed.</li>\n<li>Shield min damage was changed to 0.1</li>\n<li>A bug with entering caves was fixed</li></ul>', 47),
(23992, 6035, '090220', '090220', 'Sculpting wands are no longer purchased by traders. They used to give 5 silvers for them even without charges, which was unintended. Shield skillgain changed once more this time for the better.', '<ul><li>Sculpting wands are no longer purchased by traders. They used to give 5 silvers for them even without charges, which was unintended.</li>\n<li>Shield skillgain changed once more this time for the better.</li></ul>', 48),
(23993, 6035, '090218', '090218', 'Reconnecting now properly puts you back on the boat Archery line of sight fix Farming now yields more again Shield skillgain is borked and nerfed to more reasonable levels. You dont get more skill the more creatures you fight now because the cost in damage did not make up for it. Dropping link when you are under attack will not be a viable strategy any longer', '<ul><li>Reconnecting now properly puts you back on the boat</li>\n<li>Archery line of sight fix</li>\n<li>Farming now yields more again</li>\n<li>Shield skillgain is borked and nerfed to more reasonable levels. You dont get more skill the more creatures you fight now because the cost in damage did not make up for it.</li>\n<li>Dropping link when you are under attack will not be a viable strategy any longer</li></ul>', 49),
(23994, 6035, '090216', '090216', 'If you are fighting and your stamina is close to 0 you now gain no skill. The fighting skill you gain for killing a foe is not affected. The reason for this change is to reduce inactive grinding against several harmless opponents. Shield skillgain speed was boosted 20%. Hopefully more skill gain speeds can be increased as a result of this.', '<ul><li>If you are fighting and your stamina is close to 0 you now gain no skill. The fighting skill you gain for killing a foe is not affected. The reason for this change is to reduce inactive grinding against several harmless opponents. Shield skillgain speed was boosted 20%. Hopefully more skill gain speeds can be increased as a result of this.</li></ul>', 50),
(23995, 6035, '090213', '090213', 'The troll club strike has ended. Critical hits were toned down in frequency by 5 and damage by 50% As you loose a fatness level now your hunger is removed, resembling starving. Until you have no fat left. Archery should check for elevation better. The test client now has sound(!).', '<ul><li>The troll club strike has ended.</li>\n<li>Critical hits were toned down in frequency by 5 and damage by 50%</li>\n<li>As you loose a fatness level now your hunger is removed, resembling starving. Until you have no fat left.</li>\n<li>Archery should check for elevation better.</li>\n<li>The test client now has sound(!).</li></ul>', 51),
(23996, 6035, '090206', '090206', 'A lot of the hostile golden valley creatures are disappearing. A rumour is that they pass through the portals or are affected by them in a negative way. Creatures shouldn\'t bash fences indiscriminately any longer. Guard towers are no longer possible to build or continue on Golden Valley as you may have noticed. The guards broke the truce too often.', '<ul><li>A lot of the hostile golden valley creatures are disappearing. A rumour is that they pass through the portals or are affected by them in a negative way.</li>\n<li>Creatures shouldn\'t bash fences indiscriminately any longer.</li>\n<li>Guard towers are no longer possible to build or continue on Golden Valley as you may have noticed. The guards broke the truce too often.</li></ul>', 52),
(23997, 6035, '090202', '090202', 'Shield skillgain was increased this restart. It may be increased even more next update. More creatures bash walls now. Fighting players from the same kingdom no longer gives weapon and fight style skill in order to avoid exploits Undominated creatures on cave tiles with more than 2 creatures are now destroyed at boot because of starvation. Kingdom towers can no longer be finished by enemy kingdom alts Dragon scale movement penalty was decreased Fixed a bug with kingdom royal level losses', '<ul><li>Shield skillgain was increased this restart. It may be increased even more next update.</li>\n<li>More creatures bash walls now.</li>\n<li>Fighting players from the same kingdom no longer gives weapon and fight style skill in order to avoid exploits</li>\n<li>Undominated creatures on cave tiles with more than 2 creatures are now destroyed at boot because of starvation.</li>\n<li>Kingdom towers can no longer be finished by enemy kingdom alts</li>\n<li>Dragon scale movement penalty was decreased</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug with kingdom royal level losses</li></ul>', 53),
(23998, 6035, '090130', '090130', 'Shield skillgain should work better. Shields now take minimum 0.2 damage per hit though so they should withstand max 500 hits. You may however grind on creatures better again. The cost is this shield damage and the time invested. Rock sculpting is quicker, about 1 per 10 actions instead of 1 per 25 A bug with boat settings being lost when changing server was fixed. Boats will now allow all to board after switching servers since maybe you don\'t belong to the same village on the other server. Paved tiles should now decay on the entry server MR now receives 2 silver coins when using the portal on Golden Valley. Existing MR players also received 2 silver coins for correctness, and as a motivational perk. I am aware that this is unorthodox and sensitive. Try to see the good consequences of it though - it does mean more money globally. This bonus offer will end after a while. There is now a player assistant window for new players where they may ask questions to appointed Player Assistants. Archery should work again', '<ul><li>Shield skillgain should work better. Shields now take minimum 0.2 damage per hit though so they should withstand max 500 hits. You may however grind on creatures better again. The cost is this shield damage and the time invested.</li>\n<li>Rock sculpting is quicker, about 1 per 10 actions instead of 1 per 25</li>\n<li>A bug with boat settings being lost when changing server was fixed. Boats will now allow all to board after switching servers since maybe you don\'t belong to the same village on the other server.</li>\n<li>Paved tiles should now decay on the entry server</li>\n<li>MR now receives 2 silver coins when using the portal on Golden Valley. Existing MR players also received 2 silver coins for correctness, and as a motivational perk. I am aware that this is unorthodox and sensitive. Try to see the good consequences of it though - it does mean more money globally. This bonus offer will end after a while.</li>\n<li>There is now a player assistant window for new players where they may ask questions to appointed Player Assistants.</li>\n<li>Archery should work again</li></ul>', 54),
(23999, 6035, '090128', '090128', 'Traps now disappear if the terrain becomes invalid Same kingdom structures can no longer be destroyed with catapults on the home servers Pruning now works for old trees, setting them back to \'start of old age\' New anti-exploit feature. It will be harder to grind archery and fighting skill off of alt characters now. You will only gain a certain amount of skill from fighting another particular player per approx 4 hour period. Until that period has passed you will have to find another player to fight if you want to gain skill. If this works well we will have to discuss what the next step shall be. Some more village perimeter bug fixes', '<ul><li>Traps now disappear if the terrain becomes invalid</li>\n<li>Same kingdom structures can no longer be destroyed with catapults on the home servers</li>\n<li>Pruning now works for old trees, setting them back to \'start of old age\'</li>\n<li>New anti-exploit feature. It will be harder to grind archery and fighting skill off of alt characters now. You will only gain a certain amount of skill from fighting another particular player per approx 4 hour period. Until that period has passed you will have to find another player to fight if you want to gain skill. If this works well we will have to discuss what the next step shall be.</li>\n<li>Some more village perimeter bug fixes</li></ul>', 55),
(24000, 6035, '090120', '090120', 'This update contains a new feature - traps. Traps work on player enemies only. Players from a different kingdom or a hostile village may fall victim of your traps. There are ways to detect traps. Some suggested changes for wine making were implemented Fixed some bugs with track Wall damage should update better A bug with sculpting wands where they drained charges but couldn\'t affect the terrain should be fixed You should no longer be able to steal locked boats on home servers if you are of the same kingdom', '<ul><li>This update contains a new feature - traps. Traps work on player enemies only. Players from a different kingdom or a hostile village may fall victim of your traps. There are ways to detect traps.</li>\n<li>Some suggested changes for wine making were implemented</li>\n<li>Fixed some bugs with track</li>\n<li>Wall damage should update better</li>\n<li>A bug with sculpting wands where they drained charges but couldn\'t affect the terrain should be fixed</li>\n<li>You should no longer be able to steal locked boats on home servers if you are of the same kingdom</li></ul>', 56),
(24001, 6035, '090114', '090114', 'A large change to registration and the server situation has been made - there is now one single entry server for new players called the Golden Valley. From there they use portals to get to the other servers. In order to use the portals they have to purchase premium time. Old basic accounts will be able to log on to the Jenn home server for now, but no new accounts can be created there. Another large change has been made to home server settlements. They now have perimeter control. For a village this is 50 tiles, and for a homestead it is based on the size. Fences, houses and roads can not be built or destroyed within the perimeter unless the settlement specifically allows it. The reason for this change is to remove certain grief-like situations and relieve the GM team of the task of protecting fences. Entry server specifics: If you buy premium on the entry server you will not notice it until you go through a portal to a premium server. You can change kingdom any number of times on this server. You can only bring 200 items through the portal. Trees grow at a higher rate on that server. Pvp is not allowed but both Mol Rehan and Jenn-Kellon kingdoms exist. In order to become HOTS you now have to seek it out on the wild server. HOTS players will be beefed because of this. We sincerely hope that these changes does not bring anyone down. We believe that it is for the best in the long run.', '<ul><li>A large change to registration and the server situation has been made - there is now one single entry server for new players called the Golden Valley. From there they use portals to get to the other servers. In order to use the portals they have to purchase premium time. Old basic accounts will be able to log on to the Jenn home server for now, but no new accounts can be created there.</li>\n<li>Another large change has been made to home server settlements. They now have perimeter control. For a village this is 50 tiles, and for a homestead it is based on the size. Fences, houses and roads can not be built or destroyed within the perimeter unless the settlement specifically allows it. The reason for this change is to remove certain grief-like situations and relieve the GM team of the task of protecting fences.</li>\n<li>Entry server specifics: If you buy premium on the entry server you will not notice it until you go through a portal to a premium server. You can change kingdom any number of times on this server. You can only bring 200 items through the portal. Trees grow at a higher rate on that server. Pvp is not allowed but both Mol Rehan and Jenn-Kellon kingdoms exist.</li>\n<li>In order to become HOTS you now have to seek it out on the wild server. HOTS players will be beefed because of this.</li>\n<li>We sincerely hope that these changes does not bring anyone down. We believe that it is for the best in the long run.</li></ul>', 57),
(24002, 6035, '090110', '090110', 'The large influx of players from 4chan is pressing the server capacity on Jenn002 causing it to crash. In order to avoid this the limit of non-premium players that are allowed on the server had to be lowered while we figure out how we best handle the situation. We suggest that as soon as you have decided that you like Wurm - create an account on the beautiful Mol Rehan server! Note that you will then have to pay for some premium time on the website in order to log on that character. A bug with traders was fixed. A bug where sending items via the ingame mail system to an unavailable server made the item disappear was fixed.', '<ul><li>The large influx of players from 4chan is pressing the server capacity on Jenn002 causing it to crash. In order to avoid this the limit of non-premium players that are allowed on the server had to be lowered while we figure out how we best handle the situation. We suggest that as soon as you have decided that you like Wurm - create an account on the beautiful Mol Rehan server! Note that you will then have to pay for some premium time on the website in order to log on that character.</li>\n<li>A bug with traders was fixed.</li>\n<li>A bug where sending items via the ingame mail system to an unavailable server made the item disappear was fixed.</li></ul>', 58),
(24003, 6035, '090109', '090109', 'The chance for hitting the opponent of your target in archery was reduced', '<ul><li>The chance for hitting the opponent of your target in archery was reduced</li></ul>', 59),
(24004, 989, 'Description', 'Description', 'Vynora spell available to priests at 50 faith . An enchantment spell castable on altars . Requires linking with at least four Vynora priests to cast as it costs much more than 100 favor. The spell is available to cast once the deity\'s favour is full. Only prayers and sermons that could cause valid faith gains increase deity favour, which is used to charge rite spells . If you are capped at the 30 or 100 faith caps, you can still provide to the deity favour as long as you have the valid timing available. Missions also provide some deity favour, scaled on the difficulty of the mission.', '<p><a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a> spell available to <a href=\"/index.php/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priests</a> at 50 <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>. An enchantment spell castable on <a href=\"/index.php/Altar\" title=\"Altar\">altars</a>. Requires <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Link\" title=\"Link\">linking</a> with at least four Vynora priests to cast as it costs much more than 100 favor.\n</p>\n<p>The spell is available to cast once the deity\'s favour is full. Only prayers and sermons that could cause valid faith gains increase deity favour, which is used to charge <a href=\"/index.php/Rite_spells\" title=\"Rite spells\">rite spells</a>. If you are capped at the 30 or 100 faith caps, you can still provide to the deity favour as long as you have the valid timing available. Missions also provide some deity favour, scaled on the difficulty of the mission.\n</p>', 0),
(24005, 989, 'Effects', 'Effects', 'Priests and followers gain 0.2% mind logic towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer. This benefit can be experienced up to 24 hours from the cast by praying and having at least 30 faith . Double speed for all ships on the server for 24 hours. 5% increased chance of affinity gain during the event.', '<ul><li>Priests and followers gain 0.2% <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_logic\" title=\"Mind logic\">mind logic</a> towards 100 and 5 hours of sleep bonus through a single prayer. This benefit can be experienced up to 24 hours from the cast by praying and having at least 30 <a href=\"/index.php/Faith\" title=\"Faith\">faith</a>.</li>\n<li>Double speed for all <a href=\"/index.php/Ship\" title=\"Ship\">ships</a> on the server for 24 hours.</li>\n<li>5% increased chance of <a href=\"/index.php/Affinity\" title=\"Affinity\">affinity</a> gain during the event.</li></ul>', 1),
(24006, 989, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The spell will disappear from list after a successful cast. The cooldown for this spell is similar to that of other global spells. To make sure that the spell has cooled down, start the Sermon and wait for the 30th second of the timer. Message indicate if the ritual is already ready to be performed: You sense that Vynora is brimming with power. Maybe you can channel it somehow? ; example of message for not cooled down yet: You explain how Vynora is strong but still needs you to work faithfully so that she may manifest her powers.', '<ul><li>The spell will disappear from list after a successful cast. The cooldown for this spell is similar to that of other global spells.</li>\n<li>To make sure that the spell has cooled down, start the <a href=\"/index.php/Sermon\" title=\"Sermon\">Sermon</a> and wait for the 30th second of the timer. Message indicate if the ritual is already ready to be performed: <span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> You sense that Vynora is brimming with power. Maybe you can channel it somehow? </span>; example of message for not cooled down yet: <span style=\"color: #fff; font-family: Sans-Serif; font-size: 0.85em; border: 1px rgb(0, 0, 0) solid; background: rgb(75, 62, 48); line-height: 1.3em; -webkit-border-radius: 5px; -moz-border-radius: 5px; border-radius: 5px; -moz-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); -webkit-box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px 1px rgb(101, 101, 101); padding: 2px 10px 2px 10px; display: inline-block;\"> You explain how Vynora is strong but still needs you to work faithfully so that she may manifest her powers. </span></li></ul>', 2),
(24007, 989, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Holy crop Ritual of the sun Rite of death Rite spells', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Holy_crop\" title=\"Holy crop\">Holy crop</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Ritual_of_the_sun\" title=\"Ritual of the sun\">Ritual of the sun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rite_of_death\" title=\"Rite of death\">Rite of death</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Rite_spells\" title=\"Rite spells\">Rite spells</a></li></ul>', 3),
(24008, 6038, 'Description', 'Description', 'Enchanted grass is a special type of tile that can be created by using the Path of Love ability \'Enchant\' on a normal grass tile . Herbivorous animals like horses can graze on it with less than typical degradation, and it provides a healing bonus to all wounds when stood upon.', '<p><b>Enchanted grass</b> is a special type of <a href=\"/index.php/Tile\" title=\"Tile\">tile</a> that can be created by using the <a href=\"/index.php/Path_of_Love\" title=\"Path of Love\">Path of Love</a> ability \'Enchant\' on a normal <a href=\"/index.php/Grass_tile\" title=\"Grass tile\">grass tile</a>. Herbivorous animals like <a href=\"/index.php/Horse\" title=\"Horse\">horses</a> can graze on it with less than typical degradation, and it provides a healing bonus to all wounds when stood upon.\n</p>', 0),
(24009, 6038, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Acts as a potency 4 healing cover when stood on. Sprouts and flowers cannot be planted on enchanted grass. Does not spread or otherwise occur naturally. Can be trapped . The enchant ability used to create enchanted grass tiles has an 18-hour cooldown period between uses. Enchanted grass has an unknown chance to revert to grass on deeds with a good ratio when an animal grazes on it. If the deed has a bad ratio (less than 15 tiles per animal), the enchanted grass tile then has a higher chance of reverting to grass when grazed upon. Off-deed, enchanted grass also has a chance to revert to grass when grazed upon. The following Resource nodes can spawn on Enchanted grass: Umbellifers , Nightshades , Mints , Roots and bulbs , Vines , Briar patch , Undergrowth , Animal burrow , Critter nest , Mineral debris , Tropical foliage and Fairy garden .', '<ul><li>Acts as a potency 4 <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing cover</a> when stood on.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sprout\" title=\"Sprout\">Sprouts</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Flower\" title=\"Flower\">flowers</a> cannot be planted on enchanted grass.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Does not spread or otherwise occur naturally.</li>\n<li>Can be <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trap\" title=\"Trap\">trapped</a>.</li>\n<li>The enchant ability used to create enchanted grass tiles has an 18-hour cooldown period between uses.</li>\n<li>Enchanted grass has an unknown chance to revert to grass on deeds with a good ratio when an animal grazes on it. If the deed has a bad ratio (less than 15 tiles per animal), the enchanted grass tile then has a higher chance of reverting to grass when grazed upon. Off-deed, enchanted grass also has a chance to revert to grass when grazed upon.</li>\n<li>The following <a href=\"/index.php/Resource_nodes\" title=\"Resource nodes\">Resource nodes</a> can spawn on Enchanted grass: <a href=\"/index.php/Umbellifers\" title=\"Umbellifers\">Umbellifers</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Nightshades\" title=\"Nightshades\">Nightshades</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mints\" title=\"Mints\">Mints</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Roots_and_bulbs\" title=\"Roots and bulbs\">Roots and bulbs</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Vines\" title=\"Vines\">Vines</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Briar_patch\" title=\"Briar patch\">Briar patch</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Undergrowth\" title=\"Undergrowth\">Undergrowth</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Animal_burrow\" title=\"Animal burrow\">Animal burrow</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Critter_nest\" title=\"Critter nest\">Critter nest</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Mineral_debris\" title=\"Mineral debris\">Mineral debris</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Tropical_foliage\" title=\"Tropical foliage\">Tropical foliage</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Fairy_garden\" title=\"Fairy garden\">Fairy garden</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(24010, 6038, 'Removal', 'Removal', 'Enchanted grass is not destroyed by digging or dropping dirt, but it can be removed by packing it with a shovel, levelling, or cultivating it (turning it into dirt). Fire pillar , Ice pillar , and Corrupt spells can also be used to remove it and turn it to sand, marsh, or mycelium. It cannot be dispelled .', '<p>Enchanted grass is not destroyed by digging or dropping dirt, but it can be removed by packing it with a shovel, levelling, or cultivating it (turning it into dirt). <a href=\"/index.php/Fire_pillar\" title=\"Fire pillar\">Fire pillar</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Ice_pillar\" title=\"Ice pillar\">Ice pillar</a>, and <a href=\"/index.php/Corrupt\" title=\"Corrupt\">Corrupt</a> spells can also be used to remove it and turn it to sand, marsh, or mycelium. It cannot be <a href=\"/index.php/Dispel\" title=\"Dispel\">dispelled</a>.\n</p>', 2),
(24011, 6038, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Enchanted tree', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Enchanted_tree\" title=\"Enchanted tree\">Enchanted tree</a></li></ul>', 3),
(24020, 6040, 'Description', 'Description', 'An enchanted tree is a tree or bush which has been altered by the Meditation Path of Love ability \'Enchant\'. Once enchanted, they will no longer grow or age ; if they were sprouting at the time of enchantment, the sprout will remain on the tree but cannot be picked. Like enchanted grass , an enchanted tree tile provides a healing bonus to all wounds when standing on it. Sometimes you may need an item activated in order to receive the \'Enchant\' option.', '<p>An <b>enchanted tree</b> is a <a href=\"/index.php/Tree\" title=\"Tree\">tree</a> or bush which has been altered by the Meditation <a href=\"/index.php/Path_of_Love\" title=\"Path of Love\">Path of Love</a> ability \'Enchant\'. Once enchanted, they will no longer grow or <a href=\"/index.php/Age\" title=\"Age\">age</a>; if they were sprouting at the time of enchantment, the <a href=\"/index.php/Sprout\" title=\"Sprout\">sprout</a> will remain on the tree but cannot be picked. Like <a href=\"/index.php/Enchanted_grass\" title=\"Enchanted grass\">enchanted grass</a>, an enchanted tree tile provides a healing bonus to all wounds when standing on it.\n</p>\n<p>Sometimes you may need an item activated in order to receive the \'Enchant\' option.\n</p>', 0),
(24021, 6040, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Acts as a potency 4 healing cover when stood on. Enchanted thorn bushes do not deal damage when walked through. Enchanted fruit trees or bushes cannot be harvested. Sprouts cannot be picked from enchanted trees. Cannot be foraged or botanized . Enchanted trees do not age. This includes being immune to the effects of Wild growth . Cutting down an enchanted tree changes the tile to enchanted grass . Enchanted trees can be removed by the Vynora´s spell Ice pillar which will convert the tile to tundra or by Magranon´s spell Fire pillar which will convert the tile to sand. Success chance is very low. A trap can be placed on an enchanted tree tile, but only on PVP servers. The Enchant ability has an 18 hour cooldown.', '<ul><li>Acts as a potency 4 <a href=\"/index.php/Healing_cover\" title=\"Healing cover\">healing cover</a> when stood on.</li>\n<li>Enchanted <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Thorn\" title=\"Thorn\">thorn bushes</a> do not deal damage when walked through.</li>\n<li>Enchanted fruit trees or bushes cannot be harvested.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Sprout\" title=\"Sprout\">Sprouts</a> cannot be picked from enchanted trees.</li>\n<li>Cannot be <a href=\"/index.php/Foraging\" title=\"Foraging\">foraged</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Botanizing\" title=\"Botanizing\">botanized</a>.</li>\n<li>Enchanted trees do not age.\n<ul><li>This includes being immune to the effects of <a href=\"/index.php/Wild_growth\" title=\"Wild growth\">Wild growth</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Cutting down an enchanted tree changes the tile to <a href=\"/index.php/Enchanted_grass\" title=\"Enchanted grass\">enchanted grass</a>.</li>\n<li>Enchanted trees can be removed by the Vynora´s spell <a href=\"/index.php/Ice_pillar\" title=\"Ice pillar\">Ice pillar</a> which will convert the tile to tundra or by Magranon´s spell <a href=\"/index.php/Fire_pillar\" title=\"Fire pillar\">Fire pillar</a> which will convert the tile to sand. Success chance is very low.</li>\n<li>A <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Trap\" title=\"Trap\">trap</a> can be placed on an enchanted tree tile, but only on PVP servers.</li>\n<li>The Enchant ability has an 18 hour cooldown.</li></ul>', 1),
(24022, 6040, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Enchanted grass', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Enchanted_grass\" title=\"Enchanted grass\">Enchanted grass</a></li></ul>', 2),
(24023, 6041, 'Description', 'Description', 'A signpost with a place for a shop sign.', '<p><i>A signpost with a place for a shop sign.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24024, 6041, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'To customize a shop sign, right-click the sign and select \"Rename\"; the text and sign-type specified here will decide the sign\'s final look and displayed message. Shop signs of a low quality don\'t provide much of a smooth, workable surface on which to write. On the other hand, those of higher quality provide much more usable writing surface. For each point of quality, one letter is able to be placed on the sign (a 50ql sign then offers the capability of holding 50 characters, for example). To plant a sign, right-click on the sign while it is in the player inventory and select \"Plant\". Once planted, the sign may still be pushed, pulled, or rotated by using the right-click interface. Only the player who planted the sign may rename, move, or remove the sign, however. A minimum of 10 digging skill is required to plant a sign.', '<ul><li>To customize a shop sign, right-click the sign and select \"Rename\"; the text and sign-type specified here will decide the sign\'s final look and displayed message.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Shop signs of a low quality don\'t provide much of a smooth, workable surface on which to write. On the other hand, those of higher quality provide much more usable writing surface. For each point of quality, one letter is able to be placed on the sign (a 50ql sign then offers the capability of holding 50 characters, for example).</li></ul>\n<ul><li>To plant a sign, right-click on the sign while it is in the player inventory and select \"Plant\". Once planted, the sign may still be pushed, pulled, or rotated by using the right-click interface. Only the player who planted the sign may rename, move, or remove the sign, however. A minimum of 10 digging skill is required to plant a sign.</li></ul>', 1),
(24025, 6041, 'Limitations', 'Limitations', 'Off-Deed Signs In locations that are not deeded, one sign per Wurm week (21 real life hours) may be planted by a single player. On-Deed Signs Permissions allowing, there are no limitations to the number of signs or the frequency of their placement on-deed.', '<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Off-Deed_Signs\">Off-Deed Signs</span></h5>\n<p>In locations that are not deeded, one sign per Wurm <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Week\" title=\"Week\">week</a> (21 real life hours) may be planted by a single player. \n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"On-Deed_Signs\">On-Deed Signs</span></h5>\n<p><a href=\"/index.php/Permissions\" title=\"Permissions\">Permissions</a> allowing, there are no limitations to the number of signs or the frequency of their placement on-deed.\n</p>', 2),
(24026, 6041, 'Sign Images', 'Sign_Images', 'Sign images Alchemy Anchor Anvil Baker Bear and beer Beer Bowl Coins Construction Crops Helmet Horse Hunt Lumber Mystery Pirate Shipwright Sleep Sword & bowl Swordsmith Tailoring Wine', '<table align=\"center\" border=\"2\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center; style=\">\n<caption>Sign images\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr style=\"background-color:#a6a290;\">\n<th>Alchemy\n</th>\n<th>Anchor\n</th>\n<th>Anvil\n</th>\n<th>Baker\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:SS-Alchemy.png\"><img alt=\"SS-Alchemy.png\" data-file-height=\"538\" data-file-width=\"663\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"81\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/11/SS-Alchemy.png/100px-SS-Alchemy.png\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/11/SS-Alchemy.png/150px-SS-Alchemy.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/11/SS-Alchemy.png/200px-SS-Alchemy.png 2x\" width=\"100\"/></a>\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:SS-Anchor.jpg\"><img alt=\"SS-Anchor.jpg\" data-file-height=\"256\" data-file-width=\"256\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a8/SS-Anchor.jpg/100px-SS-Anchor.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a8/SS-Anchor.jpg/150px-SS-Anchor.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a8/SS-Anchor.jpg/200px-SS-Anchor.jpg 2x\" width=\"100\"/></a>\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:SS-Anvil.jpg\"><img alt=\"SS-Anvil.jpg\" data-file-height=\"256\" data-file-width=\"256\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/38/SS-Anvil.jpg/100px-SS-Anvil.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/38/SS-Anvil.jpg/150px-SS-Anvil.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/38/SS-Anvil.jpg/200px-SS-Anvil.jpg 2x\" width=\"100\"/></a>\n</td>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:SS-Baker.jpg\"><img alt=\"SS-Baker.jpg\" data-file-height=\"256\" data-file-width=\"256\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/thumb/b/b2/SS-Baker.jpg/100px-SS-Baker.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b2/SS-Baker.jpg/150px-SS-Baker.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b2/SS-Baker.jpg/2