n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Renowned_Blacksmith\" title=\"Renowned Blacksmith\">Renowned Blacksmith</a></li></ul>\n<p>26th August 2012 @ [03:11:01] You have just received the title \'Renowned Blacksmith\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Caterer\" title=\"Caterer\">Caterer</a></li></ul>\n<p>13th August 2012 @ [12:08:31] You have just received the title \'Caterer\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sculptor\" title=\"Sculptor\">Sculptor</a></li></ul>\n<p>29th March 2011 @ [14:29:47] You have just received the title \'Sculptor\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/High_Mason\" title=\"High Mason\">High Mason</a></li></ul>\n<p>20th March 2011 @ [13:26:55] You have just received the title \'High Mason\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Tailor\" title=\"Tailor\">Tailor</a></li></ul>\n<p>21st February 2011 @ [20:12:59] You have just received the title \'Tailor\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Excavator\" title=\"Excavator\">Excavator</a></li></ul>\n<p>26th January 2011 @ [19:26:33] You have just received the title \'Excavator\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Blacksmith\" title=\"Blacksmith\">Blacksmith</a></li></ul>\n<p>16th January 2011 @ [12:59:14] You have just received the title \'Blacksmith\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Sculptor\" title=\"Sculptor\">Sculptor</a></li></ul>\n<p>3rd December 2010 @ [17:33:58] You have just received the title \'Sculptor\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Handyman\" title=\"Handyman\">Handyman</a></li></ul>\n<p>30th November 2010 @ [19:20:22] You have just received the title \'Handyman\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Miner\" title=\"Miner\">Miner</a></li></ul>\n<p>18th November 2010 @ [03:40:01] You have just received the title \'Miner\'!\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\"