f the Hunt</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>Rider of Lomaner</td>\n<td>April, 2014 [00:00:00]</td>\n<td>Being premium for 4 months\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>53</td>\n<td>Dawn of Glory</td>\n<td>April 24, 2014 [03:18:24]</td>\n<td>\"The Altar of Three has fallen to the hands of Xallo!\"\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>Bartender</td>\n<td>May 22, 2014 [16:14:25]</td>\n<td>Juicing strawberries and olives\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>55</td>\n<td>Transmutator</td>\n<td>May 28, 2014 [16:44:08]</td>\n<td>Making healing covers\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><b>Working on the following titles:</b>\n<br/>\n- Renowned Armoursmith <br/>\n- Renowned Carpenter <br/>\n- Materia Tamer <br/>\n- High Tanner <br/>\n- Master Tanner <br/>\n</p>', 0),
