><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Glimmer_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"691\" data-file-width=\"296\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/09/Glimmer_hanging_lamp.jpg/85px-Glimmer_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/09/Glimmer_hanging_lamp.jpg/128px-Glimmer_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/09/Glimmer_hanging_lamp.jpg/171px-Glimmer_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"85\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Glimmersteel hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Gold_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"713\" data-file-width=\"249\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f3/Gold_hanging_lamp.jpg/70px-Gold_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f3/Gold_hanging_lamp.jpg/104px-Gold_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f3/Gold_hanging_lamp.jpg/139px-Gold_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"70\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Gold hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Iron_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"649\" data-file-width=\"273\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Iron_hanging_lamp.jpg/84px-Iron_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Iron_hanging_lamp.jpg/126px-Iron_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/af/Iron_hanging_lamp.jpg/168px-Iron_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"84\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Iron hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Lead_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"703\" data-file-width=\"267\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/e/e1/Lead_hanging_lamp.jpg/76px-Lead_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e1/Lead_hanging_lamp.jpg/114px-Lead_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e1/Lead_hanging_lamp.jpg/152px-Lead_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"76\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Lead hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Seryll_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"714\" data-file-width=\"305\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/65/Seryll_hanging_lamp.jpg/85px-Seryll_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/65/Seryll_hanging_lamp.jpg/128px-Seryll_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/65/Seryll_hanging_lamp.jpg/171px-Seryll_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"85\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Seryll hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Silver_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"714\" data-file-width=\"301\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/Silver_hanging_lamp.jpg/84px-Silver_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/Silver_hanging_lamp.jpg/126px-Silver_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5b/Silver_hanging_lamp.jpg/168px-Silver_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"84\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Silver hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Steel_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"713\" data-file-width=\"281\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/2a/Steel_hanging_lamp.jpg/79px-Steel_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2a/Steel_hanging_lamp.jpg/118px-Steel_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2a/Steel_hanging_lamp.jpg/157px-Steel_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"79\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Steel hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Tin_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"713\" data-file-width=\"257\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/68/Tin_hanging_lamp.jpg/72px-Tin_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/68/Tin_hanging_lamp.jpg/108px-Tin_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/68/Tin_hanging_lamp.jpg/144px-Tin_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"72\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Tin hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\"><div style=\"width: 135px\">\n<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/index.php/File:Zinc_hanging_lamp.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" data-file-height=\"716\" data-file-width=\"316\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/thumb/c/cc/Zinc_hanging_lamp.jpg/88px-Zinc_hanging_lamp.jpg\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/cc/Zinc_hanging_lamp.jpg/132px-Zinc_hanging_lamp.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/cc/Zinc_hanging_lamp.jpg/176px-Zinc_hanging_lamp.jpg 2x\" width=\"88\"/></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"gallerytext\">\n<center>Zinc hanging lamp</center>\n</div>\n</div></li>\n</ul>', 4),
(24405, 2573, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see an iron fence.', '<p><i>You see an iron fence. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(24406, 2573, 'Skill required', 'Skill_required', 'To calculate the maximum slope you can build on, based on your carpentry or masonry skill, use the following formula submitted by Ketza : Max slope = (3 * √ skill) + 10 Skill Max Slope 6 17 8 18 9 19 12 20 14 21 16 22 19 23 22 24 25 25 29 26 33 27 36 28 41 29 45 30 49 31 54 32 59 33 64 34 70 35 75 36 81 37 88 38 94 39 Note: Maximum slope is rounded down', '<p>To calculate the <a href=\"/index.php/Maximum_slope\" title=\"Maximum slope\">maximum slope</a> you can build on, based on your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, use the following formula submitted by <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ketza\" title=\"Player:Ketza\">Ketza</a>:\n</p>\n<p><i>Max slope = (3 *</i> √<i>skill) + 10</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"100\">Skill\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Max Slope\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>23\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>27\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>28\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>29\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>31\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>59</td>\n<td>33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>34\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75</td>\n<td>36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>81</td>\n<td>37\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>38\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>39\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Note:</b> Maximum slope is rounded <i>down</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(24407, 2573, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Iron fence with stone brick. Each stone brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.', '<ul><li>Repair Iron fence with stone brick. Each stone brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
(24408, 2573, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Fences Fence gates Empirical Evaluation of Fences', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Fences\" title=\"Category:Fences\">Fences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Gates\" title=\"Category:Gates\">Fence gates</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Empirical_Evaluation_of_Fences\" title=\"Empirical Evaluation of Fences\">Empirical Evaluation of Fences</a></li></ul>', 3),
(24409, 6158, 'Description', 'Description', 'You see an iron fence gate', '<p><i>You see an iron fence gate </i>\n</p>', 0),
(24410, 6158, 'Skill required', 'Skill_required', 'To calculate the maximum slope you can build on, based on your carpentry or masonry skill, use the following formula submitted by Ketza : Max slope = (3 * √ skill) + 10 Skill Max Slope 6 17 8 18 9 19 12 20 14 21 16 22 19 23 22 24 25 25 29 26 33 27 36 28 41 29 45 30 49 31 54 32 59 33 64 34 70 35 75 36 81 37 88 38 94 39 Note: Maximum slope is rounded down', '<p>To calculate the <a href=\"/index.php/Maximum_slope\" title=\"Maximum slope\">maximum slope</a> you can build on, based on your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, use the following formula submitted by <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ketza\" title=\"Player:Ketza\">Ketza</a>:\n</p>\n<p><i>Max slope = (3 *</i> √<i>skill) + 10</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"100\">Skill\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Max Slope\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>23\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>27\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>28\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>29\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>31\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>59</td>\n<td>33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>34\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75</td>\n<td>36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>81</td>\n<td>37\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>38\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>39\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Note:</b> Maximum slope is rounded <i>down</i>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 1),
(24411, 6158, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Repair Iron fence gate with stone brick. Each stone brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill. At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color. Intelligent monsters such as trolls are able to open unlocked gates. Gates can be locked with a gate lock , then controlled by deed permissions if applicable, as well as the key .', '<ul><li>Repair Iron fence gate with stone brick. Each stone brick will repair up to 10 damage depending on quality and repairing skill.</li>\n<li>At 60 damage, the iron fence bars will turn rusty in color.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Intelligent monsters such as <a href=\"/index.php/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">trolls</a> are able to open unlocked gates.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Gates can be locked with a <a href=\"/index.php/Gate_lock\" title=\"Gate lock\">gate lock</a>, then controlled by deed <a href=\"/index.php/Permissions\" title=\"Permissions\">permissions</a> if applicable, as well as the <a href=\"/index.php/Key\" title=\"Key\">key</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>', 2),
(24412, 6158, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Fences Fence gates Empirical Evaluation of Fences', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Fences\" title=\"Category:Fences\">Fences</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Category:Gates\" title=\"Category:Gates\">Fence gates</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Empirical_Evaluation_of_Fences\" title=\"Empirical Evaluation of Fences\">Empirical Evaluation of Fences</a></li></ul>', 3),
(24415, 6160, 'Description', 'Description', 'This woven fence is purely a decoration and stops neither creature nor man.', '<p><i>This woven fence is purely a decoration and stops neither creature nor man.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24416, 6160, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'A woven fence does not stop players or creatures from passing through. Players can open containers and take items from behind a woven fence. Woven fences are easy to destroy. A woven fence takes longer to construct than a wooden fence , but wood scraps are much easier to obtain. That being said, building even a mediocre quality woven fence is difficult, because higher quality wood scrap is hard to find.  Being a byproduct of construction, wood scrap has only 10% of the original material quality. The only way to obtain high quality wood scrap is to cut down young or shriveled fruit trees. The maximum quality a woven fence can be improved to depends on the player\'s carpentry skill and the utilized wood scrap\'s quality: (Carpentry skill + Wood scrap QL) / 2  (tested with 80 carpentry skill, and 4-8 carpentry skill on test). Several 1.5QL wood scraps, for example, allow improving to about 40QL with 80 carpentry. Repairing a woven fence requires 1.5 kg of wood scraps . Each wood scrap will repair up to 10 damage, depending on quality and repairing skill, and uses 1.5 kg, on its own, or from a larger bunch of wood scraps.', '<ul><li>A woven fence does not stop players or creatures from passing through.</li>\n<li>Players can open containers and take items from behind a woven fence.</li>\n<li>Woven fences are easy to destroy.</li>\n<li>A woven fence takes longer to construct than a <a href=\"/index.php/Wooden_fence\" title=\"Wooden fence\">wooden fence</a>, but wood scraps are much easier to obtain. That being said, building even a mediocre quality woven fence is difficult, because higher quality wood scrap is hard to find.  Being a byproduct of construction, wood scrap has only 10% of the original material quality. The only way to obtain high quality wood scrap is to cut down young or shriveled fruit trees.</li>\n<li>The maximum quality a woven fence can be improved to depends on the player\'s <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a> skill and the utilized wood scrap\'s quality: (Carpentry skill + Wood scrap QL) / 2  (tested with 80 carpentry skill, and 4-8 carpentry skill on test). Several 1.5QL wood scraps, for example, allow improving to about 40QL with 80 carpentry.</li>\n<li>Repairing a woven fence requires 1.5 kg of <a href=\"/index.php/Wood_scrap\" title=\"Wood scrap\">wood scraps</a>. Each wood scrap will repair up to 10 damage, depending on quality and repairing skill, and uses 1.5 kg, on its own, or from a larger bunch of wood scraps.</li></ul>', 1),
(24417, 6160, 'Skill Required', 'Skill_Required', 'To calculate the maximum slope you can build on, based on your carpentry or masonry skill, use the following formula submitted by Ketza : Max slope = (3 * √ skill) + 10 Skill Max Slope 6 17 8 18 9 19 12 20 14 21 16 22 19 23 22 24 25 25 29 26 33 27 36 28 41 29 45 30 49 31 54 32 59 33 64 34 70 35 75 36 81 37 88 38 94 39 Note: Maximum slope is rounded down', '<p>To calculate the <a href=\"/index.php/Maximum_slope\" title=\"Maximum slope\">maximum slope</a> you can build on, based on your <a href=\"/index.php/Carpentry\" title=\"Carpentry\">carpentry</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Masonry\" title=\"Masonry\">masonry</a> skill, use the following formula submitted by <a href=\"/index.php/Player:Ketza\" title=\"Player:Ketza\">Ketza</a>:\n</p>\n<p><i>Max slope = (3 *</i> √<i>skill) + 10</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"100\">Skill\n</th>\n<th width=\"100\">Max Slope\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>23\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>24\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>27\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>28\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>29\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>31\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>59</td>\n<td>33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>34\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70</td>\n<td>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75</td>\n<td>36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>81</td>\n<td>37\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>38\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>39\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Note:</b> Maximum slope is rounded <i>down</i>\n</p>', 2),
(24418, 6162, 'Description', 'Description', 'A beautiful hat, glistening in the sun. It is made from a strange green fabric and decorated with flowers that never seem to wither.', '<p><i>A beautiful hat, glistening in the sun. It is made from a strange green fabric and decorated with flowers that never seem to wither.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24419, 6162, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'The summer hat is as strong as a steel great helm but weighs only 0.30 kg. It cannot be crafted by players , and those that exist were given as gifts to GMs for their hard work and to some players for bug reports. It cannot be dropped .', '<ul><li>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">summer hat</a> is as strong as a steel <a href=\"/index.php/Great_helm\" title=\"Great helm\">great helm</a> but <a href=\"/index.php/Weight\" title=\"Weight\">weighs</a> only 0.30 kg.</li>\n<li>It cannot be <a href=\"/index.php/Crafting\" title=\"Crafting\">crafted</a> by <a href=\"/index.php/Player\" title=\"Player\">players</a>, and those that exist were given as <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Gifts\" title=\"Category:Gifts\">gifts</a> to <a href=\"/index.php/Wurm_staff\" title=\"Wurm staff\">GMs</a> for their hard work and to some players for bug reports.</li>\n<li>It cannot be <a href=\"/index.php/Nodrop\" title=\"Nodrop\">dropped</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(24420, 6162, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Great helm', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Great_helm\" title=\"Great helm\">Great helm</a></li></ul>', 2),
(24427, 3430, 'Description', 'Description', 'A statuette resembling the artists interpretation of the deity Fo.', '<p><i>A statuette resembling the artists interpretation of the deity Fo.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24428, 3430, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Statuette of Fo is made of gold , silver , or electrum using jewelry smithing . It is used to channel spells by Fo priests, or for priests or followers of Fo to convert others to priests or followers of Fo. It can also be used for decoration. Statuette QL has no effect on casting. Circle of cunning , Wind of ages , or Blessings of the dark on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed. 0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.', '<ul><li><b>Statuette of Fo</b> is made of <a href=\"/index.php/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">gold</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">silver</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Electrum\" title=\"Electrum\">electrum</a> using <a href=\"/index.php/Jewelry_smithing\" title=\"Jewelry smithing\">jewelry smithing</a>.</li>\n<li>It is used to channel spells by <a href=\"/index.php/Fo\" title=\"Fo\">Fo</a> priests, or for priests or followers of Fo to <a href=\"/index.php/Convert\" title=\"Convert\">convert</a> others to priests or followers of Fo.</li>\n<li>It can also be used for decoration.</li>\n<li>Statuette QL has no effect on casting.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Botd\" title=\"Botd\">Blessings of the dark</a> on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed.</li>\n<li>0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.</li></ul>', 1),
(24429, 3430, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Statues Statuettes Statuette of Libila Statuette of Magranon Statuette of Vynora Jewelry smithing', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Statues\" title=\"Statues\">Statues</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Statuettes\" title=\"Statuettes\">Statuettes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Libila\" title=\"Statuette of Libila\">Statuette of Libila</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Magranon\" title=\"Statuette of Magranon\">Statuette of Magranon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Vynora\" title=\"Statuette of Vynora\">Statuette of Vynora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Jewelry_smithing\" title=\"Jewelry smithing\">Jewelry smithing</a></li></ul>', 2),
(24430, 6166, 'Description', 'Description', 'A statuette resembling the artists interpretation of the deity Libila.', '<p><i>A statuette resembling the artists interpretation of the deity Libila.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24431, 6166, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Statuette of Libila is made of gold , silver , or electrum using jewelry smithing . It is used to channel spells by Libila priests, or for priests or followers of Libila to convert others to priests or followers of Libila. It can also be used for decoration. Statuette QL has no effect on casting. Circle of cunning , Wind of ages , or Blessings of the dark on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed. 0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.', '<ul><li><b>Statuette of Libila</b> is made of <a href=\"/index.php/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">gold</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">silver</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Electrum\" title=\"Electrum\">electrum</a> using <a href=\"/index.php/Jewelry_smithing\" title=\"Jewelry smithing\">jewelry smithing</a>.</li>\n<li>It is used to channel spells by <a href=\"/index.php/Libila\" title=\"Libila\">Libila</a> priests, or for priests or followers of Libila to <a href=\"/index.php/Convert\" title=\"Convert\">convert</a> others to priests or followers of Libila.</li>\n<li>It can also be used for decoration.</li>\n<li>Statuette QL has no effect on casting.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Botd\" title=\"Botd\">Blessings of the dark</a> on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed.</li>\n<li>0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.</li></ul>', 1),
(24432, 6166, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Statues Statuettes Statuette of Fo Statuette of Magranon Statuette of Vynora Jewelry smithing', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Statues\" title=\"Statues\">Statues</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Statuettes\" title=\"Statuettes\">Statuettes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Fo\" title=\"Statuette of Fo\">Statuette of Fo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Magranon\" title=\"Statuette of Magranon\">Statuette of Magranon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Vynora\" title=\"Statuette of Vynora\">Statuette of Vynora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Jewelry_smithing\" title=\"Jewelry smithing\">Jewelry smithing</a></li></ul>', 2),
(24433, 6167, 'Description', 'Description', 'A statuette resembling the artists interpretation of the deity Magranon.', '<p><i>A statuette resembling the artists interpretation of the deity Magranon.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24434, 6167, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Statuette of Magranon is made of gold , silver , or electrum using jewelry smithing . It is used to channel spells by Magranon priests, or for priests or followers of Magranon to convert others to priests or followers of Magranon. It can also be used for decoration. Statuette QL has no effect on casting. Circle of cunning , Wind of ages , or Blessings of the dark on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed. 0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.', '<ul><li><b>Statuette of Magranon</b> is made of <a href=\"/index.php/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">gold</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">silver</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Electrum\" title=\"Electrum\">electrum</a> using <a href=\"/index.php/Jewelry_smithing\" title=\"Jewelry smithing\">jewelry smithing</a>.</li>\n<li>It is used to channel spells by <a href=\"/index.php/Magranon\" title=\"Magranon\">Magranon</a> priests, or for priests or followers of Magranon to <a href=\"/index.php/Convert\" title=\"Convert\">convert</a> others to priests or followers of Magranon.</li>\n<li>It can also be used for decoration.</li>\n<li>Statuette QL has no effect on casting.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Botd\" title=\"Botd\">Blessings of the dark</a> on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed.</li>\n<li>0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.</li></ul>', 1),
