(24436, 3398, 'Description', 'Description', 'A statuette resembling the artist\'s interpretation of the deity Vynora.', '<p><i>A statuette resembling the artist\'s interpretation of the deity Vynora.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24437, 3398, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Statuette of Vynora is made of gold , silver , or electrum using jewelry smithing . It is used to channel spells by Vynora priests, or for priests or followers of Vynora to convert others to priests or followers of Vynora. It can also be used for decoration. Statuette QL has no effect on casting. Circle of cunning , Wind of ages , or Blessings of the dark on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed. 0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.', '<ul><li><b>Statuette of Vynora</b> is made of <a href=\"/index.php/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">gold</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">silver</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Electrum\" title=\"Electrum\">electrum</a> using <a href=\"/index.php/Jewelry_smithing\" title=\"Jewelry smithing\">jewelry smithing</a>.</li>\n<li>It is used to channel spells by <a href=\"/index.php/Vynora\" title=\"Vynora\">Vynora</a> priests, or for priests or followers of Vynora to <a href=\"/index.php/Convert\" title=\"Convert\">convert</a> others to priests or followers of Vynora.</li>\n<li>It can also be used for decoration.</li>\n<li>Statuette QL has no effect on casting.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Circle_of_cunning\" title=\"Circle of cunning\">Circle of cunning</a>, <a href=\"/index.php/Wind_of_ages\" title=\"Wind of ages\">Wind of ages</a>, or <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Botd\" title=\"Botd\">Blessings of the dark</a> on a statuette will not increase your channeling skill or speed.</li>\n<li>0.1kg of lump is lost upon failure to create.</li></ul>', 1),
(24438, 3398, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Statues Statuettes Statuette of Fo Statuette of Libila Statuette of Magranon', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Statues\" title=\"Statues\">Statues</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Statuettes\" title=\"Statuettes\">Statuettes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Fo\" title=\"Statuette of Fo\">Statuette of Fo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Libila\" title=\"Statuette of Libila\">Statuette of Libila</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Statuette_of_Magranon\" title=\"Statuette of Magranon\">Statuette of Magranon</a></li></ul>', 2),
(24439, 4928, 'Description', 'Description', 'A decorative iron box with wick and a canister for oil, with a socket for fitting on a pole.', '<p><i>A decorative iron box with wick and a canister for oil, with a socket for fitting on a pole. </i>\n</p>', 0),
(24440, 4928, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Used in the creation of a Lamp of corresponding type. If the lamp head is painted , the light from the lamp will be the color of the dye used. Black dye has no effect on the light of the lamp. The dye will also not transfer if the lamp head is turned into a street lamp . On failing to create you lose 0.08 kg from the metal lump.', '<ul><li>Used in the creation of a Lamp of corresponding type.</li>\n<li>If the lamp head is <a href=\"/index.php/Dye\" title=\"Dye\">painted</a>, the light from the lamp will be the color of the dye used. Black dye has no effect on the light of the lamp. The dye will also not transfer if the lamp head is turned into a <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Street_lamp\" title=\"Street lamp\">street lamp</a>.</li>\n<li>On failing to create you lose 0.08 kg from the metal lump.</li></ul>', 1),
(24441, 4344, 'Description', 'Description', 'A small metal shield with a leather strap.', '<p><i>A small metal shield with a leather strap.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24442, 4344, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'A small metal shield is the smallest shield . It can be made of any metal .', '<ul><li>A small metal shield is the smallest <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Shields\" title=\"Category:Shields\">shield</a>. It can be made of any <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Metal_lump\" title=\"Metal lump\">metal</a>.</li></ul>', 1),
(24443, 4344, 'Skills & Characteristics', 'Skills_.26_Characteristics', 'When using a small metal shield Shields > Small metal shield Body > Body control Mind > Mind speed When creating a small metal shield Smithing > Armour smithing > Shield smithing', '<p>When using a small metal shield\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Shields\" title=\"Shields\">Shields</a> &gt; Small metal shield</li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Body\" title=\"Body\">Body</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Body_control\" title=\"Body control\">Body control</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Mind\" title=\"Mind\">Mind</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Mind_speed\" title=\"Mind speed\">Mind speed</a></li></ul>\n<p>When creating a small metal shield\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\">Smithing</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Armour_smithing\" title=\"Armour smithing\">Armour smithing</a> &gt; <a href=\"/index.php/Shield_smithing\" title=\"Shield smithing\">Shield smithing</a></li></ul>', 2),
(24444, 4344, 'Titles', 'Titles', 'Sturdy Light Defender at 50 skill Sturdy Light Bastion at 70 skill Sturdy Light Bulwark at 90 skill Ogleshield at 100 skill', '<ul><li>Sturdy Light Defender at 50 skill</li>\n<li>Sturdy Light Bastion at 70 skill</li>\n<li>Sturdy Light Bulwark at 90 skill</li>\n<li>Ogleshield at 100 skill</li></ul>', 3),
(24445, 4344, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Medium metal shield Large metal shield', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Medium_metal_shield\" title=\"Medium metal shield\">Medium metal shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Large_metal_shield\" title=\"Large metal shield\">Large metal shield</a></li></ul>', 4),
(24446, 2780, 'Description', 'Description', 'Fence bars wrought from crude metal. Iron fence bars are required for building iron fences and iron fence gates .', '<p><i>Fence bars wrought from crude metal.</i>\n</p>\n<p>Iron fence bars are required for building <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_fence\" title=\"Iron fence\">iron fences</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Iron_fence_gate\" title=\"Iron fence gate\">iron fence gates</a>.\n</p>', 0),
(24447, 2780, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Failure to create will result in 0.60 kg of iron lump loss. The quality of the large anvil affects the success percentage. Can be created at low skill levels', '<ul><li>Failure to create will result in 0.60 kg of iron lump loss.</li>\n<li>The <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> of the <a href=\"/index.php/Large_anvil\" title=\"Large anvil\">large anvil</a> affects the success percentage.</li>\n<li>Can be created at low skill levels</li></ul>', 1),
(24448, 1497, 'Description', 'Description', 'A thick helm that only exposes a pair of slits where the eyes are.', '<p><i>A thick helm that only exposes a pair of slits where the eyes are.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24449, 1497, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Protects the head and face, the same as the open helm and basinet helm . Higher quality large anvils increase your chance at creating.', '<ul><li>Protects the head and face, the same as the <a href=\"/index.php/Open_helm\" title=\"Open helm\">open helm</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Basinet_helm\" title=\"Basinet helm\">basinet helm</a>.</li>\n<li>Higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvils increase your chance at creating.</li></ul>', 1),
(24450, 1497, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 2),
(24451, 1498, 'Description', 'Description', 'An open-faced round-top helm.', '<p><i>An open-faced round-top helm.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24452, 1498, 'Skins applicable', 'Skins_applicable', 'Goat Helm Stag Helm Helm of benevolence Winged Helm', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Item_skin_token\" title=\"Item skin token\">Goat Helm</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Item_skin_token\" title=\"Item skin token\">Stag Helm</a></li>\n<li>Helm of benevolence</li>\n<li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Item_skin_token\" title=\"Item skin token\">Winged Helm</a></li></ul>', 1),
(24453, 1498, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Protects the head and face, the same as the basinet helm and great helm . Higher quality large anvils increase your chance at creating. It has a secret use as a cooking utensil!', '<ul><li>Protects the head and face, the same as the <a href=\"/index.php/Basinet_helm\" title=\"Basinet helm\">basinet helm</a> and <a href=\"/index.php/Great_helm\" title=\"Great helm\">great helm</a>.</li>\n<li>Higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvils increase your chance at creating.</li>\n<li>It has a secret use as a cooking utensil!</li></ul>', 2),
(24454, 1498, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 3),
(24455, 2874, 'Description', 'Description', 'A large cutlery knife. It is used in some cooking recipes as a tool for cutting ingredients. It can be used to cut various foods into 2 kg portions, provided that the food is heavier than 2 kg.', '<p><i>A large cutlery knife.</i>\n</p>\n<p>It is used in some <a href=\"/index.php/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">cooking</a> recipes as a tool for cutting ingredients. \n</p>\n<p>It can be used to cut various foods into 2 kg portions, provided that the food is heavier than 2 kg.\n</p>', 0),
(24456, 2874, 'See also', 'See_also', 'Cooking utensils', '<ul><li><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Cooking_utensils\" title=\"Cooking utensils\">Cooking utensils</a></li></ul>', 1),
(24457, 6175, 'Description', 'Description', 'A long metal pliers for handling hot things.', '<p><i>A long metal pliers for handling hot things.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24458, 6175, 'Usage', 'Usage', 'Pliers are used for modifying stone walls into their plain version. Use a hammer or mallet for plain to wood-trimmed.', '<p><b>Pliers</b> are used for modifying stone <a href=\"/index.php/Wall\" title=\"Wall\">walls</a> into their plain version. Use a <a href=\"/index.php/Hammer\" title=\"Hammer\">hammer</a> or <a href=\"/index.php/Mallet\" title=\"Mallet\">mallet</a> for plain to wood-trimmed.\n</p>', 1),
(24459, 4499, 'Description', 'Description', 'Plate armour for the foot, with plenty of space for the toes.', '<p><i>Plate armour for the foot, with plenty of space for the toes.</i>\n</p>', 0),
(24460, 4499, 'Notes', 'Notes', 'Armour for your feet. You will need one for each foot. Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger walking speed penalties. Higher quality large anvils increase your creation chance.', '<ul><li>Armour for your feet. You will need one for each foot.</li>\n<li>Plate armour is one of the strongest armours, but also the heaviest with larger <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">walking</a> speed penalties.</li>\n<li>Higher <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/index.php/Quality\" title=\"Quality\">quality</a> large anvils increase your creation chance.</li></ul>', 1),
(24461, 4499, 'See Also', 'See_Also', 'Armour Fighting', '<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/index.php/Fighting\" title=\"Fighting\">Fighting</a></li></ul>', 2),
