e Gods scenarios relating to Epic missions . The current Valrei map may be seen by opening the Valrei map in game or by viewing the player-made map below. Community Maps Valrei map by Jekev and Mthec', '<table align=\"left\" class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:25px; text-align: center; float:none;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th> </th>\n<th colspan=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:135%\">Southern Freedom Isles</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\">\n<th>Server</th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Independence\" title=\"Independence\">Independence</a></th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Deliverance\" title=\"Deliverance\">Deliverance</a></th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Exodus\" title=\"Exodus\">Exodus</a></th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Celebration\" title=\"Celebration\">Celebration</a></th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Pristine\" title=\"Pristine\">Pristine</a></th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Release\" title=\"Release\">Release</a></th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Xanadu\" title=\"Xanadu\">Xanadu</a></th>\n<th style=\"width:11%;\"><a href=\"/index.php/Chaos\" title=\"Chaos\">Chaos</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\">\n<th>Founded</th>\n<th>Jun 2009</th>\n<th>Sep 2011</th>\n<th>Sep 2011</th>\n<th>May 2012</th>\n<th>Dec 2012</th>\n<th>Dec 2012</th>\n<th>June 2014</th>\n<th>May 2007\n</th></tr>\n<tr align=\"left\">\n<td><b>Official Maps</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/File:Independence_01.jpg\" title=\"File:Independence 01.jpg\"> In-game map</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B6J_aGQ6URL8S3YtYl9pV1hjZHM\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map dumps</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/File:Deliverance.jpg\" title=\"File:Deliverance.jpg\"> In-game map</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B6J_aGQ6URL8S2ZXRjlsdDV2SWM\" rel=\"nofollow\"