ow\">Jan 2015</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/s/pjoqnsjikbyo2q8/Exodus%20Dump.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">2012</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/s/tlrpbfbzddd7sms/Celebration.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jul 2012</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/s/kdwn6jkl97u0j4l/Pristine.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jan 2013</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/s/7bp5xjvlhe3e69d/Release.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jan 2013</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p> \n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/s/azwcjmsvkhwjsp6/Chaos.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jan 2012</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr align=\"left\">\n<td><b>Community maps</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://independence.yaga.host/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Exploration Map</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/191907-the-independence-exploration-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum thread</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VXUlm1dnPAy4mcp7-thzVoPcrJaN4Rv8/view\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cats Eye Map by HughMongus</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/160073-albia-cats-eyes-highways-map-of-indy/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1kHuvWv-8Sha5nsRgow9LSLrNxwYbHFpL/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roads Map</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/140493-albia-roads-map-of-indy/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://deliverance.yaga.host\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map by Seri</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/168376-deliverance-community-map/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://exodus.yaga.host/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map by Solmark</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/171226-new-exodus-community-map/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://celebration.yaga.host/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map by Oluffus</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/171395-new-celebration-community-map/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pristine.yaga.host/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map by Ohana</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/184443-pristine-community-map-202120222023//\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://release.yaga.host/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map by Fraskesa</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/184079-release-community-map/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://xanadu.yaga.host/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map by Dalethegood</a>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forum.wurmonline.com/index.php?/topic/183918-new-xanadu-community-map/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forum Thread</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr align=\"left\">\n<td><b>Community map<br/>archives</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p> \n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/sh/nq6rphf21ibk255/AAAR1r_NPiyGO2rfiGeUFYt2a/Delimap.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ma